épendances","gestion des erreurs","comment utiliser fastapi-templates","guide d''installation de fastapi-templates","alternatives à fastapi-templates"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","fastapi-templates","FastAPI-Projekte von Produktionsklasse","asynchrone Muster","Abhängigkeitsinjektion","Fehlerbehandlung","wie man fastapi-templates verwendet","Installationsanleitung für fastapi-templates","Alternativen zu fastapi-templates"],"pt":["como usar FastAPI","o que é FastAPI","FastAPI templates","alternativas para FastAPI","FastAPI vs Flask","instalar FastAPI","guia de configuração FastAPI"],"ru":["как использовать FastAPI","что такое FastAPI","шаблоны FastAPI","альтернативы для FastAPI","FastAPI vs Django","установить FastAPI","руководство по настройке FastAPI"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام FastAPI","ما هو FastAPI","قوالب FastAPI","بديلات ل FastAPI","FastAPI مقابل Django","تثبيت FastAPI","دليل إعداد FastAPI"]}},"owner":"rmyndharis","repo":"antigravity-skills","repoPath":"rmyndharis/antigravity-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fastapi-templates","description":"Create production-ready FastAPI projects with async patterns, dependency injection, and comprehensive error handling. Use when building new FastAPI applications or setting up backend API projects.","bodyPreview":"# FastAPI Project Templates\n\nProduction-ready FastAPI project structures with async patterns, dependency injection, middleware, and best practices for building high-performance APIs.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Starting new FastAPI projects from scratch\n- Implementing async REST APIs with Python\n- Building high-performance web services and microservices\n- Creating async applications with PostgreSQL, MongoDB\n- Setting up API projects with proper structure and testing\n\n## Do not use this skill when","body":"# FastAPI Project Templates\n\nProduction-ready FastAPI project structures with async patterns, dependency injection, middleware, and best practices for building high-performance APIs.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Starting new FastAPI projects from scratch\n- Implementing async REST APIs with Python\n- Building high-performance web services and microservices\n- Creating async applications with PostgreSQL, MongoDB\n- Setting up API projects with proper structure and testing\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to fastapi project templates\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Resources\n\n- `resources/implementation-playbook.md` for detailed patterns and examples.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T07:19:52.468Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Web Development Agents needing high-performance API templates with async patterns and dependency injection.","zh":"非常适合需要高性能API模板、异步模式和依赖注入的Python Web开发代理。","ja":"Python Web開発エージェントが高性能のAPIテンプレート、非同期パターン、依存性注入を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"높은 성능의 API 템플릿, 비동기 패턴 및 의존성 주입이 필요한 Python 웹 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo Web de Python que necesitan plantillas de API de alto rendimiento con patrones asíncronos y inyección de dependencias.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Web Python nécessitant des modèles d''API haute performance avec des modèles asynchrones et injection de dépendances.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Web-Entwicklungsagenten, die Vorlagen für Hochleistungs-APIs mit asynchronen Mustern und Abhängigkeitsinjektion benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento web Python que necessitam de modelos de API de alto desempenho com padrões assíncronos e injeção de dependência.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки Python, которым требуются шаблоны API с высокими 