de IA para coautoria de documentos","Doc Co-Authoring","Desenvolvimento de software","Tecnologias de IA","Coautoria de documentos","Fluxo de trabalho estruturado","Melhoria da qualidade do conteúdo"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для совместного создания документов","Doc Co-Authoring","Разработка программного обеспечения","Технологии ИИ","Совместное создание документов","Структурированный рабочий процесс","Повышение качества контента"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتعاونية كتابة الوثائق","Doc Co-Authoring","تطوير البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا الذكاء الاصطناعي","كتابة الوثائق التعاونية","عملية عمل مهيكلة","تحسين جودة المحتوى"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Language Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain that need structured workflows for collaborative documentation tasks.","zh":"Ideal for Language Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain that need structured workflows for collaborative documentation tasks.","ja":"Ideal for Language Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain that need structured workflows for collaborative documentation tasks.","ko":"Ideal for Language Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain that need structured workflows for collaborative documentation tasks.","es":"Ideal for Language Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain that need structured workflows for collaborative documentation tasks.","fr":"Ideal for Language Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain that need structured workflows for collaborative documentation tasks.","de":"Ideal for Language Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain that need structured workflows for collaborative documentation tasks.","pt":"Ideal for Language Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain that need structured workflows for collaborative documentation tasks.","ru":"Ideal for Language Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain that need structured workflows for collaborative documentation tasks.","ar":"Ideal for Language Agents like Claude Code, AutoGP