 Copilotを含む","19+のAIコーディングアシスタントをサポート","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["통합 컨텍스트 아키텍처","여러 개의 AI 코딩 어시스턴트를 지원","Cursor, Claude Code, GitHub Copilot 포함","19+ AI 코딩 어시스턴트 지원","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Arquitectura de contexto universal para asistentes de IA","Integración con Cursor, Claude Code y GitHub Copilot","Compatibilidad con 19+ asistentes de codificación de IA","Gestión de tareas de manera eficiente","Mejora de la productividad del desarrollador"],"fr":["Architecture de contexte universel pour les agents IA","Intégration avec Cursor, Claude Code et GitHub Copilot","Compatibilité avec 19+ assistants de codage IA","Gestion de tâches de manière efficace","Amélioration de la productivité du développeur"],"de":["Universelle Kontextarchitektur für KI-Agenten","Integration mit Cursor, Claude Code und GitHub Copilot","Kompatibilität mit 19+ KI-Coding-Assistenten","Effiziente Aufgabenverwaltung","Verbesserung der Produktivität des Entwicklers"],"pt":["Arquitetura de contexto universal","Integração com 19+ assistentes de codificação de IA","Fonte de verdade única para vários assistentes","Suporte a Cursor, Claude Code, GitHub Copilot, Gemini e Amazon Q","Melhoria da eficiência e produtividade de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Универсальная архитектура контекста","Интеграция с 19+ помощниками кодирования ИИ","Единая истина для нескольких помощников","Поддержка Cursor, Claude Code, GitHub Copilot, Gemini и Amazon Q","Улучшение эффективности и производительности разработки"],"ar":["هندسة سياق عالمية","التكامل مع 19+ مرافق كتابة الأكواد الذكية","مصدر وحيد للحقيقة لمرافق متعددة","دعم Cursor و Claude Code و GitHub Copilot و Gemini و Amazon Q","تحسين الكفاءة والإنتاجية التطويرية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI工具","generate-tasks","统一上下文架构","AI编码助手","Cursor","Claude Code","GitHub Copilot","如何使用generate-tasks","generate-tasks安装指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","generate-tasks","統一されたコンテキストアーキテクチャ","AIコーディングアシスタント","Cursor","Claude Code","GitHub Copilot","generate-tasksの使い方","generate-tasksのセットアップガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","generate-tasks","통합 컨텍스트 아키텍처","AI 코딩 어시스턴트","Cursor","Claude Code","GitHub Copilot","generate-tasks 사용법","generate-tasks 설치 가이드"],"es":["asistentes de IA","generar tareas","arquitectura de contexto universal","Cursor","Claude Code","GitHub Copilot","cómo utilizar asistentes de IA","qué es un agente de IA","alternative a GitHub Copilot"],"fr":["agents IA","générer des tâches","architecture de contexte universel","Cursor","Claude Code","GitHub Copilot","comment utiliser les agents IA","qu''est-ce qu''un agent IA","alternative à GitHub Copilot"],"de":["KI-Agenten","aufgaben generieren","universelle Kontextarchitektur","Cursor","Claude Code","GitHub Copilot","wie man KI-Agenten verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","alternative zu GitHub Copilot"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA","assistente de codificação","arquitetura de contexto universal","como usar generate-tasks","o que é generate-tasks","generate-tasks vs GitHub Copilot","instalar generate-tasks","guia de configuração do generate-tasks"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","помощники кодирования","универсальная архитектура контекста","как использовать generate-tasks","что такое generate-tasks","generate-tasks vs GitHub Copilot","установить generate-tasks","руководство по настройке generate-tasks"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","مرافق كتابة الأكواد","هندسة سياق عالمية","كيفية استخدام generate-tasks","ما هو generate-tasks","generate-tasks مقابل GitHub Copilot","تثبيت generate-tasks","دليل إعداد generate-tasks"]}},"owner":"yokharian","repo":"AIBoilerplate","repoPath":"yokharian/AIBoilerplate","stars":32,"forks":8,"updatedAt":"2026-01-19T07:34:48Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"generate-tasks","description":"Creates detailed, step-by-step task lists in Markdown format from user requirements, feature requests, or existing documentation. Use when the user asks to create a task list, break down a feature into tasks, generate implementation steps, or needs a structured development plan.","bodyPreview":"# Generating Task Lists from User Requirements\n\n## Goal\n\nTo guide the creation of a detailed, step-by-step task list in Markdown format based on user requirements, feature requests, or existing documentation. The task list should guide a developer through implementation.\n\n## Output\n\n- **Format:** Markdown (`.md`)\n- **Location:** `.specify/features/[feature-name]/`\n- **Filename:** `tasks.md`\n- **Full Path:** `.specify/features/[feature-name]/tasks.md`\n- **Note:** Use the same `[feature-name]` as","body":"# Generating Task Lists from User Requirements\n\n## Goal\n\nTo guide the creation of a detailed, step-by-step task list in Markdown format based on user requirements, feature requests, or existing documentation. The task list should guide a developer through implementation.\n\n## Output\n\n- **Format:** Markdown (`.md`)\n- **Location:** `.specify/features/[feature-name]/`\n- **Filename:** `tasks.md`\n- **Full Path:** `.specify/features/[feature-name]/tasks.md`\n- **Note:** Use the same `[feature-name]` as the corresponding PRD file\n\n## Process\n\n1. **Receive Requirements:** The user provides a feature request, task description, or points to existing documentation\n2. **Analyze Requirements:** Analyze the functional requirements, user needs, and implementation scope from the provided information\n3. **Phase 1: Generate Parent Tasks:** Based on the requirements analysis, create the file and generate the main, high-level tasks required to implement the feature. **IMPORTANT: Always include task 0.0 \"Create feature branch\" as the first task, unless the user specifically requests not to create a branch.** Use your judgement on how many additional high-level tasks to use. It''s likely to be about 5. Present these tasks to the user in the specified format (without sub-tasks yet). Inform the user: \"I have generated the high-level tasks based on your requirements. Ready to generate the sub-tasks? Respond with ''Go'' to proceed.\"\n4. **Wait for Confirmation:** Pause and wait for the user to respond with \"Go\".\n5. **Phase 2: Generate Sub-Tasks:** Once the user confirms, break down each parent task into smaller, actionable sub-tasks necessary to complete the parent task. Ensure sub-tasks logically follow from the parent task and cover the implementation details implied by the requirements.\n6. **Identify Relevant Files:** Based on the tasks and requirements, identify potential files that will need to be created or modified. List these under the `Relevant Files` section, including corresponding test files if applicable.\n7. **Generate Final Output:** Combine the parent tasks, sub-tasks, relevant files, and notes into the final Markdown structure.\n8. **Save Task List:** Save the generated document as `tasks.md` in `.specify/features/[feature-name]/` directory, where `[feature-name]` matches the feature name used in the corresponding PRD. Create the feature directory if it doesn''t exist. The full path will be `.specify/features/[feature-name]/tasks.md`.\n\n## Output Format\n\nThe generated task list _must_ follow this structure:\n\n```markdown\n## Relevant Files\n\n- `path/to/potential/file1.ts` - Brief description of why this file is relevant (e.g., Contains the main component for\n  this feature).\n- `path/to/file1.test.ts` - Unit tests for `file1.ts`.\n- `path/to/another/file.tsx` - Brief description (e.g., API route handler for data submission).\n- `path/to/another/file.test.tsx` - Unit tests for `another/file.tsx`.\n- `lib/utils/helpers.ts` - Brief description (e.g., Utility functions needed for calculations).\n- `lib/utils/helpers.test.ts` - Unit tests for `helpers.ts`.\n\n### Notes\n\n- Unit tests should typically be placed alongside the code files they are testing (e.g., `MyComponent.tsx` and\n  `MyComponent.test.tsx` in the same directory).\n- Use `npx jest [optional/path/to/test/file]` to run tests. Running without a path executes all tests found by the Jest\n  configuration.\n\n## Instructions for Completing Tasks\n\n**IMPORTANT:** As you complete each task, you must check it off in this markdown file by changing `- [ ]` to `- [x]`.\nThis helps track progress and ensures you don''t skip any steps.\n\nExample:\n\n- `- [ ] 1.1 Read file` → `- [x] 1.1 Read file` (after completing)\n\nUpdate the file after completing each sub-task, not just after completing an entire parent task.\n\n## Tasks\n\n- [ ] 0.0 Create feature branch\n    - [ ] 0.1 Create and checkout a new branch for this feature (e.g., `git checkout -b feature/[feature-name]`)\n- [ ] 1.0 Parent Task Title\n    - [ ] 1.1 [Sub-task description 1.1]\n    - [ ] 1.2 [Sub-task description 1.2]\n- [ ] 2.0 Parent Task Title\n    - [ ] 2.1 [Sub-task description 2.1]\n- [ ] 3.0 Parent Task Title (may not require sub-tasks if purely structural or configuration)\n```\n\n## Interaction Model\n\nThe process explicitly requires a pause after generating parent tasks to get user confirmation (\"Go\") before proceeding\nto generate the detailed sub-tasks. This ensures the high-level plan aligns with user expectations before diving into\ndetails.\n\n## Target Audience\n\nAssume the primary reader of the task list is a **junior developer** who will implement the feature.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:31:45.395Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing to create detailed task lists from user requirements in Markdown format.","zh":"非常适合需要根据用户需求以 Markdown 格式创建详细任务列表的开发智能体。","ja":"ユーザーの要件から Markdown 形式で詳細なタスクリストを作成する必要がある開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"사용자 요구사항에서 Markdown 형식으로 상세한 작업 목록을 생성해야 하는 개발 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan crear listas de tareas detalladas a partir de los requisitos del usuario en formato Markdown.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement qui ont besoin de créer des listes de tâches détaillées à partir des exigences de l''utilisateur au format Markdown.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die detaillierte Aufgabenlisten aus den Benutzeranforderungen im Markdown-Format erstellen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam criar listas de tarefas detalhadas a partir de requisitos do usuário em formato Markdown.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимо создавать подробные списки задач из требований пользователя в формате Markdown.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التطويين الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء قائمة مهام مفصلة من متطلبات المستخدم في تنسيق Markdown."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate step-by-step task lists in Markdown, utilizing Universal Context Architecture for compatibility with Cursor, Claude Code, GitHub Copilot, and other AI coding assistants, while supporting feature requests and existing documentation through Markdown files.","zh":"赋能智能体生成 Markdown 格式的逐步任务列表，利用 Universal Context Architecture 实现与 Cursor、Claude Code、GitHub Copilot 及其他 AI 编程助手的兼容性，同时通过 Markdown 文件支持功能请求和现有文档。","ja":"Universal Context Architecture を利用して、Cursor、Claude Code、GitHub Copilot、その他の AI コーディングアシスタントとの互換性を確保しながら、ステップバイステップのタスクリストを Markdown で生成する機能をエージェントに提供します。また、Markdown ファイルを通じて機能リクエストと既存のドキュメントをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 Markdown으로 단계별 작업 목록을 생성할 수 있도록 지원하며, Universal Context Architecture를 활용하여 Cursor, Claude Code, GitHub Copilot 및 기타 AI 코딩 어시스턴트와의 호환성을 제공합니다. 또한 Markdown 파일을 통해 기능 요청과 기존 문서를 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar listas de tareas paso a paso en Markdown, utilizando la Arquitectura de Contexto Universal para la compatibilidad con Cursor, Claude Code, GitHub Copilot y otros asistentes de codificación de IA, al tiempo que admite solicitudes de características y documentación existente a través de archivos Markdown.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des listes de tâches étape par étape en Markdown, en utilisant l''Architecture de Contexte Universel pour la compatibilité avec Cursor, Claude Code, GitHub Copilot et d''autres assistants de codage de l''IA, tout en prenant en charge les demandes de fonctionnalités et la documentation existante via des fichiers Markdown.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, schrittweise Aufgabenlisten in Markdown zu generieren, indem sie die Universal Context Architecture für die Kompatibilität mit Cursor, Claude Code, GitHub Copilot und anderen künstlichen Intelligenz-Coding-Assistenten nutzen, während sie Anfragen für Funktionen und bestehende Dokumentationen über Markdown-Dateien unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar listas de tarefas passo a passo em Markdown, utilizando a Arquitetura de Contexto Universal para compatibilidade com Cursor, Claude Code, GitHub Copilot e outros assistentes de codificação de IA, além de suportar solicitações de recursos e documentação existente por meio de arquivos Markdown.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать пошаговые списки задач в Markdown, используя Универсальную Архитектуру Контекста для совместимости с Cursor, Claude Code, GitHub Copilot и другими помощниками кодирования ИИ, а также поддерживает запросы функций и существующую документацию через файлы Markdown.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء قائمة مهام خطوة بخطوة في تنسيق Markdown، باستخدام هندسة السياق الشامل للتوافق مع Cursor و Claude Code و GitHub Copilot ومساعدي الترميز الاصطناعي الآخرون، مع دعم طلبات الميزات والوثائق الحالية من خلال ملفات Markdown."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating task lists from user requirements","Creating step-by-step implementation guides","Organizing feature requests in Markdown format"],"zh":["根据用户需求生成任务列表","创建分步实施指南","以 Markdown 格式组织功能请求"],"ja":["ユーザー要件からのタスクリストの生成","ステップバイステップの実装ガイドの作成","Markdown 形式での機能リクエストの整理"],"ko":["사용자 요구사항에서 작업 목록 생성","단계별 구현 가이드 생성","Markdown 형식으로 기능 요청 구성"],"es":["Generar listas de tareas a partir de los requisitos del usuario","Crear guías de implementación paso a paso","Organizar solicitudes de características en formato Markdown"],"fr":["Générer des listes de tâches à partir des exigences de l''utilisateur","Créer des guides d''implémentation étape par étape","Organiser les demandes de fonctionnalités au format Markdown"],"de":["Erstellen von Aufgabenlisten aus Benutzeranforderungen","Erstellung von schrittweisen Implementierungsleitfäden","Organisieren von Funktionsanfragen im Markdown-Format"],"pt":["Geração de listas de tarefas a partir de requisitos do usuário","Criação de guias de implementação passo a passo","Organização de solicitações de recursos em formato Markdown"],"ru":["Генерация списков задач из требований пользователя","Создание пошаговых руководств по реализации","Организация запросов функций в формате Markdown"],"ar":["إنشاء قائمة مهام من متطلبات المستخدم","إنشاء دلائل تنفيذ خطوة بخطوة","تنظيم طلبات الميزات في تنسيق Markdown"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user requirements or existing documentation","Output limited to Markdown (.md) format","Dependent on Universal Context Architecture for AI coding assistant compatibility"],"zh":["需要用户需求或现有文档","输出仅限于 Markdown (.md) 格式","依赖 Universal Context Architecture 来实现与 AI 编程助手的兼容性"],"ja":["ユーザー要件または既存のドキュメントが必要","出力は Markdown (.md) 形式に限定","AI コーディングアシスタントとの互換性には Universal Context Architecture に依存"],"ko":["사용자 요구사항 또는 기존 문서 필요","출력은 Markdown (.md) 형식으로 제한됨","AI 코딩 어시스턴트와의 호환성을 위해 Universal Context Architecture에 의존"],"es":["Requiere requisitos del usuario o documentación existente","Salida limitada al formato Markdown (.md)","Dependiente de la Arquitectura de Contexto Universal para la compatibilidad con asistentes de codificación de IA"],"fr":["Nécessite des exigences de l''utilisateur ou une documentation existante","Sortie limitée au format Markdown (.md)","Dépendante de l''Architecture de Contexte Universel pour la compatibilité avec les assistants de codage de l''IA"],"de":["Benötigt Benutzeranforderungen oder bestehende Dokumentation","Ausgabe beschränkt auf Markdown-Format (.md)","Abhängig von der Universal Context Architecture für die Kompatibilität mit künstlichen Intelligenz-Coding-Assistenten"],"pt":["Requer requisitos do usuário ou documentação existente","Saída limitada ao formato Markdown (.md)","Dependente da Arquitetura de Contexto Universal para compatibilidade com assistentes de codificação de IA"],"ru":["Требуется наличие требований пользователя или существующей документации","Выходные данные ограничены форматом Markdown (.md)","Зависит от Универсальной Архитектуры Контекста для совместимости с помощниками кодирования ИИ"],"ar":["يتطلب متطلبات المستخدم أو الوثائق الحالية","محدودة الإخراج إلى تنسيق Markdown (.md)","اعتماد على هندسة السياق الشامل للتوافق مع مساعدي الترميز الاصطناعي"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7e31b17a4ffb082b8ff12633bbbfbd71956dbcb4f7e4ec04bda31db9776365ee","qualityScore":62}');
