Intégration avec des outils de développement tels que React et Node.js","Interface utilisateur intuitive et facile à utiliser","Analyse de données et génération de rapports"],"de":["Benutzerdefiniertes Programmmanagement","Prozessoptimierung mit künstlicher Intelligenz","Integration mit Entwicklungstools wie React und Node.js","Intuitive und benutzerfreundliche Oberfläche","Datenanalyse und Berichterstellung"],"pt":["Gestão de programas de assignatura","Integração com a Facultad de Ciencias Exactas y Tecnologia","Ferramentas de AI para otimização de processos","Interface de usuário intuitiva","Suporte a múltiplos usuários"],"ru":["Управление программами","Интеграция с Факультетом Exactas y Tecnologia","ИИ инструменты для оптимизации процессов","Интуитивный интерфейс","Поддержка多пользовательской среды"],"ar":["إدارة برامج المساقات","التكامل مع الكلية التكنولوجية","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحسين العمليات","واجهة المستخدم البسيطة","دعم بيئة متعددة المستخدمين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Jira Epic教程","AIエージェント是什么","项目管理工具比较","Jira Epic安装","Jira Epic设置指南","如何使用Jira Epic","Jira Epic替代品"],"ja":["Jira Epicチュートリアル","AIエージェントとは","プロジェクト管理ツール比較","Jira Epicインストール","Jira Epic設定ガイド","Jira Epicの使用方法","Jira Epicの代替"],"ko":["Jira Epic 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트란","프로젝트 관리 도구 비교","Jira Epic 설치","Jira Epic 설정 가이드","Jira Epic 사용 방법","Jira Epic 대체"],"es":["herramientas de inteligencia artificial para la gestión de programas","cómo utilizar Jira Epic","Jira Epic vs Trello","instalación de Jira Epic","guía de configuración de Jira Epic","programas de gestión de proyectos","desarrollo de software con React y Node.js"],"fr":["outils d''intelligence artificielle pour la gestion de programmes","comment utiliser Jira Epic","Jira Epic vs Trello","installation de Jira Epic","guide de configuration de Jira Epic","programmes de gestion de projets","développement de logiciels avec React et Node.js"],"de":["künstliche Intelligenz-Tools für das Programmmanagement","wie man Jira Epic verwendet","Jira Epic vs Trello","Installation von Jira Epic","Konfigurationsanleitung für Jira Epic","Programme für das Projektmanagement","Softwareentwicklung mit React und Node.js"],"pt":["jira-epic","gestão de programas de assignatura","ferramentas de AI","Facultad de Ciencias Exactas y Tecnologia","como usar jira-epic","o que é jira-epic","jira-epic vs trello","jira-epic instalação","guia de configuração jira-epic"],"ru":["jira-epic","управление программами","ИИ инструменты","Факультет Exactas y Tecnologia","как использовать jira-epic","что такое jira-epic","jira-epic vs trello","установка jira-epic","руководство по настройке jira-epic"],"ar":["جيرا-إيبك","إدارة برامج المساقات","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","الكلية التكنولوجية","كيفية استخدام جيرا-إيبك","ما هو جيرا-إيبك","جيرا-إيبك vs تrello","تثبيت جيرا-إيبك","دليل إعداد جيرا-إيبك"]}},"owner":"ic-facet","repo":"gestion-programas-asignatura","repoPath":"ic-facet/gestion-programas-asignatura","stars":0,"forks":2,"updatedAt":"2026-02-23T16:11:00Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"jira-epic","description":">","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when creating Jira epics for:\n- Large features spanning multiple components\n- New views/pages in the application\n- Major refactoring initiatives\n- Features requiring API + UI + SDK work\n\n## Epic Template\n\n```markdown\n# {Epic Title}\n\n**Figma:** {figma link if available}\n\n## Feature Overview\n\n{2-3 paragraph description of what this feature does and why it''s needed}\n\n## Requirements\n\n### {Section 1: Major Functionality Area}\n\n#### {Subsection}\n- Requirement 1\n- Requir","body":"## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when creating Jira epics for:\n- Large features spanning multiple components\n- New views/pages in the application\n- Major refactoring initiatives\n- Features requiring API + UI + SDK work\n\n## Epic Template\n\n```markdown\n# {Epic Title}\n\n**Figma:** {figma link if available}\n\n## Feature Overview\n\n{2-3 paragraph description of what this feature does and why it''s needed}\n\n## Requirements\n\n### {Section 1: Major Functionality Area}\n\n#### {Subsection}\n- Requirement 1\n- Requirement 2\n- Requirement 3\n\n#### {Another Subsection}\n- Requirement 1\n- Requirement 2\n\n### {Section 2: Another Major Area}\n\n#### {Subsection}\n- Requirement 1\n- Requirement 2\n\n## Technical Considerations\n\n### Performance\n- {Performance requirement 1}\n- {Performance requirement 2}\n\n### Data Integration\n- {Data source}\n- {Integration points}\n\n### UI Components\n- {Component 1}\n- {Component 2}\n\n## Implementation Checklist\n\n- [ ] {Major deliverable 1}\n- [ ] {Major deliverable 2}\n- [ ] {Major deliverable 3}\n\n## Diagrams\n\n{Mermaid diagrams for architecture, flow, data model, etc.}\n```\n\n## Epic Title Conventions\n\nFormat: `[EPIC] Feature Name`\n\n**Examples:**\n- `[EPIC] Findings View`\n- `[EPIC] Multi-tenant Support`\n- `[EPIC] Compliance Dashboard Redesign`\n- `[EPIC] GovCloud Support`\n\n## Required Sections\n\n### 1. Feature Overview\nBrief but complete description of:\n- What the feature does\n- Who uses it\n- Why it''s needed\n\n### 2. Requirements\nOrganized by functional area:\n- Group related requirements together\n- Use clear headers and subheaders\n- Be specific and testable\n\n### 3. Technical Considerations\nAlways include:\n- **Performance**: Large dataset handling, pagination, caching\n- **Data Integration**: Data sources, APIs, relationships\n- **UI Components**: Reusable components, design system usage\n\n### 4. Implementation Checklist\nHigh-level deliverables that will become individual tasks:\n- Each checkbox = potential Jira task\n- Order by dependency (API before UI)\n- Include testing milestones\n\n## Diagrams\n\nUse Mermaid for:\n\n### Architecture Diagrams\n```mermaid\ngraph TB\n    UI[UI Components] --> API[API Endpoints]\n    API --> SDK[Prowler SDK]\n    SDK --> Cloud[Cloud Providers]\n```\n\n### Data Flow Diagrams\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    User->>UI: Apply filters\n    UI->>API: GET /findings?filters\n    API->>DB: Query findings\n    DB-->>API: Results\n    API-->>UI: JSON response\n    UI-->>User: Render table\n```\n\n### State Diagrams\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --> Pending\n    Pending --> InProgress: Start triage\n    InProgress --> Resolved: Mark resolved\n    InProgress --> Pending: Reset\n    Resolved --> [*]\n```\n\n### Entity Relationship Diagrams\n```mermaid\nerDiagram\n    FINDING ||--o{ RESOURCE : affects\n    FINDING }|--|| CHECK : \"belongs to\"\n    RESOURCE }|--|| ACCOUNT : \"belongs to\"\n    ACCOUNT }|--|| PROVIDER : \"belongs to\"\n```\n\n## Splitting Epic into Tasks\n\nAfter creating the epic, generate individual tasks using the `jira-task` skill:\n\n### Task Naming Pattern\nFrom epic `[EPIC] Findings View`, create:\n- `[FEATURE] Findings table with pagination (UI)`\n- `[FEATURE] Findings filters - provider and account (UI)`\n- `[FEATURE] Findings detail panel - Overview tab (UI)`\n- `[FEATURE] Findings detail panel - Resources tab (UI)`\n- `[FEATURE] Findings bulk actions - mute/suppress (API + UI)`\n- `[FEATURE] Findings search functionality (API + UI)`\n\n### Task Dependencies\nAlways specify in each task:\n```markdown\n## Related Tasks\n- Epic: [EPIC] Findings View\n- Blocked by: [task if any]\n- Blocks: [task if any]\n```\n\n## Figma Integration\n\nWhen Figma links are provided:\n- Include main Figma link at top\n- Reference specific frames in relevant sections\n- Example: `https://www.figma.com/design/xxx?node-id=1830-44712&m=dev`\n\n## Output Format\n\n```markdown\n## Epic: [EPIC] {Title}\n\n{Full epic content following template}\n\n---\n\n## Suggested Tasks\n\nBased on this epic, create the following tasks:\n\n| # | Title | Component | Blocked By |\n|---|-------|-----------|------------|\n| 1 | [FEATURE] Task name | API | - |\n| 2 | [FEATURE] Task name | UI | Task 1 |\n| 3 | [FEATURE] Task name | UI | Task 2 |\n\nWould you like me to generate the full task descriptions?\n```\n\n## Checklist Before Submitting\n\n1. ✅ Title follows `[EPIC] Feature Name` format\n2. ✅ Feature Overview explains what/who/why\n3. ✅ Requirements are organized by functional area\n4. ✅ Technical Considerations cover performance, data, UI\n5. ✅ Implementation Checklist has high-level deliverables\n6. ✅ Diagrams included where helpful (Mermaid format)\n7. ✅ Figma links included if available\n8. ✅ Suggested tasks table provided at the end\n\n## Formatting Rules\n\n**CRITICAL:** All output MUST be in Markdown format, ready to paste into Jira.\n\n- Use `#` for epic title, `##` for main sections, `###` for subsections\n- Use `**bold**` for emphasis\n- Use `- [ ]` for checkboxes in Implementation Checklist\n- Use ``` for code blocks and Mermaid diagrams\n- Use `backticks` for file paths, commands, and code references\n- Use tables for Suggested Tasks section\n- Use `---` to separate epic from suggested tasks\n\n## Jira MCP Integration\n\n**CRITICAL:** When creating epics via MCP, use these exact parameters:\n\n### Required Fields\n\n```json\n{\n  \"project_key\": \"PROWLER\",\n  \"summary\": \"[EPIC] Feature name\",\n  \"issue_type\": \"Epic\",\n  \"additional_fields\": {\n    \"customfield_10359\": {\"value\": \"UI\"}\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Team Field (REQUIRED)\n\nThe `customfield_10359` (Team) field is **REQUIRED**. Options:\n- `\"UI\"` - Frontend epics\n- `\"API\"` - Backend epics\n- `\"SDK\"` - Prowler SDK epics\n\n### Work Item Description Field\n\n**IMPORTANT:** The project uses `customfield_10363` (Work Item Description) instead of the standard `description` field for display in the UI.\n\n**CRITICAL:** Use **Jira Wiki markup**, NOT Markdown:\n- `h2.` instead of `##`\n- `*text*` for bold instead of `**text**`\n- `* item` for bullets (same)\n- `** subitem` for nested bullets\n\nAfter creating the epic, update the description with:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"customfield_10363\": \"h2. Feature Overview\\n\\n{overview}\\n\\nh2. Requirements\\n\\n*{Section 1}*\\n* {requirement 1}\\n* {requirement 2}\\n\\n*{Section 2}*\\n* {requirement 1}\\n* {requirement 2}\\n\\nh2. Technical Considerations\\n\\n*Performance:*\\n* {consideration 1}\\n\\n*Data Integration:*\\n* {consideration 2}\\n\\nh2. Implementation Checklist\\n\\n* [ ] {deliverable 1}\\n* [ ] {deliverable 2}\\n* [ ] {deliverable 3}\"\n}\n```\n\n### Linking Tasks to Epic\n\nWhen creating child tasks, use the epic key as parent:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"additional_fields\": {\n    \"parent\": \"PROWLER-XXX\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Workflow Transitions\n\n```\nBacklog (10037) → To Do (14) → In Progress (11) → Done (21)\n                → Blocked (10)\n```\n\n### MCP Commands Sequence\n\n1. **Create epic:**\n```\nmcp__mcp-atlassian__jira_create_issue (issue_type: \"Epic\")\n```\n\n2. **Update Work Item Description:**\n```\nmcp__mcp-atlassian__jira_update_issue with customfield_10363\n```\n\n3. **Create child tasks:**\n```\nmcp__mcp-atlassian__jira_create_issue with parent: EPIC-KEY\n```\n\n4. **Assign and transition:**\n```\nmcp__mcp-atlassian__jira_update_issue (assignee)\nmcp__mcp-atlassian__jira_transition_issue (status)\n```\n\n## Keywords\njira, epic, feature, initiative, prowler, large feature\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T13:13:57.247Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Project Management Agents needing structured issue tracking and epic creation for large features and refactoring initiatives.","zh":"适合需要结构化问题跟踪和史诗创建的项目管理代理，用于大型功能和重构项目。","ja":"プロジェクト管理エージェントが大規模な機能とリファクタリングイニシアチブのための構造化された問題追跡とエピック作成を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"대규모 기능 및 리팩토링 이니셔티브를 위한 구조화된 이슈 추적 및 에픽 생성이 필요한 프로젝트 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de proyectos que necesitan un seguimiento de problemas estructurado y la creación de epics para grandes características e iniciativas de refactorización.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de projet ayant besoin d''un suivi de problèmes structuré et de la création d''épics pour de grandes fonctionnalités et des initiatives de refactoring.","de":"Perfekt für Projektmanagement-Agenten, die ein strukturiertes Problem-Tracking und die Erstellung von Epics für große Funktionen und Refactoring-Initiativen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Projetos que necessitam de rastreamento de problemas estruturados e criação de épicos para recursos e iniciativas de refatoração em grande escala.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления проектами, которым требуется структурированное отслеживание проблем и создание эпики для крупных функций и инициатив по рефакторингу.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إدارة المشاريع الذين يحتاجون إلى تتبع مشاكل منظم وتشكيل ملحمة لسمات ومبادرات إعادة الهيكلة كبيرة النطاق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create comprehensive Jira epics with detailed feature overviews, requirements, and Figma design links, streamlining development workflows and enhancing collaboration through markdown-based templates and API + UI + SDK integration.","zh":"赋予代理创建包含详细功能概述、要求和Figma设计链接的全面Jira史诗的能力，通过基于markdown的模板和API + UI + SDK集成来简化开发工作流程并增强协作。","ja":"エージェントが詳細な機能の概要、要件、およびFigmaデザインリンクを含む包括的なJiraエピックを作成できるようにし、MarkdownベースのテンプレートとAPI + UI + SDKの統合を通じて開発ワークフローを簡素化し、コラボレーションを強化します。","ko":"에이전트가 자세한 기능 개요, 요구 사항 및 Figma 디자인 링크를 포함한 포괄적인 Jira 에픽을 생성할 수 있도록 하여 마크다운 기반 템플릿과 API + UI + SDK 통합을 통해 개발 워크플ロー를 간소화하고 협업을 강화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear epics de Jira completos con descripciones detalladas de las características, requisitos y enlaces de diseño de Figma, simplificando los flujos de trabajo de desarrollo y mejorando la colaboración a través de plantillas basadas en markdown y la integración de API + UI + SDK.","fr":"Autonomise les agents à créer des épics Jira complets avec des descriptions détaillées des fonctionnalités, des exigences et des liens de conception Figma, rationalisant les flux de travail de développement et améliorant la collaboration à travers des modèles basés sur markdown et l''intégration d''API + UI + SDK.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Jira-Epics mit detaillierten Funktionsübersichten, Anforderungen und Figma-Design-Links zu erstellen, Entwicklungswerkflüsse zu rationalisieren und die Zusammenarbeit durch markdown-basierte Vorlagen und API- + UI- + SDK-Integration zu verbessern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar épicos Jira abrangentes com visões gerais detalhadas de recursos, requisitos e links de design do Figma, racionalizando fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento e melhorando a colaboração por meio de modelos baseados em markdown e integração de API + UI + SDK.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать всесторонние эпики Jira с подробными обзорами функций, требованиями и ссылками на дизайн Figma, оптимизируя рабочие процессы разработки и повышая сотрудничество за счет шаблонов на основе markdown и интеграции API + UI + SDK.","ar":"يعزز الوكلاء لإنشاء ملحمة جيرا شاملة مع لمحة عامة مفصلة عن الميزات والمتطلبات وروابط التصميم الفيجما، وتبسيط سير عمل التطوير وتعزيز التعاون من خلال قوالب تستند إلى markdown والدمج API + UI + SDK."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating epics for large-scale application features","Managing major refactoring initiatives across multiple components","Developing new views and pages with integrated API and UI work"],"zh":["为大型应用程序功能创建史诗","跨多个组件管理主要的重构项目","使用集成的API和UI工作开发新的视图和页面"],"ja":["大規模なアプリケーションの機能のためのエピックを作成する","複数のコンポーネントを横断する主要なリファクタリングイニシアチブの管理","統合されたAPIとUIの作業を使用して新しいビューとページを開発する"],"ko":["대규모 애플리케이션 기능을 위한 에픽 생성","다중 구성 요소를横断하는 주요 리팩토링 이니셔티브 관리","통합된 API 및 UI 작업을 사용하여 새로운 뷰 및 페이지 개발"],"es":["Creación de epics para características de aplicaciones a gran escala","Gestión de iniciativas de refactorización importantes en varios componentes","Desarrollo de nuevas vistas y páginas con trabajo de API y UI integrado"],"fr":["Création d''épics pour des fonctionnalités d''applications à grande échelle","Gestion d''initiatives de refactoring importantes sur plusieurs composants","Développement de nouvelles vues et pages avec travail d''API et d''UI intégré"],"de":["Erstellung von Epics für große Anwendungsmerkmale","Verwaltung wichtiger Refactoring-Initiativen über mehrere Komponenten hinweg","Entwicklung neuer Ansichten und Seiten mit integriertem API- und UI-Arbeit"],"pt":["Criar épicos para recursos de aplicativos em grande escala","Gerenciar iniciativas de refatoração principais em vários componentes","Desenvolver novas visualizações e páginas com trabalho de API e UI integrado"],"ru":["Создание эпики для функций крупномасштабных приложений","Управление основными инициативами по рефакторингу на нескольких компонентах","Разработка новых представлений и страниц с интегрированной работой API и UI"],"ar":["إنشاء ملحمة لسمات التطبيقات على نطاق واسع","إدارة مبادرات إعادة الهيكلة الرئيسية عبر مكونات متعددة","تطوير مناظير وصفحات جديدة مع عمل API و UI متكاملة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Jira setup and configuration","Limited to epic creation and management within Jira ecosystem"],"zh":["需要Jira设置和配置","仅限于Jira生态系统内的史诗创建和管理"],"ja":["Jiraの設定と構成が必要","Jiraエコシステム内でのエピックの作成と管理のみ"],"ko":["Jira 설정 및 구성이 필요","Jira 생태계 내에서 에픽 생성 및 관리만 가능"],"es":["Requiere configuración y establecimiento de Jira","Limitado a la creación y gestión de epics dentro del ecosistema de Jira"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration et une mise en place de Jira","Limité à la création et à la gestion d''épics au sein de l''écosystème Jira"],"de":["Benötigt Jira-Setup und -Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung und Verwaltung von Epics innerhalb des Jira-Ökosystems"],"pt":["Requer configuração e instalação do Jira","Limitado à criação e gerenciamento de épicos dentro do ecossistema Jira"],"ru":["Требует настройки и конфигурации Jira","Ограничен созданием и управлением эпики внутри экосистемы Jira"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد وتكوين جيرا","محدود بالملحمة وخلق الإدارة داخل نظام جيرا"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"9a7f0c5581310667fb66286558de4bbdeb85b4fe0fbc691d1fc7416793e4eae8","qualityScore":62}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors/airbyte-agent-connectors', 'community', 'airbytehq', 'airbyte-agent-connectors', 'airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors', 'airbyte-agent-connectors', 0, 0, 62, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.872Z', '2026-03-02T02:06:09.301Z', 'a54f380d8e7b7090d24ff183443718042028d35ee7ae7194506178baeb0567f1', '{"id":"airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors/airbyte-agent-connectors","name":"airbyte-agent-connectors","description":{"zh":"Airbyte Agent Connectors AI","ja":"Airbyte Agent Connectors AI","ko":"Airbyte Agent Connectors AI","es":"Airbyte Agent Connectors ofrecen acceso confiable y seguro a sistemas externos para agentes de IA a través de herramientas bien documentadas.","fr":"Les connecteurs Airbyte Agent offrent un accès fiable et sécurisé aux systèmes externes pour les agents d''IA via des outils bien documentés.","de":"Airbyte-Connectors bieten zuverlässigen und sicheren Zugriff auf externe Systeme für KI-Agents durch gut dokumentierte Tools.","pt":"Os conectores Airbyte Agent são ferramentas prontas para uso que fornecem acesso confiável e seguro a sistemas externos para agentes de IA","ru":"Коннекторы Airbyte Agent — это готовые к использованию инструменты, которые обеспечивают надежный и безопасный доступ к внешним системам для агентов ИИ","ar":"متصفحات إيربايت إيجنت هي أدوات جاهزة للاستخدام توفر وصولا موثوقاً وأمنياً إلى الأنظمة الخارجية لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"🐙 Drop-in tools that give AI agents reliable, permission-aware access to external systems."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Airbyte Agent Connectors","ja":"Airbyte ","ko":"Airbyte ","es":"Conectores de Airbyte para Agentes de IA","fr":"Connecteurs Airbyte pour Agents d''IA","de":"Airbyte-Connectors für KI-Agents","pt":"Conectores Airbyte Agent: Acesso a Sistemas Externos","ru":"Коннекторы Airbyte Agent: Надежный доступ к внешним системам","ar":"متصفحات إيربايت إيجنت: وصول موثوق إلى الأنظمة الخارجية","en":"airbyte-agent-connectors"},"description":{"zh":"Airbyte Agent Connectors AI","ja":"Airbyte Agent Connectors AI","ko":"Airbyte Agent Connectors AI","es":"Airbyte Agent Connectors ofrecen acceso confiable y seguro a sistemas externos para agentes de IA a través de herramientas bien documentadas.","fr":"Les connecteurs Airbyte Agent offrent un accès fiable et sécurisé aux systèmes externes pour les agents d''IA via des outils bien documentés.","de":"Airbyte-Connectors bieten zuverlässigen und sicheren Zugriff auf externe Systeme für KI-Agents durch gut dokumentierte Tools.","pt":"Os conectores Airbyte Agent são ferramentas prontas para uso que fornecem acesso confiável e seguro a sistemas externos para agentes de IA","ru":"Коннекторы Airbyte Agent — это готовые к использованию инструменты, которые обеспечивают надежный и безопасный доступ к внешним системам для агентов ИИ","ar":"متصفحات إيربايت إيجنت هي أدوات جاهزة للاستخدام توفر وصولا موثوقاً وأمنياً إلى الأنظمة الخارجية لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"🐙 Drop-in tools that give AI agents reliable, permission-aware access to external systems."},"definition":{"en":"🐙 Drop-in tools that give AI agents reliable, permission-aware access to external systems."},"features":{"zh":["AI","API","Python","Platform Mode","OSS Mode","Definition ID"],"ja":["AI","API","Python","Platform Mode","OSS","Definition ID"],"ko":["AI","API","Python","Platform Mode","OSS","Definition ID"],"es":["Acceso seguro a sistemas externos","Herramientas bien documentadas y tipadas","Soporte para modos de plataforma y OSS","Identificación única de conectores a través de Definition ID","Paquetes de Python independientes para cada conector"],"fr":["Accès sécurisé aux systèmes externes","Outils bien documentés et typés","Prise en charge des modes de plateforme et OSS","Identification unique des connecteurs via Definition ID","Paquets Python indépendants pour chaque connecteur"],"de":["Sicherer Zugriff auf externe Systeme","Gut dokumentierte und typisierte Tools","Unterstützung für Plattform- und OSS-Modi","Eindeutige Identifizierung von Connectors über Definition ID","Unabhängige Python-Pakete für jeden Connector"],"pt":["Acesso a APIs de terceiros","Segurança e permissões","Ferramentas prontas para uso","Escalabilidade","Integração com Airbyte Cloud","Suporte a Python"],"ru":["Доступ к внешним API","Безопасность и разрешения","Готовые к использованию инструменты","Масштабируемость","Интеграция с Airbyte Cloud","Поддержка Python"],"ar":["الوصول إلى واجهات برمجة التطبيقات الخارجية","الأمان والصلاحيات","أدوات جاهزة للاستخدام","التمكين","التكامل مع سحابة إيربايت","دعم بايثون"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Airbyte Agent Connectors","AI","API","Python","Platform Mode","OSS Mode","Definition ID","AI"],"ja":["Airbyte Agent Connectors","AI","API","Python","Platform Mode","OSS","Definition ID","AI"],"ko":["Airbyte Agent Connectors","AI","API","Python","Platform Mode","OSS","Definition ID","AI"],"es":["conectores de Airbyte","agentes de IA","acceso a sistemas externos","integración de API","seguridad de datos","desarrollo de software","herramientas de código abierto","Python","Airbyte Cloud"],"fr":["connecteurs Airbyte","agents d''IA","accès aux systèmes externes","intégration d''API","sécurité des données","développement de logiciels","outils open source","Python","Airbyte Cloud"],"de":["Airbyte-Connectors","KI-Agents","Zugriff auf externe Systeme","API-Integration","Datenicherheit","Softwareentwicklung","Open-Source-Tools","Python","Airbyte Cloud"],"pt":["conectores airbyte agent","acesso a sistemas externos","agentes de ia","segurança e permissões","ferramentas prontas para uso","escalabilidade","integração com airbyte cloud","suporte a python","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["коннекторы airbyte agent","доступ к внешним системам","агенты ии","безопасность и разрешения","готовые к использованию инструменты","масштабируемость","интеграция с airbyte cloud","поддержка python","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["متصفحات إيربايت إيجنت","الوصول إلى الأنظمة الخارجية","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","الأمان والصلاحيات","أدوات جاهزة للاستخدام","التمكين","التكامل مع سحابة إيربايت","دعم بايثون","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"airbytehq","repo":"airbyte-agent-connectors","repoPath":"airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.872Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"airbyte-agent-connectors","description":"|","version":"1.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Airbyte Agent Connectors\n\nAirbyte Agent Connectors let AI agents call third-party APIs through strongly typed, well-documented tools. Each connector is a standalone Python package.\n\n> **Terminology:** **Platform Mode** = Airbyte Cloud at app.airbyte.ai (managed credentials, UI visibility). **OSS Mode** = local Python SDK (self-managed credentials, no cloud dependency). **Definition ID** = UUID that identifies a connector type in the Airbyte API (used in `definition_id` fields, not `connector_t","body":"# Airbyte Agent Connectors\n\nAirbyte Agent Connectors let AI agents call third-party APIs through strongly typed, well-documented tools. Each connector is a standalone Python package.\n\n> **Terminology:** **Platform Mode** = Airbyte Cloud at app.airbyte.ai (managed credentials, UI visibility). **OSS Mode** = local Python SDK (self-managed credentials, no cloud dependency). **Definition ID** = UUID that identifies a connector type in the Airbyte API (used in `definition_id` fields, not `connector_type` or `connector_definition_id`).\n\n> **Important:** This skill provides documentation and setup guidance. When helping users set up connectors, follow the documented workflows in the \"Common Workflows\" section below. Do NOT attempt to import Python modules, verify package installations, or run code to check configurations—simply guide users through the steps using the code examples provided in this documentation.\n\n## Mode Detection\n\n**First, determine which mode the user needs:**\n\n### Platform Mode (Airbyte Cloud)\nUse when:\n- Environment has `AIRBYTE_CLIENT_ID` + `AIRBYTE_CLIENT_SECRET`\n- User wants connectors visible in the Airbyte UI at app.airbyte.ai\n- User needs managed credential storage, entity cache, or multi-tenant deployments\n\n### OSS Mode (Open Source / Local SDK)\nUse when:\n- User wants to run connectors directly without platform integration\n- User is doing quick development or prototyping\n- User wants Claude Code/Desktop integration via MCP only\n\n> **Ask if unclear:** \"Are you using Airbyte Platform (app.airbyte.ai) or open source connectors?\"\n\n---\n\n## Supported Connectors\n\n**IMPORTANT:** Before proceeding with any setup, verify the requested connector is in this list. All 21 connectors follow the same entity-action pattern: `connector.execute(entity, action, params)`\n\n| Connector | Package | Auth Type | Key Entities |\n|-----------|---------|-----------|--------------|\n| [Airtable](https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors/tree/main/connectors/airtable) | `airbyte-agent-airtable` | API Key | bases, tables, records |\n| [Amazon Ads](https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors/tree/main/connectors/amazon-ads) | `airbyte-agent-amazon-ads` | OAuth2 | campaigns, ad_groups, ads |\n| [Asana](https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors/tree/main/connectors/asana) | `airbyte-agent-asana` | PAT | projects, tasks, users |\n| [Facebook Marketing](https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors/tree/main/connectors/facebook-marketing) | `airbyte-agent-facebook-marketing` | OAuth2 | campaigns, ad_sets, ads |\n| [GitHub](https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors/tree/main/connectors/github) | `airbyte-agent-github` | PAT/OAuth2 | repositories, issues, pull_requests |\n| [Gong](https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors/tree/main/connectors/gong) | `airbyte-agent-gong` | API Key | calls, users, deals |\n| [Google Drive](https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors/tree/main/connectors/google-drive) | `airbyte-agent-google-drive` | OAuth2 | files, folders |\n| [Greenhouse](https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors/tree/main/connectors/greenhouse) | `airbyte-agent-greenhouse` | API Key | applications, candidates, jobs |\n| [HubSpot](https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors/tree/main/connectors/hubspot) | `airbyte-agent-hubspot` | OAuth2/API Key | contacts, companies, deals |\n| [Intercom](https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors/tree/main/connectors/intercom) | `airbyte-agent-intercom` | API Key | contacts, conversations, companies |\n| [Jira](https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors/tree/main/connectors/jira) | `airbyte-agent-jira` | API Key | issues, projects, users |\n| [Klaviyo](https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors/tree/main/connectors/klaviyo) | `airbyte-agent-klaviyo` | API Key | profiles, lists, campaigns |\n| [Linear](https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors/tree/main/connectors/linear) | `airbyte-agent-linear` | API Key | issues, projects, teams |\n| [Mailchimp](https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors/tree/main/connectors/mailchimp) | `airbyte-agent-mailchimp` | API Key | lists, campaigns, members |\n| [Orb](https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors/tree/main/connectors/orb) | `airbyte-agent-orb` | API Key | customers, subscriptions, invoices |\n| [Salesforce](https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors/tree/main/connectors/salesforce) | `airbyte-agent-salesforce` | OAuth2 | accounts, contacts, opportunities |\n| [Shopify](https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors/tree/main/connectors/shopify) | `airbyte-agent-shopify` | API Key | orders, products, customers |\n| [Slack](https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors/tree/main/connectors/slack) | `airbyte-agent-slack` | Bot Token | channels, messages, users |\n| [Stripe](https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors/tree/main/connectors/stripe) | `airbyte-agent-stripe` | API Key | customers, payments, invoices |\n| [Zendesk Chat](https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors/tree/main/connectors/zendesk-chat) | `airbyte-agent-zendesk-chat` | OAuth2 | chats, visitors, agents |\n| [Zendesk Support](https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors/tree/main/connectors/zendesk-support) | `airbyte-agent-zendesk-support` | OAuth2/API Key | tickets, users, organizations |\n\n**If the connector is NOT in this list:** Inform the user that this connector isn''t available yet. Point them to:\n- GitHub issues: https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors/issues\n- Request a new connector by opening an issue\n\n---\n\n## Platform Mode Quick Start\n\nFor users with Airbyte Platform credentials.\n\n### Prerequisites\n\nGet credentials from [app.airbyte.ai](https://app.airbyte.ai) > Settings > API Keys:\n- `AIRBYTE_CLIENT_ID`\n- `AIRBYTE_CLIENT_SECRET`\n\n### Create a Connector\n\n```python\nfrom airbyte_agent_stripe import StripeConnector\nfrom airbyte_agent_stripe.models import StripeAuthConfig\n\nconnector = await StripeConnector.create_hosted(\n    external_user_id=\"user_123\",      # Your identifier for this user/tenant\n    airbyte_client_id=\"...\",          # From app.airbyte.ai\n    airbyte_client_secret=\"...\",\n    auth_config=StripeAuthConfig(api_key=\"sk_live_...\")\n)\n# Connector is created and ready to use programmatically\n```\n\n### Register in UI (Required for UI Visibility)\n\nAfter creating the connector programmatically, register it as a template to make it appear in the Airbyte UI''s Connectors page.\n\n**Get an Application Token first:**\n```bash\ncurl -X POST ''https://api.airbyte.ai/api/v1/account/applications/token'' \\\n  -H ''Content-Type: application/json'' \\\n  -d ''{\"client_id\": \"<AIRBYTE_CLIENT_ID>\", \"client_secret\": \"<AIRBYTE_CLIENT_SECRET>\"}''\n```\n\n**Then register the template:**\n```bash\ncurl -X POST ''https://api.airbyte.ai/api/v1/integrations/templates/sources'' \\\n  -H ''Content-Type: application/json'' \\\n  -H ''Authorization: Bearer <APPLICATION_TOKEN>'' \\\n  -d ''{\n    \"actor_definition_id\": \"<CONNECTOR_DEFINITION_ID>\",\n    \"name\": \"Stripe\",\n    \"original_source_template_id\": \"\",\n    \"partial_default_config\": {},\n    \"mode\": \"DIRECT\"\n  }''\n```\n\n- Get `actor_definition_id` from the [Connector Definition IDs table](references/programmatic-setup.md#connector-definition-ids)\n- If registration fails with \"already exists\", a template with that name already exists—choose a different name\n\nYour connector now appears in the Connectors page at [app.airbyte.ai](https://app.airbyte.ai) with a \"Direct\" badge.\n\n### Use Existing Connector\n\n```python\nconnector = StripeConnector(\n    external_user_id=\"user_123\",\n    airbyte_client_id=\"...\",\n    airbyte_client_secret=\"...\",\n)\nresult = await connector.execute(\"customers\", \"list\", {\"limit\": 10})\n```\n\n**For OAuth connectors and complete platform setup:** See [Platform Setup Reference](references/platform-setup.md)\n\n---\n\n## OSS Mode Quick Start\n\nFor users running connectors locally without platform integration.\n\n### Install\n\n```bash\n# Using uv (recommended)\nuv add airbyte-agent-github\n\n# Or using pip in a virtual environment\npython3 -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate\npip install airbyte-agent-github\n```\n\n> **Note:** When working in the `airbyte-agent-connectors` repo, packages are already available—no installation needed.\n\n### Use Directly\n\n```python\nfrom airbyte_agent_github import GithubConnector\nfrom airbyte_agent_github.models import GithubPersonalAccessTokenAuthConfig\n\nconnector = GithubConnector(\n    auth_config=GithubPersonalAccessTokenAuthConfig(token=\"ghp_your_token\")\n)\n\nresult = await connector.execute(\"issues\", \"list\", {\n    \"owner\": \"airbytehq\",\n    \"repo\": \"airbyte\",\n    \"states\": [\"OPEN\"],\n    \"per_page\": 10\n})\n```\n\n### Add to Claude via MCP\n\n```bash\nclaude mcp add airbyte-agent-mcp --scope project\n```\n\n**For MCP configuration and complete OSS setup:** See [OSS Setup Reference](references/oss-setup.md)\n\n---\n\n## Entity-Action API Pattern\n\nAll connectors use the same interface:\n\n```python\nresult = await connector.execute(entity, action, params)\n# result.data contains the records (list or dict depending on action)\n# result.meta contains pagination info for list operations\n```\n\n### Actions\n\n| Action | Description | `result.data` Type |\n|--------|-------------|-------------------|\n| `list` | Get multiple records | `list[dict]` |\n| `get` | Get single record by ID | `dict` |\n| `create` | Create new record | `dict` |\n| `update` | Modify existing record | `dict` |\n| `delete` | Remove record | `dict` |\n| `api_search` | Native API search syntax | `list[dict]` |\n\n### Quick Examples\n\n```python\n# List\nawait connector.execute(\"customers\", \"list\", {\"limit\": 10})\n\n# Get\nawait connector.execute(\"customers\", \"get\", {\"id\": \"cus_xxx\"})\n\n# Search\nawait connector.execute(\"repositories\", \"api_search\", {\n    \"query\": \"language:python stars:>1000\"\n})\n\n# Create\nawait connector.execute(\"customers\", \"create\", {\n    \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n    \"name\": \"Jane Doe\"\n})\n```\n\n### Pagination\n\n```python\nasync def fetch_all(connector, entity, params=None):\n    all_records = []\n    cursor = None\n    params = params or {}\n\n    while True:\n        if cursor:\n            params[\"after\"] = cursor\n        result = await connector.execute(entity, \"list\", params)\n        all_records.extend(result.data)\n\n        if result.meta and hasattr(result.meta, ''pagination''):\n            cursor = getattr(result.meta.pagination, ''cursor'', None)\n            if not cursor:\n                break\n        else:\n            break\n\n    return all_records\n```\n\n**For complete API reference:** See [Entity-Action API Reference](references/entity-action-api.md)\n\n---\n\n## Authentication Quick Reference\n\n### API Key Connectors\n\n```python\n# Stripe\nfrom airbyte_agent_stripe.models import StripeAuthConfig\nauth_config=StripeAuthConfig(api_key=\"sk_live_...\")\n\n# Gong\nfrom airbyte_agent_gong.models import GongAccessKeyAuthenticationAuthConfig\nauth_config=GongAccessKeyAuthenticationAuthConfig(\n    access_key=\"...\", access_key_secret=\"...\"\n)\n\n# HubSpot (Private App)\nfrom airbyte_agent_hubspot.models import HubspotPrivateAppAuthConfig\nauth_config=HubspotPrivateAppAuthConfig(access_token=\"pat-na1-...\")\n```\n\n### Personal Access Token\n\n```python\n# GitHub\nfrom airbyte_agent_github.models import GithubPersonalAccessTokenAuthConfig\nauth_config=GithubPersonalAccessTokenAuthConfig(token=\"ghp_...\")\n\n# Slack\nfrom airbyte_agent_slack.models import SlackAuthConfig\nauth_config=SlackAuthConfig(token=\"xoxb-...\")\n```\n\n### OAuth (requires refresh token)\n\n```python\n# Salesforce\nfrom airbyte_agent_salesforce.models import SalesforceOAuthConfig\nauth_config=SalesforceOAuthConfig(\n    client_id=\"...\", client_secret=\"...\", refresh_token=\"...\"\n)\n```\n\n**For complete auth details:** See [Authentication Reference](references/authentication.md)\n\n---\n\n## Platform Mode: Full Setup\n\nFor the complete 7-step HTTP API workflow, see [Platform Setup Checklist](references/platform-setup.md#complete-setup-checklist).\n\n---\n\n## Handling \"Already Exists\" Errors\n\nFor solutions to \"already exists\" errors during Platform Mode setup, see [Troubleshooting](references/troubleshooting.md#handling-already-exists-errors).\n\n---\n\n## OSS Mode: Setup Workflow\n\nFor the step-by-step OSS setup walkthrough, see [OSS Setup Reference](references/oss-setup.md#setup-workflow).\n\n---\n\n## File Placement\n\nWhen working in the `airbyte-agent-connectors` repo, place files in the connector directory (not the repo root). See [Getting Started](references/getting-started.md#file-placement) for details.\n\n---\n\n## Framework Integration\n\nFor PydanticAI and LangChain integration examples, see [Entity-Action API Reference](references/entity-action-api.md#framework-quick-start).\n\n---\n\n## Security Best Practices\n\nFor credential security guidelines, `.env` file patterns, and production recommendations, see [Authentication Reference](references/authentication.md#security-best-practices).\n\n---\n\n## Reference Documentation\n\n> **Quick Reference:** Connector Definition IDs are in the [Platform Setup Checklist](references/platform-setup.md#complete-setup-checklist) and [Programmatic Setup](references/programmatic-setup.md#connector-definition-ids).\n\n| Topic | Link |\n|-------|------|\n| Platform Setup | [references/platform-setup.md](references/platform-setup.md) |\n| OSS Setup | [references/oss-setup.md](references/oss-setup.md) |\n| Getting Started | [references/getting-started.md](references/getting-started.md) |\n| Entity-Action API | [references/entity-action-api.md](references/entity-action-api.md) |\n| Authentication | [references/authentication.md](references/authentication.md) |\n| Programmatic Setup | [references/programmatic-setup.md](references/programmatic-setup.md) |\n| MCP Integration | [references/mcp-integration.md](references/mcp-integration.md) |\n| Troubleshooting | [references/troubleshooting.md](references/troubleshooting.md) |\n| Demo Walkthrough | [references/demo-walkthrough.md](references/demo-walkthrough.md) |\n\n## Per-Connector Documentation\n\nEach connector directory contains:\n- **README.md** - Overview, example questions, basic usage\n- **AUTH.md** - All authentication options\n- **REFERENCE.md** - Complete entity/action reference with parameters\n\nExample: `connectors/github/README.md`, `connectors/github/AUTH.md`, `connectors/github/REFERENCE.md`\n\n---\n\n## Support\n\n- **Slack Community**: [slack.airbyte.com](https://slack.airbyte.com/)\n- **GitHub Issues**: [airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors](https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte-agent-connectors/issues)\n- **Documentation**: [docs.airbyte.com/ai-agents](https://docs.airbyte.com/ai-agents)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:06:09.301Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing reliable, permission-aware access to external systems through strongly typed, well-documented APIs.","zh":"非常适合需要可靠、权限感知的外部系统访问的AI代理，通过强类型、文档齐全的API实现。","ja":"信頼性が高く、パーミッションを認識した外部システムへのアクセスが必要なAIエージェントに最適です。強固に型付けされた、文書化されたAPIを通じてアクセスします。","ko":"안정적이고 권한 인식이 가능한 외부 시스템에 대한 액세스를 필요로 하는 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 강력한 타입 및 잘 문서화된 API를 통해 액세스합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan acceso confiable y consciente de permisos a sistemas externos a través de API bien documentadas y con tipos de datos fuertes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA qui ont besoin d''un accès fiable et conscient des autorisations aux systèmes externes via des API bien documentées et fortement typées.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die zuverlässigen, berechtigungsawarenen Zugriff auf externe Systeme über stark typisierte, gut dokumentierte APIs benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam de acesso confiável e ciente de permissões a sistemas externos por meio de APIs bem documentadas e fortemente tipadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, которым требуется надежный и осведомленный о разрешениях доступ к внешним системам через хорошо документированные и сильно типизированные API.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى الوصول الموثوق به والمتأثر بالتصريح إلى الأنظمة الخارجية من خلال واجهات برمجة التطبيقات المحددة جيدًا والموثقة جيدًا"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to call third-party APIs using standalone Python packages, supporting both Platform Mode and OSS Mode, with managed or self-managed credentials, and utilizes Definition ID for connector type identification in the Airbyte API.","zh":"赋予代理调用第三方API的能力，使用独立的Python包，支持平台模式和OSS模式，具有托管或自托管的凭证，并利用定义ID进行连接器类型识别，在Airbyte API中。","ja":"スタンドアロンPythonパッケージを使用して、エージェントが第三者APIを呼び出すことを可能にし、プラットフォームモードとOSSモードの両方をサポートし、管理されたクレデンシャルまたはセルフマネージドクレデンシャルを使用し、Airbyte API内でコネクタタイプの識別に定義IDを使用します。","ko":"독립적인 Python 패키지를 사용하여 에이전트가 제3의 API를 호출하도록 하며, 플랫폼 모드 및 OSS 모드를 모두 지원하며, 관리되는 자격 증명 또는 자체 관리되는 자격 증명을 사용하며, Airbyte API 내에서 커넥터 유형 식별에 정의 ID를 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a llamar a API de terceros utilizando paquetes de Python independientes, que admiten tanto el modo de plataforma como el modo OSS, con credenciales administradas o autogestionadas, y utiliza el ID de definición para la identificación del tipo de conector en la API de Airbyte.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appeler des API tierces en utilisant des packages Python autonomes, prenant en charge à la fois le mode Plateforme et le mode OSS, avec des informations d''identification gérées ou autogérées, et utilise l''ID de définition pour l''identification du type de connecteur dans l''API Airbyte.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Drittanbieter-APIs mit Hilfe von eigenständigen Python-Paketen aufzurufen, die sowohl den Plattform-Modus als auch den OSS-Modus unterstützen, mit verwalteten oder selbstverwalteten Anmeldeinformationen, und nutzt die Definition-ID zur Identifizierung des Konnektortyps in der Airbyte-API.","pt":"Habilita agentes a chamarem APIs de terceiros usando pacotes Python autônomos, suportando tanto o Modo de Plataforma quanto o Modo OSS, com credenciais gerenciadas ou auto-gerenciadas, e utiliza o ID de Definição para identificação do tipo de conector na API Airbyte.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью вызывать API третьих сторон с помощью автономных пакетов Python, поддерживая как режим платформы, так и режим OSS, с управляемыми или самоуправляемыми учетными данными, и использует ID определения для идентификации типа коннектора в API Airbyte.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من استدعاء واجهات برمجة التطبيقات الخاصة بالأطراف الثالثة باستخدام حزم بايثون مستقلة، ودعم كل من وضع المنصة ووضع OSS، مع بيانات اعتماد مُدارة أو مُدارة ذاتيًا، ويستخدم معرف التعريف لتحديد نوع المُشترك في واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Airbyte."},"useCases":{"en":["Integrating with third-party services using pre-built, strongly typed connectors","Managing credentials and permissions for external system access in Platform Mode or OSS Mode","Automating data synchronization between external systems and AI agent workflows using Airbyte Agent Connectors"],"zh":["使用预构建的强类型连接器与第三方服务集成","在平台模式或OSS模式下管理外部系统访问的凭证和权限","使用Airbyte代理连接器自动在外部系统和AI代理工作流之间同步数据"],"ja":["事前に構築された強固に型付けされたコネクタを使用して、第三者サービスと統合する","プラットフォームモードまたはOSSモードで外部システムへのアクセスのクレデンシャルとパーミッションを管理する","Airbyteエージェントコネクタを使用して、外部システムとAIエージェントのワークフロー間でデータを自動的に同期する"],"ko":["사전構築된 강력한 타입의 커넥터를 사용하여 제3의 서비스와 통합하는 것","플랫폼 모드 또는 OSS 모드에서 외부 시스템에 대한 액세스의 자격 증명 및 권한을 관리하는 것","Airbyte 에이전트 커넥터를 사용하여 외부 시스템 및 AI 에이전트 워크플로우 간에 데이터를 자동으로 동기화하는 것"],"es":["Integración con servicios de terceros mediante conectores preconstruidos y con tipos de datos fuertes","Administración de credenciales y permisos para el acceso a sistemas externos en el modo de plataforma o OSS","Automatización de la sincronización de datos entre sistemas externos y flujos de trabajo de agentes de IA mediante conectores de Airbyte"],"fr":["Intégration avec des services tiers à l''aide de connecteurs préconstruits et fortement typés","Gestion des informations d''identification et des autorisations pour l''accès aux systèmes externes en mode Plateforme ou OSS","Automatisation de la synchronisation des données entre les systèmes externes et les flux de travail des agents IA à l''aide des connecteurs Airbyte"],"de":["Integration mit Drittanbieterdiensten mithilfe vorab erstellter, stark typisierter Konnektoren","Verwaltung von Anmeldeinformationen und Berechtigungen für den Zugriff auf externe Systeme im Plattform-Modus oder OSS-Modus","Automatisierung der Datensynchronisation zwischen externen Systemen und KI-Arbeitsflüssen mithilfe von Airbyte-Konnektoren"],"pt":["Integrar com serviços de terceiros usando conectores fortemente tipados e pré-construídos","Gerenciar credenciais e permissões para acesso a sistemas externos no Modo de Plataforma ou Modo OSS","Automatizar a sincronização de dados entre sistemas externos e fluxos de trabalho de agentes de IA usando Conectores de Agentes Airbyte"],"ru":["Интегрироваться с сервисами третьих сторон с помощью сильно типизированных и предварительно построенных коннекторов","Управлять учетными данными и разрешениями для доступа к внешним системам в режиме платформы или режиме OSS","Автоматизировать синхронизацию данных между внешними системами и рабочими процессами агентов ИИ с помощью коннекторов агентов Airbyte"],"ar":["التكامل مع خدمات الطرف الثالث باستخدام مشتركين محددين جيدًا ومبنيين مسبقًا","إدارة بيانات الاعتماد والتصريحات للوصول إلى الأنظمة الخارجية في وضع المنصة أو وضع OSS","توفير تزامن البيانات بين الأنظمة الخارجية وسير عمل الوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام مشتركين وكلاء Airbyte"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment for local SDK usage in OSS Mode","Depends on Airbyte Cloud for managed credentials and UI visibility in Platform Mode","Needs Definition ID for connector type identification in the Airbyte API"],"zh":["需要Python环境以在OSS模式下使用本地SDK","依赖于Airbyte Cloud以在平台模式下管理凭证和UI可见性","需要定义ID以在Airbyte API中识别连接器类型"],"ja":["OSSモードでローカルSDKを使用するにはPython環境が必要","プラットフォームモードでクレデンシャルとUIの可視性を管理するにはAirbyte Cloudに依存する","Airbyte API内でコネクタタイプを識別するには定義IDが必要"],"ko":["OSS 모드에서 로컬 SDK를 사용하려면 Python 환경이 필요합니다.","플랫폼 모드에서 자격 증명 및 UI可視性를 관리하려면 Airbyte Cloud에 의존해야 합니다.","Airbyte API 내에서 커넥터 유형을 식별하려면 정의 ID가 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere un entorno de Python para la utilización local del SDK en el modo OSS","Depende de Airbyte Cloud para las credenciales administradas y la visibilidad de la interfaz de usuario en el modo de plataforma","Necesita el ID de definición para la identificación del tipo de conector en la API de Airbyte"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python pour l''utilisation locale du SDK en mode OSS","Dépend de Airbyte Cloud pour les informations d''identification gérées et la visibilité de l''interface utilisateur en mode Plateforme","Nécessite l''ID de définition pour l''identification du type de connecteur dans l''API Airbyte"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python-Umgebung für die lokale Verwendung des SDK im OSS-Modus","Hängt von Airbyte Cloud ab, um verwaltete Anmeldeinformationen und Benutzeroberflächen-Sichtbarkeit im Plattform-Modus zu erhalten","Benötigt die Definition-ID zur Identifizierung des Konnektortyps in der Airbyte-API"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Python para uso de SDK local no Modo OSS","Depende da Nuvem Airbyte para credenciais gerenciadas e visibilidade da interface do usuário no Modo de Plataforma","Necessita de ID de Definição para identificação do tipo de conector na API Airbyte"],"ru":["Требует среды Python для использования локального SDK в режиме OSS","Зависит от Облака Airbyte для управляемых учетных данных и видимости пользовательского интерфейса в режиме платформы","Требует ID определения для идентификации типа коннектора в API Airbyte"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة بايثون لاستخدام SDK المحلي في وضع OSS","يعتمد على سحابة Airbyte لبيانات الاعتماد المُدارة ووضوح واجهة المستخدم في وضع المنصة","يحتاج إلى معرف التعريف لتحديد نوع المُشترك في واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Airbyte"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a54f380d8e7b7090d24ff183443718042028d35ee7ae7194506178baeb0567f1","qualityScore":62}');
