Integración con OpenAI, Anthropic y Gemini APIs","Precisión y eficiencia en la traducción","Soporte para múltiples formatos de archivo","Interfaz de usuario intuitiva"],"fr":["Traduction JSON avec réflexion d''agent","Intégration avec les API OpenAI, Anthropic et Gemini","Précision et efficacité dans la traduction","Support pour plusieurs formats de fichier","Interface utilisateur intuitive"],"de":["JSON-Übersetzung mit Agenten-Reflexion","Integration mit OpenAI-, Anthropic- und Gemini-APIs","Präzision und Effizienz bei der Übersetzung","Unterstützung für mehrere Dateiformate","Benutzerfreundliche Oberfläche"],"pt":["Tradução JSON impulsionada por IA","Utiliza as APIs do OpenAI, Anthropic e Gemini","Agentic reflection para traduzir arquivos JSON complexos","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de arquivo","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento populares"],"ru":["Перевод JSON с поддержкой ИИ","Использует API OpenAI, Anthropic и Gemini","Агентское отражение для перевода сложных файлов JSON","Поддержка нескольких форматов файлов","Интеграция с популярными инструментами разработки"],"ar":["ترجمة JSON المدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي","تستخدم واجهات برمجة التطبيقات من OpenAI وAnthropic وGemini","الانعكاس الوكيل لترجمة الملفات JSON المعقدة","دعم عدة صيغ ملفات","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير الشائعة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用jta","什么是JSON翻译","jta替代品","jta与其他工具的比较","jta安装","jta设置指南","JSON翻译工具","AI智能工具"],"ja":["jtaの使い方","JSON翻訳とは","jtaの代替","jtaと他のツールの比較","jtaのインストール","jtaの設定ガイド","JSON翻訳ツール","AIエージェント"],"ko":["jta 사용법","JSON 번역이란","jta 대체","jta와 다른 도구의 비교","jta 설치","jta 설정 가이드","JSON 번역 도구","AI 에이전트"],"es":["herramientas de AI","traductor JSON","reflexión de agentes","OpenAI","Anthropic","Gemini APIs","cómo usar jta","qué es jta","jta alternativa","jta vs Google Translate"],"fr":["outils d''IA","traducteur JSON","réflexion d''agent","OpenAI","Anthropic","Gemini APIs","comment utiliser jta","qu''est-ce que jta","jta alternative","jta vs Google Translate"],"de":["KI-Tools","JSON-Übersetzer","Agenten-Reflexion","OpenAI","Anthropic","Gemini APIs","wie man jta verwendet","was ist jta","jta Alternative","jta vs Google Translate"],"pt":["como usar jta","o que é jta","ferramenta de tradução JSON","jta vs ferramentas de tradução","instalar jta","guia de configuração do jta","jta para desenvolvedores","tradução JSON com IA"],"ru":["как использовать jta","что такое jta","инструмент для перевода JSON","jta vs инструменты для перевода","установить jta","руководство по настройке jta","jta для разработчиков","перевод JSON с ИИ"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام jta","ما هو jta","أداة ترجمة JSON","jta مقابل أدوات الترجمة","تثبيت jta","دليل إعداد jta","jta للمطورين","ترجمة JSON بالذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"ckanner","repo":"jta","repoPath":"ckanner/jta","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.917Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"jta","description":"Translate JSON i18n files to multiple languages with AI-powered quality optimization. Use when user mentions translating JSON, i18n files, internationalization, locale files, or needs to convert language files to other languages.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Jta Translation\n\nAI-powered JSON internationalization file translator with Agentic reflection mechanism.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- User asks to translate JSON i18n/locale files\n- User mentions \"internationalization\", \"i18n\", \"l10n\", or \"locale\"\n- User wants to add new languages to their project\n- User needs to update existing translations\n- User mentions specific languages like \"translate to Chinese/Japanese/Korean\"\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n1. **Agentic Translation**: AI translates, evaluate","body":"# Jta Translation\n\nAI-powered JSON internationalization file translator with Agentic reflection mechanism.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- User asks to translate JSON i18n/locale files\n- User mentions \"internationalization\", \"i18n\", \"l10n\", or \"locale\"\n- User wants to add new languages to their project\n- User needs to update existing translations\n- User mentions specific languages like \"translate to Chinese/Japanese/Korean\"\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n1. **Agentic Translation**: AI translates, evaluates, and improves its own work (3x API calls per batch)\n2. **Smart Terminology**: Automatically detects and maintains consistent terms (brand names, technical terms)\n3. **Format Protection**: Preserves `{variables}`, `{{placeholders}}`, HTML tags, URLs, Markdown\n4. **Incremental Mode**: Only translates new/changed content (saves 80-90% API cost on updates)\n5. **27 Languages**: Including RTL languages (Arabic, Hebrew, Persian, Urdu)\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Step 1: Check if jta is installed\n\n```bash\n# Check if jta exists\nif ! command -v jta &> /dev/null; then\n  echo \"jta not found, will install\"\nfi\n```\n\n### Step 2: Install jta if needed\n\n```bash\n# Detect OS and install jta\nOS=\"$(uname -s)\"\nARCH=\"$(uname -m)\"\n\nif [[ \"$OS\" == \"Darwin\"* ]]; then\n  # macOS - try Homebrew first\n  if command -v brew &> /dev/null; then\n    brew tap hikanner/jta\n    brew install jta\n  else\n    # Download binary\n    if [[ \"$ARCH\" == \"arm64\" ]]; then\n      curl -L https://github.com/hikanner/jta/releases/latest/download/jta-darwin-arm64 -o jta\n    else\n      curl -L https://github.com/hikanner/jta/releases/latest/download/jta-darwin-amd64 -o jta\n    fi\n    chmod +x jta\n    sudo mv jta /usr/local/bin/\n  fi\nelif [[ \"$OS\" == \"Linux\"* ]]; then\n  # Linux\n  curl -L https://github.com/hikanner/jta/releases/latest/download/jta-linux-amd64 -o jta\n  chmod +x jta\n  sudo mv jta /usr/local/bin/\nfi\n\n# Verify installation\njta --version\n```\n\n### Step 3: Check for API key and set provider\n\nJta requires an AI provider API key. Check in this order and set the provider flag:\n\n```bash\n# Detect API key and set provider flag\nif [[ -n \"$ANTHROPIC_API_KEY\" ]]; then\n  echo \"✓ Anthropic API key found\"\n  PROVIDER_FLAG=\"--provider anthropic\"\nelif [[ -n \"$GEMINI_API_KEY\" ]]; then\n  echo \"✓ Gemini API key found\"\n  PROVIDER_FLAG=\"--provider gemini\"\nelif [[ -n \"$OPENAI_API_KEY\" ]]; then\n  echo \"✓ OpenAI API key found\"\n  PROVIDER_FLAG=\"\"  # OpenAI is default, no flag needed\nelse\n  echo \"✗ No API key found. Please set one of:\"\n  echo \"  export OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...\"\n  echo \"  export ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...\"\n  echo \"  export GEMINI_API_KEY=...\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n```\n\n**Important:** Save the `PROVIDER_FLAG` value to use in translation commands.\n\n### Step 4: Identify source file\n\n```bash\n# Find JSON files in common i18n/locale directories\nfind . -type f -name \"*.json\" \\\n  \\( -path \"*/locales/*\" -o \\\n     -path \"*/locale/*\" -o \\\n     -path \"*/i18n/*\" -o \\\n     -path \"*/lang/*\" -o \\\n     -path \"*/translations/*\" \\) \\\n  | head -20\n```\n\nAsk user to confirm which file to translate if multiple found.\n\n### Step 5: Determine translation requirements\n\nAsk user (if not specified in their request):\n- Target languages (e.g., \"zh,ja,ko\")\n- Whether to use incremental mode (recommended for updates)\n- Output location preference\n\n### Step 6: Execute translation\n\n**Always use `$PROVIDER_FLAG` from Step 3** to ensure the correct AI provider is used:\n\n```bash\n# Basic translation with detected provider\njta <source-file> --to <target-langs> $PROVIDER_FLAG\n\n# Examples:\n# Single language\njta en.json --to zh $PROVIDER_FLAG\n\n# Multiple languages\njta en.json --to zh,ja,ko $PROVIDER_FLAG\n\n# Incremental mode (for updates)\njta en.json --to zh --incremental $PROVIDER_FLAG\n\n# With custom output\njta en.json --to zh --output ./locales/zh.json $PROVIDER_FLAG\n\n# Non-interactive mode (for multiple languages)\njta en.json --to zh,ja,ko,es,fr -y $PROVIDER_FLAG\n\n# Override with specific model for quality\njta en.json --to zh --provider anthropic --model claude-sonnet-4-5\n\n# Translate specific keys only\njta en.json --to zh --keys \"settings.*,user.*\" $PROVIDER_FLAG\n\n# Exclude certain keys\njta en.json --to zh --exclude-keys \"admin.*,internal.*\" $PROVIDER_FLAG\n```\n\n### Step 7: Verify results\n\nAfter translation completes:\n\n```bash\n# Check output files exist\nls -lh <output-files>\n\n# Validate JSON structure\nfor file in <output-files>; do\n  if jq empty \"$file\" 2>/dev/null; then\n    echo \"✓ $file is valid JSON\"\n  else\n    echo \"✗ $file has invalid JSON\"\n  fi\ndone\n```\n\n### Step 8: Report to user\n\nShow the user:\n- Translation statistics (total items, success rate, API calls, duration)\n- Location of output files\n- Any errors or warnings\n- Cost implications if significant (e.g., \"Used 15 API calls, estimated $0.30\")\n\n## Terminology Management\n\nJta automatically creates a `.jta/` directory to store terminology:\n\n```\n.jta/\n├── terminology.json       # Source language terms (preserve + consistent)\n├── terminology.zh.json    # Chinese translations\n├── terminology.ja.json    # Japanese translations\n└── terminology.ko.json    # Korean translations\n```\n\n**terminology.json** structure:\n```json\n{\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"sourceLanguage\": \"en\",\n  \"preserveTerms\": [\"API\", \"OAuth\", \"GitHub\"],\n  \"consistentTerms\": [\"credits\", \"workspace\", \"prompt\"]\n}\n```\n\nUsers can manually edit these files for custom terminology.\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n**Note:** Always include `$PROVIDER_FLAG` (from Step 3) in your commands.\n\n### Pattern 1: First-time translation\n```bash\n# User: \"Translate my en.json to Chinese and Japanese\"\njta locales/en.json --to zh,ja -y $PROVIDER_FLAG\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Update existing translations\n```bash\n# User: \"I added new keys to en.json, update the translations\"\njta locales/en.json --to zh,ja --incremental -y $PROVIDER_FLAG\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Translate specific sections\n```bash\n# User: \"Only translate the settings and user sections\"\njta en.json --to zh --keys \"settings.**,user.**\" $PROVIDER_FLAG\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: High-quality translation\n```bash\n# User: \"Use the best model for highest quality\"\njta en.json --to zh --provider anthropic --model claude-sonnet-4-5\n```\n\n### Pattern 5: RTL languages\n```bash\n# User: \"Translate to Arabic and Hebrew\"\njta en.json --to ar,he -y $PROVIDER_FLAG\n# Jta automatically handles bidirectional text markers\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### Error: \"jta: command not found\"\n- Run the installation script from Step 2\n- Verify with `jta --version`\n\n### Error: \"API key not set\"\nPrompt user:\n```\nJta requires an AI provider API key. Please set one of:\n\nFor OpenAI (recommended):\n  export OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...\n  Get key at: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys\n\nFor Anthropic:\n  export ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...\n  Get key at: https://console.anthropic.com/\n\nFor Google Gemini:\n  export GEMINI_API_KEY=...\n  Get key at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey\n```\n\n### Error: \"Rate limit exceeded\"\n```bash\n# Reduce batch size and concurrency\njta en.json --to zh --batch-size 10 --concurrency 1\n```\n\n### Error: \"Invalid JSON\"\n```bash\n# Validate source file\njq . source.json\n```\n\n### Error: Translation quality issues\n1. Try a better model:\n   ```bash\n   jta en.json --to zh --provider anthropic --model claude-sonnet-4-5\n   ```\n\n2. Check terminology files in `.jta/` and edit if needed\n\n3. Use verbose mode to debug:\n   ```bash\n   jta en.json --to zh --verbose\n   ```\n\n## Performance Tips\n\n- **Small files (<100 keys)**: Use default settings\n- **Large files (>500 keys)**: Use `--batch-size 10 --concurrency 2`\n- **Frequent updates**: Always use `--incremental` to save cost\n- **Quality priority**: Use `--provider anthropic --model claude-sonnet-4-5`\n- **Speed priority**: Use `--provider openai --model gpt-3.5-turbo` (if available)\n- **Cost priority**: Use incremental mode + larger batch sizes\n\n## Supported Languages\n\n27 languages with full support:\n\n**Left-to-Right (LTR):**\n- European: en, es, fr, de, it, pt, ru, nl, pl, tr\n- Asian: zh, zh-TW, ja, ko, th, vi, id, ms, hi, bn, si, ne, my\n\n**Right-to-Left (RTL):**\n- Middle Eastern: ar, fa, he, ur\n\nView all supported languages:\n```bash\njta --list-languages\n```\n\n## Output Format\n\nJta produces:\n1. **Translated JSON files**: Same structure as source, with translations\n2. **Statistics**: Printed to console\n3. **Terminology files**: In `.jta/` directory for consistency\n\nAlways inform the user of:\n- Number of items translated\n- Success/failure count\n- Output file locations\n- Any errors or warnings\n- API usage and estimated cost (if significant)\n\n## Advanced Options\n\n**Note:** Remember to include `$PROVIDER_FLAG` in your commands.\n\n```bash\n# Skip terminology detection (use existing)\njta en.json --to zh --skip-terminology $PROVIDER_FLAG\n\n# Disable terminology management completely\njta en.json --to zh --no-terminology $PROVIDER_FLAG\n\n# Re-detect terminology (when source language changes)\njta en.json --to zh --redetect-terms $PROVIDER_FLAG\n\n# Custom terminology directory (for shared terms)\njta en.json --to zh --terminology-dir ../shared-terms/ $PROVIDER_FLAG\n\n# Specify source language explicitly\njta myfile.json --source-lang en --to zh $PROVIDER_FLAG\n\n# Custom batch size and concurrency\njta en.json --to zh --batch-size 20 --concurrency 3 $PROVIDER_FLAG\n\n# Verbose output for debugging\njta en.json --to zh --verbose $PROVIDER_FLAG\n```\n\n## Examples\n\nSee [examples/](examples/) directory for detailed, step-by-step use cases.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:25:36.782Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced JSON translation capabilities, such as Cursor or Windsurf.","zh":"非常适合需要高级JSON翻译能力的AI代理，例如Cursor或Windsurf。","ja":"CursorやWindsurfなどの、JSONの高度な翻訳機能を必要とするAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Cursor 또는 Windsurf와 같은 고급 JSON 번역 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan capacidades de traducción de JSON avanzadas, como Cursor o Windsurf.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant des capacités de traduction JSON avancées, comme Cursor ou Windsurf.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die erweiterte JSON-Übersetzungs-Funktionen benötigen, wie z.B. Cursor oder Windsurf.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de tradução JSON, como Cursor ou Windsurf.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым требуются продвинутые возможности перевода JSON, такие как Cursor или Windsurf.","ar":"مثالي لويكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى возможности متقدمة لترجمة JSON، مثل Cursor أو Windsurf."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to translate JSON i18n files using OpenAI, Anthropic, and Gemini APIs, enabling seamless internationalization and localization.","zh":"通过OpenAI、Anthropic和Gemini API，赋予代理翻译JSON i18n文件的能力，实现无缝的国际化和本地化。","ja":"OpenAI、Anthropic、Gemini APIを使用して、エージェントがJSON i18nファイルを翻訳できるようにし、シームレスな国際化とローカライズを実現します。","ko":"OpenAI, Anthropic 및 Gemini API를 사용하여 에이전트가 JSON i18n 파일을 번역할 수 있도록 하여無縫의 국제화 및 현지화를 실현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a traducir archivos de i18n de JSON utilizando las API de OpenAI, Anthropic y Gemini, lo que permite una internacionalización y localización sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de traduire des fichiers i18n JSON en utilisant les API OpenAI, Anthropic et Gemini, ce qui permet une internationalisation et une localisation sans problème.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, JSON-i18n-Dateien mithilfe der OpenAI-, Anthropic- und Gemini-APIs zu übersetzen, was eine nahtlose Internationalisierung und Lokalisierung ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a traduzir arquivos JSON i18n usando as APIs OpenAI, Anthropic e Gemini, permitindo uma internacionalização e localização sem problemas.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность переводить файлы JSON i18n с помощью API OpenAI, Anthropic и Gemini, обеспечивая беспрепятственную интернационализацию и локализацию.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من ترجمة ملفات JSON i18n باستخدام واجهات برمجة التطبيقات OpenAI وAnthropic وGemini، مما يتيح التعريب والتدويل دون مشاكل."},"useCases":{"en":["Translating JSON i18n files for multi-language projects","Generating new languages for existing projects","Updating existing translations for improved accuracy"],"zh":["将JSON i18n文件翻译为多语言项目","为现有项目生成新语言","更新现有翻译以提高准确性"],"ja":["マルチ言語プロジェクトのJSON i18nファイルの翻訳","既存のプロジェクトに新しい言語を生成する","既存の翻訳を更新して精度を向上させる"],"ko":["다국어 프로젝트를 위한 JSON i18n 파일 번역","기존 프로젝트에 새로운 언어를 생성","기존 번역을 업데이트하여 정확도를 향상"],"es":["Traducir archivos de i18n de JSON para proyectos de varios idiomas","Generar nuevos idiomas para proyectos existentes","Actualizar traducciones existentes para mejorar la precisión"],"fr":["Traduire des fichiers i18n JSON pour des projets multilingues","Générer de nouvelles langues pour des projets existants","Mettre à jour des traductions existantes pour améliorer la précision"],"de":["Übersetzen von JSON-i18n-Dateien für Mehrsprach-Projekte","Erstellen neuer Sprachen für bestehende Projekte","Aktualisieren bestehender Übersetzungen zur Verbesserung der Genauigkeit"],"pt":["Traduzir arquivos JSON i18n para projetos de vários idiomas","Gerar novos idiomas para projetos existentes","Atualizar traduções existentes para melhorar a precisão"],"ru":["Переводить файлы JSON i18n для проектов с несколькими языками","Генерировать новые языки для существующих проектов","Обновлять существующие переводы для повышения точности"],"ar":["ترجمة ملفات JSON i18n لمشاريع متعددة اللغات","إنشاء لغات جديدة للمشاريع الحالية","تحديث الترجمات الحالية لتحسين الدقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OpenAI, Anthropic, and Gemini API Keys","Limited to JSON file formats"],"zh":["需要OpenAI、Anthropic和Gemini API密钥","仅限于JSON文件格式"],"ja":["OpenAI、Anthropic、Gemini APIキーが必要","JSONファイル形式のみ"],"ko":["OpenAI, Anthropic 및 Gemini API 키가 필요","JSON 파일 형식만"],"es":["Requiere claves de API de OpenAI, Anthropic y Gemini","Limitado a formatos de archivo JSON"],"fr":["Nécessite des clés d''API OpenAI, Anthropic et Gemini","Limité aux formats de fichiers JSON"],"de":["Benötigt OpenAI-, Anthropic- und Gemini-API-Schlüssel","Begrenzt auf JSON-Dateiformate"],"pt":["Requer chaves de API OpenAI, Anthropic e Gemini","Limitado a formatos de arquivo JSON"],"ru":["Требует ключей API OpenAI, Anthropic и Gemini","Ограничен форматами файлов JSON"],"ar":["يتطلب مفاتيح واجهة برمجة التطبيقات OpenAI وAnthropic وGemini","محدود بتنسيقات ملفات JSON"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"23d7ef3efbcb5f344d9abad612ccec725ee3574e9402048728a86028c783557a","qualityScore":62}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('barateza/mcp-plesk-extension-guide/tlc-spec-driven', 'community', 'barateza', 'mcp-plesk-extension-guide', 'barateza/mcp-plesk-extension-guide', 'tlc-spec-driven', 0, 0, 62, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.984Z', '2026-03-02T02:59:41.862Z', 'f9ec1f4e4b6d87cf492f441831acf3abca248be65ee0e2b1a986fdd480152b44', '{"id":"barateza/mcp-plesk-extension-guide/tlc-spec-driven","name":"tlc-spec-driven","description":{"zh":"tlc-spec-driven是AI智能代理，为Plesk扩展开发提供文档搜索功能，使用RAG和向量嵌入技术","ja":"tlc-spec-drivenはAIエージェントであり、Plesk拡張開発のためのドキュメント検索機能を提供するRAGとベクトル埋め込み技術を使用","ko":"tlc-spec-driven은 AI 에이전트로서 Plesk 확장 개발을 위한 문서 검색 기능을 제공하며 RAG 및 벡터 임베딩 기술을 사용합니다","es":"tlc-spec-driven es una herramienta de AI que utiliza la búsqueda semántica para desarrollar extensiones de Plesk con RAG y vector embeddings","fr":"tlc-spec-driven est un outil d''IA qui utilise la recherche sémantique pour développer des extensions Plesk avec RAG et des embeddings vectoriels","de":"tlc-spec-driven ist ein KI-Tool, das die semantische Suche für die Entwicklung von Plesk-Erweiterungen mit RAG und Vektor-Einbettungen nutzt","pt":"O tlc-spec-driven é uma ferramenta de IA que utiliza RAG e embeddings vetoriais para melhorar a busca semântica na documentação de desenvolvimento de extensões Plesk.","ru":"ИИ Агент tlc-spec-driven использует RAG и векторные вложения для улучшения семантического поиска в документации разработки расширений Plesk.","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي tlc-spec-driven تستخدم RAG وترميزات متجهات لتحسين البحث الدلالي في وثائق تصميم ملحقات Plesk.","en":"Plesk Extensions Guide MCP Server: AI-powered semantic search for Plesk extension development documentation using RAG and vector embeddings."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理tlc-spec-driven：Plesk扩展开发文档搜索","ja":"AIエージェントtlc-spec-driven：Plesk拡張開発ドキュメント検索","ko":"AI 에이전트 tlc-spec-driven: Plesk 확장 개발 문서 검색","es":"Herramientas de AI: tlc-spec-driven para Plesk","fr":"Outils d''IA: tlc-spec-driven pour Plesk","de":"KI-Tools: tlc-spec-driven für Plesk","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: tlc-spec-driven para Desenvolvimento d...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: tlc-spec-driven для разработки расширений Plesk","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: tlc-spec-driven لتنمية ملحقات Plesk","en":"tlc-spec-driven"},"description":{"zh":"tlc-spec-driven是AI智能代理，为Plesk扩展开发提供文档搜索功能，使用RAG和向量嵌入技术","ja":"tlc-spec-drivenはAIエージェントであり、Plesk拡張開発のためのドキュメント検索機能を提供するRAGとベクトル埋め込み技術を使用","ko":"tlc-spec-driven은 AI 에이전트로서 Plesk 확장 개발을 위한 문서 검색 기능을 제공하며 RAG 및 벡터 임베딩 기술을 사용합니다","es":"tlc-spec-driven es una herramienta de AI que utiliza la búsqueda semántica para desarrollar extensiones de Plesk con RAG y vector embeddings","fr":"tlc-spec-driven est un outil d''IA qui utilise la recherche sémantique pour développer des extensions Plesk avec RAG et des embeddings vectoriels","de":"tlc-spec-driven ist ein KI-Tool, das die semantische Suche für die Entwicklung von Plesk-Erweiterungen mit RAG und Vektor-Einbettungen nutzt","pt":"O tlc-spec-driven é uma ferramenta de IA que utiliza RAG e embeddings vetoriais para melhorar a busca semântica na documentação de desenvolvimento de extensõ...","ru":"ИИ Агент tlc-spec-driven использует RAG и векторные вложения для улучшения семантического поиска в документации разработки расширений Plesk.","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي tlc-spec-driven تستخدم RAG وترميزات متجهات لتحسين البحث الدلالي في وثائق تصميم ملحقات Plesk.","en":"Plesk Extensions Guide MCP Server: AI-powered semantic search for Plesk extension development documentation using RAG and vector embeddings."},"definition":{"en":"Plesk Extensions Guide MCP Server: AI-powered semantic search for Plesk extension development documentation using RAG and vector embeddings."},"features":{"zh":["AI智能搜索","Plesk扩展开发文档","RAG和向量嵌入技术","快速高效的搜索功能","提高开发效率"],"ja":["AIエージェントによる検索","Plesk拡張開発ドキュメント","RAGとベクトル埋め込み技術","高速かつ効率的な検索機能","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 검색","Plesk 확장 개발 문서