ct und Node.js","Integration mit CLI für eine höhere Effizienz","Detaillierte Berichte für eine bessere Entscheidungsfindung"],"pt":["Análise de vulnerabilidades de segurança","Identificação de riscos de segurança","Correção de vulnerabilidades","Relatórios de segurança detalhados","Integração com ferramentas de IA existentes"],"ru":["Анализ уязвимостей безопасности","Выявление рисков безопасности","Исправление уязвимостей","Подробные отчеты о безопасности","Интеграция с существующими ИИ Агентами"],"ar":["تحليل الثغرات الأمنية","تحديد مخاطر الأمن","إصلاح الثغرات","تقارير أمنية مفصلة","التكامل مع وكلاء ذكيين موجودين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Convex Security Audit - AI","Convex Security Audit - AI","Convex Security Audit - AI","Convex Security Audit - AI","Convex Security Audit - AI"],"ja":["Convex Security Audit - AI","Convex Security Audit - AI","Convex Security Audit - AI","Convex Security Audit - AI","Convex Security Audit - AI"],"ko":["Convex Security Audit - AI","Convex Security Audit - AI","Convex Security Audit - AI","Convex Security Audit - AI","Convex Security Audit - AI"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de agentes de IA","qué es un audit de seguridad convex","alternativas a herramientas de seguridad","herramientas de seguridad para desarrolladores","instalación de herramientas de seguridad","guía de configuración de herramientas de seguridad"],"fr":["comment utiliser les outils d''agents IA","qu''est-ce qu''un audit de sécurité convex","alternatives aux outils de sécurité","outils de sécurité pour les développeurs","installation d''outils de sécurité","guide de configuration d''outils de sécurité"],"de":["wie man KI-Agenten-Tools verwendet","was ist ein Convex-Sicherheitsaudit","Alternativen zu Sicherheits-Tools","Sicherheits-Tools für Entwickler","Installation von Sicherheits-Tools","Konfigurationsanleitung für Sicherheits-Tools"],"pt":["como usar auditoria de segurança Convex","o que é auditoria de segurança","alternativas para auditoria de segurança Convex","Convex vs outras ferramentas de segurança","instalar auditoria de segurança Convex","guia de configuração para auditoria de segurança Convex"],"ru":["как использовать аудит безопасности Convex","что такое аудит безопасности","альтернативы для аудита безопасности Convex","Convex vs другие средства безопасности","установить аудит безопасности Convex","руководство по настройке для аудита безопасности Convex"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام تدقيق أمان Convex","ما هو تدقيق أمان","بديلات لتدقيق أمان Convex","Convex مقابل أدوات أمنية أخرى","تثبيت تدقيق أمان Convex","دليل إعداد لتدقيق أمان Convex"]}},"owner":"charlietlamb","repo":"ferix","repoPath":"charlietlamb/ferix","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.056Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Convex Security Audit","description":"Deep security review patterns for authorization logic, data access boundaries, action isolation, rate limiting, and protecting sensitive operations","version":"1.0.0","tags":["convex","security","audit","authorization","rate-limiting","protection"],"bodyPreview":"# Convex Security Audit\n\nComprehensive security review patterns for Convex applications including authorization logic, data access boundaries, action isolation, rate limiting, and protecting sensitive operations.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth\n- Production Security: https://docs.convex.dev/production\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n###","body":"# Convex Security Audit\n\nComprehensive security review patterns for Convex applications including authorization logic, data access boundaries, action isolation, rate limiting, and protecting sensitive operations.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth\n- Production Security: https://docs.convex.dev/production\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Security Audit Areas\n\n1. **Authorization Logic** - Who can do what\n2. **Data Access Boundaries** - What data users can see\n3. **Action Isolation** - Protecting external API calls\n4. **Rate Limiting** - Preventing abuse\n5. **Sensitive Operations** - Protecting critical functions\n\n### Authorization Logic Audit\n\n#### Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)\n\n```typescript\n// convex/lib/auth.ts\nimport { QueryCtx, MutationCtx } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { ConvexError } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { Doc } from \"./_generated/dataModel\";\n\ntype UserRole = \"user\" | \"moderator\" | \"admin\" | \"superadmin\";\n\nconst roleHierarchy: Record<UserRole, number> = {\n  user: 0,\n  moderator: 1,\n  admin: 2,\n  superadmin: 3,\n};\n\nexport async function getUser(ctx: QueryCtx | MutationCtx): Promise<Doc<\"users\"> | null> {\n  const identity = await ctx.auth.getUserIdentity();\n  if (!identity) return null;\n  \n  return await ctx.db\n    .query(\"users\")\n    .withIndex(\"by_tokenIdentifier\", (q) => \n      q.eq(\"tokenIdentifier\", identity.tokenIdentifier)\n    )\n    .unique();\n}\n\nexport async function requireRole(\n  ctx: QueryCtx | MutationCtx, \n  minRole: UserRole\n): Promise<Doc<\"users\">> {\n  const user = await getUser(ctx);\n  \n  if (!user) {\n    throw new ConvexError({\n      code: \"UNAUTHENTICATED\",\n      message: \"Authentication required\",\n    });\n  }\n  \n  const userRoleLevel = roleHierarchy[user.role as UserRole] ?? 0;\n  const requiredLevel = roleHierarchy[minRole];\n  \n  if (userRoleLevel < requiredLevel) {\n    throw new ConvexError({\n      code: \"FORBIDDEN\",\n      message: `Role ''${minRole}'' or higher required`,\n    });\n  }\n  \n  return user;\n}\n\n// Permission-based check\ntype Permission = \"read:users\" | \"write:users\" | \"delete:users\" | \"admin:system\";\n\nconst rolePermissions: Record<UserRole, Permission[]> = {\n  user: [\"read:users\"],\n  moderator: [\"read:users\", \"write:users\"],\n  admin: [\"read:users\", \"write:users\", \"delete:users\"],\n  superadmin: [\"read:users\", \"write:users\", \"delete:users\", \"admin:system\"],\n};\n\nexport async function requirePermission(\n  ctx: QueryCtx | MutationCtx,\n  permission: Permission\n): Promise<Doc<\"users\">> {\n  const user = await getUser(ctx);\n  \n  if (!user) {\n    throw new ConvexError({ code: \"UNAUTHENTICATED\", message: \"Authentication required\" });\n  }\n  \n  const userRole = user.role as UserRole;\n  const permissions = rolePermissions[userRole] ?? [];\n  \n  if (!permissions.includes(permission)) {\n    throw new ConvexError({\n      code: \"FORBIDDEN\",\n      message: `Permission ''${permission}'' required`,\n    });\n  }\n  \n  return user;\n}\n```\n\n### Data Access Boundaries Audit\n\n```typescript\n// convex/data.ts\nimport { query, mutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { getUser, requireRole } from \"./lib/auth\";\nimport { ConvexError } from \"convex/values\";\n\n// Audit: Users can only see their own data\nexport const getMyData = query({\n  args: {},\n  returns: v.array(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"userData\"),\n    content: v.string(),\n  })),\n  handler: async (ctx) => {\n    const user = await getUser(ctx);\n    if (!user) return [];\n    \n    // SECURITY: Filter by userId\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"userData\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_user\", (q) => q.eq(\"userId\", user._id))\n      .collect();\n  },\n});\n\n// Audit: Verify ownership before returning sensitive data\nexport const getSensitiveItem = query({\n  args: { itemId: v.id(\"sensitiveItems\") },\n  returns: v.union(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"sensitiveItems\"),\n    secret: v.string(),\n  }), v.null()),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const user = await getUser(ctx);\n    if (!user) return null;\n    \n    const item = await ctx.db.get(args.itemId);\n    \n    // SECURITY: Verify ownership\n    if (!item || item.ownerId !== user._id) {\n      return null; // Don''t reveal if item exists\n    }\n    \n    return item;\n  },\n});\n\n// Audit: Shared resources with access list\nexport const getSharedDocument = query({\n  args: { docId: v.id(\"documents\") },\n  returns: v.union(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"documents\"),\n    content: v.string(),\n    accessLevel: v.string(),\n  }), v.null()),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const user = await getUser(ctx);\n    const doc = await ctx.db.get(args.docId);\n    \n    if (!doc) return null;\n    \n    // Public documents\n    if (doc.visibility === \"public\") {\n      return { ...doc, accessLevel: \"public\" };\n    }\n    \n    // Must be authenticated for non-public\n    if (!user) return null;\n    \n    // Owner has full access\n    if (doc.ownerId === user._id) {\n      return { ...doc, accessLevel: \"owner\" };\n    }\n    \n    // Check shared access\n    const access = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"documentAccess\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_doc_and_user\", (q) => \n        q.eq(\"documentId\", args.docId).eq(\"userId\", user._id)\n      )\n      .unique();\n    \n    if (!access) return null;\n    \n    return { ...doc, accessLevel: access.level };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Action Isolation Audit\n\n```typescript\n// convex/actions.ts\n\"use node\";\n\nimport { action, internalAction } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { api, internal } from \"./_generated/api\";\nimport { ConvexError } from \"convex/values\";\n\n// SECURITY: Never expose API keys in responses\nexport const callExternalAPI = action({\n  args: { query: v.string() },\n  returns: v.object({ result: v.string() }),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    // Verify user is authenticated\n    const identity = await ctx.auth.getUserIdentity();\n    if (!identity) {\n      throw new ConvexError(\"Authentication required\");\n    }\n    \n    // Get API key from environment (not hardcoded)\n    const apiKey = process.env.EXTERNAL_API_KEY;\n    if (!apiKey) {\n      throw new Error(\"API key not configured\");\n    }\n    \n    // Log usage for audit trail\n    await ctx.runMutation(internal.audit.logAPICall, {\n      userId: identity.tokenIdentifier,\n      endpoint: \"external-api\",\n      timestamp: Date.now(),\n    });\n    \n    const response = await fetch(\"https://api.example.com/query\", {\n      method: \"POST\",\n      headers: {\n        \"Authorization\": `Bearer ${apiKey}`,\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n      },\n      body: JSON.stringify({ query: args.query }),\n    });\n    \n    if (!response.ok) {\n      // Don''t expose external API error details\n      throw new ConvexError(\"External service unavailable\");\n    }\n    \n    const data = await response.json();\n    \n    // Sanitize response before returning\n    return { result: sanitizeResponse(data) };\n  },\n});\n\n// Internal action - not exposed to clients\nexport const _processPayment = internalAction({\n  args: {\n    userId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    amount: v.number(),\n    paymentMethodId: v.string(),\n  },\n  returns: v.object({ success: v.boolean(), transactionId: v.optional(v.string()) }),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const stripeKey = process.env.STRIPE_SECRET_KEY;\n    \n    // Process payment with Stripe\n    // This should NEVER be exposed as a public action\n    \n    return { success: true, transactionId: \"txn_xxx\" };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Rate Limiting Audit\n\n```typescript\n// convex/rateLimit.ts\nimport { mutation, query } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { ConvexError } from \"convex/values\";\n\nconst RATE_LIMITS = {\n  message: { requests: 10, windowMs: 60000 }, // 10 per minute\n  upload: { requests: 5, windowMs: 300000 },  // 5 per 5 minutes\n  api: { requests: 100, windowMs: 3600000 },  // 100 per hour\n};\n\nexport const checkRateLimit = mutation({\n  args: {\n    userId: v.string(),\n    action: v.union(v.literal(\"message\"), v.literal(\"upload\"), v.literal(\"api\")),\n  },\n  returns: v.object({ allowed: v.boolean(), retryAfter: v.optional(v.number()) }),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const limit = RATE_LIMITS[args.action];\n    const now = Date.now();\n    const windowStart = now - limit.windowMs;\n    \n    // Count requests in window\n    const requests = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"rateLimits\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_user_and_action\", (q) => \n        q.eq(\"userId\", args.userId).eq(\"action\", args.action)\n      )\n      .filter((q) => q.gt(q.field(\"timestamp\"), windowStart))\n      .collect();\n    \n    if (requests.length >= limit.requests) {\n      const oldestRequest = requests[0];\n      const retryAfter = oldestRequest.timestamp + limit.windowMs - now;\n      \n      return { allowed: false, retryAfter };\n    }\n    \n    // Record this request\n    await ctx.db.insert(\"rateLimits\", {\n      userId: args.userId,\n      action: args.action,\n      timestamp: now,\n    });\n    \n    return { allowed: true };\n  },\n});\n\n// Use in mutations\nexport const sendMessage = mutation({\n  args: { content: v.string() },\n  returns: v.id(\"messages\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const identity = await ctx.auth.getUserIdentity();\n    if (!identity) throw new ConvexError(\"Authentication required\");\n    \n    // Check rate limit\n    const rateCheck = await checkRateLimit(ctx, {\n      userId: identity.tokenIdentifier,\n      action: \"message\",\n    });\n    \n    if (!rateCheck.allowed) {\n      throw new ConvexError({\n        code: \"RATE_LIMITED\",\n        message: `Too many requests. Try again in ${Math.ceil(rateCheck.retryAfter! / 1000)} seconds`,\n      });\n    }\n    \n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"messages\", {\n      content: args.content,\n      authorId: identity.tokenIdentifier,\n      createdAt: Date.now(),\n    });\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Sensitive Operations Protection\n\n```typescript\n// convex/admin.ts\nimport { mutation, internalMutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { requireRole, requirePermission } from \"./lib/auth\";\nimport { internal } from \"./_generated/api\";\n\n// Two-factor confirmation for dangerous operations\nexport const deleteAllUserData = mutation({\n  args: {\n    userId: v.id(\"users\"),\n    confirmationCode: v.string(),\n  },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    // Require superadmin\n    const admin = await requireRole(ctx, \"superadmin\");\n    \n    // Verify confirmation code\n    const confirmation = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"confirmations\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_admin_and_code\", (q) => \n        q.eq(\"adminId\", admin._id).eq(\"code\", args.confirmationCode)\n      )\n      .filter((q) => q.gt(q.field(\"expiresAt\"), Date.now()))\n      .unique();\n    \n    if (!confirmation || confirmation.action !== \"delete_user_data\") {\n      throw new ConvexError(\"Invalid or expired confirmation code\");\n    }\n    \n    // Delete confirmation to prevent reuse\n    await ctx.db.delete(confirmation._id);\n    \n    // Schedule deletion (don''t do it inline)\n    await ctx.scheduler.runAfter(0, internal.admin._performDeletion, {\n      userId: args.userId,\n      requestedBy: admin._id,\n    });\n    \n    // Audit log\n    await ctx.db.insert(\"auditLogs\", {\n      action: \"delete_user_data\",\n      targetUserId: args.userId,\n      performedBy: admin._id,\n      timestamp: Date.now(),\n    });\n    \n    return null;\n  },\n});\n\n// Generate confirmation code for sensitive action\nexport const requestDeletionConfirmation = mutation({\n  args: { userId: v.id(\"users\") },\n  returns: v.string(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const admin = await requireRole(ctx, \"superadmin\");\n    \n    const code = generateSecureCode();\n    \n    await ctx.db.insert(\"confirmations\", {\n      adminId: admin._id,\n      code,\n      action: \"delete_user_data\",\n      targetUserId: args.userId,\n      expiresAt: Date.now() + 5 * 60 * 1000, // 5 minutes\n    });\n    \n    // In production, send code via secure channel (email, SMS)\n    return code;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Complete Audit Trail System\n\n```typescript\n// convex/audit.ts\nimport { mutation, query, internalMutation } from \"./_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\nimport { getUser, requireRole } from \"./lib/auth\";\n\nconst auditEventValidator = v.object({\n  _id: v.id(\"auditLogs\"),\n  _creationTime: v.number(),\n  action: v.string(),\n  userId: v.optional(v.string()),\n  resourceType: v.string(),\n  resourceId: v.string(),\n  details: v.optional(v.any()),\n  ipAddress: v.optional(v.string()),\n  timestamp: v.number(),\n});\n\n// Internal: Log audit event\nexport const logEvent = internalMutation({\n  args: {\n    action: v.string(),\n    userId: v.optional(v.string()),\n    resourceType: v.string(),\n    resourceId: v.string(),\n    details: v.optional(v.any()),\n  },\n  returns: v.id(\"auditLogs\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"auditLogs\", {\n      ...args,\n      timestamp: Date.now(),\n    });\n  },\n});\n\n// Admin: View audit logs\nexport const getAuditLogs = query({\n  args: {\n    resourceType: v.optional(v.string()),\n    userId: v.optional(v.string()),\n    limit: v.optional(v.number()),\n  },\n  returns: v.array(auditEventValidator),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await requireRole(ctx, \"admin\");\n    \n    let query = ctx.db.query(\"auditLogs\");\n    \n    if (args.resourceType) {\n      query = query.withIndex(\"by_resource_type\", (q) => \n        q.eq(\"resourceType\", args.resourceType)\n      );\n    }\n    \n    return await query\n      .order(\"desc\")\n      .take(args.limit ?? 100);\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Never run `npx convex deploy` unless explicitly instructed\n- Never run any git commands unless explicitly instructed\n- Implement defense in depth (multiple security layers)\n- Log all sensitive operations for audit trails\n- Use confirmation codes for destructive actions\n- Rate limit all user-facing endpoints\n- Never expose internal API keys or errors\n- Review access patterns regularly\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Single point of failure** - Implement multiple auth checks\n2. **Missing audit logs** - Log all sensitive operations\n3. **Trusting client data** - Always validate server-side\n4. **Exposing error details** - Sanitize error messages\n5. **No rate limiting** - Always implement rate limits\n\n## References\n\n- Convex Documentation: https://docs.convex.dev/\n- Convex LLMs.txt: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n- Functions Auth: https://docs.convex.dev/auth/functions-auth\n- Production Security: https://docs.convex.dev/production\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:26:54.186Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Security Agents requiring advanced Convex application security review capabilities, including authorization logic and data access boundary analysis.","zh":"适用于需要高级Convex应用安全审查能力的AI安全代理，包括授权逻辑和数据访问边界分析。","ja":"Convexアプリケーションの高度なセキュリティレビュー機能を必要とするAIセキュリティエージェントに適しています。認可ロジックおよびデータアクセス境界分析を含みます。","ko":"고급 Convex 애플리케이션 보안 검토 기능을 필요로 하는 AI 보안 에이전트에 적합합니다. 권한 부여 논리 및 데이터 액세스 경계 분석을 포함합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de seguridad de IA que requieren capacidades avanzadas de revisión de seguridad de aplicaciones Convex, incluyendo lógica de autorización y análisis de límites de acceso a datos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de sécurité IA nécessitant des capacités de révision de sécurité avancées pour les applications Convex, notamment la logique d''autorisation et l''analyse des limites d''accès aux données.","de":"Ideal für AI-Sicherheitsagenten, die erweiterte Sicherheitsprüffunktionen für Convex-Anwendungen benötigen, einschließlich Autorisierungslogik und Datenzugriffsgrenzenanalyse.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Segurança de IA que exigem capacidades avançadas de revisão de segurança de aplicativos Convex, incluindo lógica de autorização e análise de limites de acesso a dados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ-безопасности, требующих продвинутых возможностей проверки безопасности приложений Convex, включая логику авторизации и анализ границ доступа к данным.","ar":"مثالي لعمال الأمن الإصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لاستعراض أمان تطبيقات Convex، بما في ذلك منطق التفويض وتحليل حدود الوصول إلى البيانات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to conduct comprehensive security audits of Convex applications, enforcing rate limiting, action isolation, and protecting sensitive operations through robust authorization functions and data access controls, leveraging Convex documentation and production security guidelines.","zh":"赋予代理进行Convex应用程序的全面安全审计能力，强制执行速率限制、操作隔离，并通过强大的授权函数和数据访问控制保护敏感操作，利用Convex文档和生产安全指南。","ja":"Convexアプリケーションの包括的なセキュリティ監査をエージェントに実行させることができ、レート制限、操作の分離を行い、強力な認可機能およびデータアクセス制御を通じて機密操作を保護します。Convexのドキュメントおよび生産セキュリティガイドラインを活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Convex 애플리케이션의 포괄적인 보안 감사를 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 속도 제한, 작업 분리 및 강력한 인증 기능 및 데이터 액세스 제어를 통해敏感한 작업을 보호합니다. Convex 문서 및 프로덕션 보안 지침을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar auditorías de seguridad integrales de aplicaciones Convex, aplicando límites de velocidad, aislamiento de acciones y protegiendo operaciones sensibles a través de funciones de autorización robustas y controles de acceso a datos, aprovechando la documentación y las directrices de seguridad de producción de Convex.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réaliser des audits de sécurité complets des applications Convex, en appliquant des limites de débit, un isolement des actions et en protégeant les opérations sensibles grâce à des fonctions d''autorisation robustes et à des contrôles d''accès aux données, en tirant parti de la documentation et des lignes directrices de sécurité de production de Convex.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Sicherheitsaudits von Convex-Anwendungen durchzuführen, indem sie Rate Limiting, Aktionenisolation und Schutz von sensitiven Operationen durch robuste Autorisierungsfunktionen und Datenzugriffskontrollen durchsetzen, wobei sie die Convex-Dokumentation und die Produktions-Sicherheitsrichtlinien nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar auditorias de segurança abrangentes de aplicativos Convex, aplicando limitação de taxa, isolamento de ações e protegendo operações sensíveis por meio de funções de autorização robustas e controles de acesso a dados, utilizando a documentação do Convex e as diretrizes de segurança de produção.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить комплексные аудиты безопасности приложений Convex, обеспечивая ограничение скорости, изоляцию действий и защиту чувствительных операций посредством прочных функций авторизации и контроля доступа к данным, используя документацию Convex и руководства по безопасности производства.","ar":"تمكّن العمال من إجراء عمليات تدقيق أمنية شاملة لتطبيقات Convex، وتنفيذ سيطرة على معدل النشاط وتفريغ الإجراءات وحماية العمليات الحساسة من خلال وظائف تفويض قوية وضوابط الوصول إلى البيانات، مستخدمة وثائق Convex وإرشادات الأمن الإنتاجي."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing Convex application authorization logic for vulnerabilities","Analyzing data access boundaries to prevent unauthorized access","Implementing rate limiting to prevent abuse and denial-of-service attacks","Isolating actions to prevent lateral movement in case of a breach","Protecting sensitive operations from unauthorized access"],"zh":["审计Convex应用程序授权逻辑以发现漏洞","分析数据访问边界以防止未经授权的访问","实施速率限制以防止滥用和拒绝服务攻击","隔离操作以防止安全漏洞时的横向移动","保护敏感操作免受未经授权的访问"],"ja":["Convexアプリケーションの認可ロジックを監査して脆弱性を発見する","データアクセス境界を分析して無許可アクセスを防ぐ","レート制限を実施して悪用およびサービス拒否攻撃を防ぐ","操作を分離してセキュリティ侵害時の横方向への移動を防ぐ","機密操作を無許可アクセスから保護する"],"ko":["Convex 애플리케이션의 권한 부여 논리를 감사하여 취약성을 발견하는 것","데이터 액세스 경계를 분석하여未許可 액세스를 방지하는 것","속도 제한을 구현하여 악용 및 서비스 거부 공격을 방지하는 것","작업을 분리하여 보안 침해 시의 횡단 방향 이동을 방지하는 것","민감한 작업을未許可 액세스로부터 보호하는 것"],"es":["Auditoría de la lógica de autorización de la aplicación Convex en busca de vulnerabilidades","Análisis de los límites de acceso a datos para prevenir el acceso no autorizado","Implementación de límites de velocidad para prevenir abusos y ataques de denegación de servicio","Aislamiento de acciones para prevenir el movimiento lateral en caso de una violación","Protección de operaciones sensibles del acceso no autorizado"],"fr":["Audit de la logique d''autorisation de l''application Convex pour les vulnérabilités","Analyse des limites d''accès aux données pour prévenir l''accès non autorisé","Mise en œuvre de limites de débit pour prévenir les abus et les attaques de déni de service","Isolement des actions pour prévenir le mouvement latéral en cas de violation","Protection des opérations sensibles contre l''accès non autorisé"],"de":["Prüfung der Autorisierungslogik der Convex-Anwendung auf Sicherheitslücken","Analyse der Datenzugriffsgrenzen, um nicht autorisierten Zugriff zu verhindern","Implementierung von Rate Limiting, um Missbrauch und Denial-of-Service-Angriffe zu verhindern","Isolierung von Aktionen, um laterales Arbeiten im Falle eines Sicherheitsvorfalls zu verhindern","Schutz von sensitiven Operationen vor nicht autorisiertem Zugriff"],"pt":["Auditoria da lógica de autorização do aplicativo Convex para vulnerabilidades","Análise de limites de acesso a dados para prevenir acesso não autorizado","Implementação de limitação de taxa para prevenir abuso e ataques de negação de serviço","Isolamento de ações para prevenir movimento lateral em caso de violação","Proteção de operações sensíveis contra acesso não autorizado"],"ru":["Аудит логики авторизации приложения Convex на наличие уязвимостей","Анализ границ доступа к данным для предотвращения неавторизованного доступа","Реализация ограничения скорости для предотвращения злоупотреблений и атак типа \"отказ в обслуживании\"","Изоляция действий для предотвращения бокового движения в случае нарушения","Защита чувствительных операций от неавторизованного доступа"],"ar":["تدقيق منطق التفويض لتطبيق Convex لتحديد النقاط الضعيفة","تحليل حدود الوصول إلى البيانات لمنع الوصول غير المصرح به","تنفيذ سيطرة على معدل النشاط لمنع الإساءة والهجمات التي تؤدي إلى انعدام الخدمة","عزل الإجراءات لمنع الحركة الجانبية في حالة حدوث انتهاك","حماية العمليات الحساسة من الوصول غير المصرح به"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Convex application code and documentation","Needs understanding of Convex-specific security features and best practices","May require additional configuration for production environments"],"zh":["需要访问Convex应用程序代码和文档","需要了解Convex特定的安全功能和最佳实践","可能需要为生产环境进行额外的配置"],"ja":["Convexアプリケーションのコードおよびドキュメントへのアクセスが必要","Convex固有のセキュリティ機能およびベストプラクティスの理解が必要","生産環境の場合、追加の設定が必要になることがあります"],"ko":["Convex 애플리케이션 코드 및 문서에 액세스해야 함","Convex 특정 보안 기능 및 모범 사례를 이해해야 함","제작 환경의 경우 추가 구성이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso al código y documentación de la aplicación Convex","Necesita comprensión de las características y mejores prácticas de seguridad específicas de Convex","Puede requerir configuración adicional para entornos de producción"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès au code et à la documentation de l''application Convex","Nécessite une compréhension des fonctionnalités et des meilleures pratiques de sécurité spécifiques à Convex","Peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire pour les environnements de production"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf den Code und die Dokumentation der Convex-Anwendung","Benötigt Verständnis für Convex-spezifische Sicherheitsfunktionen und Best Practices","Kann zusätzliche Konfiguration für Produktionsumgebungen erfordern"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao código e documentação do aplicativo Convex","Necessita de compreensão das funcionalidades de segurança específicas do Convex e das melhores práticas","Pode exigir configuração adicional para ambientes de produção"],"ru":["Требует доступа к коду и документации приложения Convex","Требует понимания особенностей безопасности Convex и лучших практик","Может требовать дополнительной настройки для производственных окружений"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الشفرة ووثائق تطبيق Convex","يتطلب فهم الميزات الأمنية الخاصة بتطبيق Convex وأفضل الممارسات","يمكن أن يتطلب تباعا إضافية للبيئات الإنتاجية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"73c90c2153d3308e020d46674240abb682bba4746179b4942c60cabda7a2e5b3","qualityScore":62}');
