","다운로드와 큐 관리의 제어","워크플로의 자동화","AI 에이전트의 지원","간단하고 사용하기 쉬운 명령줄 인터페이스"],"es":["Control de descargas","Gestión de colas","Automatización de flujos de trabajo","Integración con Agentes de IA","Interfaz de línea de comandos scriptable"],"fr":["Contrôle des téléchargements","Gestion des files d''attente","Automatisation des flux de travail","Intégration avec les Agents d''IA","Interface en ligne de commande scriptable"],"de":["Download-Steuerung","Warteschlangen-Verwaltung","Automatisierung von Workflows","Integration mit KI-Agenten","Scriptbare Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle"],"pt":["Controle de downloads","Automação de fluxos de trabalho","CLI scriptável","Integração com agentes de IA","Gerenciamento de filas","Suporte a SABnzbd"],"ru":["Управление загрузками","Автоматизация рабочих процессов","Scriptable CLI","Интеграция с ИИ Агентами","Управление очередями","Поддержка SABnzbd"],"ar":["التحكم في التنزيلات","آلية سير العمل","واجهة سطر أوامر قابلة للبرمجة","التكامل مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","إدارة الطوابير","دعم SABnzbd"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用sabx","什么是sabx","sabx替代品","sabx vs 其他CLI工具","sabx安装","sabx设置指南","AI智能代理工具","CLI工具下载"],"ja":["sabxの使い方","sabxとは","sabxの代替","sabx vs 他のCLIツール","sabxのインストール","sabxの設定ガイド","AIエージェントツール","CLIツールのダウンロード"],"ko":["sabx 사용법","sabx란","sabx 대체품","sabx vs 다른 CLI 도구","sabx 설치","sabx 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트 도구","CLI 도구 다운로드"],"es":["cómo usar sabx","qué es sabx","sabx alternativa","sabx vs SABnzbd","instalación de sabx","guía de configuración de sabx","Agentes de IA para desarrollo","herramientas de línea de comandos para SABnzbd"],"fr":["comment utiliser sabx","qu''est-ce que sabx","sabx alternative","sabx vs SABnzbd","installation de sabx","guide de configuration de sabx","Agents d''IA pour le développement","outils en ligne de commande pour SABnzbd"],"de":["sabx verwenden","was ist sabx","sabx Alternative","sabx vs SABnzbd","sabx Installieren","sabx Setup-Anleitung","KI-Agenten für Entwicklung","Kommandozeilen-Tools für SABnzbd"],"pt":["como usar sabx","o que é sabx","sabx alternative","sabx vs SABnzbd","instalar sabx","guia de configuração do sabx","agentes de IA","ferramentas de automação"],"ru":["как использовать sabx","что такое sabx","альтернатива sabx","sabx vs SABnzbd","установить sabx","руководство по настройке sabx","ИИ Агенты","инструменты автоматизации"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام sabx","ما هو sabx","بديل sabx","sabx مقابل SABnzbd","تثبيت sabx","دليل إعداد sabx","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات آليه"]}},"owner":"avivsinai","repo":"sabx","repoPath":"avivsinai/sabx","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.100Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sabx","description":"Control SABnzbd download manager via CLI. Use when users need to check download queue/history, add NZBs, manage priorities, control speed limits, pause/resume downloads, configure RSS feeds, run scheduled tasks, or automate Usenet workflows. Triggers include sabnzbd, sabx, downloads, nzb, usenet, download queue, download status.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# SABnzbd CLI (sabx)\n\nControl SABnzbd from the terminal. Covers common SABnzbd API operations.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n```bash\n# Install (Go 1.24+)\ngo install github.com/avivsinai/sabx/cmd/sabx@latest\n\n# Authenticate (stores API key in OS keyring)\nsabx login --base-url http://localhost:8080 --api-key <key>\n```\n\n## Quick Command Reference\n\n| Task | Command |\n|------|---------|\n| Queue status | `sabx queue list` |\n| Active downloads | `sabx queue list --active` |\n| Add NZB from URL | `sabx queue add ur","body":"# SABnzbd CLI (sabx)\n\nControl SABnzbd from the terminal. Covers common SABnzbd API operations.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n```bash\n# Install (Go 1.24+)\ngo install github.com/avivsinai/sabx/cmd/sabx@latest\n\n# Authenticate (stores API key in OS keyring)\nsabx login --base-url http://localhost:8080 --api-key <key>\n```\n\n## Quick Command Reference\n\n| Task | Command |\n|------|---------|\n| Queue status | `sabx queue list` |\n| Active downloads | `sabx queue list --active` |\n| Add NZB from URL | `sabx queue add url <url>` |\n| Add NZB file | `sabx queue add file <path>` |\n| Pause queue | `sabx queue pause` |\n| Resume queue | `sabx queue resume` |\n| Set priority | `sabx queue item priority <nzo_id> 2` |\n| Delete item | `sabx queue item delete <nzo_id>` |\n| History | `sabx history list` |\n| Retry failed | `sabx history retry <nzo_id>` |\n| Delete all history | `sabx history delete --all` |\n| System status | `sabx status` |\n| Full diagnostics | `sabx status --full --performance` |\n| Speed status | `sabx speed status` |\n| Set speed limit | `sabx speed limit --rate 5M` |\n| Remove speed limit | `sabx speed limit --none` |\n| Live dashboard | `sabx top` |\n\n## Priority Values\n\nPriority is -1 to 2: `-1`=low, `0`=normal, `1`=high, `2`=force\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Check and manage downloads\n```bash\nsabx queue list --active          # What''s downloading now\nsabx status --full                # Overall system health\nsabx speed status                 # Current speed and limits\nsabx warnings list                # Any runtime issues\n```\n\n### Add downloads\n```bash\nsabx queue add url https://example.com/file.nzb\nsabx queue add file ./local.nzb --cat movies\nsabx queue add local /path/on/server/file.nzb\n```\n\n### Priority and queue management\n```bash\nsabx queue item priority <nzo_id> 2    # Force (2=force priority)\nsabx queue item move <nzo_id> top      # Move to top\nsabx queue item move <nzo_id> to 0     # Move to position 0\nsabx queue sort name                   # Sort by name\nsabx history delete --all              # Clear entire history\nsabx history delete --failed           # Clear failed items only\n```\n\n### Pause/resume workflows\n```bash\nsabx queue pause                  # Pause all downloads\nsabx queue resume                 # Resume downloads\nsabx postprocess pause            # Pause post-processing\nsabx postprocess resume           # Resume post-processing\n```\n\n### RSS feed automation\n```bash\nsabx rss list                           # List configured feeds\nsabx rss add TVFeed --url <rss-url> --cat tv\nsabx rss run TVFeed                     # Manually trigger specific feed\nsabx rss run                            # Run all feeds\nsabx rss delete TVFeed\n```\n\n### Scheduler tasks\n```bash\nsabx schedule list\nsabx schedule add NightPause --set command=pause --set day=mon-sun --set hour=01 --set min=00\nsabx schedule set NightPause --set hour=02\nsabx schedule delete NightPause\n```\n\n### Server management\n```bash\nsabx server list                  # News servers\nsabx server stats                 # Per-server statistics\nsabx server test primary          # Test connectivity\nsabx server disconnect            # Disconnect from all servers\n```\n\n### Troubleshooting\n```bash\nsabx doctor                       # Health checks\nsabx warnings list                # Runtime warnings\nsabx logs list --lines 50         # Recent logs\nsabx logs tail --follow           # Stream logs\nsabx debug gc-stats               # GC diagnostics\n```\n\n## Output Modes\n\nAll commands support `--json` for scripting:\n```bash\nsabx queue list --json | jq ''.slots[0].filename''\nsabx speed status --json\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\n```bash\n# Multiple profiles\nsabx login --profile home --base-url http://home:8080 --api-key <key>\nsabx login --profile server --base-url http://server:8080 --api-key <key>\n\n# Switch profiles\nsabx --profile server queue list\n\n# Environment overrides\nSABX_BASE_URL=http://alt:8080 SABX_API_KEY=xxx sabx status\n```\n\n## References\n\n- **Full command reference**: See [references/commands.md](references/commands.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:33:52.835Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for CLI-focused AI Agents like Claude Code, Cursor, and Codex needing SABnzbd automation and queue management capabilities.","zh":"适合于像 Claude Code、Cursor 和 Codex 这样的面向 CLI 的 AI Agent，需要 SABnzbd 自动化和队列管理功能。","ja":"CLI フォーカスの AI エージェント (Claude Code、Cursor、Codex など) にとって最適で、SABnzbd の自動化とキュー管理機能が必要です。","ko":"CLI에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트(Claude Code, Cursor, Codex 등)에게 적합하며 SABnzbd 자동화 및 큐 관리 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA enfocados en CLI como Claude Code, Cursor y Codex que necesitan capacidades de automatización y gestión de cola de SABnzbd.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents IA axés sur CLI comme Claude Code, Cursor et Codex nécessitant une automation et une gestion de file d''attente SABnzbd.","de":"Perfekt für CLI-fokussierte KI-Agents wie Claude Code, Cursor und Codex, die SABnzbd-Automatisierungs- und Warteschlangen-Verwaltungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA focados em CLI, como Claude Code, Cursor e Codex, que necessitam de capacidades de automação e gerenciamento de filas do SABnzbd.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на CLI, таких как Claude Code, Cursor и Codex, которые требуют возможностей автоматизации и управления очередями SABnzbd.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يركز على واجهة سطر الأوامر مثل Claude Code و Cursor و Codex الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات أتمتة وإدارة قائمة SABnzbd."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to control SABnzbd downloads, manage queues, and automate workflows from the terminal using the SABnzbd API, supporting features like adding NZB from URLs and listing active downloads, all through a fast and scriptable CLI interface.","zh":"赋予代理控制 SABnzbd 下载、管理队列、从终端使用 SABnzbd API 自动执行工作流的能力，支持从 URL 添加 NZB 和列出活动下载等功能，所有这些都通过快速且可脚本的 CLI 接口实现。","ja":"エージェントに SABnzbd のダウンロードを制御し、キューを管理し、SABnzbd API を使用してターミナルからワークフローを自動化する機能を提供します。URL から NZB を追加したり、アクティブなダウンロードを一覧表示したりする機能をサポートし、すべて高速でスクリプト可能な CLI インターフェイスを通じて実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 SABnzbd 다운로드를 제어하고 큐를 관리하며 SABnzbd API를 사용하여 터미널에서 워크플ロー 자동화를 가능하게 하는 기능을 제공합니다. URL에서 NZB를 추가하거나 활성 다운로드를 나열하는 기능을 지원하며 모든 것은 빠르고 스크립트 가능한 CLI 인터페이스를 통해 가능합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a controlar las descargas de SABnzbd, gestionar colas y automatizar flujos de trabajo desde la terminal utilizando la API de SABnzbd, que admite características como agregar NZB desde URLs y listar descargas activas, todo a través de una interfaz de CLI rápida y scriptable.","fr":"Permet aux agents de contrôler les téléchargements SABnzbd, de gérer les files d''attente et d''automatiser les flux de travail depuis le terminal en utilisant l''API SABnzbd, qui prend en charge des fonctionnalités comme l''ajout de NZB à partir d''URL et la liste des téléchargements actifs, le tout via une interface CLI rapide et scriptable.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, SABnzbd-Downloads zu steuern, Warteschlangen zu verwalten und Workflows von der Terminal aus über die SABnzbd-API zu automatisieren, die Funktionen wie das Hinzufügen von NZB aus URLs und das Auflisten von aktiven Downloads unterstützt, all dies über eine schnelle und scriptbare CLI-Schnittstelle.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a controlar downloads do SABnzbd, gerenciar filas e automatizar fluxos de trabalho a partir do terminal usando a API do SABnzbd, com recursos como adicionar NZB a partir de URLs e listar downloads ativos, tudo por meio de uma interface de CLI rápida e scriptável.","ru":"Позволяет агентам контролировать загрузки SABnzbd, управлять очередями и автоматизировать рабочие процессы из терминала с помощью API SABnzbd, поддерживая функции, такие как добавление NZB из URL и перечисление активных загрузок, все через быстрый и скриптовый интерфейс CLI.","ar":"يمكن للعميل التحكم في تنزيلات SABnzbd وإدارة الطوابير وتنفيذ سير العمل تلقائيًا من الطرفية باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات SABnzbd، مع دعم ميزات مثل إضافة NZB من عناوين URL وlisting التنزيلات النشطة، كل ذلك من خلال واجهة سطر أوامر سريعة وقابلة للبرمجة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating SABnzbd queue management","Controlling downloads from the terminal","Integrating SABnzbd with custom workflows"],"zh":["自动化 SABnzbd 队列管理","从终端控制下载","将 SABnzbd 与自定义工作流集成"],"ja":["SABnzbd キュー管理の自動化","ターミナルからのダウンロード制御","SABnzbd とカスタムワークフローの統合"],"ko":["SABnzbd 큐 관리 자동화","터미널에서 다운로드 제어","SABnzbd와 사용자 지정 워크플로 통합"],"es":["Automatización de la gestión de cola de SABnzbd","Control de descargas desde la terminal","Integración de SABnzbd con flujos de trabajo personalizados"],"fr":["Automatisation de la gestion de file d''attente SABnzbd","Contrôle des téléchargements depuis le terminal","Intégration de SABnzbd avec des flux de travail personnalisés"],"de":["Automatisierung der SABnzbd-Warteschlangen-Verwaltung","Steuerung von Downloads von der Terminal aus","Integration von SABnzbd mit benutzerdefinierten Workflows"],"pt":["Automação de gerenciamento de filas do SABnzbd","Controle de downloads a partir do terminal","Integração do SABnzbd com fluxos de trabalho personalizados"],"ru":["Автоматизация управления очередями SABnzbd","Управление загрузками из терминала","Интеграция SABnzbd с пользовательскими рабочими процессами"],"ar":["أتمتة إدارة قائمة SABnzbd","التحكم في التنزيلات من الطرفية","دمج SABnzbd مع سير العمل المخصصة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Go 1.24+ for installation","Needs SABnzbd API key for authentication","Limited to SABnzbd API operations"],"zh":["需要 Go 1.24+ 来安装","需要 SABnzbd API 密钥来进行认证","仅限 SABnzbd API 操作"],"ja":["インストールには Go 1.24+ が必要","認証には SABnzbd API キーが必要","SABnzbd API 操作のみ"],"ko":["설치에는 Go 1.24+가 필요합니다","인증에는 SABnzbd API 키가 필요합니다","SABnzbd API 동작만 제한"],"es":["Requiere Go 1.24+ para la instalación","Necesita una clave de API de SABnzbd para la autenticación","Limitado a operaciones de la API de SABnzbd"],"fr":["Nécessite Go 1.24+ pour l''installation","A besoin d''une clé d''API SABnzbd pour l''authentification","Limité aux opérations de l''API SABnzbd"],"de":["Benötigt Go 1.24+ für die Installation","Benötigt einen SABnzbd-API-Schlüssel für die Authentifizierung","Begrenzt auf SABnzbd-API-Operationen"],"pt":["Exige Go 1.24+ para instalação","Necessita de chave de API do SABnzbd para autenticação","Limitado a operações de API do SABnzbd"],"ru":["Требует Go 1.24+ для установки","Требует ключа API SABnzbd для аутентификации","Ограничен операциями API SABnzbd"],"ar":["يتطلب Go 1.24+ للتثبيت","يحتاج إلى مفتاح API SABnzbd للتأكد","محدود بعمليات واجهة برمجة تطبيقات SABnzbd"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"05c15f03400133a22dae5fd2fcbe45f9b7245438b8bcef906c6d0492f0651fd2","qualityScore":62}');
