t":"Ferramentas de IA: co15-combinatorial-design com HUMMBL","ru":"ИИ Агенты: co15-combinatorial-design с HUMMBL","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: co15-combinatorial-design مع HUMMBL","en":"co15-combinatorial-design"},"description":{"zh":"co15组合设计是一种使用HUMMBL的agentic编排，用于提高开发效率和简化复杂系统的设计","ja":"co15組み合わせ設計は、HUMMBLを使用したエージェントのオーケストレーションを提供し、開発効率を上げ、複雑なシステムの設計を簡素化する","ko":"co15 조합 디자인은 HUMMBL을 사용한 에이전트 오케스트레이션을 제공하여 개발 효율을 높이고 복잡한 시스템의 설계를 단순화합니다","es":"El repositorio co15-combinatorial-design ofrece una orquestación de agentes con HUMMBL, un lenguaje de modelo mental útil para desarrolladores","fr":"Le référentiel co15-combinatorial-design propose une orchestration d''agents avec HUMMBL, un langage de modèle mental utile pour les développeurs","de":"Das Repository co15-combinatorial-design bietet eine Orchestrierung von Agenten mit HUMMBL, einer nützlichen mentalen Modelliersprache für Entwickler","pt":"co15-combinatorial-design é uma ferramenta de IA para agentic orchestration com HUMMBL, permitindo a criação de soluções inovadoras","ru":"co15-combinatorial-design - это инструмент ИИ для агентской оркестровки с HUMMBL, позволяющий создавать инновационные решения","ar":"co15-combinatorial-design هي أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لorchestration agentic مع HUMMBL، مما يسمح بإنشاء حلول مبتكرة","en":"Repository for agentic orchestration with HUMMBL - Highly Useful Mental Model Base Language"},"definition":{"en":"Repository for agentic orchestration with HUMMBL - Highly Useful Mental Model Base Language"},"features":{"zh":["使用HUMMBL实现agentic编排","提高开发效率和简化复杂系统的设计","支持多种开发语言和框架","提供强大的设计和优化工具","支持分布式系统和云计算"],"ja":["HUMMBLを使用したエージェントのオーケストレーション","開発効率を上げ、複雑なシステムの設計を簡素化","多種の開発言語とフレームワークをサポート","強力な設計と最適化ツールを提供","分散システムとクラウドコンピューティングをサポート"],"ko":["HUMMBL을 사용한 에이전트 오케스트레이션","개발 효율을 높이고 복잡한 시스템의 설계를 단순화","다양한 개발 언어와 프레임워크를 지원","강력한 설계와 최적화 도구를 제공","분산 시스템과 클라우드 컴퓨팅을 지원"],"es":["Orquestación de agentes con HUMMBL","Lenguaje de modelo mental útil","Desarrollo de aplicaciones de IA","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Documentación y soporte técnico"],"fr":["Orchestration d''agents avec HUMMBL","Langage de modèle mental utile","Développement d''applications d''IA","Intégration avec des outils de développement","Documentation et support technique"],"de":["Orchestrierung von Agenten mit HUMMBL","Nützliche mentale Modelliersprache","Entwicklung von KI-Anwendungen","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Dokumentation und technischer Support"],"pt":["Agentic orchestration com HUMMBL","Criação de soluções inovadoras","Integração com tecnologias de IA","Desenvolvimento de aplicações personalizadas","Suporte à tomada de decisões com base em dados"],"ru":["Агентская оркестровка с HUMMBL","Создание инновационных решений","Интеграция с технологиями ИИ","Разработка индивидуальных приложений","Поддержка принятия решений на основе данных"],"ar":["orchestration agentic مع HUMMBL","إنشاء حلول مبتكرة","التكامل مع تكنولوجيا الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير تطبيقات مخصصة","دعم اتخاذ القرارات على основе البيانات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","co15组合设计","HUMMBL","agentic编排","开发效率","复杂系统设计","如何使用co15组合设计","co15组合设计教程","co15组合设计与其他工具的比较"],"ja":["AIエージェント","co15組み合わせ設計","HUMMBL","エージェントのオーケストレーション","開発効率","複雑なシステムの設計","co15組み合わせ設計の使い方","co15組み合わせ設計チュートリアル","co15組み合わせ設計と他のツールの比較"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","co15 조합 디자인","HUMMBL","에이전트 오케스트레이션","개발 효율","복잡한 시스템 설계","co15 조합 디자인 사용법","co15 조합 디자인 튜토리얼","co15 조합 디자인과 다른 도구의 비교"],"es":["herramientas de AI","co15-combinatorial-design","HUMMBL","orquestación de agentes","lenguaje de modelo mental","desarrollo de aplicaciones de IA","cómo usar co15-combinatorial-design","alternativas a co15-combinatorial-design"],"fr":["outils d''IA","co15-combinatorial-design","HUMMBL","orchestration d''agents","langage de modèle mental","développement d''applications d''IA","comment utiliser co15-combinatorial-design","alternatives à co15-combinatorial-design"],"de":["KI-Tools","co15-combinatorial-design","HUMMBL","Orchestrierung von Agenten","mentale Modelliersprache","Entwicklung von KI-Anwendungen","wie man co15-combinatorial-design verwendet","Alternativen zu co15-combinatorial-design"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","co15-combinatorial-design","hummbl","agentic orchestration","desenvolvimento de aplicações","ia para negócios","soluções inovadoras","tecnologias de ia","como usar co15-combinatorial-design"],"ru":["ии агенты","co15-combinatorial-design","hummbl","агентская оркестровка","разработка приложений","ии для бизнеса","инновационные решения","технологии ии","как использовать co15-combinatorial-design"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","co15-combinatorial-design","hummbl","orchestration agentic","تطوير التطبيقات","الذكاء الاصطناعي للأعمال","حلول مبتكرة","تكنولوجيا الذكاء الاصطناعي","كيفية استخدام co15-combinatorial-design"]}},"owner":"hummbl-dev","repo":"hummbl-agent","repoPath":"hummbl-dev/hummbl-agent","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.152Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"co15-combinatorial-design","description":"Apply CO15 Combinatorial Design to systematically explore option combinations to find optimal configurations.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# CO15 Combinatorial Design\n\nApply the CO15 Combinatorial Design transformation to systematically explore option combinations to find optimal configurations.\n\n## What is CO15?\n\n**CO15 (Combinatorial Design)** Systematically explore option combinations to find optimal configurations.\n\n## When to Use CO15\n\n### Ideal Situations\n\n- Assemble components into a coherent whole\n- Integrate multiple solutions into a unified approach\n- Design systems that depend on clear interfaces and seams\n\n### Trigger Q","body":"# CO15 Combinatorial Design\n\nApply the CO15 Combinatorial Design transformation to systematically explore option combinations to find optimal configurations.\n\n## What is CO15?\n\n**CO15 (Combinatorial Design)** Systematically explore option combinations to find optimal configurations.\n\n## When to Use CO15\n\n### Ideal Situations\n\n- Assemble components into a coherent whole\n- Integrate multiple solutions into a unified approach\n- Design systems that depend on clear interfaces and seams\n\n### Trigger Questions\n\n- \"How can we use Combinatorial Design here?\"\n- \"What changes if we apply CO15 to this integrating two services?\"\n- \"Which assumptions does CO15 help us surface?\"\n\n## The CO15 Process\n\n### Step 1: Define the focus\n\n```typescript\n// Using CO15 (Combinatorial Design) - Establish the focus\nconst focus = \"Systematically explore option combinations to find optimal configurations\";\n```\n\n### Step 2: Apply the model\n\n```typescript\n// Using CO15 (Combinatorial Design) - Apply the transformation\nconst output = applyModel(\"CO15\", focus);\n```\n\n### Step 3: Synthesize outcomes\n\n```typescript\n// Using CO15 (Combinatorial Design) - Capture insights and decisions\nconst insights = summarize(output);\n```\n\n## Practical Example\n\n```typescript\n// Using CO15 (Combinatorial Design) - Example in a integrating two services\nconst result = applyModel(\"CO15\", \"Systematically explore option combinations to find optimal configurations\" );\n```\n\n## Integration with Other Transformations\n\n- **CO15 -> DE3**: Pair with DE3 when sequencing matters.\n- **CO15 -> SY8**: Use SY8 to validate or stress-test.\n- **CO15 -> RE2**: Apply RE2 to compose the output.\n\n## Implementation Checklist\n\n- [ ] Identify the context that requires CO15\n- [ ] Apply the model using explicit CO15 references\n- [ ] Document assumptions and outputs\n- [ ] Confirm alignment with stakeholders or owners\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Treating the model as a checklist instead of a lens\n- Skipping documentation of assumptions or rationale\n- Over-applying the model without validating impact\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Use explicit CO15 references in comments and docs\n- Keep the output focused and actionable\n- Combine with adjacent transformations when needed\n\n## Measurement and Success\n\n- Clearer decisions and fewer unresolved assumptions\n- Faster alignment across stakeholders\n- Reusable artifacts for future iterations\n\n## Installation and Usage\n\n### Nix Installation\n\n```nix\n{\n  programs.moltbot.plugins = [\n    { source = \"github:hummbl-dev/hummbl-agent?dir=skills/CO-composition/co15-combinatorial-design\"; }\n  ];\n}\n```\n\n### Manual Installation\n\n```bash\nmoltbot-registry install hummbl-agent/co15-combinatorial-design\n```\n\n### Usage with Commands\n\n```bash\n/apply-transformation CO15 \"Systematically explore option combinations to find optimal configurations\"\n```\n\n---\n*Apply CO15 to create repeatable, explicit mental model reasoning.*\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:46:47.874Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Optimization Agents needing systematic exploration of option combinations for optimal configurations.","zh":"非常适合需要系统性探索选项组合以获得最佳配置的优化代理。","ja":"最適化エージェントがオプションの組み合わせを体系的に探索するために最適な構成が必要な場合に適しています。","ko":"최적의 구성으로 옵션 조합을 체계적으로 탐색해야 하는 최적화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de optimización que necesitan una exploración sistemática de combinaciones de opciones para configuraciones óptimas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''optimisation nécessitant une exploration systématique de combinaisons d''options pour des configurations optimales.","de":"Perfekt für Optimierungsagenten, die eine systematische Erforschung von Optionenkombinationen für optimale Konfigurationen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Otimização que necessitam de exploração sistemática de combinações de opções para configurações ótimas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов оптимизации, которым требуется систематическое исследование комбинаций опций для оптимальных конфигураций.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التحسين الذي يحتاج إلى استكشاف منهجي لمجموعات الخيارات لأفضل التكوينات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to systematically explore option combinations using Combinatorial Design, integrating multiple solutions into unified approaches and designing systems with clear interfaces and seams, leveraging HUMMBL for agentic orchestration.","zh":"赋予代理系统性地探索选项组合的能力，使用组合设计，将多个解决方案整合到统一的方法中，并设计具有清晰接口和边界的系统，利用HUMMBL进行代理编排。","ja":"エージェントにオプションの組み合わせを体系的に探索する能力を付与し、組合せ設計を使用して複数のソリューションを統一されたアプローチに統合し、明確なインターフェイスとシームを持つシステムを設計し、HUMMBLを使用してエージェントのオーケストレーションを実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 옵션 조합을 체계적으로 탐색할 수 있도록 하며, 조합 설계를 사용하여 여러 솔루션을 통합된 접근 방식으로 결합하고, 명확한 인터페이스와 구분선을 갖는 시스템을 설계하며, HUMMBL을 사용하여 에이전트 오케스트레이션을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a explorar sistemáticamente las combinaciones de opciones utilizando el Diseño Combinacional, integrando múltiples soluciones en enfoques unificados y diseñando sistemas con interfaces y costuras claras, aprovechando HUMMBL para la orquestación de agentes.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''explorer systématiquement les combinaisons d''options en utilisant la Conception Combinatoire, en intégrant plusieurs solutions dans des approches unifiées et en concevant des systèmes avec des interfaces et des coutures claires, en exploitant HUMMBL pour l''orchestration d''agents.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Optionenkombinationen systematisch mithilfe des Kombinatorischen Designs zu erkunden, mehrere Lösungen in einheitliche Ansätze zu integrieren und Systeme mit klaren Schnittstellen und Nähten zu entwerfen, indem HUMMBL für die Agenten-Orchestrierung genutzt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a explorarem sistematicamente combinações de opções usando Combinatorial Design, integrando múltiplas soluções em abordagens unificadas e projetando sistemas com interfaces e costuras claras, aproveitando o HUMMBL para orquestração agente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью систематически исследовать комбинации опций с помощью Combinatorial Design, интегрируя несколько решений в унифицированные подходы и проектируя системы с четкими интерфейсами и швами, используя HUMMBL для агентской оркестрации.","ar":"يمكن للعميل استكشاف مجموعات الخيارات بشكل منهجي باستخدام التصميم التركيبي، ودمج الحلول المتعددة في نهج موحد، وتصميم الأنظمة التي تعتمد على واجهات واضحة، واستخدام HUMMBL لأوركسترا العميل."},"useCases":{"en":["Assembling components into coherent wholes","Integrating multiple solutions into unified approaches","Designing systems that depend on clear interfaces and seams"],"zh":["将组件组装成连贯的整体","将多个解决方案整合到统一的方法中","设计依赖于清晰接口和边界的系统"],"ja":["コンポーネントを一貫性のある全体に組み立てる","複数のソリューションを統一されたアプローチに統合する","明確なインターフェイスとシームに依存するシステムを設計する"],"ko":["コンポ넌트를 일관된 전체로 조립하는 것","여러 솔루션을 통합된 접근 방식으로 결합하는 것","명확한 인터페이스와 구분선에 의존하는 시스템을 설계하는 것"],"es":["Ensamblar componentes en wholes coherentes","Integrar múltiples soluciones en enfoques unificados","Diseñar sistemas que dependen de interfaces y costuras claras"],"fr":["Assembler des composants en wholes cohérents","Intégrer plusieurs solutions dans des approches unifiées","Concevoir des systèmes qui dépendent d''interfaces et de coutures claires"],"de":["Komponenten zu kohärenten Ganzen zusammenbauen","Mehrere Lösungen in einheitliche Ansätze integrieren","Systeme entwerfen, die von klaren Schnittstellen und Nähten abhängen"],"pt":["Montagem de componentes em conjuntos coerentes","Integração de múltiplas soluções em abordagens unificadas","Projeto de sistemas que dependem de interfaces e costuras claras"],"ru":["Сборка компонентов в связные целые","Интеграция нескольких решений в унифицированные подходы","Проектирование систем, которые зависят от четких интерфейсов и швов"],"ar":["تركيب المكونات في أجزاء متسقة","دمج الحلول المتعددة في نهج موحد","تصميم الأنظمة التي تعتمد على واجهات واضحة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires HUMMBL - Highly Useful Mental Model Base Language for agentic orchestration","Dependent on systematic exploration of option combinations"],"zh":["需要HUMMBL - 高度有用的精神模型基语言用于代理编排","依赖于选项组合的系统性探索"],"ja":["HUMMBL - Highly Useful Mental Model Base Languageが必要であるため、エージェントのオーケストレーションに使用する","オプションの組み合わせの体系的な探索に依存する"],"ko":["HUMMBL - 매우 유용한 정신 모델 기반 언어가 필요한 에이전트 오케스트레이션을 사용","옵션 조합의 체계적인 탐색에 의존"],"es":["Requiere HUMMBL - Lenguaje de Base de Modelo Mental Altamente Útil para la orquestación de agentes","Dependiente de la exploración sistemática de combinaciones de opciones"],"fr":["Nécessite HUMMBL - Langage de Base de Modèle Mental Hautement Utile pour l''orchestration d''agents","Dépendante de l''exploration systématique de combinaisons d''options"],"de":["Benötigt HUMMBL - Hoch Nützliche Mentale Modell-Basis-Sprache für die Agenten-Orchestrierung","Abhängig von der systematischen Erforschung von Optionenkombinationen"],"pt":["Requer HUMMBL - Highly Useful Mental Model Base Language para orquestração agente","Depende da exploração sistemática de combinações de opções"],"ru":["Требует HUMMBL - Highly Useful Mental Model Base Language для агентской оркестрации","Зависит от систематического исследования комбинаций опций"],"ar":["يتطلب HUMMBL - Highly Useful Mental Model Base Language لأوركسترا العميل","يعتمد على استكشاف منهجي لمجموعات الخيارات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6cd09cae5924d5e26986b6022f78ec63f8545c834936548b26550ccea5cb051e","qualityScore":62}');
