stem, and anti-hallucination enforcement"},"features":{"zh":["多代理协调工作流系统","持续学习与自适应机制","防幻觉强制执行技术","Claude代码专用优化","自动化代码生成管道","开发者友好的API接口"],"ja":["マルチエージェント連携ワークフローシステム","継続的学習と適応メカニズム","防幻觉強制実行技術","Claudeコード専用最適化","自動コード生成パイプライン","開発者向けAPIインターフェース"],"ko":["다중 에이전트 조정 워크플로우 시스템","지속적 학습 및 적응 메커니즘","방환각 강제 실행 기술","Claude 코드 전용 최적화","자동 코드 생성 파이프라인","개발자 친화적 API 인터페이스"],"es":["Coordinación multiagente","Sistema de aprendizaje","Prevención de alucinaciones","Automatización de flujos de trabajo","Integración con Claude Code"],"fr":["Coordination multi-agent","Système d''apprentissage","Prévention des hallucinations","Automatisation des flux de travail","Intégration avec Claude Code"],"de":["Multiagentenkoordination","Lernfunktion","Halluzinationsvermeidung","Workflow-Automatisierung","Integration mit Claude Code"],"pt":["Coordenação multi-agente","Sistema de aprendizado","Enforcement anti-hallucination","Automação de fluxo de trabalho","Integração com Claude Code"],"ru":["Координация нескольких агентов","Система обучения","Принудительное предотвращение зомбирования","Автоматизация рабочих процессов","Интеграция с Claude Code"],"ar":["تنسيق متعدد الوكلاء","نظام تعلم","تطبيق منع الوهم","آلية تحسين تدفق العمل","التكامل مع Claude Code"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI代理工作流","Schema Markup安装指南","多代理协调系统","Claude代码自动化","防幻觉AI工具","how to use Schema Markup","AI代理开发工具","代码生成自动化"],"ja":["AIエージェントワークフロー","Schema Markupインストールガイド","マルチエージェント連携システム","Claudeコード自動化","防幻觉AIツール","how to use Schema Markup","AIエージェント開発ツール","コード生成自動化"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 워크플로우","Schema Markup 설치 가이드","다중 에이전트 조정 시스템","Claude 코드 자동화","방환각 AI 도구","how to use Schema Markup","AI 에이전트 개발 도구","코드 생성 자동화"],"es":["cómo usar Schema Markup","qué es Schema Markup","alternativas a Schema Markup","Schema Markup vs Claude Code","instalación de Schema Markup","guía de configuración de Schema Markup"],"fr":["comment utiliser Schema Markup","qu''est-ce que Schema Markup","alternatives à Schema Markup","Schema Markup vs Claude Code","installation de Schema Markup","guide de configuration de Schema Markup"],"de":["wie man Schema Markup verwendet","was ist Schema Markup","Alternativen zu Schema Markup","Schema Markup vs Claude Code","Installation von Schema Markup","Konfigurationsanleitung für Schema Markup"],"pt":["como usar schema-markup","o que é schema-markup","alternativa para Claude Code","schema-markup vs outros agentes","instalar schema-markup","guia de configuração do schema-markup"],"ru":["как использовать schema-markup","что такое schema-markup","альтернатива для Claude Code","schema-markup vs другие агенты","установить schema-markup","руководство по настройке schema-markup"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام schema-markup","ما هو schema-markup","بديل ل Claude Code","schema-markup مقابل وكلاء آخرين","تثبيت schema-markup","دليل إعداد schema-markup"]}},"owner":"ashleytower","repo":"claude-code-workflow","repoPath":"ashleytower/claude-code-workflow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T01:32:52.468Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"schema-markup","description":"When the user wants to add, fix, or optimize schema markup and structured data on their site. Also use when the user mentions schema markup, structured data, JSON-LD, rich snippets, schema.org, FAQ schema, product schema, review schema, or breadcrumb schema. For broader SEO issues, see seo-audit.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Schema Markup\n\nYou are an expert in structured data and schema markup. Your goal is to implement schema.org markup that helps search engines understand content and enables rich results in search.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore implementing schema, understand:\n\n1. **Page Type","body":"# Schema Markup\n\nYou are an expert in structured data and schema markup. Your goal is to implement schema.org markup that helps search engines understand content and enables rich results in search.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore implementing schema, understand:\n\n1. **Page Type** - What kind of page? What''s the primary content? What rich results are possible?\n\n2. **Current State** - Any existing schema? Errors in implementation? Which rich results already appearing?\n\n3. **Goals** - Which rich results are you targeting? What''s the business value?\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Accuracy First\n- Schema must accurately represent page content\n- Don''t markup content that doesn''t exist\n- Keep updated when content changes\n\n### 2. Use JSON-LD\n- Google recommends JSON-LD format\n- Easier to implement and maintain\n- Place in `<head>` or end of `<body>`\n\n### 3. Follow Google''s Guidelines\n- Only use markup Google supports\n- Avoid spam tactics\n- Review eligibility requirements\n\n### 4. Validate Everything\n- Test before deploying\n- Monitor Search Console\n- Fix errors promptly\n\n---\n\n## Common Schema Types\n\n| Type | Use For | Required Properties |\n|------|---------|-------------------|\n| Organization | Company homepage/about | name, url |\n| WebSite | Homepage (search box) | name, url |\n| Article | Blog posts, news | headline, image, datePublished, author |\n| Product | Product pages | name, image, offers |\n| SoftwareApplication | SaaS/app pages | name, offers |\n| FAQPage | FAQ content | mainEntity (Q&A array) |\n| HowTo | Tutorials | name, step |\n| BreadcrumbList | Any page with breadcrumbs | itemListElement |\n| LocalBusiness | Local business pages | name, address |\n| Event | Events, webinars | name, startDate, location |\n\n**For complete JSON-LD examples**: See [references/schema-examples.md](references/schema-examples.md)\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Organization (Company Page)\nRequired: name, url\nRecommended: logo, sameAs (social profiles), contactPoint\n\n### Article/BlogPosting\nRequired: headline, image, datePublished, author\nRecommended: dateModified, publisher, description\n\n### Product\nRequired: name, image, offers (price + availability)\nRecommended: sku, brand, aggregateRating, review\n\n### FAQPage\nRequired: mainEntity (array of Question/Answer pairs)\n\n### BreadcrumbList\nRequired: itemListElement (array with position, name, item)\n\n---\n\n## Multiple Schema Types\n\nYou can combine multiple schema types on one page using `@graph`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@graph\": [\n    { \"@type\": \"Organization\", ... },\n    { \"@type\": \"WebSite\", ... },\n    { \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", ... }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Validation and Testing\n\n### Tools\n- **Google Rich Results Test**: https://search.google.com/test/rich-results\n- **Schema.org Validator**: https://validator.schema.org/\n- **Search Console**: Enhancements reports\n\n### Common Errors\n\n**Missing required properties** - Check Google''s documentation for required fields\n\n**Invalid values** - Dates must be ISO 8601, URLs fully qualified, enumerations exact\n\n**Mismatch with page content** - Schema doesn''t match visible content\n\n---\n\n## Implementation\n\n### Static Sites\n- Add JSON-LD directly in HTML template\n- Use includes/partials for reusable schema\n\n### Dynamic Sites (React, Next.js)\n- Component that renders schema\n- Server-side rendered for SEO\n- Serialize data to JSON-LD\n\n### CMS / WordPress\n- Plugins (Yoast, Rank Math, Schema Pro)\n- Theme modifications\n- Custom fields to structured data\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Schema Implementation\n```json\n// Full JSON-LD code block\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"...\",\n  // Complete markup\n}\n```\n\n### Testing Checklist\n- [ ] Validates in Rich Results Test\n- [ ] No errors or warnings\n- [ ] Matches page content\n- [ ] All required properties included\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What type of page is this?\n2. What rich results are you hoping to achieve?\n3. What data is available to populate the schema?\n4. Is there existing schema on the page?\n5. What''s your tech stack?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **seo-audit**: For overall SEO including schema review\n- **programmatic-seo**: For templated schema at scale\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-28T01:42:57.754Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for SEO-focused AI Agents needing structured data implementation for rich search results.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化数据实现以获得丰富搜索结果的SEO关注的AI代理。","ja":"SEOに焦点を当てた構造化データの実装が必要なAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"豊富한 검색 결과를 얻기 위한 구조화된 데이터 구현이 필요한 SEO 중심의 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de inteligencia artificial enfocados en SEO que necesitan implementación de datos estructurados para resultados de búsqueda ricos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle axés sur le SEO nécessitant une mise en œuvre de données structurées pour des résultats de recherche riches.","de":"Perfekt für SEO-fokussierte KI-Agents, die eine Implementierung von strukturierten Daten für reiche Suchergebnisse benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA com foco em SEO que necessitam de implementação de dados estruturados para resultados de busca ricos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на SEO, требующих реализации структурированных данных для насыщенных результатов поиска.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الويب الذكية التي تركز على تحسين محركات البحث وتحتاج إلى تنفيذ بيانات منظمة للحصول على نتائج بحث غنية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate schema.org markup for enhanced search engine understanding, enabling rich results and improved content discoverability using JSON-LD and microdata protocols.","zh":"赋予代理生成schema.org标记以增强搜索引擎的理解，从而实现丰富的结果和改进的内容发现，使用JSON-LD和microdata协议。","ja":"エージェントにschema.orgマークアップを生成する能力を与え、JSON-LDおよびmicrodataプロトコルを使用して検索エンジンの理解を強化し、リッチな結果とコンテンツの検出を改善します。","ko":"에이전트가 schema.org 마크업을 생성하여 검색 엔진의 이해를 향상시키고 JSON-LD 및 microdata 프로토콜을 사용하여 풍부한 결과와 콘텐츠 발견을 개선합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar marcado schema.org para una mejor comprensión del motor de búsqueda, lo que permite resultados ricos y una mejor capacidad de descubrimiento de contenido utilizando los protocolos JSON-LD y microdata.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer une balise schema.org pour une meilleure compréhension du moteur de recherche, permettant ainsi des résultats riches et une meilleure découverte de contenu en utilisant les protocoles JSON-LD et microdata.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, schema.org-Markup zu generieren, um das Verständnis der Suchmaschine zu verbessern, wodurch reiche Ergebnisse und eine verbesserte Inhaltsentdeckung mithilfe der JSON-LD- und Microdata-Protokolle ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar marcação schema.org para uma compreensão aprimorada do mecanismo de busca, permitindo resultados ricos e uma melhor descoberta de conteúdo usando os protocolos JSON-LD e microdata.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать маркировку schema.org для улучшенного понимания поисковыми системами, что позволяет получать насыщенные результаты и улучшать обнаруживаемость контента с помощью протоколов JSON-LD и microdata.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء تعليمات schema.org لتحسين فهم محركات البحث، مما يسمح بالحصول على نتائج غنية وتحسين اكتشاف المحتوى باستخدام بروتوكولات JSON-LD وميكروداتا."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing schema markup for product pages","Generating JSON-LD scripts for event calendars","Validating schema.org vocabulary for local business listings"],"zh":["为产品页面实现schema标记","为事件日历生成JSON-LD脚本","验证本地商业列表的schema.org词汇"],"ja":["製品ページのschemaマークアップを実装する","イベントカレンダーのJSON-LDスクリプトを生成する","ローカルビジネスリストのschema.org語彙を検証する"],"ko":["제품 페이지를 위한 schema 마크업 구현","이벤트 달력의 JSON-LD 스크립트 생성","로컬 비즈니스 목록의 schema.org 어휘 검증"],"es":["Implementar marcado de esquema para páginas de productos","Generar scripts JSON-LD para calendarios de eventos","Validar vocabulario schema.org para listados de negocios locales"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre une balise de schéma pour les pages de produits","Générer des scripts JSON-LD pour les calendriers d''événements","Valider le vocabulaire schema.org pour les listes d''entreprises locales"],"de":["Implementierung von Schemamarkup für Produktseiten","Generierung von JSON-LD-Skripten für Veranstaltungskalender","Validierung von schema.org-Vokabular für lokale Geschäftslisten"],"pt":["Implementar marcação de esquema para páginas de produtos","Gerar scripts JSON-LD para calendários de eventos","Validar vocabulário schema.org para listagens de empresas locais"],"ru":["Реализация маркировки схемы для страниц продуктов","Генерация скриптов JSON-LD для календарей событий","Проверка словаря schema.org для списков местных предприятий"],"ar":["تنفيذ تعليمات مخطط لصفحات المنتجات","إنشاء نصوص JSON-LD لتقويمات الأحداث","تحقق من مصطلحات schema.org لقوائم الشركات المحلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of schema.org vocabulary","May require additional markup for specific page types"],"zh":["需要schema.org词汇的知识","可能需要针对特定页面类型的额外标记"],"ja":["schema.org語彙の知識が必要","特定のページタイプの追加マークが必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["schema.org 어휘에 대한 지식이 필요","특정 페이지 유형에 대한 추가 마크업이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del vocabulario schema.org","Puede requerir una marca adicional para tipos de páginas específicas"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance du vocabulaire schema.org","Peut nécessiter une balise supplémentaire pour des types de pages spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse des schema.org-Vokabulars","Kann für bestimmte Seitentypen zusätzliche Markierung erfordern"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento do vocabulário schema.org","Pode exigir marcação adicional para tipos de páginas específicas"],"ru":["Требует знания словаря schema.org","Может требовать дополнительной маркировки для определенных типов страниц"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بمصطلحات schema.org","يمكن أن يتطلب تعليمات إضافية لأنواع صفحات معينة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1dc73cfc3de7466e84301bfc11a71b8a1a90b47aa842e2e181b61f34a187b2b3","qualityScore":62}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('pjt222/development-guides/practice-viriditas', 'community', 'pjt222', 'development-guides', 'pjt222/development-guides', 'practice-viriditas', 0, 0, 61, '2026-03-02T01:56:11.150Z', '2026-03-02T03:45:41.461Z', '6e58df35e662ed54fea3cd39c77bb18f9ce5ed8f7ce235f7c5dedb49dd4fa843', '{"id":"pjt222/development-guides/practice-viriditas","name":"practice-viriditas","description":{"zh":"practice-viriditas 提供了综合的 WSL-Windows 开发指南，包括 Claude Code 集成。帮助开发者高效开发和部署应用","ja":"practice-viriditas は、WSL-Windows 開発ガイドを提供します。Claude Code 統合を含み、開発者が効率的に開発とデプロイを行えるように支援します","ko":"practice-viriditas는 WSL-Windows 개발 가이드를 제공하며 Claude Code 통합을 포함합니다. 개발자가 효율적으로 개발하고 배포할 수 있도록 지원합니다","es":"Practice-viriditas ofrece guías de desarrollo integrales para entornos WSL con Claude Code. Mejora tus habilidades de desarrollo","fr":"Practice-viriditas propose des guides de développement complets pour les environnements WSL avec Claude Code. Améliorez vos compétences de développement","de":"Practice-viriditas bietet umfassende Entwicklungshandbücher für WSL-Windows-Umgebungen mit Claude Code-Integration. Verbessern Sie Ihre Entwicklungsfähigkeiten","pt":"Guia de desenvolvimento para WSL com Claude Code e practice-viriditas","ru":"Руководство по разработке для WSL с Claude Code и practice-viriditas","ar":"دليل تطوير لWSL مع Claude Code و practice-viriditas","en":"Comprehensive development guides for WSL-Windows environments with Claude Code integration"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能工具 practice-viriditas：WSL-Windows 开发指南","ja":"AIエージェント practice-viriditas：WSL-Windows 開発ガイド","ko":"AI 에이전트 practice-viriditas: WSL-Windows 개발 가이드","es":"Herramientas de Inteligencia Artificial: practice-viridit...","fr":"Outils d''Intelligence Artificielle: practice-viriditas po...","de":"KI-Tools: practice-viriditas für WSL-Windows Umgebungen","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: practice-viriditas para WSL","ru":"ИИ Агенты: practice-viriditas для WSL","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: practice-viriditas لWSL","en":"practice-viriditas"},"description":{"zh":"practice-viriditas 提供了综合的 WSL-Windows 开发指南，包括 Claude Code 集成。帮助开发者高效开发和部署应用","ja":"practice-viriditas は、WSL-Windows 開発ガイドを提供します。Claude Code 統合を含み、開発者が効率的に開発とデプロイを行えるように支援します","ko":"practice-viriditas는 WSL-Windows 개발 가이드를 제공하며 Claude Code 통합을 포함합니다. 개발자가 효율적으로 개발하고 배포할 수 있도록 지원합니다","es":"Practice-viriditas ofrece guías de desarrollo integrales para entornos WSL con Claude Code. Mejora tus habilidades de desarrollo","fr":"Practice-viriditas propose des guides de développement complets pour les environnements WSL avec Claude Code. Améliorez vos compétences de développement","de":"Practice-viriditas bietet umfassende Entwicklungshandbücher für WSL-Windows-Umgebungen mit Claude Code-Integration. Verbessern Sie Ihre Entwicklungsfähigkeiten","pt":"Guia de desenvolvimento para WSL com Claude Code e practice-viriditas","ru":"Руководство по разработке для WSL с Claude Code и practice-viriditas","ar":"دليل تطوير لWSL مع Claude Code و practice-viriditas","en":"Comprehensive development guides for WSL-Windows environments with Claude Code integration"},"definition":{"en":"Comprehensive development guides for WSL-Windows environments with Claude Code integration"},"features":{"zh":["综合的 WSL-Windows 开发指南","Claude Code 集成","高效开发和部署","支持多种开发语言","开发者友好的界面"],"ja":["WSL-Windows 開発ガイド","Claude Code 統合","効率的な開発とデプロイ","複数の開発言語をサポート","開発者向けのインターフェイス"],"ko":["WSL-Windows 개발 가이드","Claude Code 통합","효율적인 개발과 배포","다양한 개발 언어 지원","개발자용 인터페이스"],"es":["Guías de desarrollo para WSL","Integración de Claude Code","Mejora de habilidades de desarrollo","Compatibilidad con entornos Windows","Desarrollo de aplicaciones con React y Node.js"],"fr":["Guides de développement pour les environnements WSL","Intégration de Claude Code","Amélioration des compétences de développement","Compatibilité avec les environnements Windows","Développement d''applications avec React et Node.js"],"de":["Entwicklungshandbücher für WSL-Windows-Umgebungen","Claude Code-Integration","Verbesserung der Entwicklungsfähigkeiten","Kompatibilität mit Windows-Umgebungen","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit React und Node.js"],"pt":["Guia de desenvolvimento WSL","Integração com Claude Code","Ambientes de desenvolvimento personalizados","Suporte a ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Documentação detalhada"],"ru":["Руководство по разработке WSL","Интеграция с Claude Code","Настройка среды разработки","Поддержка инструментов разработки","Детальная документация"],"ar":["دليل تطوير WSL","دمج Claude Code","بيئات تطوير مخصصة","دعم أدوات التطوير","توثيق مفصل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI 智能工具","WSL-Windows 开发","Claude Code 集成","如何使用 practice-viriditas","practice-viriditas 安装","WSL-Windows 开发教程","practice-viriditas vs 其他开发工具","practice-viriditas alternative","practice-viriditas.setup guide"],"ja":["AI エージェント","WSL-Windows 開発","Claude Code 統合","practice-viriditas の使い方","practice-viriditas インストール","WSL-Windows 開発チュートリアル","practice-viriditas と他の開発ツールの比較","practice-viriditas の代替","practice-viriditas セットアップガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","WSL-Windows 개발","Claude Code 통합","practice-viriditas 사용법","practice-viriditas 설치","WSL-Windows 개발 튜토리얼","practice-viriditas와 다른 개발 도구 비교","practice-viriditas 대체","practice-viriditas 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar practice-viriditas","qué es WSL","alternativas a Claude Code","practice-viriditas vs otros herramientas de desarrollo","instalación de practice-viriditas","guías de desarrollo para WSL","desarrollo de aplicaciones con React","desarrollo de aplicaciones con Node.js"],"fr":["comment utiliser practice-viriditas","qu''est-ce que WSL","alternatives à Claude Code","practice-viriditas vs autres outils de développement","installation de practice-viriditas","guides de développement pour les environnements WSL","développement d''applications avec React","développement d''applications avec Node.js"],"de":["wie man practice-viriditas verwendet","was ist WSL","Alternativen zu Claude Code","practice-viriditas vs andere Entwicklungstools","Installation von practice-viriditas","Entwicklungshandbücher für WSL-Windows-Umgebungen","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit React","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit Node.js"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","desenvolvimento wsl","claude code","practice-viriditas","guias de desenvolvimento","ambientes de desenvolvimento","suporte a desenvolvedores","documentação de desenvolvimento","tutoriais de wsl"],"ru":["ии агенты","разработка wsl","claude code","practice-viriditas","руководства по разработке","среды разработки","поддержка разработчиков","документация разработки","уроки wsl"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير wsl","claude code","practice-viriditas","دلائل التطوير","بيئات التطوير","دعم المطورين","توثيق التطوير","دروس wsl"]}},"owner":"pjt222","repo":"development-guides","repoPath":"pjt222/development-guides","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.150Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"practice-viriditas","description":">","version":"1.0","tags":"hildegard, viriditas, greening, meditation, nature, contemplation, seasonal","bodyPreview":"# Practice Viriditas\r\n\r\nGuide meditation and philosophical contemplation on *viriditas* — Hildegard von Bingen''s concept of the divine greening power that permeates all creation.\r\n\r\n## When to Use\r\n\r\n- You want to practice Hildegardian contemplative spirituality grounded in nature\r\n- You feel disconnected from the natural world or seasonal rhythms\r\n- You need a meditation practice that integrates body, earth, and spirit\r\n- You are experiencing spiritual dryness or lack of vitality (opposite of v","body":"# Practice Viriditas\r\n\r\nGuide meditation and philosophical contemplation on *viriditas* — Hildegard von Bingen''s concept of the divine greening power that permeates all creation.\r\n\r\n## When to Use\r\n\r\n- You want to practice Hildegardian contemplative spirituality grounded in nature\r\n- You feel disconnected from the natural world or seasonal rhythms\r\n- You need a meditation practice that integrates body, earth, and spirit\r\n- You are experiencing spiritual dryness or lack of vitality (opposite of viriditas)\r\n- You want to deepen understanding of Hildegard''s ecological theology\r\n- You are seeking seasonal attunement practices through the liturgical and agricultural year\r\n\r\n## Inputs\r\n\r\n- **Required**: Current season (spring, summer, autumn, winter) or liturgical season (Advent, Lent, Easter, Ordinary Time)\r\n- **Optional**: Access to outdoor natural space (garden, park, forest) — indoor practice possible but less ideal\r\n- **Optional**: Current life situation (burnout, grief, transition, stagnation) — informs practice focus\r\n- **Optional**: Duration preference (5-10 min brief, 15-20 min standard, 30+ min extended)\r\n- **Optional**: Experience level (beginner, intermediate, advanced)\r\n\r\n## Procedure\r\n\r\n### Step 1: Understand the Concept of Viriditas\r\n\r\nGround the practice in Hildegard''s theological and natural philosophy.\r\n\r\n```\r\nVIRIDITAS — The Greening Power:\r\n\r\nDefinition:\r\nViriditas (from Latin \"viridis\" = green) is Hildegard''s term for the divine\r\nlife force that animates all creation. It is not merely \"greenness\" as color,\r\nbut the FORCE of growth, renewal, vitality, fecundity, and regeneration.\r\n\r\nHildegard''s Own Words:\r\n\"There is a power that has been from all eternity, and that force and\r\npotentiality is greenness... God has arranged all things in the world in\r\nconsideration of everything else.\"\r\n(*Liber Divinorum Operum*, Vision 1)\r\n\r\n\"Glance at the sun. See the moon and stars. Gaze at the beauty of earth''s\r\ngreenings. Now, think. What delight God gives to humankind with all these\r\nthings... All nature is at the disposal of humankind. We are to work with it.\r\nFor without it, we cannot survive.\"\r\n(*Scivias*, Book II, Vision 1)\r\n\r\nTheological Context:\r\n- Viriditas is NOT pantheism (nature = God)\r\n- Viriditas is God''s creative power EXPRESSED THROUGH nature\r\n- It is the Holy Spirit''s work in the material world\r\n- Humanity participates in viriditas through care, cultivation, and contemplation\r\n\r\nViriditas in the Human Person:\r\n- Physical: Health, vitality, energy, fruitfulness\r\n- Spiritual: Growth in virtue, generativity, creative work\r\n- Relational: Life-giving relationships, community flourishing\r\n- Ecological: Tending the earth, participating in regeneration\r\n\r\nOPPOSITE OF VIRIDITAS = ARIDITAS (Dryness):\r\n- Physical: Illness, exhaustion, infertility\r\n- Spiritual: Acedia (sloth), despair, sterility of soul\r\n- Ecological: Degradation, deforestation, soil depletion\r\n- Moral: Sin as \"withering\" or \"drying up\" of the soul''s greenness\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Expected:** User understands viriditas as divine life force in creation, not mere aesthetic greenness. Recognizes viriditas/ariditas as a spectrum of vitality.\r\n\r\n**On failure:** If theological language feels inaccessible, frame viriditas as \"life force\" or \"vitality\" — the power that makes things grow, heal, and flourish. Proceed with meditation practice.\r\n\r\n### Step 2: Preparation — Grounding and Centering\r\n\r\nPrepare the body and mind for contemplative engagement with viriditas.\r\n\r\n```\r\nPreparation Protocol (5 minutes):\r\n\r\nLOCATION:\r\n- Ideal: Outdoors in a natural setting (garden, park, forest edge, meadow)\r\n- Acceptable: Indoors near a window with a living plant visible\r\n- Minimum: Indoors with no view — use imagination and memory of nature\r\n\r\nPOSTURE:\r\n- Seated on ground, cushion, or chair — spine upright but not rigid\r\n- Hands resting on knees or in lap\r\n- Eyes open (soft gaze at nature) OR closed (inner visualization)\r\n- Barefoot if outdoors and weather permits (direct earth contact)\r\n\r\nGROUNDING:\r\n1. Take 3 deep breaths — inhale through nose, exhale through mouth\r\n2. Scan body from feet to head:\r\n   - Notice where you feel tense or closed\r\n   - Notice where you feel open or relaxed\r\n3. Imagine roots growing from your sitting bones into the earth\r\n   - You are rooted, like a tree\r\n   - You are part of the soil, not separate from it\r\n\r\nCENTERING:\r\n1. Bring attention to your heart center (chest, sternum)\r\n2. Recall Hildegard''s image: \"O most honored Greening Force, you are worthy\r\n   of embrace.\"\r\n3. Set intention: \"I am here to witness and participate in viriditas.\"\r\n   - Not to achieve or produce anything\r\n   - Not to \"get\" something from nature\r\n   - Simply to attune, observe, and participate\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Expected:** User is settled, grounded, and mentally prepared for contemplative engagement. Distraction has decreased; awareness has sharpened.\r\n\r\n**On failure:** If mind is highly agitated or distracted, extend preparation phase. Add a body scan (feet → legs → torso → arms → head) to bring awareness into the body before proceeding.\r\n\r\n### Step 3: Core Meditation — Observing Viriditas\r\n\r\nEngage in structured contemplation on the greening power in nature.\r\n\r\n```\r\nViriditas Meditation Structure (15-20 minutes):\r\n\r\nPHASE 1: OBSERVATION (5-7 minutes)\r\nLook at the natural world (or visualize it if indoors):\r\n- Where do you see green? Notice shades: lime, forest, olive, emerald\r\n- Where do you see NEW growth? Fresh shoots, buds, young leaves\r\n- Where do you see MATURE growth? Full foliage, thick bark, flowering\r\n- Where do you see DECAY? Dead leaves, fallen branches, composting matter\r\n  (Note: Decay is PART OF viriditas — it feeds new growth)\r\n\r\nSpecific Focus Questions:\r\n- Which plant or tree draws your attention? Why?\r\n- Where is viriditas most VIGOROUS? (New growth, climbing vines)\r\n- Where is viriditas most PATIENT? (Ancient trees, slow-growing moss)\r\n- Where is viriditas RESTING? (Seeds in soil, dormant buds in winter)\r\n\r\nPHASE 2: PARTICIPATION (5-7 minutes)\r\nShift from observing to FEELING yourself as part of the greening:\r\n- Place one hand on your heart, one on your belly\r\n- Breathe deeply and imagine:\r\n  - On INHALE: Sap rising through your spine, like a tree drawing water\r\n    from roots to crown\r\n  - On EXHALE: Releasing what is dead, dried, or no longer needed —\r\n    let it fall like autumn leaves\r\n\r\nAffirmation (Hildegard''s words):\r\n\"I am the supreme and fiery force who kindled every living spark...\r\nI flame above the beauty of the fields; I shine in the waters;\r\nI burn in the sun, the moon, and the stars.\"\r\n(*Scivias*, Book I, Vision 2)\r\n\r\nContinue breath cycle 7-10 rounds:\r\n- INHALE: Receive viriditas (vitality, life force, greening)\r\n- EXHALE: Release ariditas (dryness, exhaustion, withering)\r\n\r\nPHASE 3: INTEGRATION (3-5 minutes)\r\n- Return to normal breathing\r\n- Ask: \"Where in my life do I feel viriditas (alive, growing, generative)?\"\r\n- Ask: \"Where in my life do I feel ariditas (dry, stuck, lifeless)?\"\r\n- No need to answer verbally — simply let awareness arise\r\n- Bow to the green world in gratitude\r\n\r\nCLOSING:\r\nHildegard''s Prayer: \"O noble Greening, you are rooted in the sun, and in\r\nbright serenity you shine forth in a wheel that no earthly excellence can\r\ncomprehend.\"\r\nStand slowly. Re-enter ordinary awareness with renewed vitality.\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Expected:** User has experienced contemplative attunement to viriditas, both in external nature and internal life force. Sense of connection to living world strengthened.\r\n\r\n**On failure:** If meditation feels abstract or ungrounded, reduce visualization and focus ONLY on breath awareness with natural surroundings. Viriditas practice requires less \"doing\" and more \"allowing.\"\r\n\r\n### Step 4: Seasonal Attunement\r\n\r\nTailor the practice to the current season, recognizing that viriditas manifests differently throughout the year.\r\n\r\n```\r\nSeasonal Variations of Viriditas Practice:\r\n\r\nSPRING (March-May) — Viriditas ERUPTING:\r\n- Observation: Focus on buds, shoots, seedlings, first flowers\r\n- Meditation theme: Rebirth, new beginnings, potential breaking through\r\n- Affirmation: \"I am greening. New life stirs within me.\"\r\n- Action integration: Plant seeds (literal or metaphorical), begin new project\r\n- Liturgical connection: Easter (Resurrection as ultimate viriditas)\r\n\r\nSUMMER (June-August) — Viriditas at FULLNESS:\r\n- Observation: Focus on lush foliage, fruit formation, peak growth\r\n- Meditation theme: Abundance, manifestation, full expression of life\r\n- Affirmation: \"I am in full bloom. I bear fruit.\"\r\n- Action integration: Harvest (literally from garden, metaphorically from work)\r\n- Liturgical connection: Pentecost (Holy Spirit as fire AND greening)\r\n\r\nAUTUMN (September-November) — Viriditas HARVESTING and COMPOSTING:\r\n- Observation: Focus on seeds, falling leaves, fruit ripening and releasing\r\n- Meditation theme: Letting go, death as part of cycle, preparation for rest\r\n- Affirmation: \"I release what is ripe. I compost what is dead.\"\r\n- Action integration: Clear clutter, complete projects, prepare for winter rest\r\n- Liturgical connection: All Saints/All Souls (honoring death as passage)\r\n\r\nWINTER (December-February) — Viriditas RESTING (not absent):\r\n- Observation: Focus on dormant buds, seeds under snow, evergreen resilience\r\n- Meditation theme: Patience, hidden growth, trust in unseen life\r\n- Affirmation: \"I rest in the dark soil. I prepare to rise again.\"\r\n- Action integration: Stillness, contemplation, visioning without action\r\n- Liturgical connection: Advent (waiting in darkness for the coming Light)\r\n  and Lent (spiritual winter before Easter spring)\r\n\r\nNOTE: Viriditas is ALWAYS present, even in winter — it is resting,\r\nnot dead. Winter viriditas is the power that holds the promise of spring.\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Expected:** Practice adapted to current season with appropriate focus (erupting/full/harvesting/resting). User recognizes viriditas as year-round force, not limited to spring/summer.\r\n\r\n**On failure:** If seasonal variation feels confusing, practice core meditation (Step 3) without seasonal overlay. Seasonal attunement is enrichment, not requirement.\r\n\r\n### Step 5: Integration — Living as Viriditas\r\n\r\nExtend the practice from meditation into daily life, embodying the greening power.\r\n\r\n```\r\nIntegration Practices — Daily and Weekly:\r\n\r\nDAILY MICRO-PRACTICES (5 minutes):\r\n- Morning: Step outside (or to a window) and greet the day''s green world\r\n  with one breath of gratitude\r\n- Meals: Bless food as viriditas (the greening that nourishes your body)\r\n- Evening: Journal one place you noticed viriditas today (in nature, in\r\n  relationships, in creative work)\r\n\r\nWEEKLY SUSTAINED PRACTICES:\r\n- Garden or tend plants (even a single houseplant) — literal participation\r\n  in viriditas\r\n- Walk in nature without destination — receptive observation\r\n- Create something (art, music, writing, cooking) — viriditas as generativity\r\n- Practice Hildegard''s herbal remedies or holistic health (viriditas in healing)\r\n\r\nMONTHLY ATTUNEMENT:\r\n- At each new moon or full moon, return to full viriditas meditation (20 min)\r\n- Assess: Where am I greening (alive, growing)? Where am I withering (dry,\r\n  stuck)?\r\n- Adjust: Add practices that restore viriditas where ariditas has crept in\r\n\r\nANTIDOTES TO ARIDITAS (Spiritual Dryness):\r\nIf you feel viriditas has left your life:\r\n- PHYSICALLY: Rest, hydration, nourishing food, time in nature, movement\r\n- SPIRITUALLY: Prayer, music, beauty, community, service\r\n- CREATIVELY: Make something with your hands (no goal, just process)\r\n- RELATIONALLY: Seek life-giving relationships; release draining ones\r\n\r\nHildegard''s Insight:\r\n\"When the soul is dry, it is like land that is not moistened by rain but is\r\nhard and unyielding. But when it is watered, it softens and becomes fruitful.\"\r\n(*Causae et Curae*)\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Expected:** User has concrete daily/weekly/monthly practices to sustain viriditas awareness beyond meditation sessions. Life becomes practice, not just scheduled sessions.\r\n\r\n**On failure:** If integration feels overwhelming, choose ONE daily micro-practice only (morning greeting of green world). Full integration takes months to years; start small.\r\n\r\n## Validation Checklist\r\n\r\n- [ ] User understands viriditas as divine life force, not mere greenness\r\n- [ ] Preparation phase completed (grounding, centering, intention-setting)\r\n- [ ] Core meditation practiced with observation, participation, and integration phases\r\n- [ ] Seasonal variation noted (spring/summer/autumn/winter manifestations)\r\n- [ ] At least one daily or weekly integration practice identified\r\n- [ ] User aware of ariditas (dryness) as opposite of viriditas\r\n- [ ] Practice framed as contemplative participation, not goal-driven achievement\r\n\r\n## Common Pitfalls\r\n\r\n1. **Romanticizing Nature**: Viriditas includes decay, death, and composting — not just pretty flowers\r\n2. **Seasonal Rigidity**: Winter is not \"bad\" or \"less green\" — it is necessary rest before spring\r\n3. **Indoor Dismissal**: If unable to access nature, indoor practice is valid. Hildegard spent much time in cloistered convent\r\n4. **Productivity Lens**: Viriditas is not about \"doing more\" — it is about BEING alive and generative in one''s proper season\r\n5. **Ignoring Ariditas**: Denying spiritual dryness prevents addressing it. Name it, then practice restoration\r\n6. **Solo Practice Only**: Viriditas is communal. Hildegard lived in a community of nuns. Share practice with others when possible\r\n7. **Theological Avoidance**: Viriditas is theological (Holy Spirit), not secular ecology. The spiritual dimension is integral to Hildegard''s concept\r\n\r\n## Related Skills\r\n\r\n- `formulate-herbal-remedy` — Plants as viriditas; remedies restore greening to the body\r\n- `assess-holistic-health` — Health is viriditas in the body; illness is ariditas\r\n- `compose-sacred-music` — Hildegard''s music is viriditas made audible\r\n- `consult-natural-history` — Physica''s plants, stones, animals all express viriditas\r\n- `meditate` (esoteric domain) — General meditation framework (viriditas is Hildegardian variant)\r\n- `heal` (esoteric domain) — Healing restores viriditas to body and soul\r\n- `cultivate-bonsai` (gardening domain) — Bonsai care as literal participation in viriditas\r\n- `plan-garden-calendar` (gardening domain) — Seasonal attunement through gardening\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:45:41.461Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Contemplative AI Agents specializing in Hildegardian spirituality and nature-based meditation guidance.","zh":"非常适合专门研究希尔德加德精神和自然基础冥想指导的沉思型AI代理。","ja":"ヒルデガルドの精神と自然に基づく瞑想のガイダンスを専門とする瞑想型AIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"힐데가르드 영성과 자연 기반 명상 지침을専門으로 하는沈思형 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA Contemplativos especializados en espiritualidad hildegardiana y orientación de meditación basada en la naturaleza.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA contemplatifs spécialisés dans la spiritualité hildegardienne et l''orientation de la méditation basée sur la nature.","de":"Perfekt für kontemplative KI-Agents, die auf hildegardische Spiritualität und naturbasierte Meditationsführung spezialisiert sind.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Contemplativos especializados em espiritualidade hildegardiana e orientação de meditação baseada na natureza.","ru":"Идеально подходит для созерцательных агентов ИИ, специализирующихся на гилдегардианской духовности и руководстве по медитации, основанной на природе.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين التأملية المتخصصة في الروحانية هيلديغارد و توجيه التأمل القائم على الطبيعة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to guide comprehensive WSL-Windows development environments with Claude Code integration for practicing viriditas meditation. Provides structured frameworks for Hildegardian contemplative spirituality focused on divine greening power and seasonal rhythm integration.","zh":"使代理能够通过Claude Code集成来指导综合的WSL-Windows开发环境，以练习viriditas冥想。为专注于神圣的绿化力量和季节节律集成的希尔德加德沉思灵修提供结构化框架。","ja":"エージェントがClaude Codeの統合を使用して、viriditas瞑想を実践するための総合的なWSL-Windows開発環境をガイドできるようにします。神聖な緑化の力と季節のリズムの統合に焦点を当てたヒルデガルドの瞑想的な霊的鍛錬のための構造化されたフレームワークを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 Claude Code 통합을 사용하여 비리디타스 명상을 실천하기 위한综合적인 WSL-Windows 개발 환경을 가이드 할 수 있도록 합니다. 신성한 녹색의 힘과 계절 리듬 통합에 중점을 둔 힐데가르드의沈思적 영성 훈련을 위한 구조화된 프레임워크를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes guiar entornos de desarrollo de WSL-Windows con integración de Claude Code para practicar meditación viriditas. Proporciona marcos estructurados para la espiritualidad contemplativa hildegardiana centrada en el poder de reverdecimiento divino y la integración del ritmo estacional.","fr":"Permet aux agents de guider les environnements de développement WSL-Windows avec une intégration de Claude Code pour pratiquer la méditation viriditas. Fournit des cadres structurés pour la spiritualité contemplative hildegardienne axée sur le pouvoir de reverdissement divin et l''intégration du rythme saisonnier.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, WSL-Windows-Entwicklungsumgebungen mit Claude-Code-Integration für die Praxis von Viriditas-Meditation zu leiten. Bietet strukturierte Rahmenbedingungen für die kontemplative hildegardische Spiritualität, die sich auf die göttliche Grünungskraft und die Integration des jahreszeitlichen Rhythmus konzentriert.","pt":"Permite que os agentes orientem ambientes de desenvolvimento WSL-Windows abrangentes com integração do Claude Code para praticar meditação viriditas. Fornece estruturas de trabalho para espiritualidade contemplativa hildegardiana focada no poder de verde divino e integração do ritmo sazonal.","ru":"Позволяет агентам руководить комплексными средами разработки WSL-Windows с интеграцией Claude Code для практики медитации viriditas. Предоставляет структурированные рамки для созерцательной гилдегардианской духовности, ориентированной на божественную силу зеленения и интеграцию сезонного ритма.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء توجيه بيئات التطوير الشاملة WSL-Windows مع دمج Claude Code لممارسة التأمل viriditas. يوفر إطارًا منظمًا للروحانية التأملية هيلديغارد مع التركيز على قوة الخضر المقدسة وتكامل الإيقاع الفصلي."},"useCases":{"en":["Guiding meditation sessions on divine greening power","Integrating body-earth-spirit contemplative practices","Addressing spiritual dryness through nature-based meditation","Creating seasonal rhythm spiritual exercises"],"zh":["指导关于神圣的绿化力量的冥想课程","集成身心灵的沉思实践","通过自然基础的冥想解决精神上的干枯","创建季节节律的灵修锻炼"],"ja":["神聖な緑化の力についての瞑想セッションをガイドする","身心霊の瞑想的な実践を統合する","自然に基づく瞑想を通じて精神的な乾燥に対処する","季節のリズムの霊的鍛錬を作成する"],"ko":["신성한 녹색의 힘에 관한 명상 세션을 가이드하기","身心靈의沈思적 실천을 통합하기","자연 기반의 명상을 통해 영적 건조를 해결하기","계절 리듬의 영성 훈련を作成하기"],"es":["Guía de sesiones de meditación sobre el poder de reverdecimiento divino","Integración de prácticas contemplativas cuerpo-tierra-espíritu","Abordar la sequedad espiritual a través de la meditación basada en la naturaleza","Creación de ejercicios espirituales de ritmo estacional"],"fr":["Guidage de séances de méditation sur le pouvoir de reverdissement divin","Intégration de pratiques contemplatives corps-terre-esprit","Traiter la sécheresse spirituelle à travers la méditation basée sur la nature","Création d''exercices spirituels de rythme saisonnier"],"de":["Leitung von Meditationsstunden über die göttliche Grünungskraft","Integration von kontemplativen Praktiken Körper-Erde-Geist","Bewältigung der geistigen Trockenheit durch naturbasierte Meditation","Erstellung von geistigen Übungen zum jahreszeitlichen Rhythmus"],"pt":["Orientar sessões de meditação sobre o poder de verde divino","Integrar práticas contemplativas corpo-terra-espírito","Abordar a seca espiritual por meio de meditação baseada na natureza","Criar exercícios espirituais de ritmo sazonal"],"ru":["Руководство сеансами медитации о божественной силе зеленения","Интеграция созерцательных практик тела-земли-духа","Решение проблемы духовной сухости с помощью медитации, основанной на природе","Создание духовных упражнений сезонного ритма"],"ar":["توجيه جلسات التأمل عن قوة الخضر الإلهي","دمج ممارسات التأمل الجسد-الأرض-الروح","معالجة الجفاف الروحي من خلال التأمل القائم على الطبيعة","إنشاء تمارين روحية للإيقاع الفصلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires WSL-Windows development environment","Designed specifically for Hildegardian spirituality context","Focuses on contemplative rather than analytical applications"],"zh":["需要WSL-Windows开发环境","专门为希尔德加德精神的背景而设计","侧重于沉思而非分析应用"],"ja":["WSL-Windows開発環境が必要","ヒルデガルドの霊的な背景のために特別に設計されている","分析的なアプリケーションよりも瞑想的なアプリケーションに重点を置いている"],"ko":["WSL-Windows 개발 환경이 필요함","힐데가르드 영성의 배경을 위해 특별히 설계됨","분석적인 애플리케이션보다沈思적인 애플리케이션에 중점을 둠"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de desarrollo WSL-Windows","Diseñado específicamente para el contexto de la espiritualidad hildegardiana","Se centra en aplicaciones contemplativas en lugar de analíticas"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de développement WSL-Windows","Conçu spécifiquement pour le contexte de la spiritualité hildegardienne","Se concentre sur les applications contemplatives plutôt que sur les applications analytiques"],"de":["Benötigt eine WSL-Windows-Entwicklungsumgebung","Speziell für den Kontext der hildegardischen Spiritualität konzipiert","Konzentriert sich auf kontemplative anstatt auf analytische Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige ambiente de desenvolvimento WSL-Windows","Projetado especificamente para contexto de espiritualidade hildegardiana","Foca em aplicações contemplativas em vez de analíticas"],"ru":["Требует среды разработки WSL-Windows","Разработан специально для контекста гилдегардианской духовности","Фокусируется на созерцательных, а не аналитических приложениях"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة تطوير WSL-Windows","صمّم خصيصًا للسياق الروحاني هيلديغارد","يركز على التطبيقات التأملية بدلاً من التحليلية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6e58df35e662ed54fea3cd39c77bb18f9ce5ed8f7ce235f7c5dedb49dd4fa843","qualityScore":61}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('obra/superpowers/executing-plans', 'official', 'obra', 'superpowers', 'obra/superpowers', 'executing-plans', 66125, 5048, 61, '2026-03-01T05:08:15Z', '2026-03-01T05:08:47.392Z', 'd099fa42fd7518f4dafa9f2d51c1c08fce970490d57682b6acd3e7a57bb55b52', '{"id":"obra/superpowers/executing-plans","name":"executing-plans","description":{"zh":"AI智能代理执行计划是一种批量执行任务并在批次之间进行审查的技术","ja":"AIエージェントによる計画の実行は、バッチ実行とチェックポイントによるレビューを実現する技術です","ko":"AI 에이전트 계획 실행은 배치 실행 및 체크포인트를 통한審查를 실현하는 기술입니다","es":"La habilidad de ejecución de planes permite implementar planes escritos con checkpoints y revisiones. Aprende a ejecutar tareas en batches con revisiones.","fr":"La compétence d''exécution de plans permet de mettre en œuvre des plans écrits avec des points de contrôle et des révisions. Apprenez à exécuter des tâches en batches avec des révisions.","de":"Die Fähigkeit zur Ausführung von Plänen ermöglicht die Umsetzung von schriftlichen Plänen mit Checkpoints und Überprüfungen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Aufgaben in Batches mit Überprüfungen ausführen.","pt":"A habilidade de executar planos é uma ferramenta de IA que permite carregar planos, revisá-los criticamente e executá-los em batches com checkpoints para revisão","ru":"Навык выполнения планов - это инструмент ИИ Агентов, который позволяет загружать планы, критически их просматривать и выполнять их в пакетах с контрольными пунктами для проверки","ar":"مهارة تنفيذ الخطط هي أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تمكن من تحميل الخطط ومراجعتها بشكل نقدي وتنفيذها في دفعات مع نقاط مراجعة","en":"Use when you have a written implementation plan to execute in a separate session with review checkpoints"},"owner":"obra","repo":"superpowers","repoPath":"obra/superpowers","stars":66125,"forks":5048,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:08:15Z","topics":[],"skillMd":{"name":"executing-plans","description":"Use when you have a written implementation plan to execute in a separate session with review checkpoints","bodyPreview":"# Executing Plans\n\n## Overview\n\nLoad plan, review critically, execute tasks in batches, report for review between batches.\n\n**Core principle:** Batch execution with checkpoints for architect review.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the executing-plans skill to implement this plan.\"\n\n## The Process\n\n### Step 1: Load and Review Plan\n1. Read plan file\n2. Review critically - identify any questions or concerns about the plan\n3. If concerns: Raise them with your human partner before starting\n4. If n","body":"# Executing Plans\n\n## Overview\n\nLoad plan, review critically, execute tasks in batches, report for review between batches.\n\n**Core principle:** Batch execution with checkpoints for architect review.\n\n**Announce at start:** \"I''m using the executing-plans skill to implement this plan.\"\n\n## The Process\n\n### Step 1: Load and Review Plan\n1. Read plan file\n2. Review critically - identify any questions or concerns about the plan\n3. If concerns: Raise them with your human partner before starting\n4. If no concerns: Create TodoWrite and proceed\n\n### Step 2: Execute Batch\n**Default: First 3 tasks**\n\nFor each task:\n1. Mark as in_progress\n2. Follow each step exactly (plan has bite-sized steps)\n3. Run verifications as specified\n4. Mark as completed\n\n### Step 3: Report\nWhen batch complete:\n- Show what was implemented\n- Show verification output\n- Say: \"Ready for feedback.\"\n\n### Step 4: Continue\nBased on feedback:\n- Apply changes if needed\n- Execute next batch\n- Repeat until complete\n\n### Step 5: Complete Development\n\nAfter all tasks complete and verified:\n- Announce: \"I''m using the finishing-a-development-branch skill to complete this work.\"\n- **REQUIRED SUB-SKILL:** Use superpowers:finishing-a-development-branch\n- Follow that skill to verify tests, present options, execute choice\n\n## When to Stop and Ask for Help\n\n**STOP executing immediately when:**\n- Hit a blocker mid-batch (missing dependency, test fails, instruction unclear)\n- Plan has critical gaps preventing starting\n- You don''t understand an instruction\n- Verification fails repeatedly\n\n**Ask for clarification rather than guessing.**\n\n## When to Revisit Earlier Steps\n\n**Return to Review (Step 1) when:**\n- Partner updates the plan based on your feedback\n- Fundamental approach needs rethinking\n\n**Don''t force through blockers** - stop and ask.\n\n## Remember\n- Review plan critically first\n- Follow plan steps exactly\n- Don''t skip verifications\n- Reference skills when plan says to\n- Between batches: just report and wait\n- Stop when blocked, don''t guess\n- Never start implementation on main/master branch without explicit user consent\n\n## Integration\n\n**Required workflow skills:**\n- **superpowers:using-git-worktrees** - REQUIRED: Set up isolated workspace before starting\n- **superpowers:writing-plans** - Creates the plan this skill executes\n- **superpowers:finishing-a-development-branch** - Complete development after all tasks\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:08:47.392Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理执行计划","ja":"AIエージェントによる計画の実行","ko":"AI 에이전트 계획 실행","es":"Herramientas de AI: Ejecución de Planes con Agentes","fr":"Outils d''IA: Exécution de Plans avec Agents","de":"KI-Tools: Ausführung von Plänen mit Agents","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Executando Planos com Checkpoints","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Выполнение Планов с Контрольными Пунктами","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: تنفيذ الخطط مع نقاط المراجعة","en":"executing-plans"},"description":{"zh":"AI智能代理执行计划是一种批量执行任务并在批次之间进行审查的技术","ja":"AIエージェントによる計画の実行は、バッチ実行とチェックポイントによるレビューを実現する技術です","ko":"AI 에이전트 계획 실행은 배치 실행 및 체크포인트를 통한審查를 실현하는 기술입니다","es":"La habilidad de ejecución de planes permite implementar planes escritos con checkpoints y revisiones. Aprende a ejecutar tareas en batches con revisiones.","fr":"La compétence d''exécution de plans permet de mettre en œuvre des plans écrits avec des points de contrôle et des révisions. Apprenez à exécuter des tâches en...","de":"Die Fähigkeit zur Ausführung von Plänen ermöglicht die Umsetzung von schriftlichen Plänen mit Checkpoints und Überprüfungen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Aufgaben i...","pt":"A habilidade de executar planos é uma ferramenta de IA que permite carregar planos, revisá-los criticamente e executá-los em batches com checkpoints para rev...","ru":"Навык выполнения планов - это инструмент ИИ Агентов, который позволяет загружать планы, критически их просматривать и выполнять их в пакетах с контрольными п...","ar":"مهارة تنفيذ الخطط هي أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تمكن من تحميل الخطط ومراجعتها بشكل نقدي وتنفيذها في دفعات مع نقاط مراجعة","en":"Use when you have a written implementation plan to execute in a separate session with review checkpoints"},"definition":{"en":"Use when you have a written implementation plan to execute in a separate session with review checkpoints"},"features":{"zh":["批量执行任务","批次之间进行审查","使用AI技术提高执行效率","支持多种计划文件格式","实时报告执行进度"],"ja":["バッチ実行","チェックポイントによるレビュー","AI技術を使用した実行効率の向上","複数の計画ファイル形式をサポート","実行進度のリアルタイム報告"],"ko":["배치 실행","체크포인트를 통한審查","AI 기술을 사용한 실행 효율성 향상","다양한 계획 파일 형식을 지원","실행 진행 상황 실시간 보고"],"es":["Carga y revisión de planes","Ejecución de tareas en batches","Revisiones y checkpoints","Implementación de planes con agentes","Identificación de preguntas y preocupaciones"],"fr":["Chargement et révision de plans","Exécution de tâches en batches","Révisions et points de contrôle","Mise en œuvre de plans avec agents","Identification de questions et de préoccupations"],"de":["Laden und Überprüfen von Plänen","Ausführung von Aufgaben in Batches","Überprüfungen und Checkpoints","Umsetzung von Plänen mit Agents","Identifizierung von Fragen und Bedenken"],"pt":["Carregamento de planos","Revisão crítica de planos","Execução de tarefas em batches","Checkpoints para revisão","Integração com ferramentas de IA"],"ru":["Загрузка планов","Критический просмотр планов","Выполнение задач в пакетах","Контрольные пункты для проверки","Интеграция с ИИ Агентами"],"ar":["تحميل الخطط","مراجعة نقدية للخطط","تنفيذ المهام في دفعات","نقاط المراجعة","التكامل مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","计划执行","批量执行","审查检查","AI技术","执行效率","计划文件格式"],"ja":["AIエージェント","計画の実行","バッチ実行","チェックポイント","AI技術","実行効率","計画ファイル形式"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","계획 실행","배치 실행","체크포인트","AI 기술","실행 효율성","계획 파일 형식"],"es":["herramientas de AI","ejecución de planes","agentes","implementación de planes","checkpoints","revisiones","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["outils d''IA","exécution de plans","agents","mise en œuvre de plans","points de contrôle","révisions","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["KI-Tools","Ausführung von Plänen","Agents","Umsetzung von Plänen","Checkpoints","Überprüfungen","Softwareentwicklung","Softwareingenieurwesen"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA","executar planos","checkpoints","eficiência","qualidade","desenvolvimento de software","gestão de projetos"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","выполнение планов","контрольные пункты","эфективность","качество","разработка программного обеспечения","управление проектами"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تنفيذ الخطط","نقاط المراجعة","الكفاءة","الجودة","تطوير البرمجيات","إدارة المشاريع"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Autonomous Agents like AutoGPT and LangChain that require structured plan execution with critical review checkpoints","zh":"适用于像 AutoGPT 和 LangChain 这样的自主代理，需要结构化的计划执行和关键审查检查点","ja":"AutoGPT や LangChain などの自律エージェントに適しており、構造化された計画の実行と重要なレビューのチェックポイントが必要","ko":"AutoGPT 및 LangChain과 같은 자율 에이전트에 적합하며 구조화된 계획 실행 및 임계점 검토 점검을 필요로 함","es":"Ideal para Autonomous Agents como AutoGPT y LangChain que requieren ejecución de planes estructurados con puntos de revisión críticos","fr":"Idéal pour les Autonomous Agents comme AutoGPT et LangChain qui nécessitent une exécution de plan structurée avec des points de contrôle de revue critique","de":"Ideal für Autonomous Agents wie AutoGPT und LangChain, die eine strukturierte Planausführung mit kritischen Überprüfungspunkten erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Autónomos como AutoGPT e LangChain que requerem execução de planos estruturados com pontos de verificação de revisão crítica","ru":"Идеально подходит для автономных агентов, таких как AutoGPT и LangChain, которым требуется выполнение структурированных планов с критическими контрольными точками проверки","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المستقلين مثل AutoGPT و LangChain التي تتطلب تنفيذ خطة منظمة مع نقاط مراجعة حرجة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to load, review, and execute implementation plans in batches with architect review, utilizing protocols like batch execution and checkpoint reviews, and handling file formats like plan files","zh":"赋予代理加载、审查和批量执行实现计划的能力，并利用批量执行和检查点审查等协议，处理计划文件等文件格式","ja":"エージェントが実装計画を読み込み、レビューしてバッチで実行できるようにし、バッチ実行やチェックポイントのレビューなどのプロトコルを利用し、計画ファイルなどのファイル形式を処理","ko":"에이전트가 구현 계획을 로드하고 검토하여 일괄적으로 실행할 수 있도록 하며 배치 실행 및 체크포인트 검토 등 프로토콜을 사용하고 계획 파일 등의 파일 형식을 처리","es":"Empodera a los agentes para cargar, revisar y ejecutar planes de implementación en lotes con revisión de arquitecto, utilizando protocolos como batch execution y checkpoint reviews, y manejando formatos de archivo como plan files","fr":"Permet aux agents de charger, examiner et exécuter des plans d''implémentation par lots avec revue d''architecte, en utilisant des protocoles comme le batch execution et les checkpoint reviews, et en gérant des formats de fichier comme les plan files","de":"Ermöglicht Agents das Laden, Überprüfen und Ausführen von Implementierungsplänen in Batches mit Architekten-Review unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie batch execution und checkpoint reviews sowie der Handhabung von Dateiformaten wie plan files","pt":"Capacita os agentes a carregar, rever e executar planos de implementação em lotes com revisão de arquitetura, utilizando protocolos como execução em lote e revisões de checkpoint, e manipulando formatos de arquivo como ficheiros de plano","ru":"Позволяет агентам загружать, проверять и выполнять планы реализации пакетами с проверкой архитектора, используя такие протоколы, как пакетное выполнение и проверки контрольных точек, и обрабатывая форматы файлов, такие как файлы планов","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تحميل ومراجعة وتنفيذ خطط التنفيذ على دفعات مع مراجعة مهندس البرمجيات، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل التنفيذ على دفعات ومراجعات نقاط التفتيش، والتعامل مع تنسيقات الملفات مثل ملفات الخطة"},"useCases":{"en":["Executing complex implementation plans with multiple checkpoints","Reviewing and validating plan files before execution","Batch processing tasks with periodic review and reporting"],"zh":["执行具有多个检查点的复杂实现计划","审查和验证计划文件以进行执行","批处理任务并定期审查和报告"],"ja":["複数のチェックポイントを伴う複雑な実装計画の実行","実行のための計画ファイルのレビューと検証","バッチ処理タスクと定期的なレビューとレポート"],"ko":["여러 체크포인트를 가진 복잡한 구현 계획의 실행","실행을 위한 계획 파일의 검토 및 확인","배치 처리 작업 및 정기적인 검토 및 보고"],"es":["Ejecutar planes de implementación complejos con múltiples puntos de control","Revisar y validar plan files antes de la ejecución","Procesamiento por lotes de tareas con revisión y reportes periódicos"],"fr":["Exécution de plans d''implémentation complexes avec plusieurs points de contrôle","Examen et validation des plan files avant l''exécution","Traitement par lots de tâches avec examen et reporting périodiques"],"de":["Ausführung komplexer Implementierungspläne mit mehreren Kontrollpunkten","Überprüfung und Validierung von plan files vor der Ausführung","Batch-Verarbeitung von Aufgaben mit periodischer Überprüfung und Berichterstattung"],"pt":["Executar planos de implementação complexos com múltiplos pontos de verificação","Rever e validar ficheiros de plano antes da execução","Processamento de tarefas em lote com revisão periódica e relatórios"],"ru":["Выполнение сложных планов реализации с множественными контрольными точками","Проверка и валидация файлов планов перед выполнением","Пакетная обработка задач с периодической проверкой и отчетностью"],"ar":["تنفيذ خطط تنفيذ معقدة بنقاط تفتيش متعددة","مراجعة والتحقق من صحة ملفات الخطة قبل التنفيذ","معالجة المهام على دفعات مع مراجعة دورية وإعداد التقارير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires a written implementation plan file","Needs human partner input for concern resolution","Dependent on successful loading and critical review of plan files"],"zh":["需要书面实现计划文件","需要人类合作伙伴的输入来解决问题","依赖于计划文件的成功加载和关键审查"],"ja":["書面での実装計画ファイルが必要","問題の解決には人間のパートナーの入力が必要","計画ファイルの読み込みと重要なレビューに依存"],"ko":["서면 구현 계획 파일이 필요","문제 해결을 위해 인간 파트너의 입력이 필요","계획 파일의 성공적인 로드 및 임계점 검토에 의존"],"es":["Requiere un archivo de plan de implementación escrito","Necesita aportación de un socio humano para la resolución de problemas","Depende de la carga exitosa y la revisión crítica de los plan files"],"fr":["Nécessite un fichier de plan d''implémentation écrit","Requiert l''apport d''un partenaire humain pour la résolution des problèmes","Dépend du chargement réussi et de l''examen critique des plan files"],"de":["Erfordert eine schriftliche Implementierungsplan-Datei","Benötigt menschliche Partner-Eingabe für die Problemlösung","Ist vom erfolgreichen Laden und der kritischen Überprüfung der plan files abhängig"],"pt":["Requer um ficheiro de plano de implementação escrito","Necessita de contribuição de um parceiro humano para resolução de problemas","Dependente do carregamento bem-sucedido e da revisão crítica dos ficheiros de plano"],"ru":["Требует наличия письменного файла плана реализации","Требует ввода человека-партнера для разрешения проблем","Зависит от успешной загрузки и критической проверки файлов планов"],"ar":["يتطلب ملف خطة تنفيذ مكتوب","يحتاج إلى مدخلات من شريك بشري لحل المشكلات","يعتمد على التحميل الناجح والمراجعة الحرجة لملفات الخطة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d099fa42fd7518f4dafa9f2d51c1c08fce970490d57682b6acd3e7a57bb55b52","repoEtag":"W/\"c0159b000a3f1065b2a623072c2f281d1dae59e39bce28acebe789d1e6a6aa8e\"","qualityScore":61}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/article-writing', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'article-writing', 55024, 6781, 61, '2026-03-01T05:07:39Z', '2026-03-01T05:09:14.112Z', '6ab082c7850e8e46e471026ea388024b1b9a574d84eb210fcb7391c15aa6b51a', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/article-writing","name":"article-writing","description":{"zh":"article-writing AI代理技能使用Claude模型生成高质量技术内容，包括博客文章、教程和开发指南。通过品牌示例保持语音一致性，为开发者提供结构清晰、可信度高的长格式内容创作解决方案。","ja":"article-writing AIエージェントスキルはClaudeモデルを使用して、ブログ記事、チュートリアル、開発ガイドを含む高品質な技術コンテンツを生成します。ブランドの例を通じて音声一貫性を維持し、開発者に構造が明確で信頼性の高い長文コンテンツ作成ソリューションを提供します。","ko":"article-writing AI 에이전트 스킬은 Claude 모델을 사용하여 블로그 게시물, 튜토리얼, 개발 가이드를 포함한 고품질 기술 콘텐츠를 생성합니다. 브랜드 예시를 통해 음성 일관성을 유지하며 개발자에게 구조가 명확하고 신뢰도 높은 장문 콘텐츠 제작 솔루션을 제공합니다.","es":"Article-Writing es una skill de AI Agent que genera contenido técnico largo y pulido, como tutoriales y artículos, manteniendo una voz de marca consistente mediante ejemplos. Ideal para desarrolladores que necesitan crear documentación o guías de forma rápida y creíble.","fr":"Article-Writing est une compétence d''agent IA qui génère du contenu technique long et poli, comme des tutoriels et des articles, en maintenant une voix de marque cohérente via des exemples. Idéal pour les développeurs créant de la documentation ou des guides rapidement et de manière crédible.","de":"Article-Writing ist eine KI-Agenten-Fähigkeit, die lange, polierte technische Inhalte wie Tutorials und Artikel generiert und durch Beispiele eine konsistente Markenstimme beibehält. Ideal für Entwickler, die schnell und glaubwürdig Dokumentation oder Leitfäden erstellen müssen.","pt":"A skill article-writing utiliza Claude, um LLM avançado, para gerar conteúdo técnico de longa forma com voz e estrutura consistentes. Ideal para desenvolvedores que produzem documentação, tutoriais e guias.","ru":"Навык article-writing использует Claude, продвинутый LLM, для создания длинного технического контента с единым стилем и структурой. Идеально для разработчиков, создающих документацию, руководства и туториалы.","ar":"تستخدم مهارة article-writing Claude، وهي نموذج لغوي كبير متقدم، لإنشاء محتوى تقني طويل بنمط وبنية متسقة. مثالي للمطورين الذين ينشئون الوثائق والبرامج التعليمية والأدلة.","en":"Write articles, guides, blog posts, tutorials, newsletter issues, and other long-form content in a distinctive voice derived from supplied examples or brand guidance. Use when the user wants polished written content longer than a paragraph, especially when voice consistency, structure, and credib..."},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":55024,"forks":6781,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:07:39Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"article-writing","description":"Write articles, guides, blog posts, tutorials, newsletter issues, and other long-form content in a distinctive voice derived from supplied examples or brand guidance. Use when the user wants polished written content longer than a paragraph, especially when voice consistency, structure, and credibility matter.","bodyPreview":"# Article Writing\n\nWrite long-form content that sounds like a real person or brand, not generic AI output.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- drafting blog posts, essays, launch posts, guides, tutorials, or newsletter issues\n- turning notes, transcripts, or research into polished articles\n- matching an existing founder, operator, or brand voice from examples\n- tightening structure, pacing, and evidence in already-written long-form copy\n\n## Core Rules\n\n1. Lead with the concrete thing: example, output, anecd","body":"# Article Writing\n\nWrite long-form content that sounds like a real person or brand, not generic AI output.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- drafting blog posts, essays, launch posts, guides, tutorials, or newsletter issues\n- turning notes, transcripts, or research into polished articles\n- matching an existing founder, operator, or brand voice from examples\n- tightening structure, pacing, and evidence in already-written long-form copy\n\n## Core Rules\n\n1. Lead with the concrete thing: example, output, anecdote, number, screenshot description, or code block.\n2. Explain after the example, not before.\n3. Prefer short, direct sentences over padded ones.\n4. Use specific numbers when available and sourced.\n5. Never invent biographical facts, company metrics, or customer evidence.\n\n## Voice Capture Workflow\n\nIf the user wants a specific voice, collect one or more of:\n- published articles\n- newsletters\n- X / LinkedIn posts\n- docs or memos\n- a short style guide\n\nThen extract:\n- sentence length and rhythm\n- whether the voice is formal, conversational, or sharp\n- favored rhetorical devices such as parentheses, lists, fragments, or questions\n- tolerance for humor, opinion, and contrarian framing\n- formatting habits such as headers, bullets, code blocks, and pull quotes\n\nIf no voice references are given, default to a direct, operator-style voice: concrete, practical, and low on hype.\n\n## Banned Patterns\n\nDelete and rewrite any of these:\n- generic openings like \"In today''s rapidly evolving landscape\"\n- filler transitions such as \"Moreover\" and \"Furthermore\"\n- hype phrases like \"game-changer\", \"cutting-edge\", or \"revolutionary\"\n- vague claims without evidence\n- biography or credibility claims not backed by provided context\n\n## Writing Process\n\n1. Clarify the audience and purpose.\n2. Build a skeletal outline with one purpose per section.\n3. Start each section with evidence, example, or scene.\n4. Expand only where the next sentence earns its place.\n5. Remove anything that sounds templated or self-congratulatory.\n\n## Structure Guidance\n\n### Technical Guides\n- open with what the reader gets\n- use code or terminal examples in every major section\n- end with concrete takeaways, not a soft summary\n\n### Essays / Opinion Pieces\n- start with tension, contradiction, or a sharp observation\n- keep one argument thread per section\n- use examples that earn the opinion\n\n### Newsletters\n- keep the first screen strong\n- mix insight with updates, not diary filler\n- use clear section labels and easy skim structure\n\n## Quality Gate\n\nBefore delivering:\n- verify factual claims against provided sources\n- remove filler and corporate language\n- confirm the voice matches the supplied examples\n- ensure every section adds new information\n- check formatting for the intended platform\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:09:14.112Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"使用AI代理article-writing技能编写技术文章指南","ja":"AIエージェントarticle-writingスキルで技術記事を執筆","ko":"AI 에이전트 article-writing 기술 문서 작성 가이드","es":"Article-Writing: Herramienta AI para Contenido Técnico | ...","fr":"Article-Writing: Outil IA pour Rédaction Technique | Claude","de":"Article-Writing: KI-Tool für Technische Inhalte | Claude","pt":"Agentes de IA para Escrita: Artigo com Claude Code e MCP","ru":"ИИ Агенты для написания статей: Claude Code и MCP","ar":"وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي للكتابة: Claude Code و MCP","en":"article-writing"},"description":{"zh":"article-writing AI代理技能使用Claude模型生成高质量技术内容，包括博客文章、教程和开发指南。通过品牌示例保持语音一致性，为开发者提供结构清晰、可信度高的长格式内容创作解决方案。","ja":"article-writing AIエージェントスキルはClaudeモデルを使用して、ブログ記事、チュートリアル、開発ガイドを含む高品質な技術コンテンツを生成します。ブランドの例を通じて音声一貫性を維持し、開発者に構造が明確で信頼性の高い長文コンテンツ作成ソリューションを提供します。","ko":"article-writing AI 에이전트 스킬은 Claude 모델을 사용하여 블로그 게시물, 튜토리얼, 개발 가이드를 포함한 고품질 기술 콘텐츠를 생성합니다. 브랜드 예시를 통해 음성 일관성을 유지하며 개발자에게 구조가 명확하고 신뢰도 높은 장문 콘텐츠 제작 솔루션을 제공합니다.","es":"Article-Writing es una skill de AI Agent que genera contenido técnico largo y pulido, como tutoriales y artículos, manteniendo una voz de marca consistente m...","fr":"Article-Writing est une compétence d''agent IA qui génère du contenu technique long et poli, comme des tutoriels et des articles, en maintenant une voix de ma...","de":"Article-Writing ist eine KI-Agenten-Fähigkeit, die lange, polierte technische Inhalte wie Tutorials und Artikel generiert und durch Beispiele eine konsistent...","pt":"A skill article-writing utiliza Claude, um LLM avançado, para gerar conteúdo técnico de longa forma com voz e estrutura consistentes. Ideal para desenvolvedo...","ru":"Навык article-writing использует Claude, продвинутый LLM, для создания длинного технического контента с единым стилем и структурой. Идеально для разработчико...","ar":"تستخدم مهارة article-writing Claude، وهي نموذج لغوي كبير متقدم، لإنشاء محتوى تقني طويل بنمط وبنية متسقة. مثالي للمطورين الذين ينشئون الوثائق والبرامج التعليم...","en":"Write articles, guides, blog posts, tutorials, newsletter issues, and other long-form content in a distinctive voice derived from supplied examples or brand ..."},"definition":{"en":"Write articles, guides, blog posts, tutorials, newsletter issues, and other long-form content in a distinctive voice derived from supplied examples or brand guidance. Use when the user wants polished written content longer than a paragraph, especially when voice consistency, structure, and credibility matter."},"features":{"zh":["基于Claude模型的长格式技术内容生成","通过品牌示例保持一致的写作语音和风格","支持技术博客、教程、开发指南多种格式","自动化生成结构清晰的可信技术文档","与MCP协议兼容的开发者工具集成","支持Python、Node.js等开发技术栈"],"ja":["Claudeモデルベースの長文技術コンテンツ生成","ブランド例を通じた一貫した執筆音声とスタイルの維持","技術ブログ、チュートリアル、開発ガイドなどの多様なフォーマット対応","構造が明確で信頼性の高い技術文書の自動作成","MCPプロトコル互換の開発者ツール統合","Python、Node.jsなどの開発技術スタック対応"],"ko":["Claude 모델 기반 장문 기술 콘텐츠 생성","브랜드 예시를 통한 일관된 작성 음성 및 스타일 유지","기술 블로그, 튜토리얼, 개발 가이드 등 다양한 형식 지원","구조가 명확하고 신뢰도 높은 기술 문서 자동 생성","MCP 프로토콜 호환 개발자 도구 통합","Python, Node.js 등의 개발 기술 스택 지원"],"es":["Generación de contenido largo (artículos, tutoriales, guías) con estructura coherente","Mantenimiento de voz de marca mediante ejemplos o directrices","Integración con Claude y el protocolo MCP para flujos de trabajo de desarrollador","Salida de contenido pulido y creíble para audiencias técnicas","Automatización de la creación de documentación y posts de blog","Optimizado para contenido técnico y para desarrolladores"],"fr":["Génération de contenu long (articles, tutoriels, guides) avec une structure cohérente","Maintien de la voix de la marque via des exemples ou des directives","Intégration avec Claude et le protocole MCP pour les workflows développeur","Production de contenu poli et crédible pour un public technique","Automatisation de la création de documentation et d''articles de blog","Optimisé pour le contenu technique et les développeurs"],"de":["Generierung langer Inhalte (Artikel, Tutorials, Anleitungen) mit konsistenter Struktur","Beibehaltung der Markenstimme durch Beispiele oder Richtlinien","Integration mit Claude und dem MCP-Protokoll für Entwickler-Workflows","Ausgabe von polierten und glaubwürdigen Inhalten für technisches Publikum","Automatisierung der Erstellung von Dokumentation und Blog-Beiträgen","Optimiert für technische Inhalte und Entwickler"],"pt":["Geração de conteúdo longo (artigos, tutoriais, posts) com LLM Claude","Manutenção de voz e estilo consistentes a partir de exemplos","Criação de conteúdo técnico credível para desenvolvedores","Integração com MCP (Model Context Protocol) para fluxos de trabalho","Otimizado para documentação, guias e newsletters","Ferramenta de produtividade para escrita de conteúdo"],"ru":["Создание длинного контента (статьи, руководства, посты) с помощью LLM Claude","Поддержание единого голоса и стиля на основе примеров","Создание достоверного технического контента для разработчиков","Интеграция с MCP (Model Context Protocol) для рабочих процессов","Оптимизировано для документации, гайдов и рассылок","Инструмент продуктивности для написания контента"],"ar":["إنشاء محتوى طويل (مقالات، برامج تعليمية، منشورات) باستخدام نموذج Claude اللغوي الكبير","الحفاظ