e IA basado en roles","Transformación de grandes modelos de lenguaje en departamentos de ingeniería","AutoMates para la creación de equipos de ingeniería","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Soporte para múltiples lenguajes de programación"],"fr":["Cadre d''agents d''IA basé sur les rôles","Transformation de grands modèles de langage en départements d''ingénierie","AutoMates pour la création d''équipes d''ingénierie","Intégration avec les outils de développement","Support pour plusieurs langages de programmation"],"de":["Rahmenwerk für KI-Agenten basierend auf Rollen","Transformation von großen Sprachmodellen in Ingenieurabteilungen","AutoMates für die Erstellung von Ingenieurteams","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Unterstützung für mehrere Programmiersprachen"],"pt":["Criação de equipes de engenharia virtuais","Transformação de modelos de linguagem em soluções personalizadas","Estrutura de multi-agente para desenvolvimento de soluções","Integração com tecnologias como React, Python e Node.js","Interface de linha de comando (CLI) para facilidade de uso"],"ru":["Создание виртуальных инженерных команд","Преобразование языковых моделей в индивидуальные решения","Многоагентная структура для разработки решений","Интеграция с технологиями như React, Python и Node.js","Интерфейс командной строки (CLI) для простоты использования"],"ar":["إنشاء فرق هندسية افتراضية","تحويل نماذج اللغة إلى حلول مخصصة","هيكل متعدد الوكلاء لتطوير الحلول","التكامل مع تقنيات مثل React و Python و Node.js","واجهة سطر الأوامر (CLI) لسهولة الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能团队构建","AutoMates介绍","大型语言模型结构化","工程团队自动化","如何使用AutoMates","AutoMates替代方案","AutoMates安装指南"],"ja":["AIエージェントチームビルド","AutoMatesの概要","大規模言語モデルの構造化","エンジニアリングチームの自動化","AutoMatesの使い方","AutoMatesの代替","AutoMatesのセットアップガイド"],"ko":["AI 인공지능 팀 빌드","AutoMates소개","대규모 언어 모델의 구조화","엔지니어링 팀의 자동화","AutoMates 사용법","AutoMates 대체","AutoMates 설치 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de agentes de IA","cómo usar AutoMates","qué es summon-team-build","alternativas a AutoMates","AutoMates vs otros frameworks de IA","instalación de AutoMates","guía de configuración de AutoMates"],"fr":["outils d''agents d''IA","comment utiliser AutoMates","qu''est-ce que summon-team-build","alternatives à AutoMates","AutoMates vs autres cadres d''IA","installation d''AutoMates","guide de configuration d''AutoMates"],"de":["KI-Agenten-Tools","wie man AutoMates verwendet","was ist summon-team-build","Alternativen zu AutoMates","AutoMates vs andere KI-Frameworks","Installation von AutoMates","Konfigurationsanleitung für AutoMates"],"pt":["como usar ferramentas de AI Agents","o que é summon-team-build","AutoMates alternativa","summon-team-build vs AutoMates","instalar summon-team-build","guia de configuração do AutoMates"],"ru":["как использовать инструменты ИИ Агентов","что такое summon-team-build","AutoMates альтернатива","summon-team-build vs AutoMates","установить summon-team-build","руководство по настройке AutoMates"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات أجهزة الإي","ما هي summon-team-build","بديل AutoMates","summon-team-build مقابل AutoMates","تنزيل summon-team-build","دليل إعداد AutoMates"]}},"owner":"Nate-Vish","repo":"Auto-Mates","repoPath":"Nate-Vish/Auto-Mates","stars":2,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T02:12:40Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"summon-team-build","description":"Launch a build team (Fetcher + Planner + Builder + Checker) for parallel feature development","bodyPreview":"# /summon-team-build - Build Team\n\nLaunch a coordinated build team: Fetcher studies the domain, Planner designs, Builder implements, Checker reviews — working in parallel as Agent Teams teammates.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/summon-team-build <task description>\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n```\n/summon-team-build Add user authentication with JWT tokens\n/summon-team-build Refactor the database layer for PostgreSQL support\n/summon-team-build Create a REST API for the task management feature\n```\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen inv","body":"# /summon-team-build - Build Team\n\nLaunch a coordinated build team: Fetcher studies the domain, Planner designs, Builder implements, Checker reviews — working in parallel as Agent Teams teammates.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/summon-team-build <task description>\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n```\n/summon-team-build Add user authentication with JWT tokens\n/summon-team-build Refactor the database layer for PostgreSQL support\n/summon-team-build Create a REST API for the task management feature\n```\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen invoked, you are the **Team Lead** (Orca). Spawn four teammates to work on the given task.\n\n### Step 1: Understand the Task\n\nRead these files for context:\n- `Dashboard/Brief.md` — current project state\n- `Library/Rules.md` — project constraints\n- Any files the user references\n\n### Step 2: Spawn Teammates\n\nLaunch four teammates using the Task tool. Each teammate gets a detailed prompt that includes:\n\n1. **Their identity** — tell them to read their identity file first\n2. **Shared context** — tell them CLAUDE.md is auto-loaded and to follow its protocols\n3. **Their specific assignment** — what they need to do for this task\n4. **Output location** — where to put their deliverables\n5. **Coordination notes** — what the other teammates are doing\n\n#### Teammate 0: Fetcher (LEARN FIRST)\n\n```\nYou are Fetcher — The Researcher.\n\nREAD FIRST:\n- Your identity: Library/Fetcher/Fetcher_Identity.md\n- Your knowledge: Library/Knowledge/Fetcher/README.md\n- CLAUDE.md is auto-loaded (shared protocols)\n\nYOUR TASK:\nResearch what''s needed to build: [TASK DESCRIPTION]\n\nDELIVERABLE:\n1. Check Library/Sources/ for existing relevant research\n2. If gaps exist, use WebSearch and WebFetch to gather sources\n3. Save new sources to Library/Sources/[topic-slug]/ with README.md index\n4. Write a brief study file to Dashboard/Work_Space/[Feature]_Study.md covering:\n   - Key technical considerations\n   - Existing patterns and best practices\n   - Pitfalls to avoid\n   - Recommended approach with sources\n\nCOORDINATION:\n- Planner will use your research to design the blueprint\n- Builder will reference it during implementation\n- You start FIRST — the team learns before it builds\n```\n\n#### Teammate 1: Planner\n\n```\nYou are Planner — The Architect.\n\nREAD FIRST:\n- Your identity: AgenTeam/Planner/Planner_Identity.md\n- Your knowledge: Library/Knowledge/Planner/README.md\n- CLAUDE.md is auto-loaded (shared protocols)\n\nYOUR TASK:\nCreate a blueprint for: [TASK DESCRIPTION]\n\nRead Fetcher''s study file at Dashboard/Work_Space/[Feature]_Study.md when available — use the research to inform your design.\n\nDELIVERABLE:\nWrite your blueprint to Dashboard/Work_Space/BLUEPRINT_[feature].md\n\nInclude:\n- Architecture decisions and rationale\n- File structure and components\n- Implementation phases (ordered steps)\n- Dependencies and risks\n- Acceptance criteria\n\nCOORDINATION:\n- Fetcher is researching the domain — incorporate their findings\n- Builder will implement from your blueprint\n- Checker will review the implementation\n- Keep the blueprint actionable — Builder needs clear steps\n```\n\n#### Teammate 2: Builder\n\n```\nYou are Builder — The Developer.\n\nREAD FIRST:\n- Your identity: AgenTeam/Builder/Builder_Identity.md\n- Your knowledge: Library/Knowledge/Builder/README.md\n- CLAUDE.md is auto-loaded (shared protocols)\n\nYOUR TASK:\nImplement: [TASK DESCRIPTION]\n\nWait for Planner''s blueprint at Dashboard/Work_Space/BLUEPRINT_[feature].md before starting implementation. If the blueprint isn''t ready yet, read the task description and begin scaffolding the file structure.\n\nDELIVERABLE:\nWorking code in the appropriate project location.\n\nCOORDINATION:\n- Planner is creating the blueprint — follow it\n- Checker will review your code — write clean, documented code\n- Flag any blueprint issues back to the team\n```\n\n#### Teammate 3: Checker\n\n```\nYou are Checker — QA & Security.\n\nREAD FIRST:\n- Your identity: AgenTeam/Checker/Checker_Identity.md\n- Your knowledge: Library/Knowledge/Checker/README.md\n- CLAUDE.md is auto-loaded (shared protocols)\n\nYOUR TASK:\nReview the implementation of: [TASK DESCRIPTION]\n\nWait for Builder to complete implementation. While waiting, review Planner''s blueprint for:\n- Security concerns\n- Missing edge cases\n- Architecture issues\n\nDELIVERABLE:\nWrite your review to Dashboard/Work_Space/REVIEW_[feature].md\n\nInclude:\n- Security assessment (OWASP top 10 check)\n- Code quality assessment\n- Test coverage gaps\n- Verdict: APPROVED / NEEDS CHANGES (with specific items)\n\nCOORDINATION:\n- Planner created the blueprint\n- Builder implemented the code\n- Your review is the quality gate before merge\n```\n\n### Step 3: Monitor Progress\n\nAs Team Lead:\n- Watch the shared task list (`Ctrl+T` to toggle)\n- If teammates get stuck or conflict, step in to clarify\n- Synthesize results when all four finish\n\n### Step 4: Report to User\n\nWhen the team finishes, present:\n```\n=== BUILD TEAM COMPLETE ===\n\nBLUEPRINT: [summary of Planner''s design]\nIMPLEMENTATION: [summary of what Builder created]\nREVIEW: [Checker''s verdict + any issues]\n\nFiles created/modified:\n- [list of files]\n\nNext steps:\n- [any remaining items]\n===========================\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- All four teammates run in parallel — Fetcher starts research immediately, Planner starts immediately, Builder and Checker wait for upstream work\n- Teammates share files through `Dashboard/Work_Space/` (file-based coordination)\n- The user (Pilot-in-Command) has final approval on all deliverables\n- If the task is small, consider whether you really need all four — sometimes just Builder + Checker is enough\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:22:56.180Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Multi-Agent System Developers needing coordinated team builds with role-based Large Language Model integration.","zh":"非常适合需要协调团队构建和基于角色的大型语言模型集成的多代理系统开发人员。","ja":"ロールベースの大規模言語モデル統合を伴うコーディネートされたチームビルドが必要なマルチエージェントシステム開発者に最適です。","ko":"조정된 팀 빌드와 역할 기반의 대규모 언어 모델 통합이 필요한 다중 에이전트 시스템 개발자를 위한 최적의 솔루션입니다.","es":"Perfecto para desarrolladores de sistemas de multi-agente que necesitan construcciones de equipo coordinadas con integración de modelos de lenguaje grande basada en roles.","fr":"Parfait pour les développeurs de systèmes multi-agents ayant besoin de constructions d''équipe coordonnées avec une intégration de modèles de langage large basée sur les rôles.","de":"Perfekt für Multi-Agenten-System-Entwickler, die koordinierte Team-Builds mit rollenbasierter Large Language Model-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para desenvolvedores de Sistemas de Múltiplos Agentes que precisam de compilações de equipe coordenadas com integração de modelos de linguagem grande baseada em funções.","ru":"Идеально для разработчиков Систем Множественных Агентов, которым необходимы координированные сборки команд с интеграцией больших языковых моделей на основе ролей.","ar":"مثالي لمطوري نظام متعدد الوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى بناء فريق منسق مع دمج نموذج لغة كبير مبني على الأدوار."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to launch coordinated build teams with Fetcher, Planner, Builder, and Checker roles, working in parallel as Agent Teams teammates, utilizing Large Language Models for structured engineering department transformations, and supporting tasks like adding user authentication with JWT tokens or refactoring database layers for PostgreSQL support.","zh":"赋予代理人使用Fetcher、Planner、Builder和Checker角色启动协调的构建团队的能力，作为Agent Teams团队成员并行工作，利用大型语言模型进行结构化的工程部门转型，并支持添加用户身份验证与JWT令牌或为PostgreSQL支持重构数据库层等任务。","ja":"Fetcher、Planner、Builder、Checker役割を使用して、調整されたビルドチームを起動するエージェントをEmpowerすることで、エージェントチームズのチームメンバーとして並行して作業し、大規模言語モデルを使用して構造化されたエンジニアリング部門の変革を実現し、ユーザー認証の追加とJWTトークンやPostgreSQLサポートのためのデータベース層のリファクタリングなどのタスクをサポートする。","ko":"Fetcher, Planner, Builder 및 Checker 역할을 사용하여 조정된 빌드 팀을 시작하는 에이전트를 강화하여 에이전트 팀즈 팀원として 병렬로 작업하고 대규모 언어 모델을 사용하여 구조화된 엔지니어링 부서의 변화를 구현하며 사용자 인증 추가 및 JWT 토큰 또는 PostgreSQL 지원을 위한 데이터베이스 계층 리팩토링 등의 작업을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para lanzar equipos de construcción coordinados con roles de Fetcher, Planner, Builder y Checker, trabajando en paralelo como compañeros de equipo de Agent Teams, utilizando Large Language Models para transformaciones de departamentos de ingeniería estructurados y apoyando tareas como agregar autenticación de usuario con tokens JWT o refactorizar capas de base de datos para soporte de PostgreSQL.","fr":"Permet aux agents de lancer des équipes de construction coordonnées avec les rôles de Fetcher, Planner, Builder et Checker, travaillant en parallèle en tant que membres de l''équipe Agent Teams, en utilisant des modèles de langage large pour des transformations de départements d''ingénierie structurées et en soutenant des tâches comme l''ajout d''une authentification utilisateur avec des jetons JWT ou le refactoring de couches de base de données pour un support PostgreSQL.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, koordinierte Build-Teams mit den Rollen Fetcher, Planner, Builder und Checker zu starten, die parallel als Teammitglieder von Agent Teams arbeiten, Large Language Models für strukturierte Transformierungen von Ingenieurbereichen nutzen und Aufgaben wie das Hinzufügen von Benutzerauthentifizierung mit JWT-Tokens oder das Refaktorisieren von Datenbank-Schichten für PostgreSQL-Unterstützung unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita agentes a lançar equipes de compilação coordenadas com funções de Fetcher, Planner, Builder e Checker, trabalhando em paralelo como colegas de equipe de Agent Teams, utilizando Modelos de Linguagem Grande para transformações de departamentos de engenharia estruturadas e apoiando tarefas como adicionar autenticação de usuário com tokens JWT ou refatorar camadas de banco de dados para suporte ao PostgreSQL.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запуска координированных сборок команд с ролями Fetcher, Planner, Builder и Checker, работающих параллельно как члены команды Agent Teams, использующих Большие Языковые Модели для структурированных преобразований инженерных отделов и поддержки задач, таких как добавление аутентификации пользователей с помощью токенов JWT или рефакторинг слоев базы данных для поддержки PostgreSQL.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إطلاق فرق بناء منسقة مع أدوار Fetcher و Planner و Builder و Checker ، يعملون بالتوازي كمشاركين في فريق Agent Teams ، يستخدمون نموذج لغة كبير لتحويلات قسم هندسي منسقة ، ودعم المهام مثل إضافة مصادقة مستخدم مع رموز JWT أو إعادة هيكلة طبقات قاعدة البيانات لدعم PostgreSQL."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating build team launches for complex tasks","Streamlining database refactoring for PostgreSQL support","Generating REST APIs for task management features","Implementing user authentication with JWT tokens"],"zh":["为复杂任务自动启动构建团队","为PostgreSQL支持简化数据库重构","为任务管理功能生成REST API","使用JWT令牌实现用户身份验证"],"ja":["複雑なタスクのビルドチームを自動的に起動する","PostgreSQLサポートのためのデータベースのリファクタリングをストリームライン化する","タスク管理機能のためのREST APIを生成する","JWTトークンを使用してユーザー認証を実装する"],"ko":["복잡한 작업을 위한 빌드 팀 자동 시작","PostgreSQL 지원을 위한 데이터베이스 리팩토링 스트림ライ닝","작업 관리 기능을 위한 REST API 생성","JWT 토큰을 사용한 사용자 인증 구현"],"es":["Automatizar lanzamientos de equipos de construcción para tareas complejas","Optimizar el refactoring de bases de datos para soporte de PostgreSQL","Generar API de REST para características de administración de tareas","Implementar autenticación de usuario con tokens JWT"],"fr":["Automatiser les lancements d''équipes de construction pour des tâches complexes","Optimiser le refactoring de bases de données pour un support PostgreSQL","Générer des API REST pour des fonctionnalités de gestion de tâches","Mettre en œuvre une authentification utilisateur avec des jetons JWT"],"de":["Automatisieren von Build-Team-Starts für komplexe Aufgaben","Optimieren des Refactorings von Datenbanken für PostgreSQL-Unterstützung","Generieren von REST-APIs für Aufgabenmanagement-Funktionen","Implementieren von Benutzerauthentifizierung mit JWT-Tokens"],"pt":["Automatizar lançamentos de equipes de compilação para tarefas complexas","Otimizar refatoração de banco de dados para suporte ao PostgreSQL","Gerar APIs REST para recursos de gerenciamento de tarefas","Implementar autenticação de usuário com tokens JWT"],"ru":["Автоматизировать запуски сборок команд для сложных задач","Оптимизировать рефакторинг базы данных для поддержки PostgreSQL","Генерировать REST API для функций управления задачами","Реализовать аутентификацию пользователей с помощью токенов JWT"],"ar":["توفير إطلاق فرق البناء التلقائي للمهام المعقدة","تبسيط إعادة هيكلة قاعدة البيانات لدعم PostgreSQL","генерировать واجهات برمجة تطبيقات REST لسمات إدارة المهام","تنفيذ مصادقة المستخدم مع رموز JWT"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Large Language Model integration","Role-based multi-agent framework dependency"],"zh":["需要大型语言模型集成","依赖于基于角色的多代理框架"],"ja":["大規模言語モデルの統合が必要","ロールベースのマルチエージェントフレームワークに依存する"],"ko":["대규모 언어 모델 통합 필요","역할 기반의 다중 에이전트 프레임워크 의존"],"es":["Requiere integración de Large Language Model","Dependencia de framework de multi-agente basado en roles"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration de modèle de langage large","Dépendance du framework multi-agent basé sur les rôles"],"de":["Erfordert Large Language Model-Integration","Abhängigkeit von rollenbasierter Multi-Agenten-Framework"],"pt":["Requer integração de Modelo de Linguagem Grande","Dependência de framework de multi-agente baseado em funções"],"ru":["Требует интеграции Больших Языковых Моделей","Зависимость от фреймворка множественных агентов на основе ролей"],"ar":["يتطلب دمج نموذج لغة كبير","اعتماد إطار عمل متعدد الوكلاء على أساس الأدوار"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"0876b760ca840b7c222d0a6da6dd0d6e0ff6224bd8ace1f425853b63bb766b00","qualityScore":60}');
