を作成し、ユーザーのニーズを深く理解","ko":"GitHub上的 고품질 프로젝트를 사용하여 AI 스킬을 생성하고, 사용자의 요구를 깊이 이해","es":"Crea habilidades AI basadas en proyectos de GitHub de alta calidad y metodologías probadas","fr":"Créez des compétences IA basées sur des projets GitHub de haute qualité et des méthodes éprouvées","de":"Erstellen Sie KI-Fähigkeiten basierend auf hochwertigen GitHub-Projekten und bewährten Methoden","pt":"Crie habilidades AI baseadas em projetos do GitHub. Aprenda com especialistas e melhore a produtividade.","ru":"Создайте навыки AI на основе проектов GitHub. Учитесь у экспертов и повышайте производительность.","ar":"ابني مهارات الذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام مشاريع جيثب. تعلم من الخبراء وحرص على تعزيز الإنتاجية.","en":"Stand on the shoulders of giants — Create AI skills built on proven methodologies from domain experts."},"definition":{"en":"Stand on the shoulders of giants — Create AI skills built on proven methodologies from domain experts."},"features":{"zh":["基于GitHub上的高质量项目","深入理解用户需求","支持多种任务的实现","利用领域专家成熟方法","提高AI技能的准确性","简化AI技能的开发流程"],"ja":["GitHub上の高品質プロジェクトに基づく","ユーザーのニーズを深く理解","多種多様なタスクの実現をサポート","ドメインエキスパートの確立された方法を利用","AIスキルの精度を向上","AIスキルの開発プロセスを簡素化"],"ko":["GitHub上的 고품질 프로젝트를 기반으로","사용자의 요구를 깊이 이해","다양한 작업의 구현을 지원","도메인 전문가의 검증된 방법을 활용","AI 스킬의 정확성을 향상","AI 스킬의 개발 프로세스를 단순화"],"es":["Crear habilidades AI personalizadas","Utilizar proyectos de GitHub de alta calidad","Metodologías probadas y documentadas","Análisis de sentimiento y generación de documentación","Conversión de markdown a PDF"],"fr":["Créer des compétences IA personnalisées","Utiliser des projets GitHub de haute qualité","Méthodes éprouvées et documentées","Analyse de sentiment et génération de documentation","Conversion de markdown en PDF"],"de":["Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten KI-Fähigkeiten","Verwendung von hochwertigen GitHub-Projekten","Bewährte und dokumentierte Methoden","Sentiment-Analyse und Generierung von Dokumentation","Konvertierung von Markdown in PDF"],"pt":["Criação de habilidades AI personalizadas","Acesso a projetos do GitHub de alta qualidade","Melhoria da produtividade com soluções comprovadas","Aprendizado com especialistas do GitHub","Desenvolvimento de soluções inovadoras"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных навыков AI","Доступ к высококачественным проектам GitHub","Повышение производительности с помощью проверенных решений","Обучение у экспертов GitHub","Разработка инновационных решений"],"ar":["إنشاء مهارات الذكاء الاصطناعي المخصصة","الوصول إلى مشاريع جيثب عالية الجودة","تحسين الإنتاجية باستخدام حلول مجربة","التعلم من الخبراء في جيثب","تطوير حلول مبتكرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub技能集成","AI技能开发","领域专家方法","高质量项目","用户需求理解","任务实现","AI技能准确性","开发流程简化"],"ja":["GitHubスキル統合","AIスキル開発","ドメインエキスパート方法","高品質プロジェクト","ユーザーのニーズ理解","タスク実現","AIスキルの精度","開発プロセスの簡素化"],"ko":["GitHub 스킬 통합","AI 스킬 개발","도메인 전문가 방법","고품질 프로젝트","사용자의 요구 이해","작업 구현","AI 스킬의 정확성","개발 프로세스 단순화"],"es":["habilidad de GitHub","creación de habilidades AI","proyectos de GitHub","metodologías probadas","análisis de sentimiento","generación de documentación","conversión de markdown a PDF"],"fr":["compétence GitHub","création de compétences IA","projets GitHub","méthodes éprouvées","analyse de sentiment","génération de documentation","conversion de markdown en PDF"],"de":["GitHub-Fähigkeit","Erstellung von KI-Fähigkeiten","GitHub-Projekte","bewährte Methoden","Sentiment-Analyse","Generierung von Dokumentation","Konvertierung von Markdown in PDF"],"pt":["habilidade AI do GitHub","projetos do GitHub","desenvolvimento de habilidades AI","soluções inovadoras","produtividade","especialistas do GitHub"],"ru":["навык AI из GitHub","проекты GitHub","разработка навыков AI","инновационные решения","производительность","эксперты GitHub"],"ar":["مهارة الذكاء الاصطناعي من جيثب","مشاريع جيثب","تطوير مهارات الذكاء الاصطناعي","حلول مبتكرة","الإنتاجية","خبراء جيثب"]}},"owner":"GBSOSS","repo":"skill-from-masters","repoPath":"GBSOSS/skill-from-masters","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.872Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skill-from-github","description":"Create skills by learning from high-quality GitHub projects","bodyPreview":"# Skill from GitHub\n\nWhen users want to accomplish something, search GitHub for quality projects that solve the problem, understand them deeply, then create a skill based on that knowledge.\n\n## When to Use\n\nWhen users describe a task and you want to find existing tools/projects to learn from:\n\n- \"I want to be able to convert markdown to PDF\"\n- \"Help me analyze sentiment in customer reviews\"\n- \"I need to generate API documentation from code\"\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Understand User Intent\n\nClari","body":"# Skill from GitHub\n\nWhen users want to accomplish something, search GitHub for quality projects that solve the problem, understand them deeply, then create a skill based on that knowledge.\n\n## When to Use\n\nWhen users describe a task and you want to find existing tools/projects to learn from:\n\n- \"I want to be able to convert markdown to PDF\"\n- \"Help me analyze sentiment in customer reviews\"\n- \"I need to generate API documentation from code\"\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Understand User Intent\n\nClarify what the user wants to achieve:\n- What is the input?\n- What is the expected output?\n- Any constraints (language, framework, etc.)?\n\n### Step 2: Search GitHub\n\nSearch for projects that solve this problem:\n\n```\n{task keywords} language:{preferred} stars:>100 sort:stars\n```\n\n**Search tips:**\n- Start broad, then narrow down\n- Try different keyword combinations\n- Include \"cli\", \"tool\", \"library\" if relevant\n\n**Quality filters (must meet ALL):**\n- Stars > 100 (community validated)\n- Updated within last 12 months (actively maintained)\n- Has README with clear documentation\n- Has actual code (not just awesome-list)\n\n### Step 3: Present Options to User\n\nShow top 3-5 candidates:\n\n```markdown\n## Found X projects that can help\n\n### Option 1: [project-name](github-url)\n- Stars: xxx | Last updated: xxx\n- What it does: one-line description\n- Why it''s good: specific strength\n\n### Option 2: ...\n\nWhich one should I dive into? Or should I search differently?\n```\n\n**Wait for user confirmation before proceeding.**\n\n### Step 4: Deep Dive into Selected Project\n\nOnce user selects a project, thoroughly understand it:\n\n1. **Read README** - Understand purpose, features, usage\n2. **Read core source files** - Understand how it works\n3. **Check examples** - See real usage patterns\n4. **Note dependencies** - What it relies on\n5. **Identify key concepts** - The mental model behind it\n\nExtract:\n- Core algorithm/approach\n- Input/output formats\n- Error handling patterns\n- Best practices encoded in the code\n\n### Step 5: Summarize Understanding\n\nPresent what you learned to user:\n\n```markdown\n## Understanding [project-name]\n\n### Core Approach\nHow it solves the problem...\n\n### Key Techniques\n1. ...\n2. ...\n\n### Limitations\n- ...\n\n### What I''ll encode in the skill\n- ...\n\nDoes this look right? Should I proceed to create the skill?\n```\n\n**Wait for user confirmation.**\n\n### Step 6: Create Skill via skill-creator\n\nHand off to skill-creator with:\n\n1. **Clear purpose** - What the skill does\n2. **Methodology** - The approach learned from the project\n3. **Step-by-step process** - Concrete instructions\n4. **Quality criteria** - What good output looks like\n5. **Common pitfalls** - What to avoid (learned from project issues/docs)\n\n**Important:** The skill should encode the *knowledge* from the project, not just wrap the tool. The skill should work even without the original project installed.\n\n## Example\n\n**User:** \"I want to write better commit messages\"\n\n**Step 2 - Search:**\n```\ncommit message convention stars:>100 sort:stars\n```\n\n**Step 3 - Present:**\n```\n## Found 4 projects\n\n### Option 1: conventional-commits/conventionalcommits.org (4.2k ⭐)\n- Specification for human and machine readable commit messages\n- Why: Industry standard, used by Angular, Vue, etc.\n\n### Option 2: commitizen/cz-cli (15k ⭐)\n- CLI tool for creating conventional commits\n- Why: Battle-tested, lots of adapters\n\n### Option 3: carloscuesta/gitmoji (14k ⭐)\n- Emoji guide for commit messages\n- Why: Visual, fun approach\n\nWhich one interests you?\n```\n\n**User:** \"Let''s go with conventional commits\"\n\n**Step 4 - Deep dive:**\n- Read the specification\n- Understand types (feat, fix, docs, etc.)\n- Learn about scopes, breaking changes\n- Study real-world examples\n\n**Step 5 - Summarize:**\n```\n## Understanding Conventional Commits\n\n### Core Approach\nStructured format: <type>(<scope>): <description>\n\n### Key Types\n- feat: new feature\n- fix: bug fix\n- docs: documentation\n- ...\n\n### Benefits Learned\n- Automated changelog generation\n- Semantic versioning\n- Clear history\n\nReady to create a commit message skill based on this?\n```\n\n**Step 6 - Create skill with these principles encoded**\n\n## Important Notes\n\n1. **Always get user confirmation** - At step 3 (project selection) and step 5 (before creating)\n2. **Prefer learning over wrapping** - Encode the knowledge, not just \"run this tool\"\n3. **Check license** - Mention if project has restrictive license\n4. **Credit the source** - Include attribution in generated skill\n5. **Quality over speed** - Take time to truly understand the project\n\n## What This Skill is NOT\n\n- NOT a package installer\n- NOT a tool wrapper\n- It''s about **learning from the best projects** and encoding that knowledge into a reusable skill\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:06:00.635Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing expertise in open-source project integration and GitHub repository analysis.","zh":"非常适合需要在开源项目集成和 GitHub 仓库分析方面拥有专长的 AI 代理。","ja":"オープンソースプロジェクトの統合と GitHub リポジトリの分析における専門知識が必要な AI エージェントに最適です。","ko":"오픈소스 프로젝트 통합 및 GitHub 리포지토리 분석에 전문 지식이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan experiencia en integración de proyectos de código abierto y análisis de repositorios de GitHub.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''expertise en intégration de projets open source et en analyse de dépôts GitHub.","de":"Perfekt für AI-Agenten, die Expertenwissen in der Integration von Open-Source-Projekten und der Analyse von GitHub-Repositorys benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de especialização em integração de projetos de código aberto e análise de repositórios do GitHub.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимы знания в области интеграции проектов с открытым исходным кодом и анализа репозиториев GitHub.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين الذين يحتاجون إلى الخبرة في دمج مشاريع مفتوحة المصدر وتحليل مستودعات جيت هاب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage proven methodologies from domain experts by searching and understanding quality projects on GitHub, utilizing markdown, and generating API documentation from code.","zh":"使代理能够通过搜索和理解 GitHub 上的高质量项目，利用 Markdown 并从代码生成 API 文档，来利用领域专家的成熟方法。","ja":"エージェントが GitHub 上の高品質なプロジェクトを検索して理解し、Markdown を利用し、コードから API ドキュメントを生成することで、ドメインエキスパートの確立された方法論を利用できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 GitHub의 고품질 프로젝트를 검색하고 이해하고, 마크다운을 활용하고, 코드에서 API 문서를 생성함으로써, 도메인 전문가의 검증된 방법론을 활용할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar metodologías probadas de expertos en el dominio mediante la búsqueda y comprensión de proyectos de calidad en GitHub, utilizando markdown y generando documentación de API a partir del código.","fr":"Permet aux agents de tirer parti de méthodologies éprouvées d''experts de domaine en recherchant et en comprenant des projets de qualité sur GitHub, en utilisant markdown et en générant une documentation d''API à partir du code.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, bewährte Methoden von Domänenexperten zu nutzen, indem sie qualitative Projekte auf GitHub suchen und verstehen, Markdown verwenden und API-Dokumentationen aus Code generieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a utilizar metodologias comprovadas de especialistas do domínio, pesquisando e entendendo projetos de qualidade no GitHub, utilizando markdown e gerando documentação de API a partir do código.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать проверенные методологии от экспертов домена, ища и понимая качественные проекты на GitHub, используя markdown и генерируя документацию API из кода.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من استخدام منهجيات مدعومة من خبراء المجال عن طريق البحث و فهم المشاريع عالية الجودة على جيت هاب، واستخدام تنسيق ماركداون، وتوليد وثائق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات من الكود."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating task solution discovery on GitHub","Generating API documentation from open-source code","Analyzing sentiment in customer reviews using existing tools"],"zh":["在 GitHub 上自动化任务解决方案的发现","从开源代码生成 API 文档","使用现有工具分析客户评论中的情绪"],"ja":["GitHub 上のタスク解決策の自動検出","オープンソースコードから API ドキュメントを生成","既存のツールを使用して顧客レビューの感情を分析"],"ko":["GitHub에서 태스크 해결方案을 자동화하여 발견하는こと","오픈소스 코드에서 API 문서를 생성하는こと","기존 도구를 사용하여 고객 리뷰의 감정을 분석하는こと"],"es":["Automatizar el descubrimiento de soluciones de tareas en GitHub","Generar documentación de API a partir de código de código abierto","Analizar la opinión en reseñas de clientes utilizando herramientas existentes"],"fr":["Automatiser la découverte de solutions de tâches sur GitHub","Générer une documentation d''API à partir de code open source","Analyser les sentiments dans les avis clients en utilisant des outils existants"],"de":["Automatisieren der Aufgabenlösungsentdeckung auf GitHub","Generieren von API-Dokumentationen aus Open-Source-Code","Analysieren von Stimmungen in Kundenbewertungen unter Verwendung bestehender Tools"],"pt":["Automatizar a descoberta de soluções de tarefas no GitHub","Gerar documentação de API a partir de código de código aberto","Analisar o sentimento em avaliações de clientes usando ferramentas existentes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать открытие решений задач на GitHub","Генерировать документацию API из открытого исходного кода","Анализировать настроения в отзывах клиентов, используя существующие инструменты"],"ar":["أتمتة اكتشاف حلول المهام على جيت هاب","توليد وثائق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات من الكود المفتوح","تحليل المشاعر في تقييمات العملاء باستخدام أدوات موجودة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub access and understanding of project structures","Dependent on the quality and relevance of GitHub projects"],"zh":["需要 GitHub 访问和对项目结构的理解","依赖于 GitHub 项目的质量和相关性"],"ja":["GitHub へのアクセスとプロジェクト構造の理解が必要","GitHub プロジェクトの品質と関連性に依存"],"ko":["GitHub 접근 및 프로젝트 구조에 대한 이해가 필요함","GitHub 프로젝트의 품질 및 관련성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a GitHub y comprensión de las estructuras de proyecto","Dependiente de la calidad y relevancia de los proyectos de GitHub"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à GitHub et une compréhension des structures de projet","Dépend de la qualité et de la pertinence des projets GitHub"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf GitHub und Verständnis der Projekstrukturen","Abhängig von der Qualität und Relevanz der GitHub-Projekte"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao GitHub e compreensão das estruturas de projeto","Dependente da qualidade e relevância dos projetos do GitHub"],"ru":["Требует доступа к GitHub и понимания структуры проектов","Зависит от качества и актуальности проектов GitHub"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى جيت هاب وفهم هيكل المشروع","يعتمد على جودة وأهمية مشاريع جيت هاب"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"3a5c1312f05fdf3e74e9edc2759cfb2ac7ecf61ce01b7ebe687853c1cf8ed156","qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('lekman/cdn/github-mcp', 'community', 'lekman', 'cdn', 'lekman/cdn', 'github-mcp', 0, 0, 60, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.873Z', '2026-03-02T02:06:12.072Z', 'de8ef5e53ff95d6f10b1f36ddb165aaf206d28deeecd37cdf1460754710b9d1a', '{"id":"lekman/cdn/github-mcp","name":"github-mcp","description":{"zh":"GitHub MCP技能实现内容地址图像存储和分发，使用Cloudflare CDN和Azure后端，提供安全的图像存储和访问","ja":"GitHub MCPスキルは、コンテンツアドレスタイプの画像ストレージと配布を実現し、Cloudflare CDNとAzureバックエンドを使用してセキュアな画像ストレージとアクセスを提供します","ko":"GitHub MCP 스킬은 콘텐츠 주소형 이미지 저장소 및 배포를 구현하며, Cloudflare CDN과 Azure 백엔드를 사용하여 보안 이미지 저장소 및 접근을 제공합니다","es":"El skill github-mcp permite el almacenamiento y distribución de imágenes mediante Cloudflare CDN con Azure como backend, utilizando tokens de acceso seguros","fr":"Le skill github-mcp permet le stockage et la distribution d''images via Cloudflare CDN avec Azure comme backend, en utilisant des jetons d''accès sécurisés","de":"Das Skill github-mcp ermöglicht die Speicherung und Verteilung von Bildern über Cloudflare CDN mit Azure als Backend, unter Verwendung sicherer Zugriffstoken","pt":"O GitHub MCP é uma habilidade que permite o armazenamento de imagens com endereçamento de conteúdo usando Cloudflare CDN com backend do Azure","ru":"GitHub MCP — это навык, который позволяет хранить изображения с адресацией контента, используя Cloudflare CDN с бэкендом Azure","ar":"GitHub MCP هو مهارة يسمح بتخزين الصور عن طريق عنوان المحتوى باستخدام Cloudflare CDN مع الخلفية Azure","en":"Content-addressed image storage and distribution using Cloudflare CDN with Azure backend."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"GitHub MCP技能：内容地址图像存储和Cloudflare CDN","ja":"GitHub MCPスキル：コンテンツアドレスタイプの画像ストレージとCloudflare CDN","ko":"GitHub MCP 스킬: 콘텐츠 주소형 이미지 저장소 및 Cloudflare CDN","es":"Almacenamiento de imágenes con GitHub MCP y Cloudflare","fr":"Stockage d''images avec GitHub MCP et Cloudflare","de":"Bildspeicherung mit GitHub MCP und Cloudflare","pt":"GitHub MCP: Armazenamento de Imagens com Cloudflare CDN","ru":"GitHub MCP: Хранение изображений с помощью Cloudflare CDN","ar":"GitHub MCP: تخزين الصور باستخدام Cloudflare CDN","en":"github-mcp"},"description":{"zh":"GitHub MCP技能实现内容地址图像存储和分发，使用Cloudflare CDN和Azure后端，提供安全的图像存储和访问","ja":"GitHub MCPスキルは、コンテンツアドレスタイプの画像ストレージと配布を実現し、Cloudflare CDNとAzureバックエンドを使用してセキュアな画像ストレージとアクセスを提供します","ko":"GitHub MCP 스킬은 콘텐츠 주소형 이미지 저장소 및 배포를 구현하며, Cloudflare CDN과 Azure 백엔드를 사용하여 보안 이미지 저장소 및 접근을 제공합니다","es":"El skill github-mcp permite el almacenamiento y distribución de imágenes mediante Cloudflare CDN con Azure como backend, utilizando tokens de acceso seguros","fr":"Le skill github-mcp permet le stockage et la distribution d''images via Cloudflare CDN avec Azure comme backend, en utilisant des jetons d''accès sécurisés","de":"Das Skill github-mcp ermöglicht die Speicherung und Verteilung von Bildern über Cloudflare CDN mit Azure als Backend, unter Verwendung sicherer Zugriffstoken","pt":"O GitHub MCP é uma habilidade que permite o armazenamento de imagens com endereçamento de conteúdo usando Cloudflare CDN com backend do Azure","ru":"GitHub MCP — это навык, который позволяет хранить изображения с адресацией контента, используя Cloudflare CDN с бэкендом Azure","ar":"GitHub MCP هو مهارة يسمح بتخزين الصور عن طريق عنوان المحتوى باستخدام Cloudflare CDN مع الخلفية Azure","en":"Content-addressed image storage and distribution using Cloudflare CDN with Azure backend."},"definition":{"en":"Content-addressed image storage and distribution using Cloudflare CDN with Azure backend."},"features":{"zh":["内容地址图像存储","Cloudflare CDN集成","Azure后端支持","安全的图像存储和访问","支持GitHub存储库、问题、拉取请求和工作流"],"ja":["コンテンツアドレスタイプの画像ストレージ","Cloudflare CDN統合","Azureバックエンドサポート","セキュアな画像ストレージとアクセス","GitHubリポジトリ、問題、プルリクエスト、ワークフローをサポート"],"ko":["콘텐츠 주소형 이미지 저장소","Cloudflare CDN 통합","Azure 백엔드 지원","보안 이미지 저장소 및 접근","GitHub 저장소, 문제, 풀 리퀘스트, 워크플ロー 지원"],"es":["Almacenamiento de imágenes con Cloudflare CDN","Integración con Azure como backend","Uso de tokens de acceso seguros con 1Password","Acceso a repositorios, issues, pull requests y workflows de GitHub","Configuración segura con 1Password CLI"],"fr":["Stockage d''images avec Cloudflare CDN","Intégration avec Azure comme backend","Utilisation de jetons d''accès sécurisés avec 1Password","Accès aux référentiels, aux problèmes, aux demandes de tirage et aux workflows de GitHub","Configuration sécurisée avec 1Password CLI"],"de":["Bildspeicherung mit Cloudflare CDN","Integration mit Azure als Backend","Verwendung sicherer Zugriffstoken mit 1Password","Zugriff auf Repositorys, Issues, Pull-Requests und Workflows von GitHub","Sichere Konfiguration mit 1Password CLI"],"pt":["Armazenamento de imagens com endereçamento de conteúdo","Integração com Cloudflare CDN","Backend do Azure","Gerenciamento de tokens seguro via 1Password","Acesso a repositórios, problemas e pull requests do GitHub"],"ru":["Хранение изображений с адресацией контента","Интеграция с Cloudflare CDN","Бэкенд Azure","Безопасное управление токенами через 1Password","Доступ к репозиториям, проблемам и запросам на включение в GitHub"],"ar":["تخزين الصور عن طريق عنوان المحتوى","التكامل مع Cloudflare CDN","الخلفية Azure","إدارة Tokens آمنة من خلال 1Password","الدخول إلى المستودعات والمسائل والطلبات السحابية في GitHub"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub MCP","内容地址图像存储","Cloudflare CDN","Azure后端","图像存储","安全访问","GitHub集成"],"ja":["GitHub MCP","コンテンツアドレスタイプの画像ストレージ","Cloudflare CDN","Azureバックエンド","画像ストレージ","セキュアなアクセス","GitHub統合"],"ko":["GitHub MCP","콘텐츠 주소형 이미지 저장소","Cloudflare CDN","Azure 백엔드","이미지 저장소","보안 접근","GitHub 통합"],"es":["github mcp","cloudflare cdn","azure backend","almacenamiento de imágenes","distribución de imágenes","seguridad de tokens","1password","github integración"],"fr":["github mcp","cloudflare cdn","azure backend","stockage d''images","distribution d''images","sécurité des jetons","1password","intégration github"],"de":["github mcp","cloudflare cdn","azure backend","bildspeicherung","bildverteilung","sicherheit von zugriffstoken","1password","github integration"],"pt":["GitHub MCP","armazenamento de imagens","Cloudflare CDN","Azure","gerenciamento de tokens","1Password","desenvolvimento de software","integração de repositórios"],"ru":["GitHub MCP","хранение изображений","Cloudflare CDN","Azure","управление токенами","1Password","разработка программного обеспечения","интеграция репозиториев"],"ar":["GitHub MCP","تخزين الصور","Cloudflare CDN","Azure","إدارة Tokens","1Password","تطوير البرمجيات","تكامل المستودعات"]}},"owner":"lekman","repo":"cdn","repoPath":"lekman/cdn","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.873Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-mcp","description":"Configure and manage GitHub MCP server with 1Password token management. Use when working with GitHub repositories, issues, pull requests, and workflows.","bodyPreview":"<!-- This skill follows the Agent Skills open standard: https://agentskills.io -->\n\n# GitHub MCP Setup\n\nConfigure the GitHub MCP server to access GitHub repositories, issues, pull requests, and workflows directly from Claude Code using secure token management via 1Password.\n\n**IMPORTANT:** This skill uses 1Password CLI to securely fetch GitHub tokens. Tokens are NEVER hardcoded.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n\n- Setting up MCP server integration for GitHub\n- Working with GitHub","body":"<!-- This skill follows the Agent Skills open standard: https://agentskills.io -->\n\n# GitHub MCP Setup\n\nConfigure the GitHub MCP server to access GitHub repositories, issues, pull requests, and workflows directly from Claude Code using secure token management via 1Password.\n\n**IMPORTANT:** This skill uses 1Password CLI to securely fetch GitHub tokens. Tokens are NEVER hardcoded.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n\n- Setting up MCP server integration for GitHub\n- Working with GitHub repositories, issues, or pull requests\n- Automating GitHub workflows\n- Troubleshooting GitHub MCP connection\n- Reauthenticating with different GitHub token\n- Configuring organization-specific tokens per repository\n\n## Configuration Scopes\n\nGitHub MCP supports two configuration scopes:\n\n### Global Configuration (User-wide)\n\n- **Config file**: `~/.claude.json`\n- **Use when**: Single GitHub account across all projects\n- **Token**: Shared across all repositories\n- **Command**: `bun .claude/skills/github-mcp/configure-mcp.ts --global`\n\n### Local Configuration (Project-specific)\n\n- **Config file**: `.claude/mcp.json` (gitignored)\n- **Use when**: Different GitHub organizations or accounts per repository\n- **Token**: Specific to this project only\n- **Command**: `bun .claude/skills/github-mcp/configure-mcp.ts --local`\n- **Auto-detection**: Script uses local config if `.env` file exists\n\n**Recommended approach**: Use local configuration when working with organization-specific tokens.\n\n## Automated Setup Workflow\n\nWhen this skill is invoked, follow these steps in order:\n\n### Step 1: Check if MCP Tools Are Available\n\nAttempt to use a GitHub MCP tool:\n\n```text\nUse: mcp__github__search_repositories\nInput: { \"query\": \"test\" }\n```\n\n- **If successful**: MCP is ready. Skip to usage section.\n- **If fails with \"No such tool available\"**: Continue to Step 2.\n\n### Step 2: Check if MCP Server Is Configured\n\nRun check to see server status:\n\n```bash\nclaude mcp list\n```\n\n**Possible outcomes:**\n\n**A) Server not listed:**\n\n- Run configuration script: `bun .claude/skills/github-mcp/configure-mcp.ts`\n- Script will auto-detect scope (local if `.env` exists, otherwise global)\n- Script will prompt for 1Password authentication (30 second timeout)\n- Instruct user: \"The GitHub MCP server has been configured. Please restart Claude Code with `claude -c` to continue this conversation.\"\n- **STOP HERE** - Wait for user to restart and continue\n\n**B) Server listed with \"✓ Connected\":**\n\n- MCP should be available but tools aren''t loading\n- Instruct user: \"Please restart Claude Code with `claude -c` to reload MCP servers.\"\n- **STOP HERE** - Wait for user to restart and continue\n\n**C) Server connected but using wrong/expired token:**\n\n- User reports authentication errors or wrong repository access\n- Run reauthentication: `bun .claude/skills/github-mcp/configure-mcp.ts --reauth`\n- Follow reauthentication workflow (see Reauthentication section below)\n- **STOP HERE** - Wait for user to complete reauth flow\n\n### Step 3: Add Global Allow Patterns (Optional)\n\nTo avoid permission prompts for GitHub MCP tools:\n\n```bash\nbun .claude/skills/github-mcp/configure-mcp.ts --allow-patterns\n```\n\nThis adds `mcp__github__*` to `~/.claude/settings.json` allowed tools.\n\n### Step 4: Verify Connection\n\nAfter user restarts, repeat Step 1 to verify tools are now available.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n### Required: Bun Runtime\n\nCheck if installed:\n\n```bash\nwhich bun\n```\n\nIf not installed:\n\n```bash\ncurl -fsSL https://bun.sh/install | bash\n```\n\n### Required: 1Password CLI\n\nCheck if installed:\n\n```bash\nwhich op\n```\n\nIf not installed:\n\n```bash\nbrew install 1password-cli\n```\n\n### Required: .env File with 1Password Reference\n\nThe `.env` file must contain:\n\n```bash\nGITHUB_TOKEN=op://Private/GitHub.com/GITHUB_TOKEN\n```\n\n**Format:** `op://vault/item/field`\n\n- `vault`: 1Password vault name (e.g., \"Private\")\n- `item`: Item name in vault (e.g., \"GitHub.com\")\n- `field`: Field name (e.g., \"GITHUB_TOKEN\")\n\n### 1Password Authentication\n\nWhen running the script, 1Password will prompt for authentication:\n\n- **Timeout:** 30 seconds\n- **Action required:** Approve 1Password access request\n- **Failure:** Script exits with timeout error\n\n## Available MCP Tools\n\nOnce connected, you''ll have access to GitHub MCP tools including:\n\n**Repository Operations:**\n\n- `mcp__github__search_repositories` - Search GitHub repositories\n- `mcp__github__get_repository` - Get repository details\n- `mcp__github__list_commits` - List repository commits\n- `mcp__github__get_file_contents` - Read file contents\n\n**Issue Operations:**\n\n- `mcp__github__search_issues` - Search issues across repositories\n- `mcp__github__create_issue` - Create new issue\n- `mcp__github__update_issue` - Update issue details\n- `mcp__github__list_issues` - List repository issues\n\n**Pull Request Operations:**\n\n- `mcp__github__search_pull_requests` - Search pull requests\n- `mcp__github__create_pull_request` - Create new PR\n- `mcp__github__list_pull_requests` - List repository PRs\n- `mcp__github__merge_pull_request` - Merge a PR\n\n**Workflow Operations:**\n\n- `mcp__github__list_workflows` - List GitHub Actions workflows\n- `mcp__github__get_workflow_run` - Get workflow run details\n- `mcp__github__trigger_workflow` - Trigger workflow dispatch\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n**Search Your Pull Requests (Recommended):**\n\n```typescript\nUse: mcp__github__search_pull_requests\nInput: { \"query\": \"is:open is:pr author:@me\" }\n```\n\n**Why use `author:@me`?**\n\n- Searches content created by the authenticated user\n- Avoids permission errors when searching specific usernames\n- Works across all repositories you have access to\n\n**Search Repositories:**\n\n```typescript\nUse: mcp__github__search_repositories\nInput: { \"query\": \"language:typescript stars:>1000\" }\n```\n\n**Search Your Issues:**\n\n```typescript\nUse: mcp__github__search_issues\nInput: { \"query\": \"is:open is:issue author:@me\" }\n```\n\n**Create Issue:**\n\n```typescript\nUse: mcp__github__create_issue\nInput: {\n  \"owner\": \"northbridge-security\",\n  \"repo\": \"ai-toolkit\",\n  \"title\": \"Bug: Fix data pipeline timeout\",\n  \"body\": \"Pipeline times out after 5 minutes...\"\n}\n```\n\n**List Pull Requests (Specific Repository):**\n\n```typescript\nUse: mcp__github__list_pull_requests\nInput: {\n  \"owner\": \"northbridge-security\",\n  \"repo\": \"ai-toolkit\",\n  \"state\": \"open\"\n}\n```\n\n**Note:** Repository-specific operations (list, create, update) require exact owner/repo names. If repository names are unclear or custom git remotes are used, use search APIs with `author:@me` first to discover accessible repositories.\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Use Search APIs for Discovery\n\n**Recommended pattern:**\n\n1. Use search APIs with `author:@me` to discover content\n2. Extract exact owner/repo names from results\n3. Use repository-specific APIs for detailed operations\n\n**Example workflow:**\n\n```typescript\n// Step 1: Find your repositories\nUse: mcp__github__search_repositories\nInput: { \"query\": \"user:@me\" }\n\n// Step 2: Use exact names from results\nUse: mcp__github__list_pull_requests\nInput: {\n  \"owner\": \"username\",\n  \"repo\": \"my-repo\",\n  \"state\": \"open\"\n}\n```\n\n### Common Search Patterns\n\n**Your open PRs across all repos:**\n\n```text\nis:open is:pr author:@me\n```\n\n**Your issues assigned to you:**\n\n```text\nis:open is:issue assignee:@me\n```\n\n**PRs you reviewed:**\n\n```text\nis:pr reviewed-by:@me\n```\n\n**Recent activity:**\n\n```text\nis:pr author:@me updated:>2025-01-01\n```\n\n### Avoiding Permission Errors\n\n**Don''t use:** `user:my-username` (may fail with 422 validation error)\n\n**Use instead:** `author:@me` (always works for authenticated user)\n\n**Why:** GitHub''s search API has different permission models for username searches vs authenticated user searches. Using `@me` ensures the token''s permissions are correctly applied.\n\n## Reauthentication\n\nIf you need to switch tokens or reauthenticate:\n\n**Run reauthentication script:**\n\n```bash\nbun .claude/skills/github-mcp/configure-mcp.ts --reauth\n```\n\nThis will:\n\n1. Remove existing MCP server configuration\n2. Fetch fresh token from 1Password (30 second timeout)\n3. Reconfigure server with new token\n\n**After running reauthentication:**\n\n1. Restart Claude Code with `claude -c`\n2. GitHub MCP tools should now use new token\n\n**Use cases:**\n\n- Token expired or rotated\n- Need to switch between GitHub accounts\n- Repository access permissions changed\n- Testing with different token scopes\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### 1Password CLI Not Found\n\n**Error:** `1Password CLI (op) is not installed`\n\n**Solution:**\n\n```bash\nbrew install 1password-cli\n```\n\nVerify installation:\n\n```bash\nop --version\n```\n\n### 1Password Authentication Timeout\n\n**Error:** `Timeout: 1Password authentication not completed within 30 seconds`\n\n**Causes:**\n\n- User didn''t approve 1Password prompt in time\n- 1Password app not running\n- 1Password CLI not authenticated\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n1. Ensure 1Password app is running\n2. Authenticate 1Password CLI:\n\n   ```bash\n   op account list\n   op signin\n   ```\n\n3. Run configure script again\n4. Approve 1Password prompt within 30 seconds\n\n### GITHUB_TOKEN Not Found in .env\n\n**Error:** `GITHUB_TOKEN not found in .env file`\n\n**Solution:**\n\nCreate or update `.env` file in project root:\n\n```bash\nGITHUB_TOKEN=op://Private/GitHub.com/GITHUB_TOKEN\n```\n\nVerify 1Password reference is correct:\n\n```bash\nop read op://Private/GitHub.com/GITHUB_TOKEN\n```\n\n### Invalid 1Password Reference\n\n**Error:** `1Password CLI failed: [error message]`\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n1. **Check vault name:** Ensure vault exists in 1Password\n\n   ```bash\n   op vault list\n   ```\n\n2. **Check item name:** Verify item exists in vault\n\n   ```bash\n   op item list --vault Private\n   ```\n\n3. **Check field name:** Confirm field exists in item\n\n   ```bash\n   op item get \"GitHub.com\" --vault Private\n   ```\n\n4. **Test reference directly:**\n\n   ```bash\n   op read op://Private/GitHub.com/GITHUB_TOKEN\n   ```\n\n### Tools Not Appearing After Configuration\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n1. Verify server shows \"✓ Connected\" in `claude mcp list`\n2. Restart Claude Code completely (not just terminal)\n3. Check `~/.claude.json` contains GitHub server config with headers\n4. Verify token has correct GitHub API permissions\n\n### \"No such tool available\" Error\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n1. Run pre-flight check (Step 1)\n2. Verify MCP server is configured: `claude mcp list`\n3. Check token validity: `op read op://...` and test with GitHub API\n4. Restart Claude Code after configuration\n\n### Plain Text Token Warning\n\n**Warning:** `Using plain text token from .env file`\n\n**Risk:** Token stored in plain text, visible to anyone with file access\n\n**Solution:**\n\nConvert to 1Password reference:\n\n1. Store token in 1Password\n2. Update .env:\n\n   ```bash\n   GITHUB_TOKEN=op://Private/GitHub.com/GITHUB_TOKEN\n   ```\n\n3. Run configure script again\n\n## Security Best Practices\n\n1. **NEVER commit .env file** - Add to `.gitignore`\n2. **NEVER commit .claude/mcp.json** - Already gitignored, contains tokens\n3. **Use 1Password references** - Never plain text tokens\n4. **Use local config for org-specific tokens** - Prevents cross-org token leakage\n5. **Rotate tokens regularly** - Use `--reauth` after rotation\n6. **Limit token scopes** - Grant only necessary permissions\n7. **Audit token usage** - Review GitHub token activity logs\n8. **Add allow patterns** - Use `--allow-patterns` to avoid accidental permission grants\n\n## Configuration Details\n\n### MCP Server Configuration\n\nThe script configures GitHub MCP as a remote HTTP server with bearer token authentication:\n\n**Global configuration (`~/.claude.json`):**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"github\": {\n      \"type\": \"http\",\n      \"url\": \"https://api.githubcopilot.com/mcp/\",\n      \"headers\": {\n        \"Authorization\": \"Bearer ghp_xxxxxxxxxxxx\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Local configuration (`.claude/mcp.json`):**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"github\": {\n      \"type\": \"http\",\n      \"url\": \"https://api.githubcopilot.com/mcp/\",\n      \"headers\": {\n        \"Authorization\": \"Bearer ghp_organization_token\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Server Details:**\n\n- **Type:** Remote HTTP MCP server\n- **Host:** GitHub-managed (official)\n- **Authentication:** Bearer token in Authorization header\n- **Endpoint:** `https://api.githubcopilot.com/mcp/`\n- **Token Source:** 1Password CLI (`op read`)\n\n### Allow Patterns Configuration\n\nThe `--allow-patterns` flag adds GitHub MCP tools to `~/.claude/settings.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"allowedTools\": [\"mcp__github__*\"]\n}\n```\n\n**Benefits:**\n\n- No permission prompts for GitHub MCP tools\n- Faster workflow when using MCP tools frequently\n- Consistent experience across sessions\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `atlassian-mcp` - Atlassian/Jira MCP integration (OAuth-based)\n- `secureai-mcp` - SecureAI task management and security controls\n\n## References\n\n- [GitHub MCP Server Repository](https://github.com/github/github-mcp-server)\n- [1Password CLI Documentation](https://developer.1password.com/docs/cli/)\n- [Model Context Protocol Specification](https://modelcontextprotocol.io)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:06:12.072Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud-Native Agents requiring secure GitHub repository access and content-addressed image storage via Cloudflare CDN and Azure backend.","zh":"适用于需要安全的 GitHub 仓库访问和通过 Cloudflare CDN 以及 Azure 后端进行内容寻址的镜像存储的云原生代理。","ja":"Cloudflare CDN と Azure バックエンドを介したコンテンツアドレスタイプのイメージストレージおよびセキュアな GitHub リポジトリアクセスを必要とするクラウドネイティブエージェントに適しています。","ko":"Cloudflare CDN 및 Azure 백엔드를 통해 안전한 GitHub 리포지토리 액세스 및 콘텐츠 주소 형식의 이미지 저장이 필요한 클라우드 네이티브 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes nativos de la nube que requieren acceso seguro a repositorios de GitHub y almacenamiento de imágenes con direcciones de contenido a través de Cloudflare CDN y backend de Azure.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Cloud-Native nécessitant un accès sécurisé aux référentiels GitHub et un stockage d''images à adresses de contenu via Cloudflare CDN et backend Azure.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Native-Agents, die sicheren Zugriff auf GitHub-Repositorys und inhaltsadressierten Bildspeicher über Cloudflare CDN und Azure-Backend erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Nativos em Nuvem que exigem acesso seguro a repositórios do GitHub e armazenamento de imagens com endereçamento de conteúdo via Cloudflare CDN e backend do Azure.","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов, требующих безопасного доступа к репозиториям GitHub и хранилищу изображений с адресацией контента через сеть доставки контента Cloudflare и бэкэнд Azure.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأصليين في السحابة الذين يتطلبون الوصول الآمن إلى مستودعات GitHub وتخزين الصور الموجهة بالمحتوى عبر شبكة توزيع المحتوى Cloudflare وخدمة الخلفية Azure."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to securely manage GitHub tokens using 1Password CLI, enabling direct access to GitHub repositories, issues, pull requests, and workflows from Claude Code, while leveraging Cloudflare CDN for optimized content distribution.","zh":"使得代理能够使用 1Password CLI 安全地管理 GitHub 令牌，实现从 Claude Code 直接访问 GitHub 仓库、问题、拉取请求和工作流，同时利用 Cloudflare CDN 进行优化的内容分发。","ja":"1Password CLI を使用して GitHub トークンをセキュアに管理し、Claude Code から GitHub リポジトリ、問題、プルリクエスト、ワークフローに直接アクセスできるようにエージェントをEmpowerし、Cloudflare CDN を使用して最適化されたコンテンツ配信を実現します。","ko":"1Password CLI를 사용하여 GitHub 토큰을 안전하게 관리하고 Claude Code에서 GitHub 리포지토리, 문제, 풀 요청 및 워크플로에 직접 액세스할 수 있도록 에이전트를 강화하여 Cloudflare CDN을 사용한 최적화된 콘텐츠 분배를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar de forma segura los tokens de GitHub utilizando 1Password CLI, lo que permite el acceso directo a los repositorios, problemas, solicitudes de extracción y flujos de trabajo de GitHub desde Claude Code, al mismo tiempo que aprovecha Cloudflare CDN para la distribución de contenido optimizada.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer de manière sécurisée les jetons GitHub à l''aide de 1Password CLI, permettant un accès direct aux référentiels, problèmes, demandes d''extraction et flux de travail GitHub à partir de Claude Code, tout en exploitant Cloudflare CDN pour une distribution de contenu optimisée.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, GitHub-Tokens mithilfe von 1Password CLI sicher zu verwalten, wodurch direkter Zugriff auf GitHub-Repositorys, Probleme, Pull-Anfragen und Arbeitsabläufe von Claude Code ermöglicht wird, während gleichzeitig Cloudflare CDN für optimierte Inhaltsverteilung genutzt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar tokens do GitHub de forma segura usando o 1Password CLI, permitindo acesso direto a repositórios do GitHub, problemas, solicitações de pull e fluxos de trabalho do Claude Code, aproveitando a rede de distribuição de conteúdo da Cloudflare para distribuição de conteúdo otimizada.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность безопасного управления токенами GitHub с помощью 1Password CLI, что позволяет получить прямой доступ к репозиториям GitHub, проблемам, запросам на вытягивание и рабочим процессам из Claude Code, используя сеть доставки контента Cloudflare для оптимизированной доставки контента.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إدارة رموز الوصول إلى GitHub بشكل آمن باستخدام 1Password CLI، مما يسمح بالوصول المباشر إلى مستودعات GitHub والقضايا والطلبات السحابية والعمليات من كلود كود، مع الاستفادة من شبكة توزيع المحتوى Cloudflare لتوزيع المحتوى المتوافق."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring MCP server integration for GitHub","Automating GitHub workflow management","Securing GitHub token management with 1Password"],"zh":["配置MCP服务器与GitHub集成","自动化GitHub工作流管理","使用1Password安全管理GitHub令牌"],"ja":["MCPサーバーのGitHub統合を構成する","GitHubワークフローの管理を自動化する","1Passwordを使用してGitHubトークンのセキュア管理"],"ko":["MCP 서버 GitHub 통합 구성","GitHub 워크플ロー 관리 자동화","1Password를 사용한 GitHub 토큰 보안 관리"],"es":["Configuración de la integración del servidor MCP para GitHub","Automatización de la administración de flujos de trabajo de GitHub","Protección de la administración de tokens de GitHub con 1Password"],"fr":["Configuration de l''intégration du serveur MCP pour GitHub","Automatisation de la gestion des flux de travail GitHub","Sécurisation de la gestion des jetons GitHub avec 1Password"],"de":["Konfiguration der MCP-Server-Integration für GitHub","Automatisierung der GitHub-Workflow-Verwaltung","Sicherung der GitHub-Token-Verwaltung mit 1Password"],"pt":["Configurando integração do servidor MCP para GitHub","Automatizando gerenciamento de fluxos de trabalho do GitHub","Proteção da gestão de tokens do GitHub com 1Password"],"ru":["Настройка интеграции сервера MCP с GitHub","Автоматизация управления рабочими процессами GitHub","Защита управления токенами GitHub с помощью 1Password"],"ar":["تهيئة دمج خادم MCP مع GitHub","توفير آلي لإدارة سير عمل GitHub","حماية إدارة رموز الوصول إلى GitHub مع 1Password"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires 1Password CLI for token management","Azure backend required","Cloudflare CDN dependency"],"zh":["需要1Password CLI进行令牌管理","需要Azure后端","依赖Cloudflare CDN"],"ja":["トークン管理には1Password CLIが必要","Azureバックエンドが必要","Cloudflare CDNに依存"],"ko":["토큰 관리를 위해 1Password CLI가 필요","Azure 백엔드가 필요","Cloudflare CDN에 의존"],"es":["Requiere 1Password CLI para la administración de tokens","Se requiere backend de Azure","Dependencia de Cloudflare CDN"],"fr":["Nécessite 1Password CLI pour la gestion des jetons","Backend Azure requis","Dépendance de Cloudflare CDN"],"de":["Benötigt 1Password CLI für Token-Verwaltung","Azure-Backend erforderlich","Abhängigkeit von Cloudflare CDN"],"pt":["Exige 1Password CLI para gerenciamento de tokens","Requer backend do Azure","Dependência da CDN da Cloudflare"],"ru":["Требует 1Password CLI для управления токенами","Требуется бэкэнд Azure","Зависимость от сети доставки контента Cloudflare"],"ar":["يتطلب 1Password CLI لإدارة رموز الوصول","يتطلب خدمة الخلفية Azure","اعتماد على شبكة توزيع المحتوى Cloudflare"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"de8ef5e53ff95d6f10b1f36ddb165aaf206d28deeecd37cdf1460754710b9d1a","qualityScore":60}');
