"de":"PRD-Generator: Erstelle klare Produktanforderungsdokumente","pt":"Gerador PRD: Crie Documentos de Requisitos de Produto","ru":"Генератор PRD: Создавайте подробные документы","ar":"مولد مواصفات المنتج: أنشئ وثائق متطلبات المنتج","en":"prd-generator"},"description":{"zh":"PRD 生成器创建详细的产品需求文档，用于自动化实现。它通过提问和回答生成结构化的 PRD 文档","ja":"PRD ジェネレーターは詳細な製品要件文書を作成し、自動化を実現します。質問と回答を通じて構造化された PRD 文書を生成します","ko":"PRD 생성기는 자동화를 위한 상세한 제품 요구사항 문서를 생성합니다. 질문과 답변을 통해 구조화된 PRD 문서를 생성","es":"El generador de PRD crea documentos de requisitos de producto claros y ejecutables para implementación autónoma. Recibe descripciones de características y ge...","fr":"Le générateur de PRD crée des documents de spécifications de produit clairs et exécutables pour mise en œuvre autonome. Il reçoit des descriptions de fonctio...","de":"Der PRD-Generator erstellt klare und ausführbare Produktanforderungsdokumente für autonome Implementierung. Er erhält Funktionsbeschreibungen und generiert s...","pt":"O Gerador PRD é uma ferramenta que cria documentos de requisitos de produto detalhados e claros para implementação autônoma","ru":"Генератор PRD - это инструмент, создающий подробные и ясные документы требований к продукту для автономной реализации","ar":"مولد مواصفات المنتج هو أداة تنشئ وثائق متطلبات المنتج المتفصلة والواضحة للتنفيذ المستقل","en":"Copilot ralph is an autonomous AI agent loop that runs repeatedly until all PRD items are complete."},"definition":{"en":"Copilot ralph is an autonomous AI agent loop that runs repeatedly until all PRD items are complete."},"features":{"zh":["创建详细的产品需求文档","自动化实现","结构化的 PRD 文档","提问和回答生成 PRD","保存到 prd.json 文件"],"ja":["詳細な製品要件文書を作成","自動化を実現","構造化された PRD 文書","質問と回答を通じて PRD を生成","prd.json ファイルに保存"],"ko":["상세한 제품 요구사항 문서 생성","자동화를 구현","구조화된 PRD 문서","질문과 답변을 통해 PRD 생성","prd.json 파일에 저장"],"es":["Crea documentos de requisitos de producto claros y ejecutables","Recibe descripciones de características del usuario","Formula preguntas clarificadoras esenciales","Genera PRD estructurados","Guarda el PRD en un archivo JSON"],"fr":["Crée des documents de spécifications de produit clairs et exécutables","Reçoit des descriptions de fonctionnalités de l''utilisateur","Pose des questions clarificatrices essentielles","Génère des PRD structurés","Enregistre le PRD dans un fichier JSON"],"de":["Erstellt klare und ausführbare Produktanforderungsdokumente","Erhält Funktionsbeschreibungen vom Benutzer","Stellt wesentliche Klarstellungsfragen","Generiert strukturierte PRD","Speichert die PRD in einer JSON-Datei"],"pt":["Criação de documentos de requisitos de produto detalhados","Perguntas esclarecedoras para garantir clareza","Geração de PRD estruturado","Salvar em formato JSON","Implementação autônoma"],"ru":["Создание подробных документов требований к продукту","Кларифицирующие вопросы для обеспечения ясности","Генерация структурированного PRD","Сохранение в формате JSON","Автономная реализация"],"ar":["إنشاء وثائق متطلبات المنتج المتفصلة","أسئلة توضيحية لضمان الوضوح","إنشاء مواصفات المنتج المنظّمة","حفظ في شكل JSON","التنفيذ المستقل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PRD 生成器","自动化工具","产品需求文档","结构化 PRD","Copilot Ralph","自动化实现"],"ja":["PRD ジェネレーター","自動化ツール","製品要件文書","構造化 PRD","Copilot Ralph","自動化実現"],"ko":["PRD 생성기","자동화 도구","제품 요구사항 문서","구조화된 PRD","Copilot Ralph","자동화를 구현"],"es":["generador de PRD","documentos de requisitos de producto","implementación autónoma","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de requisitos","documento de especificaciones de producto"],"fr":["générateur de PRD","documents de spécifications de produit","mise en œuvre autonome","développement de logiciels","ingénierie des exigences","document de spécifications de produit"],"de":["PRD-Generator","Produktanforderungsdokumente","autonome Implementierung","Softwareentwicklung","Anforderungsingenieur","Produktspezifikationsdokument"],"pt":["Gerador PRD","Documentos de requisitos de produto","Implementação autônoma","Perguntas esclarecedoras","Geração de PRD","Formato JSON"],"ru":["Генератор PRD","Документы требований к продукту","Автономная реализация","Кларифицирующие вопросы","Генерация PRD","Формат JSON"],"ar":["مولد مواصفات المنتج","وثائق متطلبات المنتج","التنفيذ المستقل","أسئلة توضيحية","إنشاء مواصفات المنتج","شكل JSON"]}},"owner":"brenbuilds1","repo":"copilot-ralph","repoPath":"brenbuilds1/copilot-ralph","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.877Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prd-generator","description":"Generate a Product Requirements Document (prd.json) for the Ralph autonomous agent loop. Use when planning a feature, starting a new project, or preparing work for Ralph to implement. Triggers on: create a prd, write prd for, plan this feature, generate user stories, set up ralph for, spec out.","bodyPreview":"# PRD Generator\n\nCreate detailed Product Requirements Documents that are clear, actionable, and suitable for autonomous implementation by Ralph.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Receive a feature description from the user\n2. Ask 3-5 essential clarifying questions (with lettered options)\n3. Generate a structured PRD based on answers\n4. Save to `prd.json` in project root\n\n**Important:** Do NOT start implementing. Just create the PRD.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Clarifying Questions\n\nAsk only critical questions where the","body":"# PRD Generator\n\nCreate detailed Product Requirements Documents that are clear, actionable, and suitable for autonomous implementation by Ralph.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Receive a feature description from the user\n2. Ask 3-5 essential clarifying questions (with lettered options)\n3. Generate a structured PRD based on answers\n4. Save to `prd.json` in project root\n\n**Important:** Do NOT start implementing. Just create the PRD.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Clarifying Questions\n\nAsk only critical questions where the initial prompt is ambiguous. Focus on:\n\n- **Problem/Goal:** What problem does this solve? Why build this?\n- **Core Functionality:** What are the key user actions?\n- **Scope/Boundaries:** What should it NOT do?\n- **Technology:** What stack/framework to use?\n- **Success Criteria:** How do we know it''s done?\n\n### Format Questions Like This:\n\n```\n1. What is the primary goal of this feature?\n   A. Improve user onboarding experience\n   B. Increase user retention\n   C. Reduce support burden\n   D. Other: [please specify]\n\n2. Who is the target user?\n   A. New users only\n   B. Existing users only\n   C. All users\n   D. Admin users only\n\n3. What is the scope?\n   A. Minimal viable version (MVP)\n   B. Full-featured implementation\n   C. Just the backend/API\n   D. Just the UI/frontend\n\n4. What technology stack?\n   A. React + Node.js\n   B. Next.js\n   C. Plain HTML/CSS/JS\n   D. Other: [please specify]\n\n5. What''s explicitly OUT of scope?\n   A. Authentication/login\n   B. Database persistence\n   C. Mobile responsiveness\n   D. None of the above - include everything\n```\n\nThis lets users respond with \"1A, 2C, 3A, 4B, 5A\" for quick iteration.\n\n---\n\n## Step 2: Break Down Into User Stories\n\nAfter gathering answers, break the feature into small, focused user stories.\n\n### Story Size Rule\n\nEach story must be **small enough to complete in one Ralph iteration** (one agent context window, ~15-30 minutes of focused work).\n\n**Good story sizes:**\n- Add a single component\n- Create one API endpoint\n- Add form validation\n- Create a database migration\n- Wire up frontend to API\n\n**Too large (must split):**\n- \"Build the dashboard\" → Split into: layout, sidebar, header, each widget\n- \"Add authentication\" → Split into: login form, API endpoint, session handling, protected routes\n- \"Create the API\" → Split into: one endpoint per story\n\n### Story Format\n\nEach story needs:\n- **id:** Unique identifier (US-001, US-002, etc.)\n- **title:** Short action-oriented name\n- **priority:** Order of implementation (1 = first)\n- **description:** Context for implementation - what and why\n- **acceptanceCriteria:** Verifiable checklist of \"done\"\n\n### Writing Good Acceptance Criteria\n\nCriteria must be **specific and verifiable**, not vague.\n\n**Bad (too vague):**\n- \"Works correctly\"\n- \"Handles errors\"\n- \"Is responsive\"\n- \"Looks good\"\n\n**Good (specific and testable):**\n- \"Form shows red border and error message when email format is invalid\"\n- \"API returns 400 status with `{ error: ''Invalid email'' }` for malformed input\"\n- \"Button is disabled and shows spinner while request is in flight\"\n- \"Cards stack vertically on screens < 768px wide\"\n\n### Standard Criteria to Include\n\nFor every story, include relevant items from:\n- \"Typecheck passes\" (if using TypeScript)\n- \"Lint passes\"\n- \"No console errors in browser\"\n\nFor UI stories, always include:\n- \"Visually verified in browser\"\n- Specific responsive behavior if applicable\n\nFor API stories, always include:\n- Success response format\n- Error response format\n- Edge cases (duplicate, not found, etc.)\n\n---\n\n## Step 3: Define Non-Goals\n\nExplicitly state what this PRD will NOT include. This prevents scope creep and sets clear boundaries.\n\nExamples:\n- \"No user authentication - assumes public access\"\n- \"No email notifications\"\n- \"No mobile app - web only\"\n- \"No analytics tracking\"\n\n---\n\n## Step 4: Order by Dependencies\n\nArrange stories so foundations come first:\n\n1. **Priority 1-2:** Setup, scaffolding, database schema\n2. **Priority 3-5:** Core functionality, main features\n3. **Priority 6+:** Enhancements, polish, nice-to-haves\n\nA story cannot depend on a higher-numbered story.\n\n---\n\n## Writing for Junior Developers and AI Agents\n\nThe PRD reader may be a junior developer or AI agent (Ralph). Therefore:\n\n- Be explicit and unambiguous\n- Avoid jargon or explain technical terms\n- Provide enough detail to understand purpose and implementation approach\n- Use concrete examples where helpful\n- Each acceptance criterion should be independently verifiable\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\nSave as `prd.json` in the project root:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"projectName\": \"Feature Name\",\n  \"branchName\": \"ralph/feature-name\",\n  \"description\": \"Brief description of the feature and problem it solves\",\n  \"userStories\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-001\",\n      \"title\": \"Short action-oriented title\",\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"description\": \"Detailed context: what to build and why. Include relevant technical details.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Specific verifiable criterion\",\n        \"Another specific criterion\",\n        \"Typecheck passes\"\n      ],\n      \"passes\": false\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**Fields:**\n- `projectName`: Human-readable feature name\n- `branchName`: Git branch (convention: `ralph/kebab-case-name`)\n- `description`: Overview of the feature and problem it solves\n- `userStories`: Array of stories, ordered by priority\n- `passes`: Always `false` initially (Ralph sets to `true` when complete)\n\n---\n\n## Example PRD\n\n```json\n{\n  \"projectName\": \"Task Priority System\",\n  \"branchName\": \"ralph/task-priority\",\n  \"description\": \"Add priority levels to tasks so users can focus on what matters most. Tasks can be marked as high, medium, or low priority with visual indicators and filtering.\",\n  \"userStories\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-001\",\n      \"title\": \"Add priority field to database schema\",\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"description\": \"Add a priority column to the tasks table to persist priority across sessions. Priority should be an enum of ''high'', ''medium'', or ''low'' with ''medium'' as the default.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Migration adds priority column to tasks table\",\n        \"Column type is enum: ''high'' | ''medium'' | ''low''\",\n        \"Default value is ''medium''\",\n        \"Migration runs without errors\",\n        \"Existing tasks get ''medium'' priority\"\n      ],\n      \"passes\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-002\",\n      \"title\": \"Display priority badge on task cards\",\n      \"priority\": 2,\n      \"description\": \"Show a colored badge on each task card indicating its priority level. Users should see priority at a glance without hovering or clicking.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Each task card shows a priority badge\",\n        \"High priority: red badge with ''High'' text\",\n        \"Medium priority: yellow badge with ''Medium'' text\",\n        \"Low priority: gray badge with ''Low'' text\",\n        \"Badge is visible without interaction\",\n        \"Typecheck passes\",\n        \"Visually verified in browser\"\n      ],\n      \"passes\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-003\",\n      \"title\": \"Add priority selector to task edit form\",\n      \"priority\": 3,\n      \"description\": \"Allow users to change a task''s priority when editing it. The selector should show the current priority and save changes immediately.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Priority dropdown appears in task edit modal\",\n        \"Dropdown shows all three options: High, Medium, Low\",\n        \"Current priority is pre-selected\",\n        \"Selection change saves to database immediately\",\n        \"UI updates to reflect new priority without page reload\",\n        \"Typecheck passes\",\n        \"Visually verified in browser\"\n      ],\n      \"passes\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-004\",\n      \"title\": \"Add priority filter to task list\",\n      \"priority\": 4,\n      \"description\": \"Add a filter dropdown to the task list header so users can view only tasks of a specific priority level.\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"Filter dropdown in task list header\",\n        \"Options: All, High, Medium, Low\",\n        \"Selecting a filter shows only matching tasks\",\n        \"Filter state persists in URL query params\",\n        \"Shows ''No tasks found'' when filter has no matches\",\n        \"Typecheck passes\",\n        \"Visually verified in browser\"\n      ],\n      \"passes\": false\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## After Generation\n\nTell the user:\n\n```\nPRD saved to prd.json\n\nTo start Ralph:\n  ./ralph.sh\n\nTo check story status:\n  cat prd.json | jq ''.userStories[] | {id, title, passes}''\n```\n\n---\n\n## Checklist\n\nBefore saving the PRD:\n\n- [ ] Asked 3-5 clarifying questions with lettered options\n- [ ] Incorporated user''s answers into the PRD\n- [ ] Each user story is small enough for one iteration\n- [ ] Stories are ordered by dependency (foundations first)\n- [ ] Acceptance criteria are specific and verifiable (not vague)\n- [ ] Non-goals/scope boundaries are clear from description\n- [ ] Branch name follows `ralph/feature-name` convention\n- [ ] All stories have `\"passes\": false`\n- [ ] Saved to `prd.json`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:07:14.820Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Autonomous AI Agents needing structured Product Requirements Document generation.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化产品需求文档生成的自主AI代理。","ja":"構造化された製品要件文書の生成を必要とする自律型AIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 제품 요구 사항 문서 생성이 필요한 자율형 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA Autónomos que necesitan generar Documentos de Requisitos de Producto estructurados.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''IA Autonomes ayant besoin de générer des Documents de Spécifications de Produit structurés.","de":"Perfekt für autonome KI-Agents, die strukturierte Produktanforderungsdokumente benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Autônomos que necessitam de geração de Documentos de Requisitos de Produto estruturados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для автономных агентов ИИ, которым требуется генерация структурированных документов требований к продукту.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين المستقلين الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء مستندات متطلبات المنتج المؤسسة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create detailed PRDs in JSON format, utilizing clarifying questions and feature descriptions to produce clear, actionable documents suitable for autonomous implementation, leveraging file formats like `prd.json`.","zh":"赋予代理创建详细的PRD文档的能力，以JSON格式输出，利用澄清问题和功能描述生成清晰、可执行的文档，适合自主实现，支持如`prd.json`的文件格式。","ja":"エージェントがJSON形式で詳細なPRDを作成する能力を付与し、明確化する質問と機能説明を使用して、明確で実行可能な文書を生成し、`prd.json`などのファイル形式を利用して自律的な実装に適した文書を生成します。","ko":"에이전트가 JSON 형식으로詳細한 PRD를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, 澄明하는 질문과 기능 설명을 사용하여 명확하고 실행 가능한 문서를 생성하여, `prd.json`와 같은 파일 형식을 활용하여 자율적인 구현에 적합한 문서를 생성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear PRDs detallados en formato JSON, utilizando preguntas aclaratorias y descripciones de características para producir documentos claros y accionables adecuados para la implementación autónoma, aprovechando formatos de archivo como `prd.json`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des PRDs détaillés au format JSON, en utilisant des questions clarifiantes et des descriptions de fonctionnalités pour produire des documents clairs et opérationnels adaptés à la mise en œuvre autonome, en exploitant des formats de fichiers tels que `prd.json`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, detaillierte PRDs im JSON-Format zu erstellen, indem sie klärende Fragen und Funktionsbeschreibungen verwenden, um klare, umsetzbare Dokumente zu erstellen, die für die autonome Implementierung geeignet sind und Dateiformate wie `prd.json` nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar PRDs detalhados no formato JSON, utilizando perguntas esclarecedoras e descrições de recursos para produzir documentos claros e ações viáveis adequados para implementação autônoma, aproveitando formatos de arquivo como `prd.json`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать подробные документы требований к продукту в формате JSON, используя уточняющие вопросы и описания функций для создания ясных и действенных документов, пригодных для автономной реализации, используя форматы файлов, такие как `prd.json`.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء وثائق متطلبات المنتج المفصلة بالتنسيق JSON، باستخدام أسئلة توضيحية ووصفات الميزات لإنتاج وثائق واضحة وقابلة للتنفيذ المناسبة للتنفيذ المستقل، واستخدام تنسيقات الملفات مثل `prd.json`."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating PRDs for new feature development","Automating requirements gathering with clarifying questions","Creating structured product documentation in JSON"],"zh":["为新功能开发生成PRD","使用澄清问题自动化需求收集","创建结构化的产品文档以JSON格式"],"ja":["新機能開発のためのPRDの生成","明確化する質問を使用した要件収集の自動化","JSON形式での構造化された製品文書の作成"],"ko":["새로운 기능 개발을 위한 PRD 생성","명확화하는 질문을 사용한 요구사항 수집 자동화","JSON 형식의 구조화된 제품 문서 생성"],"es":["Generación de PRDs para el desarrollo de nuevas características","Automatización de la recopilación de requisitos con preguntas aclaratorias","Creación de documentación de productos estructurada en JSON"],"fr":["Génération de PRDs pour le développement de nouvelles fonctionnalités","Automatisation de la collecte des exigences avec des questions clarifiantes","Création de documentation de produits structurée au format JSON"],"de":["Erstellung von PRDs für die Entwicklung neuer Funktionen","Automatisierung der Anforderungserfassung mit klärenden Fragen","Erstellung von strukturierter Produkt-Dokumentation im JSON-Format"],"pt":["Geração de PRDs para desenvolvimento de novos recursos","Automatização da coleta de requisitos com perguntas esclarecedoras","Criação de documentação de produto estruturada em JSON"],"ru":["Генерация документов требований к продукту для разработки новых функций","Автоматизация сбора требований с помощью уточняющих вопросов","Создание структурированной документации продукта в формате JSON"],"ar":["إنشاء مستندات متطلبات المنتج لتنمية الميزات الجديدة","تحسين جمع المتطلبات باستخدام أسئلة توضيحية","إنشاء توثيق منتج منظم بالتنسيق JSON"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user input for feature descriptions","Does not support implementation, only PRD generation","Output is limited to `prd.json` file format"],"zh":["需要用户输入功能描述","不支持实现，只支持PRD生成","输出仅限于`prd.json`文件格式"],"ja":["機能説明のユーザー入力が必要","実装はサポートせず、PRDの生成のみ","出力は`prd.json`ファイル形式のみ"],"ko":["기능 설명에 대한 사용자 입력이 필요","구현은 지원하지 않고, PRD 생성만 지원","출력은 `prd.json` 파일 형식만"],"es":["Requiere la entrada del usuario para las descripciones de características","No admite la implementación, solo la generación de PRD","La salida está limitada al formato de archivo `prd.json`"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée utilisateur pour les descriptions de fonctionnalités","Ne prend pas en charge la mise en œuvre, uniquement la génération de PRD","La sortie est limitée au format de fichier `prd.json`"],"de":["Benötigt Benutzereingaben für Funktionsbeschreibungen","Unterstützt keine Implementierung, nur die PRD-Generierung","Die Ausgabe ist auf das Dateiformat `prd.json` beschränkt"],"pt":["Requer entrada do usuário para descrições de recursos","Não suporta implementação, apenas geração de PRD","Saída limitada ao formato de arquivo `prd.json`"],"ru":["Требует ввода пользователя для описаний функций","Не поддерживает реализацию, только генерацию документа требований к продукту","Выход ограничен форматом файла `prd.json`"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال المستخدم لوصفات الميزات","لا يدعم التنفيذ، بل إنشاء مستند متطلبات المنتج فقط","الإخراج مقيد بتنسيق الملف `prd.json`"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7305fe677f6548f915aab760770e1a11628ccd95c2b903a33ba37ef6ade8ae3f","qualityScore":60}');
