Claude Codeをステートレスからステートフルに変換し、永続的なコンテキストメモリシステムを備える","ko":"디버깅 기능은 Claude Code를 상태 변환 및 지속성 컨텍스트 메모리 시스템을 제공","es":"El skill de depuración transforma Claude Code de estadoless a stateful con memoria de contexto persistente","fr":"Le skill de débogage transforme Claude Code d''étatless en stateful avec une mémoire de contexte persistante","de":"Das Debugging-Skill transformiert Claude Code von stateless zu stateful mit persistenter Kontextspeicher","pt":"A ferramenta de depuração transforma o código Claude de stateless para stateful, melhorando a eficiência do código.","ru":"Инструмент отладки преобразует код Claude из stateless в stateful, повышая эффективность кода.","ar":"أداة تصحيح الأخطاء تتحول كود Claude من غير الحالة إلى الحالة، مما يحسن كفاءة الكود.","en":"Transform Claude Code from stateless to stateful. Persistent context memory   system with cross-session persistence, token-efficient storage, and zero   depe..."},"definition":{"en":"Transform Claude Code from stateless to stateful. Persistent context memory   system with cross-session persistence, token-efficient storage, and zero   dependencies."},"features":{"zh":["状态转换","持久性上下文内存系统","跨会话持久性","令牌高效存储","零依赖"],"ja":["ステートレスからステートフルへの変換","永続的なコンテキストメモリシステム","クロスセッション永続性","トークン効率的なストレージ","ゼロ依存"],"ko":["상태 변환","지속성 컨텍스트 메모리 시스템","크로스 세션 지속성","토큰 효율적인 저장","제로 의존"],"es":["Memoria de contexto persistente","Almacenamiento eficiente de tokens","Sin dependencias","Persistencia entre sesiones","Sistema de depuración avanzado","Transformación de código stateless a stateful"],"fr":["Mémoire de contexte persistante","Stockage efficace de tokens","Sans dépendances","Persistance entre sessions","Système de débogage avancé","Transformation de code stateless en stateful"],"de":["Persistenter Kontextspeicher","Token-effizienter Speicher","Ohne Abhängigkeiten","Persistenz zwischen Sitzungen","Erweitertes Debugging-System","Transformation von stateless zu stateful Code"],"pt":["Sistema de memória de contexto persistente","Armazenamento eficiente de tokens","Zero dependências","Suporte à persistência entre sessões","Melhoria da eficiência do código"],"ru":["Система постоянной памяти контекста","Эффективное хранение токенов","Нет зависимостей","Поддержка сохранения между сессиями","Повышение эффективности кода"],"ar":["نظام ذاكرة سياق مستدام","تخزين كفء للأشكال","بدون зависимости","دعم الحفاظ على البيانات بين الجلسات","تحسين كفاءة الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能工具调试","状态转换","持久性上下文内存系统","如何使用AI智能工具","AI智能工具与其他工具的比较","AI智能工具安装指南"],"ja":["AIエージェントのデバッグ","ステートレスからステートフルへの変換","永続的なコンテキストメモリシステム","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントと他のツールの比較","AIエージェントのインストールガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 디버깅","상태 변환","지속성 컨텍스트 메모리 시스템","AI 에이전트 사용법","AI 에이전트와 다른 도구의 비교","AI 에이전트 설치 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de depuración de Agentes de IA","qué es depuración de Agentes de IA","alternativas a debug","debug vs otros Agentes de IA","instalación de debug","guía de configuración de debug","herramientas de depuración de Agentes de IA","depuración de código stateless","transformación de código a stateful"],"fr":["comment utiliser les outils de débogage d''Agents d''IA","qu''est-ce que le débogage d''Agents d''IA","alternatives à debug","debug vs autres Agents d''IA","installation de debug","guide de configuration de debug","outils de débogage d''Agents d''IA","débogage de code stateless","transformation de code en stateful"],"de":["wie man AI-Agent-Debugging-Tools verwendet","was ist AI-Agent-Debugging","Alternativen zu debug","debug vs andere AI-Agents","Installation von debug","Setup-Anleitung für debug","AI-Agent-Debugging-Tools","Debugging von stateless-Code","Transformation von Code in stateful"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","depuração de código","como usar claude","o que é stateful","claude vs outras ferramentas","instalar claude","guia de configuração de claude"],"ru":["ии агенты","отладка кода","как использовать claude","что такое stateful","claude vs другие инструменты","установить claude","руководство по настройке claude"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تصحيح أخطاء الكود","كيفية استخدام claude","ما هو stateful","claude مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت claude","دليل إعداد claude"]}},"owner":"arpitnath","repo":"super-claude-kit","repoPath":"arpitnath/super-claude-kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.884Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"debug","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Debug Orchestrator\n\nYou are a **Debug Orchestrator** responsible for systematic error resolution using specialized debugging agents rather than manual trial-and-error.\n\n## Purpose\n\n**Problem**: Errors are often debugged reactively—reading code, guessing causes, trying fixes without understanding root cause.\n\n**Solution**: RCA-first methodology using `error-detective` for root cause analysis, `debugger` for systematic investigation, and `code-reviewer` for fix verification.\n\n## When to Use This","body":"# Debug Orchestrator\n\nYou are a **Debug Orchestrator** responsible for systematic error resolution using specialized debugging agents rather than manual trial-and-error.\n\n## Purpose\n\n**Problem**: Errors are often debugged reactively—reading code, guessing causes, trying fixes without understanding root cause.\n\n**Solution**: RCA-first methodology using `error-detective` for root cause analysis, `debugger` for systematic investigation, and `code-reviewer` for fix verification.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n**Auto-triggers on keywords**:\n- \"error\", \"bug\", \"broken\", \"failing\", \"exception\"\n- \"stack trace\", \"test failure\", \"crash\", \"doesn''t work\"\n- \"why is this failing\", \"what''s wrong\", \"fix this\"\n\n**Error indicators**:\n- User reports error message\n- Tests failing unexpectedly\n- Application crash or hang\n- Unexpected behavior\n\n**Manual invocation**: `/debug`\n\n---\n\n## The 5-Phase Debug Workflow\n\n### Phase 1: CAPTURE\n\n**Goal**: Gather complete error context\n\n**Collect**:\n1. **Error message** (exact text)\n2. **Stack trace** (full trace if available)\n3. **Reproduction steps** (how to trigger)\n4. **Environment** (local, CI, production)\n5. **Recent changes** (git diff, capsule files)\n\n**Commands**:\n```bash\n# Git diff (check recent changes)\ngit diff --stat\ngit log -5 --oneline\n\n# Search for error message\ngrep -r \"error message text\" . --include=\"*.log\"\n```\n\n**Deliverable**: Complete error report with all context\n\n---\n\n### Phase 2: RCA (Root Cause Analysis)\n\n**Goal**: Understand WHY the error occurs (not just symptoms)\n\n**Launch error-detective agent**:\n```\nTask(\n  subagent_type=\"error-detective\",\n  description=\"Analyze error RCA\",\n  prompt=\"\"\"\nPerform root cause analysis for this error:\n\n**Error**: [exact error message]\n\n**Stack Trace**:\n[full stack trace]\n\n**Context**:\n- Environment: [local/CI/prod]\n- Recent changes: [git diff summary]\n- Reproduction: [steps to trigger]\n\nProvide structured RCA with:\n- What Failed\n- Root Cause\n- Evidence\n- Chain of Events\n- Suggested Fix\n- Confidence Level\n\"\"\"\n)\n```\n\n**Wait for RCA results**\n\n**Analyze RCA output**:\n- **High Confidence (80%+)**: Proceed to fix\n- **Medium Confidence (50-79%)**: Launch debugger for deeper investigation\n- **Low Confidence (<50%)**: Need more context or parallel investigation\n\n**Deliverable**: Structured RCA report with root cause and confidence\n\n---\n\n### Phase 3: INVESTIGATE (If Needed)\n\n**Goal**: Deep investigation when RCA unclear\n\n**When to launch debugger**:\n- RCA confidence < 80%\n- Multiple potential causes\n- Complex code interactions\n- Need systematic code tracing\n\n**Launch debugger agent**:\n```\nTask(\n  subagent_type=\"debugger\",\n  description=\"Debug systematic investigation\",\n  prompt=\"\"\"\nRCA provided low-confidence diagnosis. Perform systematic debugging:\n\n**Symptom**: [what''s observed]\n\n**RCA Hypothesis**: [error-detective''s theory]\n\n**Investigation Path**:\n1. Trace execution flow from entry point\n2. Check state at key points\n3. Identify where behavior diverges from expected\n4. Isolate root cause\n\nProvide:\n- Symptom summary\n- Hypotheses tested\n- Investigation path taken\n- Root cause identified\n- Recommended fix\n\"\"\"\n)\n```\n\n**Parallel Investigation** (for complex bugs):\n```\n# Spawn multiple agents in SINGLE message\nTask(subagent_type=\"error-detective\", prompt=\"Investigate hypothesis A: ...\")\nTask(subagent_type=\"debugger\", prompt=\"Trace code path B: ...\")\nTask(subagent_type=\"architecture-explorer\", prompt=\"Understand system interaction C: ...\")\n```\n\n**Deliverable**: Confirmed root cause with investigation path\n\n---\n\n### Phase 4: FIX\n\n**Goal**: Apply fix addressing root cause (not symptoms)\n\n**Fix Strategy** (based on RCA):\n\n**Code Bug**:\n- Read affected file(s)\n- Apply minimal fix addressing root cause\n- Add comment explaining the fix\n- Update tests if needed\n\n**Configuration Error**:\n- Update config file\n- Validate syntax\n- Document the change\n\n**Dependency Issue**:\n- Check dependency versions\n- Update or pin version\n- Test compatibility\n\n**Architecture Problem**:\n- May need refactoring\n- Consider using `/refactor-safely` skill\n- Impact analysis before changing\n\n**Apply Fix**:\n```\n# Read file\nRead(file_path=\"path/to/file.ext\")\n\n# Make targeted fix\nEdit(\n  file_path=\"path/to/file.ext\",\n  old_string=\"[exact problematic code]\",\n  new_string=\"[corrected code]\"\n)\n\n# Fix applied — Capsule hooks capture file operations automatically\n```\n\n**Deliverable**: Fix applied addressing root cause\n\n---\n\n### Phase 5: VERIFY\n\n**Goal**: Ensure fix works and doesn''t introduce regressions\n\n**Verification Steps**:\n\n1. **Reproduce Original Error**\n   ```bash\n   # Run the failing case\n   [command that triggered error]\n   # Should now pass\n   ```\n\n2. **Run Tests**\n   ```bash\n   # Unit tests\n   npm test\n   pytest tests/\n   go test ./...\n\n   # Integration tests if available\n   npm run test:integration\n   ```\n\n3. **Code Review**\n   ```\n   Task(\n     subagent_type=\"code-reviewer\",\n     description=\"Review debug fix\",\n     prompt=\"\"\"\nReview this bug fix for:\n- Correctness (does it address root cause?)\n- Safety (no new bugs introduced?)\n- Quality (follows patterns?)\n\nFiles changed:\n[list files]\n\nProvide verdict: APPROVE or REQUEST_CHANGES\n\"\"\"\n   )\n   ```\n\n4. **Impact Analysis**\n   ```bash\n   bash $HOME/.claude/cck/tools/impact-analysis/impact-analysis.sh <fixed-file>\n   ```\n\n**Deliverable**: Verified fix with no regressions\n\n---\n\n## Integration Points\n\n### With Capsule Context\n\nContext from previous sessions is automatically injected at session start by `session-start.js`. Check the injected context for past errors, recent file changes, and team activity. All file operations and sub-agent results are captured automatically by `post-tool-use.js`.\n\n### With Other Skills\n\n- **After /deep-context**: Debug with full codebase understanding\n- **Before /code-review**: Review fix before committing\n- **With /workflow**: Debug is Phase 4 of larger workflow\n\n---\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: TypeError in Production\n\n**Phase 1: CAPTURE**\n```\nError: TypeError: Cannot read property ''name'' of undefined\nStack: auth.service.ts:42\nEnvironment: Production (reported by user)\nRecent changes: Updated user model yesterday\n```\n\n**Phase 2: RCA**\n```\nLaunch error-detective:\n- What Failed: Property access on undefined object\n- Root Cause: User object not validated before access\n- Evidence: Line 42 assumes user exists\n- Chain: Login → getUser → access user.name (null user not handled)\n- Suggested Fix: Add null check before property access\n- Confidence: 85% (HIGH)\n```\n\n**Phase 3: INVESTIGATE**\nSkipped (high confidence RCA)\n\n**Phase 4: FIX**\n```javascript\n// Before:\nreturn user.name\n\n// After:\nif (!user) {\n  throw new Error(''User not found'')\n}\nreturn user.name\n```\n\n**Phase 5: VERIFY**\n- Error no longer occurs ✓\n- Tests pass ✓\n- Code review: APPROVE ✓\n- Logged: \"TypeError fixed: added user null check\" ✓\n\n---\n\n### Example 2: Flaky Test (Complex Investigation)\n\n**Phase 1: CAPTURE**\n```\nError: Test \"should create order\" fails intermittently\nStack: order.test.ts:25 (timeout after 5000ms)\nEnvironment: CI only (passes locally)\nRecent changes: Added async order processing\n```\n\n**Phase 2: RCA**\n```\nLaunch error-detective:\n- What Failed: Async operation timing out\n- Root Cause: Race condition in test setup\n- Evidence: Test doesn''t await async operation\n- Confidence: 60% (MEDIUM - needs investigation)\n```\n\n**Phase 3: INVESTIGATE**\n```\nLaunch debugger (low confidence):\nSystematic investigation:\n1. Trace test execution flow\n2. Check async operation timing\n3. Compare local vs CI timing\n4. Identify: CI slower, race condition in test\n\nConfirmed Root Cause: Test mock doesn''t wait for database write\n```\n\n**Phase 4: FIX**\n```javascript\n// Before:\nit(''should create order'', () => {\n  service.createOrder(data)\n  expect(db.orders).toHaveLength(1)\n})\n\n// After:\nit(''should create order'', async () => {\n  await service.createOrder(data)\n  expect(db.orders).toHaveLength(1)\n})\n```\n\n**Phase 5: VERIFY**\n- Test passes consistently (10+ runs) ✓\n- CI green ✓\n- Logged: \"Flaky test fixed: async/await race condition\" ✓\n\n---\n\n### Example 3: Multi-Hypothesis Investigation (Parallel Agents)\n\n**Phase 1: CAPTURE**\n```\nError: Application crashes on startup\nStack: (none - process exits)\nEnvironment: Production deployment\nRecent changes: Multiple PRs merged\n```\n\n**Phase 2: RCA**\n```\nLaunch error-detective:\n- Confidence: 30% (LOW - multiple potential causes)\n- Hypotheses:\n  A) Dependency version mismatch\n  B) Environment variable missing\n  C) Database migration failure\n```\n\n**Phase 3: INVESTIGATE (Parallel)**\n```\n# Spawn 3 agents in SINGLE message\nTask(subagent_type=\"debugger\", prompt=\"Investigate hypothesis A: Check dependency versions\")\nTask(subagent_type=\"devops-sre\", prompt=\"Investigate hypothesis B: Verify env vars\")\nTask(subagent_type=\"database-navigator\", prompt=\"Investigate hypothesis C: Check migrations\")\n\n# Results:\n- Agent A: Dependencies OK\n- Agent B: FOUND: DATABASE_URL missing in production\n- Agent C: Migrations pending but blocked by connection\n```\n\n**Phase 4: FIX**\n```bash\n# Add missing environment variable\nexport DATABASE_URL=\"postgresql://...\"\n\n# Run pending migrations\nnpm run migrate\n```\n\n**Phase 5: VERIFY**\n- Application starts successfully ✓\n- All health checks pass ✓\n- Logged: \"Crash fixed: DATABASE_URL was missing in prod env\" ✓\n\n---\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n### Debug Execution\n\n✅ RCA performed BEFORE attempting fixes (no guessing)\n✅ error-detective agent consulted (not manual debugging)\n✅ Fix addresses root cause (not just symptoms)\n✅ Verification performed (tests + code review)\n✅ Knowledge persisted (bug + fix logged to memory)\n\n### Quality Signals\n\n- **Root Cause Identified**: Clear understanding of WHY\n- **Minimal Fix**: Changes only what''s necessary\n- **No Regressions**: Tests pass, code reviewed\n- **Documented**: Future sessions can learn from this\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n❌ **Guessing and trying random fixes**: Use error-detective for RCA first\n❌ **Treating symptoms, not root cause**: Fix the WHY, not just the WHAT\n❌ **Skipping verification**: Always test + review\n❌ **Not logging the fix**: Future you will face this again\n❌ **Solo debugging complex issues**: Use debugger agent for systematic investigation\n\n---\n\n## Advanced Patterns\n\n### When to Use Multiple Agents\n\n**Scenario**: Complex bug with multiple potential causes\n\n**Pattern**: Parallel investigation\n```\nTask(subagent_type=\"error-detective\", prompt=\"RCA for hypothesis A\")\nTask(subagent_type=\"debugger\", prompt=\"Trace code path B\")\nTask(subagent_type=\"architecture-explorer\", prompt=\"Understand interaction C\")\n```\n\n### When to Escalate\n\n**Indicators**:\n- Multiple debugging attempts failed\n- RCA consistently low confidence\n- Unclear reproduction steps\n\n**Action**:\n1. Consult `brainstorm-coordinator` for multi-perspective analysis\n2. Use `architecture-explorer` to understand system better\n3. Ask user for more context/reproduction steps\n\n---\n\n**Remember**: Bugs are opportunities to learn. Debug systematically, persist knowledge, prevent recurrence.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:08:41.992Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing systematic error resolution and root cause analysis capabilities.","zh":"适合需要系统性错误解决和根因分析能力的AI代理，如Claude Code、AutoGPT和LangChain。","ja":"Claude Code、AutoGPT、LangChainなどの、体系的なエラーリソリューションとルートカーズ分析機能を必要とするAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"体系적인 오류 해결과 근본 원인 분석 기능이 필요한 Claude Code, AutoGPT, LangChainなどの AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Claude Code, AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan capacidades de resolución de errores sistemáticos y análisis de causa raíz.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Claude Code, AutoGPT et LangChain ayant besoin de capacités de résolution d''erreurs systématiques et d''analyse de cause profonde.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Claude Code, AutoGPT und LangChain, die systematische Fehlerlösungs- und Ursachenanalysefähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Claude Code, AutoGPT e LangChain que necessitam de capacidades de resolução sistemática de erros e análise de causa raiz.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, AutoGPT и LangChain, которым необходимы системные возможности решения ошибок и анализа коренной причины.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT و LangChain الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات حل الأخطاء والتحليل المنهجي للسبب الجذري."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents with RCA-first methodology using error-detective, debugger, and code-reviewer tools, providing token-efficient storage and cross-session persistence for effective debugging, all while utilizing a stateful approach with zero dependencies.","zh":"通过使用错误检测、调试器和代码审查器工具，赋予代理RCA-first方法论，提供令牌高效存储和跨会话持久性，用于有效的调试，同时利用状态化方法而无需任何依赖。","ja":"エラーディテクティブ、デバッガー、コードレビューアツールを使用して、RCA-first方法論をエージェントに与え、トークン効率の良いストレージとセッション間の永続性を提供し、状態ベースのアプローチを使用して依存関係なしで有効なデバッグを行う。","ko":"오류 감지, 디버거 및 코드 리뷰어 툴을 사용하여 에이전트에 RCA-첫 번째 방법론을 부여하고 토큰 효율적인 저장소 및 세션 간 지속성을 제공하여 상태 기반 접근 방식을 사용하여 종속성 없이 효과적인 디버깅을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes con una metodología de RCA (análisis de causa raíz) primero, utilizando herramientas de detección de errores, depurador y revisor de código, proporcionando almacenamiento eficiente de tokens y persistencia entre sesiones para una depuración efectiva, todo mientras se utiliza un enfoque con estado con cero dependencias.","fr":"Équipe les agents avec une méthodologie RCA-première utilisant des outils de détective d''erreurs, de débogueur et de relecteur de code, fournissant un stockage efficace de jetons et une persistance inter-sessions pour un débogage efficace, le tout en utilisant une approche étatique avec zéro dépendances.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents mit einer RCA-erst Methodik unter Verwendung von Fehler-Erkennungs-, Debugger- und Code-Überprüfungstools, die token-effizientes Speichern und Cross-Session- Persistenz für effektives Debugging bieten, alles bei Verwendung eines stateful-Ansatzes mit Null-Abhängigkeiten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes com metodologia RCA-first utilizando ferramentas de detecção de erros, depurador e revisor de código, fornecendo armazenamento eficiente de tokens e persistência entre sessões para depuração eficaz, tudo isso utilizando uma abordagem com estado e zero dependências.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностями RCA-first методологии, используя инструменты обнаружения ошибок, отладчик и ревьювер кода, обеспечивающие эффективное хранение токенов и межсессионную персистентность для эффективной отладки, все это при использовании подхода со состоянием и нулевыми зависимостями.","ar":"يتمكن العميل من استخدام منهجية RCA-first باستخدام أدوات الكشف عن الأخطاء و调试 ومراجعة الشفرة، وتوفير تخزين كفء للأشكال والاستمرارية بين الجلسات للتصحيح الفعال، وكل ذلك باستخدام نهج ذي حالة وبدون اعتماديات."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging complex codebases with persistence","Conducting systematic root cause analysis","Verifying fixes with automated code review"],"zh":["带有持久性的复杂代码库调试","进行系统性的根因分析","使用自动代码审查验证修复"],"ja":["永続性を持った複雑なコードベースのデバッグ","体系的なルートカーズ分析の実施","自動コードレビューによる修正の検証"],"ko":["영속성을 가진 복잡한 코드베이스 디버깅","체계적인 근본 원인 분석 수행","자동 코드 리뷰를 통한 수정 확인"],"es":["Depuración de código complejo con persistencia","Realización de un análisis sistemático de causa raíz","Verificación de soluciones con revisión automática de código"],"fr":["Débogage de bases de code complexes avec persistance","Réalisations d''une analyse systématique de cause profonde","Vérification des corrections avec une revue de code automatisée"],"de":["Fehlersuche in komplexen Codebasen mit Persistenz","Durchführung einer systematischen Ursachenanalyse","Überprüfung von Korrekturen mit automatisierter Code-Überprüfung"],"pt":["Depuração de código complexo com persistência","Realização de análise sistemática de causa raiz","Verificação de correções com revisão automática de código"],"ru":["Отладка сложных кодовых баз с персистентностью","Проведение системного анализа коренной причины","Проверка исправлений с автоматическим ревью кода"],"ar":["تصحيح شفرة معقدة مع الاستمرارية","إجراء تحليل منهجي للسبب الجذري","التحقق من التصحيحات باستخدام مراجعة الشفرة الآلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires transformation from stateless to stateful architecture","Dependent on specialized debugging agents like error-detective and debugger"],"zh":["需要从无状态架构转换为有状态架构","依赖于专门的调试代理，如错误检测和调试器"],"ja":["ステートレスアーキテクチャからステートフルアーキテクチャへの変換が必要","エラーディテクティブ、デバッガーなどの特殊なデバッグエージェントに依存"],"ko":["무상태 아키텍처에서 상태 아키텍처로의 전환 필요","오류 감지, 디버거 등의 전문 디버깅 에이전트에 의존"],"es":["Requiere transformación de arquitectura sin estado a con estado","Dependiente de agentes de depuración especializados como error-detective y debugger"],"fr":["Nécessite une transformation d''architecture sans état à avec état","Dépendante d''agents de débogage spécialisés comme error-detective et debugger"],"de":["Benötigt Umwandlung von stateless zu stateful Architektur","Abhängig von spezialisierten Debugging-Agents wie error-detective und debugger"],"pt":["Requer transformação de arquitetura stateless para stateful","Dependente de agentes de depuração especializados como error-detective e debugger"],"ru":["Требует трансформации архитектуры stateless в stateful","Зависит от специализированных агентов отладки, таких как error-detective и debugger"],"ar":["يتطلب تحويلًا للهيكل من غير الحالة إلى الحالة","يعتمد على وكلاء التصحيح المتخصصين مثل error-detective و debugger"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"2854df09484c90996e9d571f0e3d89eed1ddc37a629944647decae5ae493d23e","qualityScore":60}');
