à des discussions techniques et forums"],"de":["Lernen mit anderen Entwicklern","Zusammenarbeiten an Open-Source-Projekten","Zugang zu fortgeschrittenen Lernressourcen","Verbinden mit anderen Entwicklern weltweit","Verbessern Ihrer Fähigkeiten mit KI-Tools","Teilnehmen an technischen Diskussionen und Foren"],"pt":["Aprendizado colaborativo","Ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","Comunidade de desenvolvedores","Recursos para melhorar habilidades","Integração com tecnologias de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Совместное обучение","ИИ Агенты для разработчиков","Сообщество разработчиков","Ресурсы для улучшения навыков","Интеграция с технологиями разработки"],"ar":["تعلم تعاوني","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","مجتمع المطورين","موارد لتحسين المهارات","تكامل مع تقنيات التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用daily.dev","什么是AI工具","daily.dev替代品","daily.dev与竞争对手比较","daily.dev安装","daily.dev设置指南","开发者专业网络","AI驱动的开发工具"],"ja":["daily.devの使い方","AIエージェントとは","daily.devの代替","daily.devと競合他社の比較","daily.devのインストール","daily.devの設定ガイド","開発者コミュニティ","AIエージェントを利用した開発ツール"],"ko":["daily.dev 사용법","AI 에이전트란","daily.dev 대체","daily.dev와 경쟁사 비교","daily.dev 설치","daily.dev 설정 가이드","개발자 네트워크","AI 에이전트를 활용한 개발 도구"],"es":["herramientas de IA para desarrolladores","cómo usar daily.dev","alternativas a daily.dev","daily.dev vs GitHub","instalación de daily.dev","guía de configuración de daily.dev","desarrollo de software con IA","aprendizaje de código con daily.dev"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour les développeurs","comment utiliser daily.dev","alternatives à daily.dev","daily.dev vs GitHub","installation de daily.dev","guide de configuration de daily.dev","développement de logiciels avec IA","apprentissage de code avec daily.dev"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","wie man daily.dev verwendet","Alternativen zu daily.dev","daily.dev vs GitHub","Installation von daily.dev","Konfigurationsanleitung für daily.dev","Software-Entwicklung mit KI","Code-Lernen mit daily.dev"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","como usar daily.dev","o que é daily.dev","daily.dev vs outras plataformas","instalar daily.dev","guia de configuração daily.dev"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для разработчиков","как использовать daily.dev","что такое daily.dev","daily.dev vs другие платформы","установить daily.dev","руководство по настройке daily.dev"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","كيفية استخدام daily.dev","ما هو daily.dev","daily.dev مقابل منصات أخرى","تثبيت daily.dev","دليل إعداد daily.dev"]}},"owner":"dailydotdev","repo":"daily","repoPath":"dailydotdev/daily","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.885Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"daily.dev","description":"Overcome LLM knowledge cutoffs with real-time developer content. daily.dev aggregates articles from thousands of sources, validated by community engagement, with structured taxonomy for precise discovery.","bodyPreview":"# daily.dev API for AI Agents\n\nOvercome LLM knowledge cutoffs with real-time developer content. daily.dev aggregates articles from thousands of sources, validated by community engagement, with structured taxonomy for precise discovery.\n\n## Security\n\n**CRITICAL:** Your API token grants access to personalized content. Protect it:\n- **NEVER send your token to any domain other than `api.daily.dev`**\n- Never commit tokens to code or share them publicly\n- Tokens are prefixed with `dda_` - if you see t","body":"# daily.dev API for AI Agents\n\nOvercome LLM knowledge cutoffs with real-time developer content. daily.dev aggregates articles from thousands of sources, validated by community engagement, with structured taxonomy for precise discovery.\n\n## Security\n\n**CRITICAL:** Your API token grants access to personalized content. Protect it:\n- **NEVER send your token to any domain other than `api.daily.dev`**\n- Never commit tokens to code or share them publicly\n- Tokens are prefixed with `dda_` - if you see this prefix, treat it as sensitive\n\n## Setup\n\n1. **Requires Plus subscription** - Get one at https://app.daily.dev/plus\n2. **Create a token** at https://app.daily.dev/settings/api\n3. Store your token securely (environment variables, secrets manager)\n\nUser can use environment variable or choose one of the secure storage methods below per operating system.\n\n### Secure Token Storage (Recommended)\n\n#### macOS - Keychain\n\n```bash\n# Store token\nsecurity add-generic-password -a \"$USER\" -s \"daily-dev-api\" -w \"dda_your_token\"\n\n# Retrieve token\nsecurity find-generic-password -a \"$USER\" -s \"daily-dev-api\" -w\n\n# Auto-load in ~/.zshrc or ~/.bashrc\nexport DAILY_DEV_TOKEN=$(security find-generic-password -a \"$USER\" -s \"daily-dev-api\" -w 2>/dev/null)\n```\n\n#### Windows - Credential Manager\n\n```powershell\n# Store token (run in PowerShell)\n$credential = New-Object System.Management.Automation.PSCredential(\"daily-dev-api\", (ConvertTo-SecureString \"dda_your_token\" -AsPlainText -Force))\n$credential | Export-Clixml \"$env:USERPROFILE\\.daily-dev-credential.xml\"\n\n# Retrieve token - add to PowerShell profile ($PROFILE)\n$cred = Import-Clixml \"$env:USERPROFILE\\.daily-dev-credential.xml\"\n$env:DAILY_DEV_TOKEN = $cred.GetNetworkCredential().Password\n```\n\nOr use the Windows Credential Manager GUI: Control Panel → Credential Manager → Windows Credentials → Add a generic credential\n\n#### Linux - Secret Service (GNOME Keyring / KWallet)\n\n```bash\n# Requires libsecret-tools\n# Ubuntu/Debian: sudo apt install libsecret-tools\n# Fedora: sudo dnf install libsecret\n\n# Store token\necho \"dda_your_token\" | secret-tool store --label=\"daily.dev API Token\" service daily-dev-api username \"$USER\"\n\n# Retrieve token\nsecret-tool lookup service daily-dev-api username \"$USER\"\n\n# Auto-load in ~/.bashrc or ~/.zshrc\nexport DAILY_DEV_TOKEN=$(secret-tool lookup service daily-dev-api username \"$USER\" 2>/dev/null)\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer dda_your_token_here\n```\n\n## Base URL\n\n```\nhttps://api.daily.dev/public/v1\n```\n\n## API Reference\n\nFull OpenAPI spec: https://api.daily.dev/public/v1/docs/json\n\nTo fetch details for a specific endpoint (e.g. response schema):\n```bash\ncurl -s https://api.daily.dev/public/v1/docs/json | jq ''.paths[\"/feeds/foryou\"].get''\n```\n\nTo fetch a component schema (replace `def-17` with schema name from $ref):\n```bash\ncurl -s https://api.daily.dev/public/v1/docs/json | jq ''.components.schemas[\"def-17\"]''\n```\n\n### Available Endpoints\n!`curl -s https://api.daily.dev/public/v1/docs/json | jq -r ''.paths | to_entries | map(.key as $path | .value | to_entries | map(.key as $method | {tag: (.value.tags[0] // \"other\"), line: (\"\\(.key | ascii_upcase) \\($path)\" + (if .value.description then \" - \\(.value.description)\" else \"\" end) + (if (.value.parameters | length) > 0 then \"\\n  Params: \" + ([.value.parameters[] | \"\\(.name)(\\(.in)): \\(.description // .schema.type)\"] | join(\"; \")) else \"\" end) + (if .value.requestBody then \"\\n  Body: \" + (.value.requestBody.content[\"application/json\"].schema | if .properties then ([.properties | to_entries[] | \"\\(.key)\"] | join(\", \")) elif .\"$ref\" then (.\"$ref\" | split(\"/\") | last) else \"object\" end) else \"\" end))})) | flatten | group_by(.tag) | map(\"#### \\(.[0].tag)\\n\" + (map(.line) | join(\"\\n\\n\"))) | join(\"\\n\\n\")''`\n\n## Agent Use Cases\n\n**Why daily.dev for agents?** LLMs have knowledge cutoffs. daily.dev provides real-time, community-validated developer content with structured taxonomy across thousands of sources. Agents can use this to stay current, get diverse perspectives, and understand what the developer community actually cares about.\n\nThese examples show how AI agents can combine daily.dev APIs with external context to create powerful developer workflows.\n\n### 🔍 GitHub Repo → Personalized Feed\nScan a user''s GitHub repositories to detect their actual tech stack from `package.json`, `go.mod`, `Cargo.toml`, `requirements.txt`, etc. Then:\n- Fetch `/tags` to see all available tags for deterministic matching\n- Auto-follow matching tags via `/feeds/filters/tags/follow`\n- Create a custom feed tuned to their stack with `/feeds/custom/`\n- Surface trending articles about their specific dependencies\n\n**Trigger:** \"Set up daily.dev based on my GitHub projects\"\n\n### 🛠️ GitHub → Auto-fill Stack Profile\nAnalyze a user''s GitHub activity to build their daily.dev tech stack profile automatically:\n- Scan repositories for languages, frameworks, and tools actually used in code\n- Search `/profile/stack/search` to find matching technologies on daily.dev\n- Populate their stack via `POST /profile/stack/` organized by section (languages, frameworks, tools)\n- Update `/profile/` bio based on their primary technologies and contributions\n\n**Trigger:** \"Build my daily.dev profile from my GitHub\"\n\n### 🚀 New Project → Curated Onboarding\nWhen a user initializes a new project or clones a repo:\n- Analyze the tech choices from config files\n- Create a dedicated custom feed filtered to exactly those technologies\n- Build a \"Getting Started\" bookmark list with foundational articles\n- Block irrelevant tags to keep the feed focused on the project scope\n\n**Trigger:** \"Help me learn the stack for this project\"\n\n### 📊 Weekly Digest → Synthesized Briefing\nCompile a personalized weekly summary by:\n- Fetching `/feeds/foryou` and `/feeds/popular` filtered by user''s followed tags\n- Cross-referencing with their GitHub activity to prioritize relevant topics\n- Summarizing key articles and trending discussions\n- Delivering as a structured briefing with links to full posts\n\n**Trigger:** Scheduled, or \"Give me my weekly dev news\"\n\n### 📚 Research Project Workspace\nWhen a user wants to deep-dive into a topic (e.g., \"I want to learn Kubernetes\"):\n- Create a custom feed via `/feeds/custom/` filtered to that topic\n- Set up a matching bookmark list via `POST /bookmarks/lists` to collect the best finds\n- As the user reads, save articles to the list with `POST /bookmarks/`\n- Track learning progress: compare bookmarked posts vs. new feed items\n- Adjust feed filters over time as understanding deepens (beginner → advanced content)\n\n**Trigger:** \"Start a research project on [topic]\"\n\n### 🧠 Agent Self-Improvement Feed\nAgents can overcome their knowledge cutoff by maintaining their own custom feed:\n- Create a custom feed via `/feeds/custom/` for technologies the agent frequently assists with\n- Periodically fetch `/feeds/custom/{feedId}` to ingest recent articles\n- Use `/posts/{id}` to read full summaries and key points\n- Agent can now provide advice with current information: \"As of this week, the recommended approach is...\"\n- Continuously adapt the feed filters based on what users are asking about\n\n**Trigger:** Agent background process, or \"What''s new in [technology] since your training?\"\n\n### 🔀 Multi-Source Synthesis\nGet balanced perspectives by aggregating content across publishers:\n- Search `/search/posts` for a topic to find coverage from multiple sources\n- Use `/search/sources` to identify authoritative publishers on the topic\n- Fetch posts from different sources via `/feeds/source/{source}`\n- Synthesize diverse viewpoints into a balanced summary with citations\n- Surface where sources agree vs. disagree on best practices\n\n**Trigger:** \"What are the different perspectives on [topic]?\" or \"Compare approaches to [problem]\"\n\n### 📈 Trending Radar\nHelp users stay ahead by monitoring community signals:\n- Fetch `/feeds/popular` to detect what''s gaining traction right now\n- Cross-reference with user''s followed tags to surface relevant trends\n- Use `/feeds/discussed` to find topics sparking active debate\n- Alert users when technologies in their stack are trending (new releases, security issues, paradigm shifts)\n- Use `/tags` to fetch the full tag catalog and `/search/tags` to explore adjacent trending topics\n\n**Trigger:** \"What should I be paying attention to?\" or \"What''s trending in [area]?\"\n\n## Rate Limits\n\n* **60 requests per minute** per user\n\nCheck response headers:\n- `X-RateLimit-Limit` - Maximum requests allowed per window\n- `X-RateLimit-Remaining` - Requests remaining in current window\n- `X-RateLimit-Reset` - Unix timestamp when the window resets\n- `Retry-After` - Seconds to wait (only when rate limited)\n\n## Errors\n\n| Code | Meaning |\n|------|---------|\n| 401  | Invalid or missing token |\n| 403  | Plus subscription required |\n| 404  | Resource not found |\n| 429  | Rate limit exceeded |\n\n**Error Response Format:**\n```json\n{\n  \"error\": \"error_code\",\n  \"message\": \"Human readable message\"\n}\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:09:03.980Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Knowledge Graph Agents needing real-time developer content and taxonomy for precise discovery.","zh":"非常适合需要实时开发者内容和分类法以实现精确发现的知识图谱代理。","ja":"リアルタイムの開発者コンテンツと分類法を使用して正確な発見を行う必要がある知識グラフエージェントに最適。","ko":"실시간 개발자 콘텐츠와 분류법을 사용하여 정확한 발견을 수행해야 하는 지식 그래프 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Gráficos de Conocimiento que necesitan contenido de desarrolladores en tiempo real y taxonomía para un descubrimiento preciso.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Graphique de Connaissance ayant besoin de contenu de développeurs en temps réel et de taxonomie pour une découverte précise.","de":"Perfekt für Wissensgraphen-Agents, die Echtzeit-Entwicklerinhalt und Taxonomie für eine präzise Entdeckung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Grafos de Conhecimento que necessitam de conteúdo de desenvolvedor em tempo real e taxonomia para descoberta precisa.","ru":"Идеально для агентов графа знаний, которым требуется контент разработчика в режиме реального времени и таксономия для точного обнаружения.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء رسومات المعرفة الذين يحتاجون إلى محتوى المطورين في الوقت الفعلي وتаксونوميا لاكتشاف دقيق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to overcome LLM knowledge cutoffs with aggregated articles from thousands of sources, validated by community engagement, using the daily.dev API for personalized content discovery and retrieval via HTTPS protocol.","zh":"赋予代理人使用daily.dev API通过HTTPS协议进行个性化内容发现和检索的能力，以克服LLM知识截止的限制，并聚合来自数千个来源的文章，通过社区参与进行验证。","ja":"daily.dev APIを使用してHTTPSプロトコル経由でパーソナライズされたコンテンツの発見と取得を行い、LLMの知識カットオフの制限を克服し、数千の情報源からの記事を集め、コミュニティの関与によって検証することでエージェントに力を与える。","ko":"일일.dev API를 사용하여 HTTPS 프로토콜을 통해 개인화된 콘텐츠 발견 및 검색을 수행하여 LLM 지식 종료 제한을 극복하고, 수천 개의 정보源에서 기사를 수집하고, 커뮤니티 참여를 통해 검증함으로써 에이전트에게 힘을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a superar los límites de conocimiento de LLM con artículos agregados de miles de fuentes, validados por la participación de la comunidad, utilizando la API de daily.dev para el descubrimiento y recuperación de contenido personalizado a través del protocolo HTTPS.","fr":"Permet aux agents de surmonter les limites de connaissance de LLM avec des articles agrégés de milliers de sources, validés par l''engagement de la communauté, en utilisant l''API daily.dev pour la découverte et la récupération de contenu personnalisé via le protocole HTTPS.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die LLM-Wissensgrenzen mit aggregierten Artikeln von Tausenden von Quellen zu überwinden, validiert durch die Beteiligung der Community, unter Verwendung der daily.dev-API für die personalisierte Inhaltsentdeckung und -rückgewinnung über das HTTPS-Protokoll.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a superar as limitações de conhecimento do LLM com artigos agregados de milhares de fontes, validados pelo engajamento da comunidade, usando a API daily.dev para descoberta e recuperação de conteúdo personalizado via protocolo HTTPS.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преодолеть ограничения знаний LLM с помощью агрегированных статей из тысяч источников, проверенных вовлечением сообщества, используя API daily.dev для персонализированной обнаружения и извлечения контента через протокол HTTPS.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من التغلب على قيود معرفة LLM باستخدام مقالات مجتمعة من آلاف المصادر، مدققة من خلال التفاعل المجتمعي، باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات daily.dev لاكتشاف المحتوى المخصص واسترجاعه عبر بروتوكول HTTPS."},"useCases":{"en":["Aggregating real-time developer articles for knowledge graph updates","Validating community engagement metrics for content relevance","Discovering precise content using structured taxonomy"],"zh":["聚合实时开发者文章以更新知识图谱","验证社区参与度指标以确定内容相关性","使用结构化分类法发现精确内容"],"ja":["知識グラフの更新のためにリアルタイムの開発者記事を集める","コンテンツの関連性を決定するためにコミュニティの関与メトリクスを検証する","構造化された分類法を使用して正確なコンテンツを発見する"],"ko":["지식 그래프를 업데이트하기 위한 실시간 개발자 기사를 수집하는 것","콘텐츠 관련성을 결정하기 위한 커뮤니티 참여 메트릭스를 검증하는 것","구조화된 분류법을 사용하여 정확한 콘텐츠를 발견하는 것"],"es":["Agregación de artículos de desarrolladores en tiempo real para actualizaciones del gráfico de conocimiento","Validación de métricas de participación de la comunidad para la relevancia del contenido","Descubrimiento de contenido preciso utilizando taxonomía estructurada"],"fr":[" Agrégation d''articles de développeurs en temps réel pour des mises à jour du graphique de connaissance","Validation des métriques d''engagement de la communauté pour la pertinence du contenu","Découverte de contenu précis en utilisant une taxonomie structurée"],"de":["Agrregation von Echtzeit-Entwicklerartikeln für Wissensgraphen-Aktualisierungen","Validierung von Community-Engagement-Metriken für die Inhaltsrelevanz","Entdeckung von präzisem Inhalt unter Verwendung einer strukturierten Taxonomie"],"pt":["Agregando artigos de desenvolvedor em tempo real para atualizações de grafos de conhecimento","Validando métricas de engajamento da comunidade para relevância de conteúdo","Descobrindo conteúdo preciso usando taxonomia estruturada"],"ru":["Агрегируя статьи разработчиков в режиме реального времени для обновления графа знаний","Проверяя метрики вовлечения сообщества для релевантности контента","Обнаруживая точный контент с помощью структурированной таксономии"],"ar":["تجميع مقالات المطورين في الوقت الفعلي لتحديث رسومات المعرفة","تحقق من مقاييس التفاعل المجتمعي لأهمية المحتوى","اكتشاف المحتوى الدقيق باستخدام التصنيف المنظم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires daily.dev API token","Token must be protected and never shared publicly or committed to code","API token is specific to the api.daily.dev domain"],"zh":["需要daily.dev API令牌","令牌必须被保护，不能公开分享或提交到代码中","API令牌特定于api.daily.dev域"],"ja":["daily.dev APIトークンが必要","トークンは保護され、公開されたりコードにコミットされたりしてはならない","APIトークンはapi.daily.devドメインに特有"],"ko":["일일.dev API 토큰이 필요합니다.","토큰은 보호되어야 하며 공개되거나 코드에 커밋되어서는 안 됩니다.","API 토큰은 api.daily.dev 도메인에 특정됩니다."],"es":["Requiere token de API de daily.dev","El token debe protegerse y nunca compartirse públicamente ni comprometerse en el código","El token de API es específico del dominio api.daily.dev"],"fr":["Nécessite un jeton d''API daily.dev","Le jeton doit être protégé et ne doit jamais être partagé publiquement ou compromis dans le code","Le jeton d''API est spécifique au domaine api.daily.dev"],"de":["Benötigt daily.dev-API-Token","Das Token muss geschützt werden und darf niemals öffentlich geteilt oder im Code committet werden","Das API-Token ist spezifisch für die Domäne api.daily.dev"],"pt":["Requer token da API daily.dev","O token deve ser protegido e nunca compartilhado publicamente ou comprometido com o código","O token da API é específico do domínio api.daily.dev"],"ru":["Требует токена API daily.dev","Токен должен быть защищен и никогда не должен быть общедоступным или передан в код","Токен API специфичен для домена api.daily.dev"],"ar":["يتطلب رمز واجهة برمجة تطبيقات daily.dev","يجب حماية الرمز وألا يتم مشاركة ihn علنا أو إيداعه في الكود","رمز واجهة برمجة التطبيقات محدد لمنطقة api.daily.dev"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4eb0b5b5de7fe3853e43b82608fefce8ecab135808b92bc814b072de232d09d1","qualityScore":60}');
