高效的系统管理","ja":"マルチエージェントAIオーケストレーションを使用した高品質なシステム管理","ko":"멀티 에이전트 AI 오케스트레이션을 통한 효율적인 시스템 관리","es":"Gates es un agente AI que utiliza GLM-4.7 para la orquestación de agentes múltiples con calidad y memoria avanzadas","fr":"Gates est un agent IA qui utilise GLM-4.7 pour l''orchestration d''agents multiples avec qualité et mémoire avancées","de":"Gates ist ein AI-Agent, der GLM-4.7 für die Orchestrierung von Multi-Agenten mit Qualität und erweiterter Speicher verwendet","pt":"Gates é uma ferramenta de AI que permite a orquestração de agentes com GLM-4.7, qualidade de portas e sistema de memória","ru":"Gates - это инструмент ИИ, который позволяет выполнять мульти-агентскую оркестрацию с GLM-4.7, качеством шлюзов и системой памяти","ar":"Gates هي أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تمكنك من تنسيق وكلاء متعدد مع GLM-4.7 وبوابات جودة ونظام ذاكرة","en":"Multi-Agent AI Orchestration with GLM-4.7 PRIMARY, Claude, Codex, Gemini. Quality gates, memory system, 67 hooks. MiniMax deprecated."},"definition":{"en":"Multi-Agent AI Orchestration with GLM-4.7 PRIMARY, Claude, Codex, Gemini. Quality gates, memory system, 67 hooks. MiniMax deprecated."},"features":{"zh":["GLM-4.7 PRIMARY支持","Claude、Codex和Gemini集成","质量控制和系统管理","67个钩子函数","MiniMax弃用"],"ja":["GLM-4.7 PRIMARY対応","Claude、Codex、Geminiとの統合","品質管理とシステム管理","67個のフック関数","MiniMax廃止"],"ko":["GLM-4.7 PRIMARY 지원","Claude, Codex, Gemini 통합","품질 관리 및 시스템 관리","67개의 후크 함수","MiniMax 폐지"],"es":["Orquestación de agentes múltiples con GLM-4.7","Puertas de calidad avanzadas","Sistema de memoria avanzado","67 hooks para personalización","Compatibilidad con Claude, Codex y Gemini"],"fr":["Orchestration d''agents multiples avec GLM-4.7","Portes de qualité avancées","Système de mémoire avancé","67 hooks pour la personnalisation","Compatibilité avec Claude, Codex et Gemini"],"de":["Orchestrierung von Multi-Agenten mit GLM-4.7","Erweiterte Qualitätsgates","Erweiterter Speichersystem","67 Hooks für Anpassung","Kompatibilität mit Claude, Codex und Gemini"],"pt":["Orquestração de agentes com GLM-4.7","Qualidade de portas e sistema de memória","67 ganchos para integração","MiniMax deprecated","Suporte a múltiplos agentes"],"ru":["Мульти-агентская оркестрация с GLM-4.7","Качество шлюзов и система памяти","67 крючков для интеграции","MiniMax deprecated","Поддержка нескольких агентов"],"ar":["تنسيق وكلاء متعدد مع GLM-4.7","بوابات جودة ونظام ذاكرة","67 مشبكًا للتكامل","MiniMax deprecated","دعم عدة وكلاء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理网关","GLM-4.7 PRIMARY","Claude","Codex","Gemini","多智能体AI编排","质量控制","系统管理","如何使用AI智能代理网关","AI智能代理网关安装"],"ja":["AIエージェントのゲート管理","GLM-4.7 PRIMARY","Claude","Codex","Gemini","マルチエージェントAIオーケストレーション","品質管理","システム管理","AIエージェントのゲート管理の使い方","AIエージェントのゲート管理のインストール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 게이트","GLM-4.7 PRIMARY","Claude","Codex","Gemini","멀티 에이전트 AI 오케스트레이션","품질 관리","시스템 관리","AI 에이전트 게이트 사용법","AI 에이전트 게이트 설치"],"es":["cómo usar agentes AI","qué es un agente AI","gates vs otros agentes AI","instalación de gates","guía de configuración de gates","agentes AI para desarrolladores","GLM-4.7 tutorial","orchestación de agentes múltiples"],"fr":["comment utiliser les agents IA","qu''est-ce qu''un agent IA","gates vs autres agents IA","installation de gates","guide de configuration de gates","agents IA pour développeurs","tutoriel GLM-4.7","orchestration d''agents multiples"],"de":["wie man AI-Agenten verwendet","was ist ein AI-Agent","gates vs andere AI-Agenten","installation von gates","konfigurationsanleitung für gates","AI-Agenten für Entwickler","GLM-4.7-Tutorial","Orchestrierung von Multi-Agenten"],"pt":["como usar Gates","o que é GLM-4.7","ferramentas de AI para orquestração de agentes","Gates vs outros agentes de AI","instalar Gates","guia de configuração do Gates","orquestração de agentes com Python","orquestração de agentes com Node.js"],"ru":["как использовать Gates","что такое GLM-4.7","инструменты ИИ для мульти-агентской оркестрации","Gates vs другие агенты ИИ","установить Gates","руководство по настройке Gates","мульти-агентская оркестрация с Python","мульти-агентская оркестрация с Node.js"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Gates","ما هو GLM-4.7","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتنسيق وكلاء متعدد","Gates مقابل وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الآخرون","تثبيت Gates","دليل إعداد Gates","تنسيق وكلاء متعدد مع Python","تنسيق وكلاء متعدد مع Node.js"]}},"owner":"alfredolopez80","repo":"multi-agent-ralph-loop","repoPath":"alfredolopez80/multi-agent-ralph-loop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.895Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gates","description":"9-language quality gate validation: linting, formatting, type checking, and test execution. Validates code changes meet quality standards before completion. Use when: (1) after code implementation, (2) before PR creation, (3) as part of /orchestrator Step 6, (4) manual quality check. Triggers: /gates, quality gates, run validation, check quality, validate code.","bodyPreview":"# Gates - Quality Validation (v2.37)\n\nComprehensive quality validation across 9 programming languages with **TLDR-assisted analysis**.\n\n## v2.88 Key Changes (MODEL-AGNOSTIC)\n\n- **Model-agnostic**: Uses model configured in `~/.claude/settings.json` or CLI/env vars\n- **No flags required**: Works with the configured default model\n- **Flexible**: Works with GLM-5, Claude, Minimax, or any configured model\n- **Settings-driven**: Model selection via `ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_*_MODEL` env vars\n\n## Quick Start","body":"# Gates - Quality Validation (v2.37)\n\nComprehensive quality validation across 9 programming languages with **TLDR-assisted analysis**.\n\n## v2.88 Key Changes (MODEL-AGNOSTIC)\n\n- **Model-agnostic**: Uses model configured in `~/.claude/settings.json` or CLI/env vars\n- **No flags required**: Works with the configured default model\n- **Flexible**: Works with GLM-5, Claude, Minimax, or any configured model\n- **Settings-driven**: Model selection via `ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_*_MODEL` env vars\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n/gates              # Run all quality gates\nralph gates         # Via CLI\nralph gates src/    # Specific directory\n```\n\n## LSP Usage for Type Checking\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Use LSP for efficient type checking instead of reading entire files.\n\n### When to Use LSP\n- Type checking TypeScript/JavaScript files\n- Finding type errors without running `tsc --noEmit`\n- Getting hover information for symbols\n- Finding references across the codebase\n\n### LSP Commands\n```yaml\n# Type check a specific file (TypeScript)\nLSP:\n  server: typescript-language-server\n  action: diagnostics\n  file: src/auth/login.ts\n\n# Get hover information for a symbol\nLSP:\n  server: typescript-language-server\n  action: hover\n  file: src/auth/login.ts\n  line: 42\n  character: 10\n\n# Find all references\nLSP:\n  server: typescript-language-server\n  action: references\n  file: src/auth/login.ts\n  line: 42\n  character: 10\n\n# Python type checking with pyright\nLSP:\n  server: pyright\n  action: diagnostics\n  file: src/auth/login.py\n```\n\n### LSP vs Traditional Type Checking\n| Method | Tokens Used | Speed | Use Case |\n|--------|-------------|-------|----------|\n| `tsc --noEmit` | HIGH (reads all files) | Slow | Full project check |\n| `LSP diagnostics` | LOW (indexed access) | Fast | Single file check |\n| `LSP hover` | MINIMAL | Instant | Quick type lookup |\n\n## Pre-Gates: TLDR Language Detection (v2.37)\n\n**AUTOMATIC** - Detect project languages efficiently:\n\n```bash\n# Get codebase structure to detect languages (95% token savings)\ntldr structure . > /tmp/project-structure.md\n\n# From structure, identify:\n# - Primary language(s)\n# - Config files present\n# - Test frameworks used\n```\n\n## Supported Languages\n\n| Language | Linter | Formatter | Types |\n|----------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| TypeScript | ESLint | Prettier | tsc |\n| JavaScript | ESLint | Prettier | - |\n| Python | Ruff | Black | mypy |\n| Rust | Clippy | rustfmt | cargo check |\n| Go | golint | gofmt | go vet |\n| Java | Checkstyle | google-java-format | - |\n| Ruby | RuboCop | - | Sorbet |\n| PHP | PHP_CodeSniffer | php-cs-fixer | PHPStan |\n| Solidity | Solhint | prettier-solidity | - |\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Detect Languages\n```bash\n# Auto-detect based on file extensions and config files\n```\n\n### 2. Run Linters\n```bash\n# Per-language linting\nnpx eslint src/          # TypeScript/JavaScript\nruff check .             # Python\ncargo clippy             # Rust\ngolangci-lint run        # Go\n```\n\n### 3. Check Formatting\n```bash\nnpx prettier --check .   # JS/TS\nblack --check .          # Python\nrustfmt --check src/     # Rust\ngofmt -l .               # Go\n```\n\n### 4. Type Checking\n```bash\nnpx tsc --noEmit         # TypeScript\nmypy .                   # Python\ncargo check              # Rust\ngo vet ./...             # Go\n```\n\n### 5. Run Tests\n```bash\nnpm test                 # Node projects\npytest                   # Python\ncargo test               # Rust\ngo test ./...            # Go\n```\n\n## Exit Codes\n\n| Code | Meaning |\n|------|---------|\n| 0 | All gates passed |\n| 1 | Lint errors |\n| 2 | Format errors |\n| 3 | Type errors |\n| 4 | Test failures |\n\n## Gate Configuration\n\n### Minimal (fast)\n```bash\nralph gates --minimal    # Lint only\n```\n\n### Standard (default)\n```bash\nralph gates              # Lint + Format + Types\n```\n\n### Full (CI)\n```bash\nralph gates --full       # Lint + Format + Types + Tests\n```\n\n## Integration\n\n- Invoked by /orchestrator in Step 6\n- **Pre-step: tldr structure for language detection** (v2.37)\n- Must pass before VERIFIED_DONE\n- Hooks: `quality-gates.sh` (PostToolUse)\n\n## TLDR Integration (v2.37)\n\n| Phase | TLDR Command | Purpose |\n|-------|--------------|---------|\n| Language detection | `tldr structure .` | Identify languages |\n| Error context | `tldr context $FILE .` | Understand failing code |\n| Impact analysis | `tldr deps $FILE .` | Find related tests |\n\n## Agent Teams Integration (v2.88)\n\n**Optimal Scenario**: Integrated (Agent Teams + Custom Subagents)\n\nQuality gates use Agent Teams coordination with specialized ralph-tester agents for parallel quality validation.\n\n### Why Scenario C for Gates\n- Multiple quality checks require coordination (lint, format, type, test)\n- Quality gates are meta-validation (hooks validate the validators)\n- Language-specific specialization via ralph-tester\n- TeammateIdle/TaskCompleted hooks for quality enforcement\n\n### Subagent Roles\n\n| Subagent | Role in Gates |\n|----------|---------------|\n| `ralph-tester` | Execute test suites in parallel |\n| `ralph-reviewer` | Analyze code quality issues |\n| `ralph-coder` | Apply auto-fixes for linting/formatting |\n\n### Parallel Gates Execution\nWhen Agent Teams is active, gates run in parallel across subagents:\n1. **Team Lead** creates task list with gate phases\n2. **ralph-tester** runs tests concurrently\n3. **ralph-reviewer** reviews linter output\n4. **ralph-coder** applies fixes\n\n### Quality Gate Hooks\n- `TeammateIdle`: Triggers before agent goes idle\n- `TaskCompleted`: Validates gate completion\n\n## Action Reporting (v2.93.0)\n\n**Los resultados de `/gates` generan reportes automáticos completos**:\n\n### Reporte Automático\n\nCuando `/gates` completa, se genera automáticamente:\n\n1. **En la conversación de Claude**: Resultados visibles de todas las validaciones\n2. **En el repositorio**: `docs/actions/gates/{timestamp}.md`\n3. **Metadatos JSON**: `.claude/metadata/actions/gates/{timestamp}.json`\n\n### Contenido del Reporte\n\nCada reporte incluye:\n- ✅ **Summary**: Tipo de validación ejecutada\n- ✅ **Results**: Resultados de linters, formatters, type checkers, tests\n- ✅ **Errors**: Errores encontrados por categoría\n- ✅ **Recommendations**: Acciones correctivas sugeridas\n- ✅ **Next Steps**: Qué hacer según el resultado\n\n### Generación Manual (Opcional)\n\n```bash\n# Al inicio\nsource .claude/lib/action-report-lib.sh\nstart_action_report \"gates\" \"Running quality gates on src/\"\n\n# Ejecutar validaciones\nif ! npx tsc --noEmit; then\n    record_error \"TypeScript errors found\"\nfi\n\nif ! npx eslint .; then\n    record_error \"ESLint violations found\"\nfi\n\nif ! npm test; then\n    record_error \"Test failures found\"\nfi\n\n# Al completar\nif [[ ${#CURRENT_ACTION_ERRORS[@]} -eq 0 ]]; then\n    complete_action_report \\\n        \"success\" \\\n        \"All quality gates passed\" \\\n        \"Safe to commit: git commit -m ''chore: pass quality gates''\"\nelse\n    complete_action_report \\\n        \"failed\" \\\n        \"Quality gates failed\" \\\n        \"Fix errors and run /gates again\"\nfi\n```\n\n### Ver Reportes Anteriores\n\n```bash\n# Listar todos los reportes de gates\nls -lt docs/actions/gates/\n\n# Ver el reporte más reciente\ncat $(ls -t docs/actions/gates/*.md | head -1)\n\n# Buscar reportes fallidos\ngrep -l \"Status: FAILED\" docs/actions/gates/*.md\n\n# Ver tendencia de calidad\ngrep -c \"Status: COMPLETED\" docs/actions/gates/*.md\ngrep -c \"Status: FAILED\" docs/actions/gates/*.md\n```\n\n### Integración CI/CD\n\nLos metadatos JSON permiten integración con pipelines:\n\n```bash\n# En tu CI pipeline\nsource .claude/lib/action-report-generator.sh\n\n# Ejecutar gates\n/gates\n\n# Obtener resultado del último reporte\nlatest_report=$(find_latest_report \"gates\")\nstatus=$(grep \"Status:\" \"$latest_report\" | awk ''{print $2}'')\n\nif [[ \"$status\" != \"COMPLETED\" ]]; then\n    echo \"Quality gates failed - blocking commit\"\n    exit 1\nfi\n```\n\n### Referencias del Sistema de Reportes\n\n- [Action Reports System](docs/actions/README.md) - Documentación completa\n- [action-report-lib.sh](.claude/lib/action-report-lib.sh) - Librería helper\n- [action-report-generator.sh](.claude/lib/action-report-generator.sh) - Generador\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- Never skip gates for \"quick fixes\"\n- Never ignore type errors\n- Never commit with lint warnings\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:10:39.410Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Multi-Agent AI Orchestration Agents needing advanced quality validation and model-agnostic analysis across various programming languages.","zh":"适用于 Multi-Agent AI Orchestration Agents，需要高级质量验证和模型无关分析跨各种编程语言。","ja":"Multi-Agent AI Orchestration Agents に適した高級の品質検証とモデル無関分析を提供する。","ko":"Multi-Agent AI Orchestration Agents 에 적합한 고급 품질 검증 및 모델 无关 분석을 제공한다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Orquestación de IA Multi-Agente que necesitan una validación de calidad avanzada y un análisis agnóstico de modelos en varios lenguajes de programación.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Orchestration d''IA Multi-Agents nécessitant une validation de qualité avancée et une analyse agnostique de modèles sur divers langages de programmation.","de":"Perfekt für Multi-Agenten-KI-Orchestrierungsagenten, die eine erweiterte Qualitätsvalidierung und eine modellagnostische Analyse in verschiedenen Programmiersprachen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Orquestração de IA Multi-Agente que necessitam de validação de qualidade avançada e análise agnóstica de modelo em várias linguagens de programação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов оркестровки ИИ с несколькими агентами, которым необходима продвинутая проверка качества и анализ, независимый от модели, в нескольких языках программирования.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحكم الإيجاد المتعددة التي تحتاج إلى التحقق من الجودة المتقدم وتحليل منفصل عن النموذج عبر لغات برمجة متعددة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform comprehensive quality validation using TLDR-assisted analysis, supporting up to 9 programming languages with flexible model selection via settings-driven configuration, including GLM-5, Claude, and other configured models.","zh":"Empowers 代理执行使用 TLDR-assisted 分析的综合质量验证，支持多达 9 个编程语言，并通过设置驱动配置提供灵活的模型选择，包括 GLM-5、Claude 和其他配置模型。","ja":"TLDR-assisted 分析を使用して、多達 9 個のプログラミング言語をサポートし、設定駆動の構成により、GLM-5、Claude などを含む、モデルを自由に選択することができる。","ko":"TLDR-assisted 분석을 사용하여, 최대 9개 의 프로그래밍 언어를 지원하고, 설정驱동의 구성으로, GLM-5, Claude 등 포함된 모델을 자유롭게 선택할 수 있다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar una validación de calidad integral utilizando análisis asistido por TLDR, que admite hasta 9 lenguajes de programación con una selección de modelos flexible a través de una configuración basada en ajustes, incluyendo GLM-5, Claude y otros modelos configurados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réaliser une validation de qualité complète en utilisant l''analyse assistée par TLDR, prenant en charge jusqu''à 9 langages de programmation avec une sélection de modèles flexible via une configuration basée sur les paramètres, y compris GLM-5, Claude et d''autres modèles configurés.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, eine umfassende Qualitätsvalidierung unter Verwendung von TLDR-unterstützter Analyse durchzuführen, die bis zu 9 Programmiersprachen mit einer flexiblen Modellauswahl über eine konfigurationsbasierte Einstellung unterstützt, einschließlich GLM-5, Claude und anderer konfigurierter Modelle.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar uma validação de qualidade abrangente usando análise assistida por TLDR, suportando até 9 linguagens de programação com seleção de modelo flexível via configuração baseada em configuração, incluindo GLM-5, Claude e outros modelos configurados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить комплексную проверку качества с помощью анализа, помеченного TLDR, поддерживая до 9 языков программирования с гибким выбором модели через настройку, основанную на конфигурации, включая GLM-5, Claude и другие настроенные модели.","ar":"تمكين العوامل من أداء التحقق الشامل من الجودة باستخدام التحليل المساعد من TLDR ، ودعم حتى 9 لغات برمجة مع اختيار نموذج مرن عبر الإعدادات التي تعتمد على التكوين ، بما في ذلك GLM-5 و Claude والنماذج المضمنة الأخرى."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating code quality across multiple programming languages","Performing model-agnostic analysis with configured default models","Integrating with various AI models such as GLM-4.7, Claude, and Codex","Utilizing 67 hooks for customized analysis and validation workflows"],"zh":["跨多个编程语言验证代码质量","使用配置默认模型执行模型无关分析","与 GLM-4.7、Claude 和 Codex 等各种 AI 模型集成","利用 67 个钩子实现自定义分析和验证工作流"],"ja":["複数のプログラミング言語を跨ぐコード品質の検証","設定されたデフォルトモデルを使用して、モデル無関分析を実行する","GLM-4.7、Claude などと言った、様々な AI モデルと集成する","67 個のフックを使用して、カスタム分析と検証のワークフローを実現する"],"ko":["여러 프로그래밍 언어를跨ぐ 코드 품질 검증","설정된 기본 모델을 사용하여 모델 무关 분석을 수행한다.","GLM-4.7, Claude, Codex 등 다양한 AI 모델과 통합","67개의 훩을 사용하여, 커스텀 분석 및 검증의 워크플로우를 구현"],"es":["Validar la calidad del código en varios lenguajes de programación","Realizar un análisis agnóstico de modelos con modelos predeterminados configurados","Integrarse con varios modelos de IA como GLM-4.7, Claude y Codex","Utilizar 67 ganchos para flujos de trabajo personalizados de análisis y validación"],"fr":["Valider la qualité du code sur divers langages de programmation","Réalisé une analyse agnostique de modèles avec des modèles par défaut configurés","Intégrer avec divers modèles d''IA tels que GLM-4.7, Claude et Codex","Utiliser 67 crochets pour des flux de travail d''analyse et de validation personnalisés"],"de":["Überprüfen der Codequalität in verschiedenen Programmiersprachen","Durchführen einer modellagnostischen Analyse mit konfigurierten Standardmodellen","Integration mit verschiedenen KI-Modellen wie GLM-4.7, Claude und Codex","Verwenden von 67 Haken für benutzerdefinierte Analyse- und Validierungsworkflows"],"pt":["Validar a qualidade do código em várias linguagens de programação","Realizar análise agnóstica de modelo com modelos padrão configurados","Integrar com vários modelos de IA, como GLM-4.7, Claude e Codex","Utilizar 67 ganchos para fluxos de trabalho personalizados de análise e validação"],"ru":["Проверять качество кода в нескольких языках программирования","Проводить анализ, независимый от модели, с настроенными моделями по умолчанию","Интегрироваться с различными моделями ИИ, такими как GLM-4.7, Claude и Codex","Использовать 67 крючков для настраиваемых рабочих процес