ipt"},"features":{"zh":["使用Next.js构建","集成Hono和Flutter","支持TypeScript","生产级别monorepo结构","实现身份验证"],"ja":["Next.jsで構築","HonoとFlutterの統合","TypeScriptのサポート","プロダクショングレードのmonorepo構造","認証の実装"],"ko":["Next.js로 구축","Hono와 Flutter 통합","TypeScript 지원","프로덕션급 monorepo 구조","인증 구현"],"es":["Monorepo para aplicaciones web","Autenticación integrada","Construido con Next.js, Hono, Flutter y TypeScript","Producción de grado para aplicaciones web","Estructura de repositorio escalable"],"fr":["Monorepo pour applications web","Authentification intégrée","Construit avec Next.js, Hono, Flutter et TypeScript","Production de grade pour applications web","Structure de référentiel évolutiva"],"de":["Monorepo für Webanwendungen","Integrierte Authentifizierung","Erstellt mit Next.js, Hono, Flutter und TypeScript","Produktionsgrade für Webanwendungen","Skalierbare Repository-Struktur"],"pt":["Monorepo de aplicativos web de produção","Autenticação integrada","Construído com Next.js, Hono, Flutter e TypeScript","Pronto para produção","Escalável e flexível"],"ru":["Производственное монорепо веб-приложения","Встроенная аутентификация","Построено с помощью Next.js, Hono, Flutter и TypeScript","Готово к производству","Масштабируемое и гибкое"],"ar":["تطبيق ويب مكون من مستودع واحد للتصنيع","مصادقة مدمجة","مبني على Next.js و Hono و Flutter و TypeScript","جاهز للتصنيع","مُكبر ومرن"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用innozverse-repo-structure","什么是monorepo结构","innozverse-repo-structure替代品","innozverse-repo-structure vs Next.js","innozverse-repo-structure安装","innozverse-repo-structure设置指南"],"ja":["innozverse-repo-structureの使い方","monorepo構造とは","innozverse-repo-structureの代替","innozverse-repo-structure vs Next.js","innozverse-repo-structureのインストール","innozverse-repo-structureの設定ガイド"],"ko":["innozverse-repo-structure 사용법","monorepo 구조란","innozverse-repo-structure 대체","innozverse-repo-structure vs Next.js","innozverse-repo-structure 설치","innozverse-repo-structure 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI para aplicaciones web","monorepo para aplicaciones web","autenticación en aplicaciones web","Next.js tutorial","Hono vs Next.js","Flutter instalación","TypeScript configuración"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour applications web","monorepo pour applications web","authentification dans les applications web","Didacticiel Next.js","Hono vs Next.js","Installation de Flutter","Configuration de TypeScript"],"de":["KI-Tools für Webanwendungen","Monorepo für Webanwendungen","Authentifizierung in Webanwendungen","Next.js-Tutorial","Hono vs Next.js","Flutter-Installation","TypeScript-Konfiguration"],"pt":["como usar innozverse-repo-structure","o que é monorepo","innozverse-repo-structure alternativa","innozverse-repo-structure vs Next.js","instalar innozverse-repo-structure","guia de configuração do innozverse-repo-structure","desenvolvimento web com innozverse-repo-structure","aplicativos web de produção"],"ru":["как использовать innozverse-repo-structure","что такое монорепо","альтернатива innozverse-repo-structure","innozverse-repo-structure vs Next.js","установить innozverse-repo-structure","руководство по настройке innozverse-repo-structure","веб-разработка с помощью innozverse-repo-structure","производственные веб-приложения"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام innozverse-repo-structure","ما هو المستودع الواحد","بديل innozverse-repo-structure","innozverse-repo-structure مقابل Next.js","تثبيت innozverse-repo-structure","دليل إعداد innozverse-repo-structure","التطوير الويب مع innozverse-repo-structure","تطبيقات ويب للتصنيع"]}},"owner":"lastcow","repo":"innozverse","repoPath":"lastcow/innozverse","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.902Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"innozverse-repo-structure","description":"Navigate and understand the innozverse repository structure, file organization, naming conventions, and module boundaries. Use when creating new files, organizing code, or understanding where to add features.","bodyPreview":"# innozverse Repository Structure Skill\n\nWhen navigating and modifying the innozverse repository, follow these structure conventions.\n\n## Top-Level Structure\n\n```\ninnozverse/\n├── apps/                 # Applications\n├── packages/             # Shared packages\n├── docs/                 # Documentation\n├── .claude/              # Claude AI skills\n├── .github/              # GitHub workflows\n├── package.json          # Root package.json\n├── pnpm-workspace.yaml   # pnpm workspace config\n├── turbo.js","body":"# innozverse Repository Structure Skill\n\nWhen navigating and modifying the innozverse repository, follow these structure conventions.\n\n## Top-Level Structure\n\n```\ninnozverse/\n├── apps/                 # Applications\n├── packages/             # Shared packages\n├── docs/                 # Documentation\n├── .claude/              # Claude AI skills\n├── .github/              # GitHub workflows\n├── package.json          # Root package.json\n├── pnpm-workspace.yaml   # pnpm workspace config\n├── turbo.json            # Turborepo config\n└── README.md             # Main README\n```\n\n## Apps Directory\n\n### apps/web (Next.js)\n```\napps/web/\n├── src/\n│   └── app/              # App Router pages\n│       ├── layout.tsx    # Root layout\n│       ├── page.tsx      # Home page\n│       └── globals.css   # Global styles\n├── public/               # Static assets\n├── next.config.js        # Next.js config\n├── tsconfig.json         # TypeScript config\n├── .eslintrc.json        # ESLint config\n├── .env.example          # Environment template\n└── package.json          # Package dependencies\n```\n\n**Key Points**:\n- Use App Router (not Pages Router)\n- Pages in `src/app/`\n- Static files in `public/`\n- Environment vars start with `NEXT_PUBLIC_`\n\n### apps/api (Fastify)\n```\napps/api/\n├── src/\n│   ├── index.ts          # Server entry point\n│   └── routes/\n│       ├── health.ts     # Health check route\n│       └── v1/           # Versioned API routes\n│           └── index.ts  # v1 routes\n├── Dockerfile            # Fly.io deployment\n├── fly.toml              # Fly.io config\n├── tsconfig.json         # TypeScript config\n├── .eslintrc.js          # ESLint config\n├── .env.example          # Environment template\n└── package.json          # Package dependencies\n```\n\n**Key Points**:\n- Routes organized by version (`v1/`, `v2/`)\n- Health check at root level\n- Dockerfile for Fly.io deployment\n- Environment vars in `.env` (never commit)\n\n### apps/mobile (Flutter)\n```\napps/mobile/\n├── lib/\n│   ├── main.dart         # App entry point\n│   └── services/\n│       └── api_service.dart  # API client\n├── android/              # Android-specific\n├── ios/                  # iOS-specific\n├── pubspec.yaml          # Dart dependencies\n├── README.md             # Mobile-specific docs\n└── analysis_options.yaml # Dart linter config\n```\n\n**Key Points**:\n- Main app in `lib/main.dart`\n- Services in `lib/services/`\n- Models in `lib/models/` (when added)\n- Widgets in `lib/widgets/` (when added)\n\n## Packages Directory\n\n### packages/shared\n```\npackages/shared/\n├── src/\n│   ├── index.ts          # Main export\n│   ├── types.ts          # Type definitions\n│   ├── schemas.ts        # Zod schemas\n│   └── constants.ts      # Shared constants\n├── dist/                 # Compiled output (gitignored)\n├── tsconfig.json\n├── .eslintrc.js\n└── package.json\n```\n\n**Purpose**: Domain types, Zod schemas, shared constants\n\n**Usage**:\n```typescript\nimport { HealthResponse, healthResponseSchema } from ''@innozverse/shared'';\n```\n\n### packages/api-client\n```\npackages/api-client/\n├── src/\n│   └── index.ts          # API client implementation\n├── dist/                 # Compiled output (gitignored)\n├── tsconfig.json\n├── .eslintrc.js\n└── package.json\n```\n\n**Purpose**: Typed HTTP client for web app\n\n**Usage**:\n```typescript\nimport { ApiClient } from ''@innozverse/api-client'';\nconst client = new ApiClient(''http://localhost:8080'');\n```\n\n### packages/config\n```\npackages/config/\n├── eslint-preset.js      # Shared ESLint config\n├── tsconfig.base.json    # Base TypeScript config\n└── package.json\n```\n\n**Purpose**: Shared tooling configuration\n\n**Usage**:\n```json\n// tsconfig.json\n{\n  \"extends\": \"@innozverse/config/tsconfig.base.json\"\n}\n```\n\n## Documentation\n\n```\ndocs/\n├── architecture.md       # System architecture\n├── conventions.md        # Coding conventions\n├── deployment-flyio.md   # Fly.io deployment\n└── contracts.md          # API contracts strategy\n```\n\n## File Naming Conventions\n\n### TypeScript\n- **Files**: `kebab-case.ts` (e.g., `api-client.ts`)\n- **React Components**: `PascalCase.tsx` (e.g., `Button.tsx`)\n- **Tests**: `*.test.ts` or `*.test.tsx`\n- **Types**: `types.ts` or `<module>.types.ts`\n\n### Dart\n- **Files**: `snake_case.dart` (e.g., `api_service.dart`)\n- **Tests**: `*_test.dart`\n\n### Configuration\n- **ESLint**: `.eslintrc.js` or `.eslintrc.json`\n- **TypeScript**: `tsconfig.json`\n- **Environment**: `.env.example` (committed), `.env` (gitignored)\n\n## Where to Add New Code\n\n### New API Endpoint\n```\napps/api/src/routes/v1/users.ts  # New endpoint file\n```\n\nUpdate `apps/api/src/routes/v1/index.ts` to register\n\n### New Shared Type\n```\npackages/shared/src/types.ts  # Add interface\npackages/shared/src/schemas.ts  # Add Zod schema\n```\n\nExport from `packages/shared/src/index.ts`\n\n### New Web Page\n```\napps/web/src/app/users/page.tsx  # New page at /users\n```\n\n### New Mobile Screen\n```\napps/mobile/lib/screens/users_screen.dart  # New screen\n```\n\n### New Shared Utility\n```\npackages/shared/src/utils/helper.ts  # New utility\n```\n\nExport from `packages/shared/src/index.ts`\n\n## Import Paths\n\n### Within innozverse Packages\n```typescript\n// ✅ Use package name\nimport { HealthResponse } from ''@innozverse/shared'';\n\n// ❌ Don''t use relative paths across packages\nimport { HealthResponse } from ''../../../packages/shared/src/types'';\n```\n\n### Within the Same Package\n```typescript\n// ✅ Use relative imports\nimport { helper } from ''./utils/helper'';\n\n// ❌ Don''t use absolute package imports for same package\nimport { helper } from ''@innozverse/shared/utils/helper'';\n```\n\n### Next.js @ Alias\n```typescript\n// In apps/web only\nimport { Component } from ''@/app/components/Component'';\n```\n\n## Build Artifacts\n\n### What''s Gitignored\n```\nnode_modules/\ndist/\n.next/\n.turbo/\nbuild/\n.env\n.env.local\n*.log\n```\n\n### What''s Committed\n```\nsrc/\npublic/\npackage.json\ntsconfig.json\n.env.example\nREADME.md\n```\n\n## Scripts Organization\n\n### Root package.json\n- `dev`: Run web + API\n- `build`: Build all packages and apps\n- `lint`: Lint everything\n- `test`: Run all tests\n\n### Individual Packages\n- `dev`: Start dev server\n- `build`: Build package\n- `lint`: Lint package\n- `typecheck`: Type check\n\n## Adding New Packages\n\n1. **Create directory**: `mkdir packages/new-package`\n2. **Initialize**: `cd packages/new-package && pnpm init`\n3. **Name**: Use `@innozverse/` prefix\n4. **Add to workspace**: Already covered by `packages/*` in `pnpm-workspace.yaml`\n5. **Build config**: Copy `tsconfig.json` from similar package\n6. **Add scripts**: `build`, `lint`, `typecheck`\n\n## Directory Depth Guidelines\n\n### Maximum Nesting\n- **Apps**: 3-4 levels deep\n  ```\n  apps/web/src/app/users/[id]/page.tsx  ✅\n  ```\n\n- **Packages**: 2-3 levels deep\n  ```\n  packages/shared/src/utils/validation.ts  ✅\n  ```\n\n### When to Create Subdirectories\n- **3+ related files**: Create a subdirectory\n- **Single file**: Keep at current level\n- **Shared concern**: Extract to `utils/` or `lib/`\n\n## Module Boundaries\n\n### Apps Cannot Import from Other Apps\n```typescript\n// ❌ Never do this\nimport { something } from ''../../api/src/utils'';\n```\n\n### Apps Can Import from Packages\n```typescript\n// ✅ This is fine\nimport { HealthResponse } from ''@innozverse/shared'';\n```\n\n### Packages Can Import from Other Packages\n```typescript\n// ✅ This is fine (with workspace dependency)\nimport { schema } from ''@innozverse/shared'';\n```\n\n## Special Directories\n\n### .claude/skills/\nAI agent instructions for project-specific patterns\n\n### .github/workflows/\nGitHub Actions CI/CD pipelines\n\n### public/ (in apps/web)\nStatic assets served at root URL\n\n### dist/ (in packages)\nCompiled TypeScript output (gitignored, created on build)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:15:14.061Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Next.js and TypeScript Agents needing structured monorepo management for web applications","zh":"非常适合需要结构化的单体仓库管理的Next.js和TypeScript代理，用于Web应用程序","ja":"Next.jsとTypeScriptエージェントが構造化されたモノレポ管理を必要とするWebアプリケーションに最適","ko":"Next.js와 TypeScript 에이전트가 구조화된 모노레포 관리를 필요로 하는 웹 애플리케이션에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes Next.js y TypeScript que necesitan una gestión de monorepo estructurada para aplicaciones web","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Next.js et TypeScript ayant besoin d''une gestion de monorepo structurée pour les applications web","de":"Perfekt für Next.js- und TypeScript-Agents, die eine strukturierte Monorepo-Verwaltung für Webanwendungen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Next.js e TypeScript que necessitam de gestão de monorepo estruturada para aplicações web","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Next.js и TypeScript, которым требуется структурированное управление монорепозиторием для веб-приложений","ar":"مثالي لعميل Next.js و TypeScript الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة مونوربو متكاملة للتطبيقات الويب"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to navigate and modify production-grade monorepo structures with authentication, leveraging Next.js, Hono, Flutter, and TypeScript, while utilizing pnpm workspace config and GitHub workflows","zh":"赋予代理导航和修改生产级别的单体仓库结构的能力，利用Next.js、Hono、Flutter和TypeScript，同时使用pnpm workspace配置和GitHub工作流","ja":"Next.js、Hono、Flutter、TypeScriptを利用し、pnpm workspace設定とGitHubワークフローを使用して、エージェントが生産レベルのモノレポ構造をナビゲートして変更できるようにする","ko":"Next.js, Hono, Flutter, TypeScript를 활용하여 에이전트가 생산급 모노레포 구조를 탐색하고 수정할 수 있도록 하며, pnpm workspace 설정과 GitHub 워크플로를 사용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a navegar y modificar estructuras de monorepo de grado de producción con autenticación, aprovechando Next.js, Hono, Flutter y TypeScript, mientras utiliza la configuración de espacio de trabajo de pnpm y flujos de trabajo de GitHub","fr":"Permet aux agents de naviguer et de modifier des structures de monorepo de production avec authentification, en exploitant Next.js, Hono, Flutter et TypeScript, tout en utilisant la configuration de l''espace de travail pnpm et les workflows GitHub","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Produktionsgrade-Monorepo-Strukturen mit Authentifizierung zu navigieren und zu modifizieren, indem Next.js, Hono, Flutter und TypeScript genutzt und die pnpm-Arbeitsbereichskonfiguration sowie GitHub-Workflows verwendet werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a navegar e modificar estruturas de monorepo de produção com autenticação, aproveitando Next.js, Hono, Flutter e TypeScript, ao mesmo tempo em que utiliza configuração de workspace pnpm e fluxos de trabalho do GitHub","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью навигации и изменения промышленных монорепозиториев с аутентификацией, используя Next.js, Hono, Flutter и TypeScript, а также используя конфигурацию workspace pnpm и рабочие процессы GitHub","ar":"يُمكّن الوكيل من التنقل وتعديل هياكل مونوربو للإنتاج مع المصادقة، مستفيداً من Next.js و Hono و Flutter و TypeScript، وفي الوقت نفسه يستخدم تكوين مساحة عمل pnpm و سير عمل GitHub"},"useCases":{"en":["Organizing large-scale web applications into modular repositories","Implementing authentication and authorization in monorepo structures","Managing dependencies and packages with pnpm workspace config"],"zh":["将大规模的Web应用程序组织成模块化的仓库","在单体仓库结构中实现身份验证和授权","使用pnpm workspace配置管理依赖项和包"],"ja":["大規模なWebアプリケーションをモジュール化されたリポジトリに組織する","モノレポ構造で認証と認可を実装する","pnpm workspace設定を使用して依存関係とパッケージを管理する"],"ko":["대규모 웹 애플리케이션을 모듈화된 저장소로 구성","모노레포 구조에서 인증 및 인가 구현","pnpm workspace 설정을 사용하여 의존성 및 패키지 관리"],"es":["Organizar aplicaciones web a gran escala en repositorios modulares","Implementar autenticación y autorización en estructuras de monorepo","Gestionar dependencias y paquetes con la configuración de espacio de trabajo de pnpm"],"fr":["Organiser des applications web à grande échelle en référentiels modulaires","Mettre en œuvre l''authentification et l''autorisation dans des structures de monorepo","Gérer les dépendances et les packages avec la configuration de l''espace de travail pnpm"],"de":["Große Webanwendungen in modulare Repositories organisieren","Authentifizierung und Autorisierung in Monorepo-Strukturen implementieren","Abhängigkeiten und Pakete mit der pnpm-Arbeitsbereichskonfiguration verwalten"],"pt":["Organizar aplicações web em grande escala em repositórios modulares","Implementar autenticação e autorização em estruturas de monorepo","Gerenciar dependências e pacotes com configuração de workspace pnpm"],"ru":["Организация крупномасштабных веб-приложений в модульные репозитории","Реализация аутентификации и авторизации в монорепозиториях","Управление зависимостями и пакетами с помощью конфигурации workspace pnpm"],"ar":["تنظيم التطبيقات الويب على نطاق واسع في مستودعات متصلة","تنفيذ المصادقة والتحقق في هياكل مونوربو","إدارة التبعيات والحزم باستخدام تكوين مساحة عمل pnpm"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pnpm and GitHub workflow setup","Specific to Next.js, Hono, Flutter, and TypeScript ecosystems"],"zh":["需要pnpm和GitHub工作流设置","特定于Next.js、Hono、Flutter和TypeScript生态系统"],"ja":["pnpmとGitHubワークフローの設定が必要","Next.js、Hono、Flutter、TypeScriptのエコシステムに特有"],"ko":["pnpm과 GitHub 워크플로 설정이 필요","Next.js, Hono, Flutter, TypeScript 생태계에 특정"],"es":["Requiere la configuración de pnpm y GitHub workflow","Específico para los ecosistemas Next.js, Hono, Flutter y TypeScript"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration de pnpm et GitHub workflow","Spécifique aux écosystèmes Next.js, Hono, Flutter et TypeScript"],"de":["Benötigt die Konfiguration von pnpm und GitHub-Workflow","Spezifisch für die Next.js-, Hono-, Flutter- und TypeScript-Ökosysteme"],"pt":["Requer configuração de pnpm e fluxo de trabalho do GitHub","Específico para os ecossistemas Next.js, Hono, Flutter e TypeScript"],"ru":["Требуется настройка pnpm и рабочий процесс GitHub","Конкретно для экосистем Next.js, Hono, Flutter и TypeScript"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد pnpm و سير عمل GitHub","محدد لنظام Next.js و Hono و Flutter و TypeScript"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"31d36154099e3788d5bb713853f2a6297919af9b2bbd74d0e33a71a85ac168ff","qualityScore":60}');
