cution vs HEC-RAS","instalar hecras_plan_execution","guia de configuração do hecras_plan_execution","automação do HEC-RAS 6.x","acesso a dados HDF com Python"],"ru":["как использовать hecras_plan_execution","что такое hecras_plan_execution","альтернатива hecras_plan_execution","hecras_plan_execution vs HEC-RAS","установка hecras_plan_execution","руководство по настройке hecras_plan_execution","автоматизация HEC-RAS 6.x","доступ к данным HDF на Python"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام hecras_plan_execution","ما هو hecras_plan_execution","بديل hecras_plan_execution","hecras_plan_execution مقابل HEC-RAS","تثبيت hecras_plan_execution","دليل إعداد hecras_plan_execution","تحكم آلي في HEC-RAS 6.x","وصول إلى بيانات HDF مع Python"]}},"owner":"gpt-cmdr","repo":"ras-commander","repoPath":"gpt-cmdr/ras-commander","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.909Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"hecras_plan_execution","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Planning HEC-RAS Execution\n\nDecision support for selecting optimal HEC-RAS execution strategy. Analyzes Project Inspector output and generates actionable execution plans.\n\n## Primary Sources\n\n**DO NOT duplicate content from primary sources. This skill is a lightweight navigator.**\n\n- **`.claude/rules/hec-ras/execution.md`** - Complete execution mode documentation\n- **`.claude/agents/hecras-project-inspector.md`** - Project Intelligence Report schema\n- **`.claude/skills/hecras_compute_plans/SKI","body":"# Planning HEC-RAS Execution\n\nDecision support for selecting optimal HEC-RAS execution strategy. Analyzes Project Inspector output and generates actionable execution plans.\n\n## Primary Sources\n\n**DO NOT duplicate content from primary sources. This skill is a lightweight navigator.**\n\n- **`.claude/rules/hec-ras/execution.md`** - Complete execution mode documentation\n- **`.claude/agents/hecras-project-inspector.md`** - Project Intelligence Report schema\n- **`.claude/skills/hecras_compute_plans/SKILL.md`** - Mode Selection Guide\n- **`.claude/skills/hecras_compute_rascontrol/SKILL.md`** - Legacy HEC-RAS (< 6.0)\n\n---\n\n## Mode Selection Decision Tree\n\n```\n1. Is HEC-RAS version < 6.0?\n   YES -> Use RasControl (hecras_compute_rascontrol skill)\n   NO  -> Continue\n\n2. How many runnable plans?\n   ZERO    -> Report blockers, stop\n   ONE     -> compute_plan() [+ stream_callback if monitoring needed]\n   MULTIPLE -> Continue to step 3\n\n3. Multiple Plan Decision:\n   Debugging/diagnosing? -> compute_test_mode()\n   Have remote workers?  -> compute_parallel_remote()\n   Production/batch?     -> compute_parallel()\n```\n\n### Mode Selection Matrix\n\n| Context | Plans | Mode | Rationale |\n|---------|-------|------|-----------|\n| Debugging | Any | `compute_test_mode()` | Sequential, single folder |\n| Single plan, monitoring | 1 | `compute_plan()` + callback | Real-time output |\n| Single plan, quick | 1 | `compute_plan()` | Simplest API |\n| Multiple plans, production | 2+ | `compute_parallel()` | Fastest throughput |\n| Distributed infrastructure | 2+ | `compute_parallel_remote()` | Scale-out |\n| HEC-RAS < 6.0 | Any | `RasControl` | COM-based required |\n| Resume interrupted | 2+ | `compute_parallel(skip_existing=True)` | Skips completed |\n\n---\n\n## Input: Project Intelligence Report\n\nExpected input from Project Inspector Agent:\n\n```markdown\n## Plans Analysis\n| Plan | Title | Status | Geometry | Flow | Issues |\n|------|-------|--------|----------|------|--------|\n| 01 | Baseline | Runnable | g01 | u01 | None |\n| 02 | Future | Missing geom | g03 (MISSING) | u02 | Geometry file not found |\n\n### Execution Readiness\n- **Ready to Run**: 01, 03\n- **Blocked**: 02 (missing geometry g03)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Output: Execution Plan\n\nGenerate structured execution plans in this format:\n\n```markdown\n# Execution Plan\n\n## Recommended Mode\n`compute_parallel()` - Multiple runnable plans, production context\n\n## Execution Order\n1. Plan 01 (Baseline) - Ready\n2. Plan 03 (Modified) - Ready\n   [Skip: Plan 02 - blocked by missing geometry g03]\n\n## Parameters\n```python\nRasCmdr.compute_parallel(\n    plans_to_run=[\"01\", \"03\"],\n    max_workers=2,\n    num_cores=4,\n    force_rerun=False,\n    verify=True\n)\n```\n\n## Prerequisites\n- None for runnable plans\n\n## Blockers (Cannot Run)\n| Plan | Issue | Resolution |\n|------|-------|------------|\n| 02 | Missing geometry g03 | Create geometry file or fix reference |\n\n## Warnings\n- Plan 02 blocked until g03 is created\n```\n\n---\n\n## Parameter Recommendation\n\n### Worker/Core Allocation\n\n| System Cores | Model Type | `max_workers` | `num_cores` |\n|--------------|------------|---------------|-------------|\n| 4-8 | 1D | 2-4 | 2 |\n| 8-16 | 2D | 2-4 | 4 |\n| 16+ | Mixed | 4-6 | 4 |\n\n**Formula**: `max_workers = min(num_plans, total_cores // num_cores)`\n\n### Geometry Flags\n\n| Scenario | `clear_geompre` | `force_geompre` |\n|----------|-----------------|-----------------|\n| Geometry unchanged | `False` | `False` |\n| Minor edits (Manning''s n) | `True` | `False` |\n| Major changes (new mesh) | `False` | `True` |\n| Geometry corruption | `False` | `True` |\n\n### Skip/Rerun Flags\n\n| Scenario | `force_rerun` | `skip_existing` |\n|----------|---------------|-----------------|\n| Normal (smart skip) | `False` | `False` |\n| Force fresh results | `True` | `False` |\n| Resume interrupted | `False` | `True` |\n\n---\n\n## Dependency Analysis\n\n### Check for Blockers\n\n```python\ndef get_runnable_plans(plan_df):\n    \"\"\"Identify which plans can execute.\"\"\"\n    runnable, blocked = [], {}\n\n    for _, plan in plan_df.iterrows():\n        plan_num = plan[''plan_number'']\n        geom_ok = Path(plan[''Geom Path'']).exists() if plan.get(''Geom Path'') else True\n        flow_ok = Path(plan[''Flow Path'']).exists() if plan.get(''Flow Path'') else True\n\n        if geom_ok and flow_ok:\n            runnable.append(plan_num)\n        else:\n            blocked[plan_num] = \"Missing geometry\" if not geom_ok else \"Missing flow\"\n\n    return runnable, blocked\n```\n\n### Dependencies to Consider\n\n1. **Shared Geometry** - Plans using same geometry can run in parallel\n2. **Upstream/Downstream** - Cascade models need sequential execution\n3. **DSS Dependencies** - Plans reading same DSS may conflict\n\n---\n\n## Context-Specific Templates\n\n### Debugging Context\n\n```python\nRasCmdr.compute_test_mode(\n    plans_to_run=[\"01\", \"02\", \"03\"],\n    dest_folder_suffix=\"[Debug]\",\n    num_cores=2,\n    verify=True\n)\n```\n\n### Production Context\n\n```python\nRasCmdr.compute_parallel(\n    plans_to_run=[\"01\", \"02\", \"03\"],\n    max_workers=4,\n    num_cores=4,\n    verify=True\n)\n```\n\n### Monitoring Context\n\n```python\nfrom ras_commander.callbacks import ConsoleCallback\n\nRasCmdr.compute_plan(\n    \"01\",\n    stream_callback=ConsoleCallback(verbose=True),\n    verify=True\n)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Blockers\n\n| Blocker | Resolution |\n|---------|------------|\n| Missing geometry file | Create geometry or fix .prj reference |\n| Missing flow file | Create flow file or fix reference |\n| Missing DSS file | Download/create DSS or update path |\n| Geometry HDF outdated | Run with `force_geompre=True` |\n| Results already current | Use `force_rerun=True` if needed |\n| HEC-RAS < 6.0 | Use RasControl skill instead |\n\n---\n\n## Integration\n\n### Upstream Skills\n- **hecras-project-inspector** - Generates intelligence report\n- **dss_read_boundary-data** - Validates boundary conditions\n- **qa_repair_geometry** - Fixes geometry blockers\n\n### Downstream Skills\n- **hecras_compute_plans** - Runs the execution plan\n- **hecras_compute_remote** - Distributed execution\n- **hecras_extract_results** - Post-execution analysis\n- **hecras_parse_compute-messages** - Interpret execution results\n\n---\n\n## See Also\n\n- **`.claude/rules/hec-ras/execution.md`** - Complete parameter documentation\n- **`.claude/agents/hecras-project-inspector.md`** - Input format details\n- **`examples/113_parallel_execution.ipynb`** - Working parallel example\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:20:19.882Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Hydrological Analysis Agents needing advanced HEC-RAS execution planning and HDF data access","zh":"非常适合需要高级 HEC-RAS 执行规划和 HDF 数据访问的水文分析代理","ja":"水文分析エージェントが高度な HEC-RAS 実行計画と HDF データアクセスを必要とする場合に最適","ko":"고급 HEC-RAS 실행 계획 및 HDF 데이터 액세스가 필요한 수문 분석 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis Hidrológico que necesitan una planificación avanzada de ejecución de HEC-RAS y acceso a datos HDF","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse Hydrologique ayant besoin d''une planification avancée d''exécution de HEC-RAS et d''un accès aux données HDF","de":"Perfekt für Hydrologische Analyseagenten, die eine erweiterte HEC-RAS-Ausführungsplanung und HDF-Datenzugriff benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Hidrológica que precisam de planejamento de execução avançado do HEC-RAS e acesso a dados HDF","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов гидрологического анализа, которым требуется продвинутый планирование выполнения HEC-RAS и доступ к данным HDF","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل الهيدرولوجي الذي يحتاج إلى تخطيط تنفيذ متقدم لبرنامج HEC-RAS ووصول إلى بيانات HDF"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze Project Inspector output and generate actionable execution plans using the RAS-Commander library and Python API, enabling optimized decision support for HEC-RAS 6.x execution strategies and leveraging large language models for automation","zh":"赋予代理分析 Project Inspector 输出并使用 RAS-Commander 库和 Python API 生成可执行的执行计划，实现针对 HEC-RAS 6.x 执行策略的优化决策支持，并利用大型语言模型实现自动化","ja":"エージェントが Project Inspector の出力を分析し、RAS-Commander ライブラリと Python API を使用して実行可能な実行計画を生成することで、HEC-RAS 6.x の実行戦略の最適化された意思決定サポートを可能にし、大規模な言語モデルを使用して自動化を実現する","ko":"에이전트가 프로젝트 인스펙터 출력을 분석하고 RAS-Commander 라이브러리 및 Python API를 사용하여 실행 가능한 실행 계획을 생성하여 HEC-RAS 6.x 실행 전략에 대한 최적화된 의사 결정 지원을 가능하게 하며, 대형 언어 모델을 사용하여 자동화를 구현하는 것을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar la salida del Project Inspector y generar planes de ejecución accionables utilizando la biblioteca RAS-Commander y la API de Python, lo que permite una toma de decisiones optimizada para estrategias de ejecución de HEC-RAS 6.x y aprovecha los grandes modelos de lenguaje para la automatización","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser la sortie de Project Inspector et de générer des plans d''exécution actionnables en utilisant la bibliothèque RAS-Commander et l''API Python, ce qui permet un soutien décisionnel optimisé pour les stratégies d''exécution de HEC-RAS 6.x et exploitant les grands modèles de langage pour l''automatisation","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Ausgabe von Project Inspector zu analysieren und handhabbare Ausführungspläne unter Verwendung der RAS-Commander-Bibliothek und der Python-API zu generieren, was eine optimierte Entscheidungsunterstützung für HEC-RAS 6.x-Ausführungsstrategien ermöglicht und große Sprachmodelle für die Automatisierung nutzt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar a saída do Project Inspector e gerar planos de execução eficazes usando a biblioteca RAS-Commander e a API Python, permitindo suporte de decisão otimizado para estratégias de execução do HEC-RAS 6.x e aproveitando grandes modelos de linguagem para automação","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать вывод Project Inspector и генерировать эффективные планы выполнения с помощью библиотеки RAS-Commander и API Python, обеспечивая оптимизированную поддержку принятия решений для стратегий выполнения HEC-RAS 6.x и использует большие языковые модели для автоматизации","ar":"تمكين العميل من تحليل مخرجات Project Inspector وتوليد خطط تنفيذ قابلة للتنفيذ باستخدام مكتبة RAS-Commander وواجهة برمجة التطبيقات Python، مما يتيح دعمًا ذا صلة لاستراتيجيات تنفيذ HEC-RAS 6.x والاستفادة من نماذج اللغة الكبيرة للتحكم الآلي"},"useCases":{"en":["Planning HEC-RAS execution strategies based on Project Inspector output","Generating actionable execution plans for hydrological modeling","Automating HEC-RAS 6.x workflows using Python and the RAS-Commander library"],"zh":["根据 Project Inspector 输出规划 HEC-RAS 执行策略","为水文建模生成可执行的执行计划","使用 Python 和 RAS-Commander 库自动化 HEC-RAS 6.x 工作流"],"ja":["Project Inspector の出力に基づく HEC-RAS 実行戦略の計画","水文モデリングのための実行可能な実行計画の生成","Python と RAS-Commander ライブラリを使用した HEC-RAS 6.x ワークフローの自動化"],"ko":["프로젝트 인스펙터 출력을 기반으로 HEC-RAS 실행 전략을 계획","수문 모델링을 위한 실행 가능한 실행 계획을 생성","Python 및 RAS-Commander 라이브러리를 사용하여 HEC-RAS 6.x 워크플로 자동화"],"es":["Planificación de estrategias de ejecución de HEC-RAS basadas en la salida de Project Inspector","Generación de planes de ejecución accionables para modelado hidrológico","Automatización de flujos de trabajo de HEC-RAS 6.x utilizando Python y la biblioteca RAS-Commander"],"fr":["Planification de stratégies d''exécution de HEC-RAS basées sur la sortie de Project Inspector","Génération de plans d''exécution actionnables pour la modélisation hydrologique","Automatisation des flux de travail de HEC-RAS 6.x en utilisant Python et la bibliothèque RAS-Commander"],"de":["Planung von HEC-RAS-Ausführungsstrategien basierend auf der Ausgabe von Project Inspector","Erzeugung von handhabbaren Ausführungsplänen für hydrologisches Modellieren","Automatisierung von HEC-RAS 6.x-Workflows mithilfe von Python und der RAS-Commander-Bibliothek"],"pt":["Planejamento de estratégias de execução do HEC-RAS com base na saída do Project Inspector","Geração de planos de execução eficazes para modelagem hidrológica","Automação de fluxos de trabalho do HEC-RAS 6.x usando Python e a biblioteca RAS-Commander"],"ru":["Планирование стратегий выполнения HEC-RAS на основе вывода Project Inspector","Генерация эффективных планов выполнения для гидрологического моделирования","Автоматизация рабочих процессов HEC-RAS 6.x с помощью Python и библиотеки RAS-Commander"],"ar":["تخطيط استراتيجيات تنفيذ برنامج HEC-RAS على أساس مخرجات Project Inspector","توليد خطط تنفيذ قابلة للتنف