alidation de la Conformité ADR","de":"KI-Tools: Überprüfung der ADR-Konformität","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Validação de Conformidade ADR","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Проверка соответствия ADR","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: التحقق من مطابقة السجلات القرارية...","en":"validating-adr-compliance"},"description":{"zh":"验证PR代码与架构决策记录（ADRs）的合规性，使用Oracle进行深入分析","ja":"PRコードをアーキテクチャ・デシジョン・レコード（ADRs）と比較してコンプライアンスを検証。Oracleを使用して詳細な分析を実行","ko":"PR 코드를 아키텍처 결정 레코드(ADRs)와 비교하여 규정 준수성을 검증하고 Oracle을 사용하여 자세한 분석을 수행","es":"Valida el código PR contra los registros de decisiones de arquitectura (ADRs) utilizando oráculos para un análisis profundo de la implementación","fr":"Validez le code PR contre les enregistrements de décisions d''architecture (ADRs) en utilisant des oracles pour une analyse approfondie de la mise en œuvre","de":"Überprüfen Sie den PR-Code gegen die Architektur-Entscheidungs-Records (ADRs) unter Verwendung von Orakeln für eine tiefe Analyse der Implementierung","pt":"A Validação de Conformidade ADR é uma habilidade de agente de IA que verifica o código PR contra os Registros de Decisões de Arquitetura","ru":"Проверка соответствия ADR - это навык ИИ Агента, который проверяет код PR на соответствие Архитектурным Решениям","ar":"التحقق من مطابقة السجلات القرارية للهندسة المعمارية هو مهارة لبرنامج ذكاء اصطناعي يمكنه التحقق من صحة رمز PR مقابل السجلات القرارية للهندسة المعمارية","en":"Validates PR code against Architecture Decision Records (ADRs). Uses oracle for deep analysis of implementation compliance."},"definition":{"en":"Validates PR code against Architecture Decision Records (ADRs). Uses oracle for deep analysis of implementation compliance."},"features":{"zh":["验证PR代码与ADRs的合规性","使用Oracle进行深入分析","支持多种编程语言","提高代码质量和可维护性","简化代码审查流程"],"ja":["PRコードとADRsのコンプライアンスを検証","Oracleを使用した詳細な分析","複数のプログラミング言語をサポート","コード品質とメンテナンス性の向上","コードレビューの簡素化"],"ko":["PR 코드와 ADRs의 규정 준수 검증","Oracle을 사용한 자세한 분석","다중 프로그래밍 언어 지원","코드 품질과 유지 보수성 향상","코드 리뷰 프로세스 간소화"],"es":["Análisis profundo de la implementación","Validación de cumplimiento de ADR","Uso de oráculos para la verificación","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Informes detallados de la conformidad"],"fr":["Analyse approfondie de la mise en œuvre","Validation de la conformité ADR","Utilisation d''oracles pour la vérification","Intégration avec les outils de développement","Rapports détaillés de la conformité"],"de":["Tiefe Analyse der Implementierung","Überprüfung der ADR-Konformität","Verwendung von Orakeln für die Überprüfung","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Detaillierte Berichte über die Konformität"],"pt":["Validação de código PR contra Registros de Decisões de Arquitetura","Análise profunda de implementação com oráculo","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Relatórios detalhados de conformidade","Suporte a múltiplas linguagens de programação"],"ru":["Проверка кода PR на соответствие Архитектурным Решениям","Глубокий анализ реализации с помощью оракула","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Подробные отчеты о соответствии","Поддержка нескольких языков программирования"],"ar":["التحقق من صحة رمز PR مقابل السجلات القرارية للهندسة المعمارية","التحليل العميق للتنفيذ باستخدام البرنامج المساعد","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","تقارير مفصلة عن المطابقة","دعم لعدة لغات برمجة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ADR合规性","AI智能代理","代码审查","架构决策记录","如何使用ADR","ADR合规性验证工具","代码质量提高","代码可维护性","代码审查流程简化"],"ja":["ADRコンプライアンス","AIエージェント","コードレビュー","アーキテクチャ・デシジョン・レコード","ADRの使い方","ADRコンプライアンス検証ツール","コード品質の向上","コードメンテナンス性","コードレビューの簡素化"],"ko":["ADR 규정 준수","AI 에이전트","코드 리뷰","아키텍처 결정 레코드","ADR 사용 방법","ADR 규정 준수 검증 도구","코드 품질 향상","코드 유지 보수성","코드 리뷰 프로세스 간소화"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrollo","validación de cumplimiento de ADR","registros de decisiones de arquitectura","cómo usar herramientas de AI","alternativas a herramientas de AI","instalación de herramientas de AI","guía de configuración de herramientas de AI"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour le développement","validation de la conformité ADR","enregistrements de décisions d''architecture","comment utiliser les outils d''IA","alternatives aux outils d''IA","installation des outils d''IA","guide de configuration des outils d''IA"],"de":["KI-Tools für die Entwicklung","Überprüfung der ADR-Konformität","Architektur-Entscheidungs-Records","wie man KI-Tools verwendet","Alternativen zu KI-Tools","Installation von KI-Tools","Konfigurationshandbuch für KI-Tools"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","validação de conformidade adr","registrar decisões de arquitetura","como usar ferramentas de ia","o que é validação de conformidade adr","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","alternativas para validação de conformidade adr"],"ru":["ии агенты","проверка соответствия adr","архитектурные решения","как использовать ии агенты","что такое проверка соответствия adr","ии агенты для разработчиков","альтернативы для проверки соответствия adr"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التحقق من مطابقة السجلات القرارية للهندسة المعمارية","السجلات القرارية للهندسة المعمارية","كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو التحقق من مطابقة السجلات القرارية للهندسة المعمارية","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","بديلات للتحقق من مطابقة السجلات القرارية للهندسة المعمارية"]}},"owner":"axiomhq","repo":"validating-adr-compliance","repoPath":"axiomhq/validating-adr-compliance","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.924Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"validating-adr-compliance","description":"Validates PR code against Architecture Decision Records (ADRs). Uses oracle for deep analysis of implementation compliance. Use when asked to validate a PR against an ADR, check ADR compliance, or review implementation adherence to architectural decisions.","bodyPreview":"# Validating ADR Compliance\n\nValidates that PR code and related implementations adhere to Architecture Decision Records.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Validating a PR implements an ADR correctly\n- Checking if code changes align with documented architectural decisions\n- Reviewing implementation details against ADR specifications\n- Identifying deviations from accepted architecture\n\n## Preconditions & Assumptions\n\nBefore starting, confirm these assumptions hold:\n\n- **ADR location**: ADRs are stored under `doc","body":"# Validating ADR Compliance\n\nValidates that PR code and related implementations adhere to Architecture Decision Records.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Validating a PR implements an ADR correctly\n- Checking if code changes align with documented architectural decisions\n- Reviewing implementation details against ADR specifications\n- Identifying deviations from accepted architecture\n\n## Preconditions & Assumptions\n\nBefore starting, confirm these assumptions hold:\n\n- **ADR location**: ADRs are stored under `doc/adr/` by default. Adjust if the repo uses a different path.\n- **Base branch**: The default comparison branch is `main` (or `origin/main`). Adjust for repos using `master` or another base.\n- **PR context**: This skill is optimized for validating a specific PR/branch vs its base.\n\nIf assumptions don''t hold, the user must provide:\n- The ADR ID or file path\n- The set of implementation files or modules to review\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Identify the ADR\n\n**Default behavior**: Automatically detect ADRs added/modified in the current PR.\n\nRun this command to find ADRs changed in the current branch:\n```bash\ngit diff --name-only origin/main...HEAD -- doc/adr/\n```\n\nIf no ADRs found in the diff, try with `main`:\n```bash\ngit diff --name-only main...HEAD -- doc/adr/\n```\n\nUse the repository''s default branch as the base for diffs (commonly `main` or `master`). Adjust the git commands accordingly.\n\n#### Handling Multiple ADRs\n\nIf multiple ADRs are added/modified in the PR, treat each ADR separately:\n\n- Build a separate requirements checklist per ADR\n- Map implementation files to each ADR where possible\n- Produce one compliance report per ADR\n\n#### Check ADR Status\n\nWhen reading the ADR, note its **Status**:\n\n- **Accepted**: Enforce compliance—this is the primary case\n- **Superseded**: Identify the superseding ADR and validate against that instead\n- **Proposed/Draft**: Treat findings as advisory—decision is not final\n- **Deprecated**: Do not enforce; explain this ADR should not be validated\n\nIf the ADR has a `Supersedes` or `Superseded by` field, always prefer the latest ADR in the chain for compliance checks.\n\n#### Fallback Options\n\nIf no ADR in PR diff:\n\n1. User provides the ADR number (e.g., \"ADR-0052\")\n2. User references a specific ADR file\n3. Search `doc/adr/` for relevant ADRs based on PR topic keywords\n\nIf multiple candidate ADRs appear relevant based on keywords or status, present the top candidates and ask the user to confirm which ADR(s) to validate against.\n\n#### No ADR Found\n\nIf no relevant ADR is found:\n\n- Report explicitly: \"No applicable ADR identified for this PR based on doc/adr/ and provided inputs.\"\n- Ask the user to provide a specific ADR ID or confirm that no ADR validation is required\n- Do NOT fabricate compliance concerns\n\nOnce identified, read the full ADR:\n```\nRead doc/adr/XXXX-<name>.md\n```\n\n### Step 2: Extract ADR Requirements\n\nParse the ADR and extract a structured requirements table:\n\n| ID | Type | Description | Source (ADR quote/section) | Verifiability |\n|----|------|-------------|---------------------------|---------------|\n| ADR-XXXX-R1 | API | Endpoint must exist at /path | \"Decision – We add...\" | Strict |\n| ADR-XXXX-R2 | Security | Header X-Org-Id required | \"API: All requests MUST...\" | Strict |\n| ADR-XXXX-R3 | Performance | Call must be rate limited | \"Consequences – expensive...\" | Heuristic |\n\n**Requirement types**: Functional / API / Data / Performance / Security / Observability / Operational / Other\n\n**Verifiability levels**:\n- **Strict**: Exactly testable in code\n- **Heuristic**: Approximate, requires judgment\n- **Non-verifiable**: Documentation/assumption only—cannot assert from code\n\nFor vague high-level statements (e.g., \"should scale well\"), still record them but mark as `Heuristic` or `Non-verifiable`. Treat these separately from strict requirements in the report.\n\n### Step 3: Identify Implementation Files\n\nFind all code related to the ADR implementation, starting narrow and expanding as needed:\n\n#### Start from PR Diff\n\n1. List all files changed in the PR\n2. Filter to files likely related to the ADR by:\n   - Matching ADR title keywords, endpoint paths, or key terms\n   - File location (service/module that owns the feature)\n\n#### Expand if Necessary\n\nOnly if needed, broaden search beyond PR files:\n\n- Use `finder` to locate implementations based on ADR keywords\n- Use `Grep` for specific API endpoints, struct names, or patterns\n- Include supporting modules that PR files depend on if behavior is non-local\n\n#### Check All Artifact Types\n\nCheck for all implementation artifacts, not just application code:\n\n- API/router handlers\n- Domain/service logic\n- Configuration and feature flags\n- Infrastructure-as-code or deployment configs\n- Documentation and API specs (if ADR requires them)\n- Test files (unit, integration, e2e)\n\n#### Monorepo Hint\n\nIn monorepos, narrow search to the service or package that owns the ADR''s domain before broadening to the whole repo.\n\n### Step 4: Deep Analysis with Oracle\n\n**CRITICAL**: Use the oracle tool for the compliance analysis. This is a complex research task requiring expert reasoning.\n\nCall the oracle with:\n- **task**: \"Validate implementation compliance against ADR\"\n- **context**: Include:\n  - The full ADR text\n  - The structured requirements table from Step 2\n  - List of implementation files found\n- **files**: All relevant implementation files (as JSON array)\n\n#### Oracle Prompt Template\n\n```\nTask: Validate that the implementation in these files correctly adheres to ADR-XXXX (<title>)\n\nContext:\nADR-XXXX specifies:\n[Paste structured requirements table here]\n\nPlease:\n1. For each requirement in the table, determine:\n   - Status: PASS / FAIL / UNKNOWN\n   - Evidence: file path(s) and line number(s)\n   - Reasoning: brief justification (1–3 sentences)\n\n2. Highlight any potential conflicts with other ADRs (if visible).\n\n3. Identify any tests that validate or should validate these requirements.\n\n4. Explicitly call out any requirements that cannot be verified with the provided files (mark as UNKNOWN).\n\nFiles: [\"path/to/handler.rs\", \"path/to/types.rs\", \"path/to/tests.rs\"]\n```\n\n#### Handling Large Files\n\nIf implementation files are large:\n\n- Prefer including only the relevant sections (handlers, functions, types) instead of entire files\n- If you must split files, clearly label chunks (e.g., `handler.rs [lines 1–200]`)\n- Ensure each code snippet is accompanied by its file path and line range for traceability\n\n### Step 5: Report Findings\n\nStructure the compliance report:\n\n```markdown\n## ADR Compliance Report: ADR-XXXX\n\n### Summary\n[COMPLIANT / PARTIAL / NON-COMPLIANT]\n\n### Requirements Checklist\n- [ ] ADR-XXXX-R1 – [PASS/FAIL/UNKNOWN] – Evidence: [file:line or \"Not found\"]\n- [ ] ADR-XXXX-R2 – [PASS/FAIL/UNKNOWN] – Evidence: [file:line]\n...\n\n### Deviations Found\n1. **[Deviation]**: Description\n   - Expected: (from ADR)\n   - Actual: (in code)\n   - File: [link to file:line]\n   - Severity: [Critical/Major/Minor]\n\n### Assumptions & Limitations\n- List any assumptions made (e.g., \"Assume auth middleware enforces header globally\")\n- Note any missing context or code that prevented full verification\n\n### Recommendations\n- Actionable fixes for any deviations\n\n### Files Reviewed\n- [List of all files analyzed with links]\n```\n\n#### Result States\n\n- **PASS**: Requirement is demonstrably satisfied with evidence\n- **FAIL**: Requirement is violated or missing\n- **UNKNOWN**: Requirement cannot be verified from provided code (config not present, depends on external systems, ADR too vague)\n\n#### Severity Definitions\n\n- **Critical**: Violates core decision or breaks contract (API shape, required fields, major constraints)\n- **Major**: Violates important but non-fatal aspects (performance safeguards, logging, observability)\n- **Minor**: Style, minor deviations, or missing documentation that do not change core behavior\n\n## Edge Cases & Failure Modes\n\n### Partial Implementation PRs\n\nIf the PR intentionally implements only part of an ADR:\n\n- Note this in the summary: \"Partial implementation of ADR-XXXX per PR scope.\"\n- Mark unimplemented requirements as `NOT-IN-SCOPE` (if user confirms) or `UNKNOWN`\n\n### Contradictory ADRs\n\nIf a requirement appears to conflict with another ADR:\n\n- Call this out in \"Deviations Found\" as an **Architectural Conflict**\n- Recommend reconciling the ADRs rather than the implementation alone\n\n### Superseded or Deprecated ADRs\n\n- **Superseded**: Validate against the superseding ADR instead\n- **Deprecated**: Do not enforce; treat analysis as historical/contextual only\n\n## ADR Location\n\nADRs are stored in: `doc/adr/`\n\nFormat: `XXXX-<short-name>.md` (e.g., `0052-metrics-lookup-for-tag-values.md`)\n\n## ADR Structure Reference\n\nEach ADR typically contains:\n\n- **Title**: `# N. <decision title>`\n- **Date**: When the decision was made\n- **Status**: Proposed, Accepted, Deprecated, Superseded\n- **Supersedes/Superseded by**: References to related ADRs (if any)\n- **Context**: Problem and constraints\n- **Decision**: The architectural choice\n- **Consequences**: Trade-offs and outcomes\n\n## Tips for Effective Validation\n\n1. **Be Literal**: Check exact API paths, field names, types\n2. **Check Edge Cases**: ADRs often mention error handling or limitations\n3. **Verify Consequences**: If ADR says \"expensive call\", look for rate limiting/guards\n4. **Test Coverage**: Verify tests exist for ADR requirements\n5. **Look for Superseded ADRs**: An ADR may update a previous decision\n6. **Scope to PR First**: Start narrow from the diff, expand only as needed\n7. **Use UNKNOWN Honestly**: Don''t claim PASS without evidence; don''t claim FAIL without proof\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:26:50.353Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents requiring precise Architecture Decision Records (ADR) compliance validation","zh":"适用于需要精确架构决策记录（ADR）合规性验证的代码审查代理","ja":"コードレビューエージェントに適しています。正確なアーキテクチャ決定レコード（ADR）コンプライアンス検証を必要とする","ko":"코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다. 정확한 아키텍처 결정 기록(ADR) 준수 검증을 필요로 하는 경우에 사용","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisión de Código que requieren una validación precisa de registros de decisiones de arquitectura (ADR)","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant une validation précise des enregistrements de décisions d''architecture (ADR)","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agents, die eine präzise Validierung von Architecture Decision Records (ADR) erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que exigem validação precisa de Registros de Decisões de Arquitetura (ADR)","ru":"Идеально для агентов проверки кода, требующих точной проверки соответствия записям об архитектурных решениях (ADR)","ar":"مثالية لعميل مراجعة الكود الذي يتطلب التحقق الدقيق من سجلات قرارات الهندسة المعمارية (ADR)"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to validate PR code against ADRs using deep analysis, ensuring implementation compliance with documented architectural decisions, and leveraging oracle for detailed inspections of code changes and their alignment with ADR specifications in ''.md'' files under ''doc'' directories","zh":"赋予代理验证PR代码与ADR的能力，使用深度分析，确保实现与记录的架构决策的合规性，并利用oracle进行代码更改的详细检查及其与ADR规范在''.md''文件下的''doc''目录中的对齐","ja":"エージェントにPRコードをADRに対して検証する能力を与え、深い分析を使用して、実装が文書化されたアーキテクチャの決定と一致することを保証し、''.md''ファイルの下の''doc''ディレクトリ内のADR仕様とコード変更の詳細な調査とその整列をoracleを利用して実行する","ko":"에이전트가 PR 코드를 ADR와 비교하여 검증할 수 있도록 하며, 깊은 분석을 사용하여 구현이 문서화된 아키텍처 결정과 일치하는지 확인하고, ''.md'' 파일下的 ''doc'' 디렉토리 내의 ADR 사양과 코드 변경의详细检查 및 그에 대한 일치를 오라클을 사용하여 수행","es":"Habilita a los agentes a validar el código de PR contra ADR utilizando un análisis profundo, asegurando la implementación cumpla con las decisiones arquitectónicas documentadas y aprovechando Oracle para inspecciones detalladas de los cambios de código y su alineación con las especificaciones de ADR en archivos ''.md'' bajo directorios ''doc''","fr":"Permet aux agents de valider le code de PR contre les ADR en utilisant une analyse approfondie, en garantissant la mise en œuvre du respect des décisions architecturales documentées et en exploitant Oracle pour des inspections détaillées des modifications de code et de leur alignement sur les spécifications ADR dans les fichiers ''.md'' sous les répertoires ''doc''","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, PR-Code gegen ADR mithilfe einer tiefen Analyse zu validieren, die Implementierung sicherzustellen, um die dokumentierten architektonischen Entscheidungen zu erfüllen und Oracle für detaillierte Inspektionen von Codeänderungen und deren Ausrichtung auf ADR-Spezifikationen in ''.md''-Dateien unter ''doc''-Verzeichnissen zu nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a validar o código de PR contra ADRs usando análise profunda, garantindo a implementação compatível com as decisões arquiteturais documentadas, e aproveitando oracle para inspeções detalhadas das alterações de código e seu alinhamento com as especificações ADR em arquivos ''.md'' sob diretórios ''doc''","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверять код PR на соответствие ADR с помощью глубокого анализа, обеспечивая реализацию в соответствии с задокументированными архитектурными решениями, и использует oracle для детального осмотра изменений кода и их соответствия спецификациям ADR в файлах ''.md'' в директориях ''doc''","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من التحقق من代码 PR مقابل سجلات قرارات الهندسة المعمارية (ADRs) باستخدام تحليل عميق، وضمان التنفيذ المتوافق مع القرارات الهندسية المعمارية الموثقة، وتستفيد من oracle لفحص مفصل لتغييرات الكود وتماشيها مع مواصفات ADR في الملفات ''.md'' تحت مجلدات ''doc''"},"useCases":{"en":["Validating pull requests against accepted architecture decisions","Reviewing implementation details for compliance with ADR specifications","Identifying deviations from documented architectural decisions in code changes"],"zh":["针对已接受的架构决策验证拉取请求","审查实现细节以确保符合ADR规范","识别代码更改中与记录的架构决策的偏差"],"ja":["受け入れられたアーキテクチャの決定に対してプルリクエストを検証する","ADR仕様とのコンプライアンスを確実にするために実装の詳細をレビューする","コード変更の中で文書化されたアーキテクチャの決定からの偏差を特定する"],"ko":["수락된 아키텍처 결정에 대한 풀 리퀘스트를 검증","구현 세부 정보를 검토하여 ADR 사양과 일치하는지 확인","코드 변경에서 문서화된 아키텍처 결정에서 발생한 편차를 식별"],"es":["Validar solicitudes de extracción contra decisiones de arquitectura aceptadas","Revisar detalles de implementación para el cumplimiento de las especificaciones de ADR","Identificar desviaciones de las decisiones de arquitectura documentadas en los cambios de código"],"fr":["Valider les demandes d''extraction par rapport aux décisions d''architecture acceptées","Réviser les détails d''implémentation pour le respect des spécifications ADR","Identifier les déviations des décisions d''architecture documentées dans les modifications de code"],"de":["Überprüfen von Pull-Requests gegen akzeptierte Architekturentscheidungen","Überprüfen von Implementierungsdetails auf Einhaltung von ADR-Spezifikationen","Feststellen von Abweichungen von den dokumentierten Architekturentscheidungen in Codeänderungen"],"pt":["Validar solicitações de pull contra decisões de arquitetura aceitas","Revisar detalhes de implementação para compatibilidade com especificações ADR","Identificar desvios de decisões de arquitetura documentadas em alterações de código"],"ru":["Проверка запросов на включение против принятых решений по архитектуре","Просмотр деталей реализации для соответствия спецификациям ADR","Определение отклонений от задокументированных решений по архитектуре в изменениях кода"],"ar":["التحقق من طلبات الدمج مقابل قرارات الهندسة المعمارية المقبولة","مراجعة تفاصيل التنفيذ للامتثال لمواصفات ADR","تحديد الانحرافات عن قرارات الهندسة المعمارية الموثقة في تغييرات الكود"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ADRs to be stored under ''doc'' directory","Assumes PR code and related implementations are accessible for analysis"],"zh":["需要ADR存储在''doc''目录下","假设PR代码和相关实现是可访问的用于分析"],"ja":["ADRが''doc''ディレクトリ下に保存されている必要がある","PRコードと関連する実装は分析のためにアクセス可能であると仮定する"],"ko":["ADR가 ''doc'' 디렉토리 아래에 저장되어야 함","PR 코드와 관련된 구현은 분석을 위해 접근할 수 있다고 가정"],"es":["Requiere que los ADR se almacenen bajo el directorio ''doc''","Supone que el código de PR y las implementaciones relacionadas son accesibles para el análisis"],"fr":["Exige que les ADR soient stockés sous le répertoire ''doc''","Suppose que le code de PR et les implementations associées soient accessibles pour l''analyse"],"de":["Erfordert, dass ADR unter dem Verzeichnis ''doc'' gespeichert werden","Geht davon aus, dass PR-Code und damit verbundene Implementierungen für die Analyse zugänglich sind"],"pt":["Exige que os ADRs sejam armazenados sob o diretório ''doc''","Supõe que o código PR e as implementações relacionadas sejam acessíveis para análise"],"ru":["Требует, чтобы ADR хранились в директории ''doc''","Предполагает, что код PR и связанные с ним реализации доступны для анализа"],"ar":["يتطلب أن يتم تخزين سجلات قرارات الهندسة المعمارية (ADRs) تحت مجلد ''doc''","يفترض أن يكون код PR والتنفيذات ذات الصلة قابلة للوصول للتحليل"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"85697f527217e0b293668d59f9329249fe7172d6d84e7fb89aa506689721430b","qualityScore":60}');
