"],"fr":["Automatisation des flux de travail de l''IA","Orchestration des agents","Continuité de session","Commandes de productivité","Intégration avec Claude Code"],"de":["Automatisierung von AI-Workflows","Agenten-Orchestrierung","Sitzungsfortsetzung","Produktivitätskommandos","Integration mit Claude Code"],"pt":["Continuidade de sessão","Automação de fluxos de trabalho","Orquestração de agentes","Integração com Claude Code","Comandos de produtividade"],"ru":["Непрерывность сеанса","Автоматизация рабочих процессов","Оркестровка агентов","Интеграция с Claude Code","Команды производительности"],"ar":["استمرارية الجلسة","تحسين إنتاجية العمل","تنفيذ أوامر استمرارية الجلسة","دمج مع Claude Code","أوامر الإنتاجية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI工具","会话连续性","生产力命令","AI工作流自动化","代理编排","如何使用Handoff","Handoff教程","AI工具Handoff","Handoff安装","Handoff设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","セッション連続性","生産性コマンド","AIワークフロー自動化","エージェントのオーケストレーション","Handoffの使い方","Handoffチュートリアル","AIエージェントHandoff","Handoffのインストール","Handoffの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","세션 연속성","생산성 명령","AI 워크플로 자동화","에이전트 오케스트레이션","Handoff 사용법","Handoff 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트 Handoff","Handoff 설치","Handoff 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI","automatización de flujos de trabajo","orquestación de agentes","continuidad de sesión","Claude Code","desarrollo de AI","productividad en el desarrollo","cómo usar handoff","qué es handoff"],"fr":["outils IA","automatisation des flux de travail","orchestration des agents","continuité de session","Claude Code","développement d''IA","productivité dans le développement","comment utiliser handoff","qu''est-ce que handoff"],"de":["KI-Tools","Automatisierung von Workflows","Agenten-Orchestrierung","Sitzungsfortsetzung","Claude Code","AI-Entwicklung","Produktivität in der Entwicklung","wie man handoff verwendet","was ist handoff"],"pt":["como usar handoff","o que é handoff","ferramentas de ia","alternativas ao handoff","handoff vs claude code","instalar handoff","guia de configuração do handoff"],"ru":["как использовать handoff","что такое handoff","инструменты ии","альтернативы handoff","handoff vs claude code","установить handoff","руководство по настройке handoff"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام handoff","ما هي handoff","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديل handoff","handoff مقابل claude code","تثبيت handoff","دليل إعداد handoff"]}},"owner":"robynsmith","repo":"claude-code-skills-demo","repoPath":"robynsmith/claude-code-skills-demo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.937Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"handoff","description":"Capture session context before ending or compaction","bodyPreview":"# Session Handoff Skill\n\nCaptures the current session context to ensure continuity across sessions and after auto-compaction.\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen this skill is invoked, create a comprehensive session handoff document:\n\n1. **Check for uncommitted changes**:\n   - Run `git status` to check for uncommitted changes\n   - If there are uncommitted changes, inform the user and ask if they want to:\n     - Commit the changes now (offer to help create the commit)\n     - Continue with handoff anyway (chan","body":"# Session Handoff Skill\n\nCaptures the current session context to ensure continuity across sessions and after auto-compaction.\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen this skill is invoked, create a comprehensive session handoff document:\n\n1. **Check for uncommitted changes**:\n   - Run `git status` to check for uncommitted changes\n   - If there are uncommitted changes, inform the user and ask if they want to:\n     - Commit the changes now (offer to help create the commit)\n     - Continue with handoff anyway (changes will be documented but not committed)\n     - Cancel the handoff to commit manually first\n   - If working tree is clean, proceed to step 2\n\n2. **Determine the date and time**:\n   - Use today''s date in YYYY-MM-DD format\n   - Use bash command `date ''+%I:%M %p''` to get the current time (e.g., \"09:33 AM\")\n   - Use bash command `date ''+%A''` to get the day of week if helpful for context\n\n3. **Create the handoff file**:\n   - Location: `contexts/_LifeOS/handoff/session-handoff-YYYY-MM-DD.md`\n   - If a file for today already exists, read it first and append with a new timestamp section\n   - Format session header as: `## Session N (Day Period - HH:MM AM/PM)` where Day Period is descriptive (e.g., \"Morning\", \"Afternoon\", \"Evening\", \"Early Morning\")\n\n4. **Capture the following sections**:\n\n   ### Session Summary\n   - Brief overview of what was accomplished in this session\n   - Main topics discussed or worked on\n   - Time range if relevant\n\n   ### Key Decisions Made\n   - Important choices and why they were made\n   - Architectural decisions\n   - Approach selections\n   - What was chosen and what was rejected\n\n   ### Code Changes\n   - List files modified with specific line numbers when relevant (use format `file.ts:123`)\n   - Brief description of what changed and why\n   - Any patterns or conventions established\n   - New files created\n\n   ### Open Questions & Blockers\n   - Unresolved questions\n   - Things that need investigation\n   - Blockers preventing progress\n   - Edge cases to consider\n\n   ### Next Steps\n   - Concrete action items as a checklist using `- [ ]` format\n   - Priorities for next session\n   - Follow-up tasks\n\n   ### Context for Next Session\n   - Important background that would be lost in compaction\n   - Links to relevant files or resources\n   - Any special considerations\n   - Current working directory or focus area\n\n5. **Format guidelines**:\n   - Use clear markdown headings\n   - Be specific with file references (include line numbers)\n   - Keep it concise but complete\n   - Use bullet points and checklists\n   - Include timestamps for multiple sessions in one day\n\n6. **Commit and push the handoff**:\n   - Add the handoff file to git staging\n   - Commit with message format: \"Add Session N handoff: [brief summary]\"\n   - Push to remote to ensure context is backed up\n   - Confirm to the user what was committed and pushed\n   - Show a brief summary of what was documented\n\n## Example Output Format\n\n```markdown\n# Session Handoff - 2026-01-11\n\n## Session 1 (Morning - 9:00 AM)\n\n### Session Summary\n\nResearched Claude Code session management strategies and created comprehensive documentation. Set up handoff infrastructure for future session continuity.\n\n### Key Decisions Made\n\n- **Storage location**: Decided to store session context in `contexts/_LifeOS/handoff/` following existing PARA structure\n- **Skill creation**: Chose to create a reusable `/handoff` skill rather than manual process\n- **Naming convention**: Will use `session-handoff-YYYY-MM-DD.md` format\n\n### Code Changes\n\n- Created `contexts/tech/3_resources/ai-learnings/Claude Code Session Management.md`\n  - Comprehensive guide to session management\n  - Community resources and best practices\n  - References to GitHub repos and tools\n\n- Created `contexts/_LifeOS/handoff/README.md`\n  - Explains purpose of handoff folder\n  - Documents naming conventions\n  - Links to related resources\n\n- Updated `CLAUDE.md:32` and `CLAUDE.md:56`\n  - Added handoff folder documentation\n  - Mentioned `/handoff` skill usage\n\n- Updated `contexts/tech/3_resources/ai-learnings/README.md:17-18`\n  - Added new session management topic\n\n- Created `.claude/skills/handoff/SKILL.md`\n  - Custom skill for session handoff automation\n  - Follows PARA methodology\n\n### Open Questions & Blockers\n\nNone currently\n\n### Next Steps\n\n- [ ] Test the `/handoff` skill in practice\n- [ ] Consider creating additional skills for common workflows (journal entry, learning log, etc.)\n- [ ] Explore community skill repositories for other useful tools\n- [ ] Review wshobson/commands and claude-code-showcase repos\n\n### Context for Next Session\n\nThis session focused on meta-work: improving the Claude Code workflow itself. The repository is a personal knowledge management system using PARA methodology, primarily for Obsidian notes. The handoff system is now in place to preserve context across sessions and auto-compaction events.\n```\n\n## Implementation Notes\n\n- This skill follows the PARA methodology for personal knowledge management\n- Session handoff files are stored in `_LifeOS/handoff/` as they''re related to daily workflow\n- The skill can be invoked simply by typing `/handoff` in Claude Code\n- Multiple sessions in one day append to the same file with new timestamp sections\n- The handoff is automatically committed and pushed to remote for backup\n- The handoff file serves as input for the next session to recover full context\n- Pushing ensures context is preserved even if local machine fails or user switches machines\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:35:22.029Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Workflow Automation Agents like Claude Code, requiring seamless session continuity and productivity commands","zh":"适合于需要无缝会话连续性和生产力命令的AI工作流自动化代理，如Claude Code","ja":"Claude Codeのようなシームレスなセッションの継続性と生産性のコマンドを必要とするAIワークフローの自動化エージェントに適しています","ko":"클라우드 코드와 같은 무중단 세션 연속성 및 생산성 명령이 필요한 AI 워크플로 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización de Flujo de Trabajo de IA como Claude Code, que requieren una continuidad de sesión sin problemas y comandos de productividad","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Automatisation de Flux de Travail d''IA comme Claude Code, nécessitant une continuité de session sans interruption et des commandes de productivité","de":"Ideal für AI-Workflow-Automatisierungsagenten wie Claude Code, die eine nahtlose Sitzungsfortsetzung und Produktivitätsbefehle erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação de Fluxo de Trabalho de IA como Claude Code, que exigem continuidade de sessão sem interrupção e comandos de produtividade","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации рабочего процесса ИИ, таких как Claude Code, требующих бесшовной непрерывности сеанса и команд производительности","ar":"مثالية لعميل автомاتيزيوم تدفق عمل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code ، الذي يتطلب استمرار الجلسة دون انقطاع وأوامر الإنتاجية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to capture current session context, ensuring continuity across sessions and after auto-compaction, using git status checks and commit management via protocols like Git","zh":"赋予代理捕获当前会话上下文的能力，确保会话之间和自动压缩后的一致性，使用git状态检查和通过Git等协议的提交管理","ja":"エージェントが現在のセッションコンテキストをキャプチャする機能を提供し、セッション間および自動圧縮後の継続性を確保する、Gitなどのプロトコルを使用したGitステータスチェックとコミット管理を使用して","ko":"에이전트가 현재 세션 컨텍스트를 캡처할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 세션 간 및 자동 압축 후的一致성을 보장하며, Git과 같은 프로토콜을 사용한 Git 상태 확인 및 커밋 관리를 사용합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a capturar el contexto de la sesión actual, garantizando la continuidad entre sesiones y después de la compactación automática, utilizando verificaciones de estado de git y gestión de confirmación a través de protocolos como Git","fr":"Permet aux agents de capturer le contexte de session actuel, assurant la continuité entre les sessions et après la compaction automatique, en utilisant des vérifications d''état de git et une gestion de validation via des protocoles comme Git","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, den aktuellen Sitzungskontext zu erfassen, die Kontinuität zwischen den Sitzungen und nach der automatischen Kompaktierung sicherzustellen, indem Git-Statusprüfungen und Commit-Verwaltung über Protokolle wie Git verwendet werden","pt":"Permite que os agentes capturam o contexto da sessão atual, garantindo a continuidade entre as sessões e após a compactação automática, usando verificações de status do git e gerenciamento de compromissos via protocolos como Git","ru":"Позволяет агентам захватить текущий контекст сеанса, обеспечивая непрерывность между сеансами и после автоматической компактизации, используя проверки статуса git и управление коммитами через протоколы như Git","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من التقاط سياق الجلسة الحالية ، مما يضمن الاستمرارية عبر الجلسات وبعد الت緊يح التلقائي ، باستخدام فحوصات حالة الجيت وإدارة الالتزامات عبر بروتوكولات مثل Git"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating session handoffs for uninterrupted workflow","Generating comprehensive session handoff documents","Checking for uncommitted changes with git status"],"zh":["自动化会话交接以实现无中断的工作流程","生成综合的会话交接文档","使用git状态检查未提交的更改"],"ja":["中断されないワークフローを実現するためのセッションハンドオフの自動化","包括的なセッションハンドオフドキュメントの生成","gitステータスチェックを使用した未コミットの変更の確認"],"ko":["중단되지 않는 워크플로우를 구현하기 위한 세션 인계의 자동화","포괄적인 세션 인계 문서의 생성","git 상태 확인을 사용한 커밋되지 않은 변경 사항의 확인"],"es":["Automatización de transferencias de sesión para un flujo de trabajo ininterrumpido","Generación de documentos de transferencia de sesión completos","Comprobación de cambios no confirmados con git status"],"fr":["Automatisation des transferts de session pour un flux de travail ininterrompu","Génération de documents de transfert de session complets","Vérification des modifications non validées avec git status"],"de":["Automatisierung von Sitzungsübergaben für einen unterbrechungsfreien Arbeitsablauf","Erzeugung umfassender Sitzungsübergabedokumente","Prüfung auf nicht committete Änderungen mit git status"],"pt":["Automatizar a transferência de sessões para um fluxo de trabalho ininterrupto","Gerar documentos abrangentes de transferência de sessões","Verificar alterações não comprometidas com git status"],"ru":["Автоматизировать передачу сеансов для беспрерывного рабочего процесса","Генерировать всесторонние документы передачи сеанса","Проверять незакоммиченные изменения с помощью git status"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي في نقل الجلسات من أجل تدفق عمل غير منقطع","توليد وثائق شاملة لنقل الجلسات","التحقق من التغييرات غير الملتزمة مع حالة الجيت"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation and configuration","Needs user input for handling uncommitted changes"],"zh":["需要Git的安装和配置","需要用户输入来处理未提交的更改"],"ja":["Gitのインストールと構成が必要","未コミットの変更を処理するためにユーザー入力が必要"],"ko":["Git의 설치 및 구성이 필요합니다","커밋되지 않은 변경 사항을 처리하기 위해 사용자 입력이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de Git","Necesita entrada de usuario para el manejo de cambios no confirmados"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Git","Nécessite une entrée utilisateur pour la gestion des modifications non validées"],"de":["Benötigt Git-Installation und -Konfiguration","Benötigt Benutzereingabe für die Behandlung von nicht committeten Änderungen"],"pt":["Exige a instalação e configuração do Git","Necessita de entrada do usuário para lidar com alterações não comprometidas"],"ru":["Требует установки и конфигурации Git","Требует ввода пользователя для обработки незакоммиченных изменений"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين الجيت","يحتاج إلى إدخال المستخدم لمعالجة التغييرات غير الملتزمة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"88d69927dc3d55ed9f757da9ec2e5dfa634ccf7781812af05777c6a127897b3c","qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('benjaminshoemaker/ai_coding_project_base/feature-technical-spec', 'community', 'benjaminshoemaker', 'ai_coding_project_base', 'benjaminshoemaker/ai_coding_project_base', 'feature-technical-spec', 0, 0, 60, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.943Z', '2026-03-02T02:40:16.958Z', '296e881084ba19bd02952f32ed14ed622b0cd1b8a3ce8f2dc037941c11c1a58b', '{"id":"benjaminshoemaker/ai_coding_project_base/feature-technical-spec","name":"feature-technical-spec","description":{"zh":"AI工具技术规格是一种结构化的提示框架，用于构建软件产品。它指导您完成产品规范、技术设计和实现规划","ja":"AIエージェントの技術仕様は、ソフトウェア製品を構築するための構造化されたプロンプトフレームワークです","ko":"AI 에이전트 기술 사양은 소프트웨어 제품을 구축하는 데 사용되는 구조화된 프롬프트 프레임워크입니다","es":"El kit de herramientas feature-technical-spec es un marco de promoción estructurado para desarrollar productos de software con asistentes de codificación de IA.","fr":"Le kit d''outils feature-technical-spec est un cadre de promotion structuré pour développer des produits logiciels avec des assistants de codage IA.","de":"Das Toolkit feature-technical-spec ist ein strukturierter Rahmen für die Entwicklung von Softwareprodukten mit AI-Coding-Assistenten.","pt":"Uma estrutura de prompts estruturada para construir produtos de software com assistentes de codificação de IA. Produz documentos que agentes de IA podem executar.","ru":"Структурированный каркас для создания программных продуктов с помощью ИИ кодировщиков. Производит документы, которые ИИ агенты могут выполнить.","ar":"إطار منظم لبناء منتجات البرمجيات باستخدام مساعدي الترميز الذكي. ينتج وثائق يمكن للوكلاء الذكية تنفيذها.","en":"A structured prompt framework for building software products with AI coding assistants. This toolkit guides you through product specification, technical design, and implementation planning—producing documents that AI agents can execute against."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI工具技术规格","ja":"AIエージェントの技術仕様","ko":"AI 에이전트 기술 사양","es":"Herramientas de AI: feature-technical-spec para desarroll...","fr":"Outils d''IA : feature-technical-spec pour les développeurs","de":"AI-Tools: feature-technical-spec für Entwickler","pt":"Ferramenta de Especificação Técnica para Ferramentas de IA","ru":"Инструмент Технической Спецификации для ИИ Агентов","ar":"أداة مواصفات تقنية للأدوات الذكية","en":"feature-technical-spec"},"description":{"zh":"AI工具技术规格是一种结构化的提示框架，用于构建软件产品。它指导您完成产品规范、技术设计和实现规划","ja":"AIエージェントの技術仕様は、ソフトウェア製品を構築するための構造化されたプロンプトフレームワークです","ko":"AI 에이전트 기술 사양은 소프트웨어 제품을 구축하는 데 사용되는 구조화된 프롬프트 프레임워크입니다","es":"El kit de herramientas feature-technical-spec es un marco de promoción estructurado para desarrollar productos de software con asistentes de codificación de IA.","fr":"Le kit d''outils feature-technical-spec est un cadre de promotion structuré pour développer des produits logiciels avec des assistants de codage IA.","de":"Das Toolkit feature-technical-spec ist ein strukturierter Rahmen für die Entwicklung von Softwareprodukten mit AI-Coding-Assistenten.","pt":"Uma estrutura de prompts estruturada para construir produtos de software com assistentes de codificação de IA. Produz documentos que agentes de IA podem exec...","ru":"Структурированный каркас для создания программных продуктов с помощью ИИ кодировщиков. Производит документы, которые ИИ агенты могут выполнить.","ar":"إطار منظم لبناء منتجات البرمجيات باستخدام مساعدي الترميز الذكي. ينتج وثائق يمكن للوكلاء الذكية تنفيذها.","en":"A structured prompt framework for building software products with AI coding assistants. This toolkit guides you through product specification, technical desi..."},"definition":{"en":"A structured prompt framework for building software products with AI coding assistants. This toolkit guides you through product specification, technical design, and implementation planning—producing documents that AI agents can execute against."},"features":{"zh":["产品规范指导","技术设计支持","实现规划工具","AI工具集成","结构化提示框架"],"ja":["製品仕様のガイド","技術設計のサポート","実装計画ツール","AIエージェントの統合","構造化されたプロンプトフレームワーク"],"ko":["제품 사양 가이드","기술 설계 지원","구현 계획 도구","AI 에이전트 통합","구조화된 프롬프트 프레임워크"],"es":["Marco de promoción estructurado para desarrollar productos de software","Asistentes de codificación de IA para mejorar la eficiencia","Planificación de la implementación y diseño técnico","Generación de documentos para la ejecución de agentes de IA","Mejora del flujo de trabajo y la colaboración en equipo","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo de software populares"],"fr":["Cadre de promotion structuré pour développer des produits logiciels","Assistants de codage IA pour améliorer l''efficacité","Planification de la mise en œuvre et conception technique","Génération de documents pour l''exécution d''agents IA","Amélioration du flux de travail et de la collaboration d''équipe","Intégration avec des outils de développement de logiciels populaires"],"de":["Strukturierter Rahmen für die Entwicklung von Softwareprodukten","AI-Coding-Assistenten für verbesserte Effizienz","Implementierungs- und technische Planung","Erzeugung von Dokumenten für die Ausführung von AI-Agents","Verbesserung des Arbeitsablaufs und der Teamzusammenarbeit","Integration mit beliebten Software-Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Estrutura de prompts para especificação de produtos","Design técnico e planejamento de implementação","Documentos executáveis por agentes de IA","Integração com assistentes de codificação de IA","Otimização do desenvolvimento de produtos de software"],"ru":["Структурированный каркас для спецификации продукта","Технический дизайн и планирование реализации","Документы, которые могут быть выполнены ИИ агентами","Интеграция с ИИ кодировщиками","Оптимизация разработки программных продуктов"],"ar":["إطار منظم لمواصفات المنتج","تصميم تقني وتخطيط التنفيذ","وثائق يمكن للوكلاء الذكية تنفيذها","التكامل مع مساعدي الترميز الذكي","تحسين تطوير منتجات البرمجيات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI工具技术规格","如何使用AI工具","什么是AI工具技术规格","AI工具技术规格替代品","AI工具技术规格安装","AI工具技术规格设置指南","AI工具技术规格与其他工具的比较"],"ja":["AIエージェントの技術仕様","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントの技術仕様とは","AIエージェントの技術仕様の代替品","AIエージェントの技術仕様のインストール","AIエージェントの技術仕様の設定ガイド","AIエージェントの技術仕様と他のツールの比較"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 기술 사양","AI 에이전트 사용법","AI 에이전트 기술 사양이란","AI 에이전트 기술 사양 대체品","AI 에이전트 기술 사양 설치","AI 에이전트 기술 사양 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트 기술 사양과 다른 도구의 비교"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","feature-technical-spec","desarrollo de software con IA","asistentes de codificación de IA","mejora del flujo de trabajo","colaboración en equipo","integración con herramientas de desarrollo","guía de instalación de feature-technical-spec","alternativas a feature-technical-spec"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour les développeurs","feature-technical-spec","développement de logiciels avec IA","assistants de codage IA","amélioration du flux de travail","collaboration d''équipe","intégration avec des outils de développement","guide d''installation de feature-technical-spec","alternatives à feature-technical-spec"],"de":["AI-Tools für Entwickler","feature-technical-spec","Entwicklung von Softwareprodukten mit AI","AI-Coding-Assistenten","Verbesserung des Arbeitsablaufs","Teamzusammenarbeit","Integration mit Software-Entwicklungstools","Installationsanleitung für feature-technical-spec","Alternativen zu feature-technical-spec"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA","assistente de codificação de IA","desenvolvimento de produtos de software","especificação técnica","design técnico","planejamento de implementação","documentos executáveis","integração com IA","otimização de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","ИИ кодировщики","создание программных продуктов","техническая спецификация","технический дизайн","планирование реализации","документы для ИИ агентов","интеграция с ИИ","оптимизация разработки"],"ar":["الأدوات الذكية","مساعد الترميز الذكي","بناء منتجات البرمجيات","مواصفات تقنية","تصميم تقني","تخطيط التنفيذ","وثائق للوكلاء الذكية","التكامل مع الأدوات الذكية","تحسين التطوير"]}},"owner":"benjaminshoemaker","repo":"ai_coding_project_base","repoPath":"benjaminshoemaker/ai_coding_project_base","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.943Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"feature-technical-spec","description":"Define technical approach (architecture, integration points, data model) for a feature through guided Q&A and write FEATURE_TECHNICAL_SPEC.md. Use after /feature-spec.","bodyPreview":"Generate a feature technical specification document for the feature `$1`.\n\n## Workflow\n\nCopy this checklist and track progress:\n\n```\nFeature Technical Spec Progress:\n- [ ] Directory guard\n- [ ] Check prerequisites (FEATURE_SPEC.md exists)\n- [ ] Existing file guard (prevent overwrite)\n- [ ] Existing code analysis (similar functionality, patterns, integration points)\n- [ ] Codebase maturity assessment\n- [ ] Generate FEATURE_TECHNICAL_SPEC.md\n- [ ] Run spec-verification\n- [ ] Capture deferred requi","body":"Generate a feature technical specification document for the feature `$1`.\n\n## Workflow\n\nCopy this checklist and track progress:\n\n```\nFeature Technical Spec Progress:\n- [ ] Directory guard\n- [ ] Check prerequisites (FEATURE_SPEC.md exists)\n- [ ] Existing file guard (prevent overwrite)\n- [ ] Existing code analysis (similar functionality, patterns, integration points)\n- [ ] Codebase maturity assessment\n- [ ] Generate FEATURE_TECHNICAL_SPEC.md\n- [ ] Run spec-verification\n- [ ] Capture deferred requirements\n- [ ] Cross-model review (if Codex available)\n```\n\n## Directory Guard\n\n1. If `.toolkit-marker` exists in the current working directory → **STOP**:\n   \"You''re in the toolkit repo. Feature skills run from your project directory.\n    Run: `cd ~/Projects/your-project && /feature-technical-spec $1`\"\n\n2. Check `.claude/toolkit-version.json` exists in the current working directory (confirms `/setup` was run).\n   If missing → **STOP**: \"Toolkit not installed. Run `/setup` from the toolkit first.\"\n\n3. Check `AGENTS.md` exists in the current working directory (confirms project root).\n   If missing → **STOP**: \"Run this from your project root (where AGENTS.md lives).\"\n\n## Arguments\n\n- `$1` = feature name (e.g., `analytics`, `dark-mode`)\n- If `$1` is empty, ask the user for the feature name\n- `PROJECT_ROOT` = current working directory\n- `FEATURE_DIR` = `PROJECT_ROOT/features/$1`\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Check that `FEATURE_DIR/FEATURE_SPEC.md` exists. If not:\n  \"FEATURE_SPEC.md not found at features/$1/. Run `/feature-spec $1` first.\"\n- Check that `PROJECT_ROOT/AGENTS.md` exists (indicates an existing project). If not, warn:\n  \"AGENTS.md not found. Feature development assumes an existing project. Did you mean to run `/product-spec` for a new project?\"\n\n## Existing File Guard (Prevent Overwrite)\n\nBefore asking any questions, check whether `FEATURE_DIR/FEATURE_TECHNICAL_SPEC.md` already exists.\n\n- If it does not exist: continue normally.\n- If it exists: **STOP** and ask the user what to do:\n  1. **Backup then overwrite (recommended)**: read the existing file and write it to `FEATURE_DIR/FEATURE_TECHNICAL_SPEC.md.bak.YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS`, then write the new document to `FEATURE_DIR/FEATURE_TECHNICAL_SPEC.md`\n  2. **Overwrite**: replace `FEATURE_DIR/FEATURE_TECHNICAL_SPEC.md` with the new document\n  3. **Abort**: do not write anything; suggest they rename/move the existing file first\n\n## Process\n\nRead `.claude/skills/feature-technical-spec/PROMPT.md` and follow its instructions exactly:\n\n1. Read `FEATURE_DIR/FEATURE_SPEC.md` as input\n\n2. **Perform Existing Code Analysis** (REQUIRED before any design):\n\n   **Note:** All code analysis should be performed on PROJECT_ROOT (current working directory).\n\n   a. **Similar Functionality Audit**\n      - Search for existing code that does something similar to what the feature needs\n      - List any utilities, helpers, or patterns that could be reused\n      - Flag if creating new code when existing code could be extended\n      - Output:\n        ```\n        SIMILAR FUNCTIONALITY FOUND\n        ---------------------------\n        - {file}: {description of similar functionality}\n        - {file}: {reusable utility/helper}\n\n        Recommendation: {extend existing | create new | hybrid approach}\n        ```\n\n   b. **Pattern Compliance Check**\n      - Identify how similar features are implemented in the codebase\n      - Note naming conventions, file organization, error handling patterns\n      - Document the \"house style\" for this type of feature\n      - Output:\n        ```\n        EXISTING PATTERNS\n        -----------------\n        File organization: {pattern}\n        Naming convention: {pattern}\n        Error handling: {pattern}\n        Testing approach: {pattern}\n        ```\n\n   c. **Integration Point Mapping**\n      - List every existing file/module the feature will touch\n      - For each, assess: complexity, test coverage, documentation quality\n      - Flag high-risk integration points\n      - Output:\n        ```\n        INTEGRATION POINTS\n        ------------------\n        | File | Risk | Coverage | Notes |\n        |------|------|----------|-------|\n        | {file} | High/Med/Low | X% | {concerns} |\n        ```\n\n3. **Assess codebase maturity** — Is this a legacy/brownfield codebase?\n   - Look for: outdated dependencies, missing tests, undocumented code, deprecated patterns\n   - If legacy indicators found, explicitly address technical debt, undocumented behavior, and human decision points\n\n4. Work through integration analysis, regression risks, and migration strategy\n\n5. Generate the final FEATURE_TECHNICAL_SPEC.md document, incorporating findings from step 2\n\n## Output\n\nWrite the completed specification to `FEATURE_DIR/FEATURE_TECHNICAL_SPEC.md`.\n\n## Verification (Automatic)\n\nAfter writing FEATURE_TECHNICAL_SPEC.md, run the spec-verification workflow:\n\n1. Read `.claude/skills/spec-verification/SKILL.md` for the verification process\n2. Verify context preservation: Check that all key items from FEATURE_SPEC.md appear in FEATURE_TECHNICAL_SPEC.md\n3. Run quality checks for vague language, missing rationale, undefined contracts, integration gaps\n4. Present any CRITICAL issues to the user with resolution options\n5. Apply fixes based on user choices\n6. Re-verify until clean or max iterations reached\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Do not proceed to \"Next Step\" until verification passes or user explicitly chooses to proceed with noted issues.\n\n## Deferred Requirements Capture (During Q&A)\n\n**IMPORTANT:** Capture deferred requirements interactively during the Q&A process, not after.\n\nWrite deferred items to `PROJECT_ROOT/DEFERRED.md` (not the feature directory).\n\n### When to Trigger\n\nDuring the Q&A, watch for signals that the user is deferring a technical decision:\n- \"out of scope\"\n- \"not in this feature\" / \"separate feature\"\n- \"v2\" / \"future version\"\n- \"premature optimization\"\n- \"technical debt we''ll address later\"\n- \"keep it simple for now\"\n- \"follow-up\" / \"future enhancement\"\n\n### Capture Flow\n\nWhen you detect a deferral signal, immediately use AskUserQuestion:\n\n```\nQuestion: \"Would you like to save this to your deferred requirements?\"\nHeader: \"Defer?\"\nOptions:\n  - \"Yes, capture it\" — I''ll ask a few quick questions to document it\n  - \"No, skip\" — Don''t record this\n```\n\n**If user selects \"Yes, capture it\":**\n\nAsk these clarifying questions:\n\n1. **What''s being deferred?**\n   \"In one sentence, what''s the technical decision or feature?\"\n   (Pre-fill with your understanding from context)\n\n2. **Why defer it?**\n   Options: \"Premature optimization\" / \"Out of scope\" / \"Separate feature\" / \"V2\" / \"Needs more research\" / \"Other\"\n\n3. **Notes for later?**\n   \"Any technical context that will help when revisiting this?\"\n   (Optional — user can skip)\n\n### Write to DEFERRED.md Immediately\n\nAfter collecting answers, append to `PROJECT_ROOT/DEFERRED.md` right away.\n\n**Add new section or append to existing feature section:**\n\n```markdown\n\n## From FEATURE_TECHNICAL_SPEC.md: {FEATURE_NAME} ({date})\n\n| Requirement | Reason | Notes |\n|-------------|--------|-------|\n| {user''s answer} | {selected reason} | {notes or \"—\"} |\n```\n\n### Continue Q&A\n\nAfter capturing (or skipping), continue the spec Q&A where you left off.\n\n## Cross-Model Review (Automatic)\n\nAfter verification passes, run cross-model review if Codex CLI is available:\n\n1. Check if Codex CLI is installed: `codex --version`\n2. If available, run `/codex-consult` with upstream context\n3. Present any findings to the user before proceeding\n\n**Consultation invocation:**\n```\n/codex-consult --upstream features/$1/FEATURE_SPEC.md --research \"{detected technologies from codebase}\" features/$1/FEATURE_TECHNICAL_SPEC.md\n```\n\n**If Codex finds issues:**\n- Show critical issues and recommendations\n- Ask user: \"Address findings before proceeding?\" (Yes/No)\n- If Yes: Apply suggested fixes\n- If No: Continue with noted issues\n\n**If Codex unavailable:** Skip silently and proceed to Next Step.\n\n## Error Handling\n\n| Situation | Action |\n|-----------|--------|\n| FEATURE_SPEC.md not found in `features/$1/` | Stop and report \"Run `/feature-spec $1` first\" |\n| PROMPT.md not found at `.claude/skills/feature-technical-spec/PROMPT.md` | Stop and report \"Skill asset missing — reinstall toolkit or run /setup\" |\n| Codebase too large for full code analysis (>5000 files) | Limit analysis to `src/`, `lib/`, and `app/` directories; note reduced scope in output |\n| DEFERRED.md write fails (permissions or disk) | Output deferred items to terminal, warn user, continue with spec generation |\n| Codex CLI invocation fails or times out | Log the error, skip cross-model review, proceed to Next Step |\n\n## Next Step\n\nWhen verification is complete, inform the user:\n```\nFEATURE_TECHNICAL_SPEC.md created and verified at features/$1/FEATURE_TECHNICAL_SPEC.md\n\nVerification: PASSED | PASSED WITH NOTES | NEEDS REVIEW\nCross-Model Review: PASSED | PASSED WITH NOTES | SKIPPED\nDeferred Requirements: {count} items captured to DEFERRED.md\n\nNext: Run /feature-plan $1\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:40:16.958Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Coding Assistants needing structured software development workflows with FEATURE_SPEC.md and technical design documentation.","zh":"非常适合需要利用 FEATURE_SPEC.md 和技术设计文档进行结构化软件开发工作流程的 AI 编程助手。","ja":"FEATURE_SPEC.md と技術設計ドキュメントを用いた構造化されたソフトウェア開発ワークフローを必要とする AI コーディングアシスタントに最適です。","ko":"FEATURE_SPEC.md 및 기술 설계 문서를 사용하는 구조화된 소프트웨어 개발 워크플로우가 필요한 AI 코딩 어시스턴트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Asistentes de Codificación con IA que necesitan flujos de trabajo de desarrollo de software estructurados con FEATURE_SPEC.md y documentación de diseño técnico.","fr":"Parfait pour les Assistants de Codification IA nécessitant des flux de travail de développement de logiciels structurés avec FEATURE_SPEC.md et une documentation de conception technique.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Codierungsassistenten, die strukturierte Softwareentwicklungs-Workflows mit FEATURE_SPEC.md und technischer Design-Dokumentation benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Assistentes de Codificação de IA que necessitam de fluxos de trabalho estruturados de desenvolvimento de software com FEATURE_SPEC.md e documentação técnica de design.","ru":"Идеально подходит для ИИ-ассистентов программирования, которым требуются структурированные рабочие процессы разработки программного обеспечения с FEATURE_SPEC.md и технической проектной документацией.","ar":"مثالي لمساعدات البرمجة بالذكاء الاصطناعي التي تحتاج إلى سير عمل منظمة لتطوير البرمجيات مع ملف FEATURE_SPEC.md ووثائق التصميم الفني."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate comprehensive FEATURE_TECHNICAL_SPEC.md documents, facilitating seamless execution and integration with existing codebases through directory guards, prerequisite checks, and spec-verification protocols like Markdown formatting and YAML metadata.","zh":"使智能体能够生成全面的 FEATURE_TECHNICAL_SPEC.md 文档，通过目录守卫、先决条件检查以及 Markdown 格式和 YAML 元数据等规范验证协议，促进与现有代码库的无缝执行和集成。","ja":"ディレクトリガード、前提条件チェック、Markdown フォーマットや YAML メタデータなどの仕様検証プロトコルを通じて、既存のコードベースとのシームレスな実行と統合を促進する、包括的な FEATURE_TECHNICAL_SPEC.md ドキュメントの生成をエージェントに可能にします。","ko":"디렉토리 가드, 전제 조건 확인, Markdown 형식 및 YAML 메타데이터와 같은 사양 검증 프로토콜을 통해 기존 코드베이스와의 원활한 실행 및 통합을 용이하게 하는 포괄적인 FEATURE_TECHNICAL_SPEC.md 문서 생성을 에이전트가 수행할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar documentos FEATURE_TECHNICAL_SPEC.md completos, facilitando una ejecución e integración perfecta con las bases de código existentes a través de protecciones de directorio, comprobaciones de requisitos previos y protocolos de verificación de especificaciones como el formato Markdown y los metadatos YAML.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des documents FEATURE_TECHNICAL_SPEC.md complets, facilitant une exécution et une intégration transparentes avec les bases de code existantes grâce à des gardes de répertoire, des vérifications de prérequis et des protocoles de vérification des spécifications comme le formatage Markdown et les métadonnées YAML.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, umfassende FEATURE_TECHNICAL_SPEC.md-Dokumente zu generieren, was die nahtlose Ausführung und Integration in bestehende Codebasen durch Directory Guards, Voraussetzungsprüfungen und Spezifikations-Verifizierungsprotokolle wie Markdown-Formatierung und YAML-Metadaten erleichtert.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a gerar documentos abrangentes FEATURE_TECHNICAL_SPEC.md, facilitando a execução e integração perfeitas com bases de código existentes através de guardas de diretório, verificações de pré-requisitos e protocolos de verificação de especificações, como formatação Markdown e metadados YAML.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать комплексные документы FEATURE_TECHNICAL_SPEC.md, обеспечивая беспрепятственное выполнение и интеграцию с существующими кодобазами через защиту директорий, проверки предварительных условий и протоколы проверки спецификаций, такие как форматирование Markdown и метаданные YAML.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء وثائق FEATURE_TECHNICAL_SPEC.md شاملة، مما يسهل التنفيذ السلس والتكامل مع قواعد التعليمات البرمجية الحالية من خلال حراس الدليل، وفحوصات المتطلبات الأساسية، وبروتوكولات التحقق من المواصفات مثل تنسيق Markdown وبيانات التعريف YAML."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating feature specification generation","Generating technical design documents with existing file guards","Debugging implementation planning with codebase maturity assessments"],"zh":["自动化功能规范生成","利用现有文件守卫生成技术设计文档","通过代码库成熟度评估进行调试实施规划"],"ja":["機能仕様生成の自動化","既存のファイルガードを用いた技術設計ドキュメントの生成","コードベースの成熟度評価を用いた実装計画のデバッグ"],"ko":["기능 사양 생성 자동화","기존 파일 가드를 사용한 기술 설계 문서 생성","코드베이스 성숙도 평가를 통한 디버깅 구현 계획"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de especificaciones de características","Generación de documentos de diseño técnico con protecciones de archivos existentes","Planificación de depuración de implementación con evaluaciones de madurez de la base de código"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de spécifications de fonctionnalités","Génération de documents de conception technique avec des gardes de fichiers existants","Planification du débogage de l''implémentation avec des évaluations de maturité de la base de code"],"de":["Automatisierung der Generierung von Funktionsspezifikationen","Generierung technischer Designdokumente mit vorhandenen File Guards","Debugging-Implementierungsplanung mit Bewertungen der Codebase-Reife"],"pt":["Automatização da geração de especificações de funcionalidades","Geração de documentos de design técnico com guardas de arquivo existentes","Planejamento de depuração de implementação com avaliações de maturidade da base de código"],"ru":["Автоматизация создания спецификаций функций","Создание технических проектных документов с существующей защитой файлов","Планирование отладки реализации с оценками зрелости кодобазы"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء مواصفات الميزة","إنشاء وثائق التصميم الفني مع حراس الملفات الحالية","تخطيط تصحيح الأخطاء في التنفيذ مع تقييمات نضج قاعدة التعليمات البرمجية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires FEATURE_SPEC.md existence","Needs filesystem access for directory and file management","Limited to Markdown-based documentation"],"zh":["需要 FEATURE_SPEC.md 存在","需要文件系统访问权限以进行目录和文件管理","仅限于基于 Markdown 的文档"],"ja":["FEATURE_SPEC.md の存在が必要","ディレクトリおよびファイル管理のためのファイルシステムアクセスが必要","Markdown ベースのドキュメントに限定"],"ko":["FEATURE_SPEC.md 존재 필요","디렉토리 및 파일 관리를 위한 파일 시스템 액세스 필요","Markdown 기반 문서로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la existencia de FEATURE_SPEC.md","Necesita acceso al sistema de archivos para la gestión de directorios y archivos","Limitado a documentación basada en Markdown"],"fr":["Nécessite l''existence de FEATURE_SPEC.md","Requiert un accès au système de fichiers pour la gestion des répertoires et des fichiers","Limité à la documentation basée sur Markdown"],"de":["Erfordert die Existenz einer FEATURE_SPEC.md","Benötigt Dateisystemzugriff für die Verzeichnis- und Dateiverwaltung","Beschränkt auf Markdown-basierte Dokumentation"],"pt":["Requer a existência de FEATURE_SPEC.md","Necessita de acesso ao sistema de arquivos para gerenciamento de diretórios e arquivos","Limitado à documentação baseada em Markdown"],"ru":["Требует наличия FEATURE_SPEC.md","Требует доступ к файловой системе для управления каталогами и файлами","Ограничено документацией на основе Markdown"],"ar":["يتطلب وجود ملف FEATURE_SPEC.md","يحتاج إلى الوصول لنظام الملفات لإدارة الدليل والملفات","مقتصر على الوثائق القائمة على Markdown"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"296e881084ba19bd02952f32ed14ed622b0cd1b8a3ce8f2dc037941c11c1a58b","qualityScore":60}');
